window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LADY_GU_TOO_WEAK_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":601,"title":"Chapter 601 - Beautiful Victory","paragraphs":["To everyone, Xuan Island was a mysterious and desirable place. People who came from Xuan Island were either rich or noble, not to mention the Luo family, an exceedingly powerful family.","Such a large family that had hundreds of years of history actually sent someone to celebrate Qiao Xi’s birthday?","Someone reacted and asked in fear, “May I know who from the Luo family is here?”","If the Luo family had only sent a butler or servant, it would not be a big deal. After all, the master of the Luo family was not the one making an appearance.","In the next second, the butler broke out in cold sweat and said, “It’s... It’s the young master of the Luo family from Xuan Island, Luo Qing.”","Boom!!!","Everyone’s heart skipped a beat. They stood up at the same time and rushed out as if they were possessed.","Without even saying goodbye, the banquet hall that was originally filled with guests instantly became cold and quiet.","The appearance of the Xue, Shen, and Qin families was already beyond everyone’s expectations. Now, even the mysterious young master of the Luo family from Xuan Island had come. They would be crazy if they still stayed in Xu Anran’s banquet hall.","Wen Xi was too embarrassed to leave, but her parents dragged her to Qiao Xi’s banquet hall.","Although they were relatives of the Xu family, in the face of absolute power, they had no choice but to yield. Furthermore, if they went over there, they might have a chance to interact with those families. If they were to get on good terms with just one person there, it would bring great benefits to the entire family.","How could the Xu family compare to those families?","Xu Anran stood where she was like a stone statue. Her face was hideous, and her eyes were filled with hatred. Her hypocritical mask gradually shattered.","Xu Anyi was stunned for a few seconds before he hurried over to comfort her. “Anran, it’s okay. Even though they’ve left, there’s still us. I won’t leave you.”","Updates by vipnovel.com","Xia Yunlou gnashed her teeth in anger, resenting Qiao Xi for not giving Anran face and ruining her birthday party.","Xu Zhi stood on the spot, his body trembling as if he was struck by lightning.","Impossible!","How could Qiao Xi possibly know so many great figures?","In that case, she had agreed to compete with Anran, not because of the shares but because she knew that she would not lose and would win beautifully.","When he regained his senses, Xu Zhi’s face was gloomy. His body became limp, and he almost fell to the floor.","That was right! Qiao Xi knew that she could win, yet she still wanted 30% of the shares!","“Dad, Mom, since... there’s no one else in the banquet hall, why don’t we go celebrate Sister’s birthday together? Let’s not be separated on an occasion like this.”","Xu Anran hesitated for a long time before she opened her mouth aggrievedly. Her magnanimous and forgiving look made people’s hearts ache.","“I know it’s my sister’s birthday today. I’m the one who took over her birthday and identity. If we don’t celebrate my sister’s birthday, she’ll definitely blame me and think that I’m the one who didn’t let you two join her—”","“How can you be blamed for this?!” Xia Yunlou interrupted her. She was burning with rage. “It’s clearly Qiao Xi who stole your guests, yet she still has the cheek to blame you? How can she be so shameless?!”","Xu Anran said with tears in her eyes, “Mom, I know you love me and are unwilling to announce that I’m your adopted daughter. But my sister has already spread the news. Now that everyone knows about it, how can I still have any reason to hog you all?","“Don’t blame her for this. She... She just wants to join this family. After all... she’s your biological daughter.”","After saying this, Xia Yunlou was even more furious. “How could she do this?! I don’t have such a selfish daughter!”","Xu Anran teared up and said, “Mom, I’ve never thought of snatching my sister away from you. I just want to stay by your side and be your daughter. Am I really wrong? I don’t want others to misunderstand me, so let’s go to my sister’s birthday together.”","Xia Yunlou still felt a little awkward in her heart, but after thinking carefully about Xu Anran’s words, she felt that they made sense. If they didn’t attend Qiao Xi’s birthday banquet, outsiders would think that the Xu family was targeting her.","After all, Qiao Xi knew so many big shots. If people knew that the Xu family treated their own daughter harshly, it wouldn’t be good for them.","Xia Yunlou was silent for a while before she finally said helplessly, “Alright. Since you’ve said so, I’ll listen to you. Xi Xi is so willful, but you’re so sensible. You’re truly my good daughter.”"]},{"number":602,"title":"Chapter 602 - Fence Sitters","paragraphs":["In the banquet hall.","These guests were all invited by Shen Yu and the others. Qiao Xi did not participate in inviting them at all.","The Zhao family came because Qiao Xi had saved the life of a member of their family. The other families were inextricably linked to the Shen, Qin, and Xue families. They also knew Qiao Xi’s identity, so they would naturally rush over to attend her birthday banquet.","When Qiao Xi went to Imperial Capital last time, she had once caused a stir. Everyone knew that these great families treated Qiao Xi like a pearl in their palm.","Moreover, everyone knew that Qiao Xi was married to that master who wasn’t an ordinary person.","When everyone entered the banquet hall, they realized that the second young master of the Gu family, Gu Yao, was actually mixing drinks for everyone. Everyone was even more certain of Qiao Xi’s status.","The Yang family also found out that Qiao Xi might be the legendary top hacker, Black Tide, which was why the eldest daughter of the Yang family had rushed over from the capital.","No matter if Qiao Xi was the beloved daughter of the four major families, Mrs. Gu, or Black Tide, any one of these identities could not be underestimated.","At this moment, the banquet hall was filled with people, and everyone circled around Qiao Xi. It caused Wen Xi and the others to gnash their teeth with rage.","“Miss Qiao, Miss Qiao!”","The guests who rushed over from Xu Anran’s side shouted anxiously, “Happy birthday! Miss Qiao, we’re all here to celebrate your birthday. It’s just that Mr. Xu and Madam Xu didn’t let us leave just now, so we were delayed. I’m sure you won’t blame us.”","“That’s right, Miss Qiao. We originally planned to rush over after giving her our gifts, but who knew that Miss Xu Anran would hold us back? That’s why we’re late. Look, the moment we gave her our gifts, we rushed over.”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully, and everyone hurriedly lowered their heads in fear.","Gu Yao said in a low voice, “They’re all fence sitters. Seeing that the guests here are more distinguished, they came over to Qiao Xi’s side. Their presence doesn’t even matter.”","Updates by vipnovel.com","“It’s alright, I won’t blame you.” Qiao Xi smiled gently.","The guests were overjoyed and immediately walked in. After entering, they were frightened. There were many important people here, and they couldn’t afford to offend them. Therefore, they had to be careful in everything they did.","Wen Xi looked reluctant. Her parents snorted unhappily. “So, it turns out Xu Anran is the real adopted daughter. If I had known about this, I wouldn’t have let you curry favor with her. What a waste of time.”","“Did you offend Miss Qiao previously because of Xu Anran? Are you stupid? Don’t you know what kind of person Miss Qiao is? The families attending her birthday party can easily make the Wen family suffer. You’re killing the Wen family here!”","Wen Xi bit her lip tightly and refused to make a sound.","She curried favor with Xu Anran for the sake of the Wen family. Who knew that Qiao Xi had such a strong background? It was too late to say anything now. She reckoned that Qiao Xi would not forgive her and only hoped that she would not cause trouble for the Wen family.","At this moment, Xu Anran walked in with Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou. When she saw everyone surrounding Qiao Xi and wishing her a happy birthday, her face turned gloomy.","Xia Yunlou was indignant. “Don’t they see that we’re here too? Why isn’t anyone wishing Anran a happy birthday?”","Xu Anran lowered her head and said aggrievedly, “Mom, it’s alright. Let’s go in.”","On the other hand, Li Xing’er looked at everyone sitting down and snorted. “They were mocking you just now, but once they found out that you had backers, they immediately rushed over. Only you would let them in. If it were me, I would have asked the bodyguards to chase them out!”","“Of course, it’s useful for me to let them in.” Qiao Xi blinked and smiled slyly.","Li Xing’er was confused.","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “They came from Xu Anran’s banquet hall. Originally, they wanted to celebrate Xu Anran’s birthday. Now, the other party’s birthday party hasn’t even ended and they’ve already come to my side. I think Xu Anran’s expression must be very interesting to see!”","At this moment, Xu Anran was probably angered to death!","As soon as Qiao Xi finished speaking, she heard a commotion not far away. She looked toward the source of the noise and saw Xu Anran’s face gradually turning sinister. Her eyes were filled with resentment.","Qiao Xi sneered. “See, they’re already here.”"]},{"number":603,"title":"Chapter 603 - Even More Shameless","paragraphs":["“Xi Xi, we’re here to celebrate your birthday.” Xu Zhi walked over slowly with a smile on his face. “I only left for a short while, but so many guests have come to celebrate your birthday. You’re indeed my good daughter.”","Everyone snorted. Who didn’t know that Xu Zhi was trying to find a way out for himself?","However, Xu Zhi did not care about those disdainful gazes. No matter what, he was Qiao Xi’s biological father. What was wrong with him coming to attend his daughter’s birthday banquet?","Xu Zhi helplessly said, “Originally, the two of you were going to celebrate your birthdays separately, but Anran was afraid that you’d be too lonely. Besides, why would the two of you have to separate? So, we came together.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows when she heard Xu Zhi’s words.","Xu Anran pretended to be weak. “Sister, I’m sorry. It’s all my fault. I know... you hate me because I stole your identity, but I grew up in the Xu family. I don’t want to leave the family. I’ve never wanted to fight with you for anything. I’m willing to give everything to you, including this birthday party...","“I just wanted to invite more people to attend the party. I want to introduce everyone to you. I had kind intentions, but I didn’t expect you to misunderstand. Sister, can you forgive me?”","Li Xing’er widened her eyes. This Xu Anran was really a top-notch hypocritical b*tch.","Things had already come to this point, yet she was still pretending. How could she say such innocent words in public? Did she really think that everyone was a fool?","Misunderstanding? Who was she trying to fool?!","If it weren’t for the four great families coming to support Qiao Xi, the Xu family would probably be sticking their chins up into the sky right now. They might even ridicule Qiao Xi!","She had never liked such two-faced behavior. She thought that Yao Mengqing was shameless enough, but Xu Anran was even more shameless!","Xia Yunlou used this as an excuse to continue speaking, “Xi Xi, our whole family has been busy preparing for your birthday party. How can you not appreciate our kindness? Aren’t you going to thank Anran?”","Li Xing’er: “?” ‘Look! She’s even more shameless!’","Updates by vipnovel.com","Xia Yunlou pretended to be helpless. “I didn’t know that you had so many friends. I was afraid that you would lose your dignity, so I came up with an arrangement with Anran. I wanted to announce your identity at the birthday party. I didn’t expect you to have so many friends. I’m really happy for you!","“Look! That’s the cake we prepared for you. Do you like it?”","There was no tenderness in Xia Yunlou’s eyes. She was still full of schemes.","She was clearly aware in her heart that Qiao Xi’s background was formidable, and it was surely impossible to go head-on against her. At the very least, she wanted to let the guests present know that the Xu family had never mistreated Qiao Xi.","Therefore, she had to pretend to be a good mother so that no one would notice anything amiss.","Originally, she wanted to be a good mother as well, but this child, Qiao Xi, was extremely mischievous, jealous, and selfish. She was utterly unworthy of being her daughter!","At this moment, the banquet hall was terrifyingly quiet. Since Qiao Xi didn’t say anything, no one dared to speak.","Xu Anran glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. She guessed that Qiao Xi would definitely not be able to reject her. No matter what they did, they would always be her family.","If Qiao Xi really chased their entire family out in front of all the guests, then she would be unfilial and criticized for it for her entire life. She was sure that Qiao Xi would definitely let them stay.","As expected, Qiao Xi remained silent for a moment before smiling. “Of course, I like it! How can I not like what my parents prepared for me? I’m already very happy that you’re willing to celebrate my birthday with me.”","Xu Anran smirked smugly.","It seemed that Qiao Xi didn’t have any tricks up her sleeve. She was just lucky to have met Shen Yu. The two of them were so close, so perhaps they had some sort of relationship!","The birthday party was about to begin. Qiao Xi glanced at the door. The door to the hall was still open.","She was neither anxious nor impatient as she stood still and waited.","Not long after, there was a commotion at the door.","This was Qiao Xi’s birthday banquet, and the big shots of various places were gathered here. Who would dare to be so rude?","Everyone frowned and looked toward the door. They saw a sloppy man shouting as he broke past the security guards and rushed into the banquet hall.","The sudden intrusion of a stranger scared the rich young ladies present. They took a few steps back and looked at the scene in front of them with panic written all over their faces. They had attended many banquets and had never seen such a scene before."]},{"number":604,"title":"Chapter 604 - A Husband Suddenly Appeared","paragraphs":["Li Xing’er waved her hand and ordered the bodyguards to drag him away. Unexpectedly, this man swept his gaze around the venue and rushed toward Qiao Xi as if she was his target.","The man’s hair was greasy, and he was wearing a set of tattered clothes. He looked dirty. He tried to take Qiao Xi’s hand, but she stopped him.","“Who are you?! What are you doing?”","The sloppy man did not pay attention to Li Xing’er. He directly hugged Qiao Xi’s legs and tightly pulled the corner of her gown as he loudly shouted, “Wifey! I finally found you!”","Everyone widened their eyes in shock and instinctively looked at Gu Zheng who was not far away.","This man actually called Qiao Xi... his wife?","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. His slender fingers caressed the wine glass as if he was thinking about something. Then, his gaze landed on Xu Anran.","When the man saw that Qiao Xi didn’t respond, he immediately became fierce. “Wifey! You’re so cruel! Now that you’ve become an heiress, you look down on me, your husband? You’ve been with me since you were 16. We even have a child together. Have you forgotten all of this?","“Even if you’re already the daughter of a rich family, it can’t change the fact that you’re my wife. Hurry up and come back! I beg you to stop running away. I can’t live without you!”","The man reached out to pull on Qiao Xi’s gown.","Everyone gasped.","Regardless of whether this was true or not, they were very clear in their hearts that this man wouldn’t appear here for no reason. Someone wanted to take advantage of the fact that all the guests were present to completely ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation.","She got together with this man at the age of 16 and even had a child with him. For the sake of being the daughter of a wealthy family, she abandoned her ‘husband’. If this matter were to spread, Qiao Xi’s reputation in Li City would be ruined.","“Xi Xi, we’re childhood sweethearts. When you were bullied when you were young, I was the one who stood up for you. You said that you would marry me when you grew up and promised to take good care of your husband and children. But we were only married for a short while before you abandoned me! I had so many beautiful memories with you, but you actually abandoned me for money!”","Updates by vipnovel.com","He said tearfully, “You’ve been gone for so long, and I’ve been looking for you. So... So you...”","Xia Yunlou spoke first, “Xi Xi grew up in the countryside. The girls there get married very early, and she didn’t have anyone to discipline her either. It’s not strange that she started relying on men at an early age, but it’s not right for her to just come back to the Xu family without acknowledging her husband!”","“Madam Xu! Are you Xi Xi’s mother or not?!” Li Xing’er rebuked angrily. “This man’s words alone are not conclusive proof! I really don’t understand. You clearly know that these words will ruin Xi Xi’s reputation and destroy her current family, yet you still can’t wait to label Xi Xi. What are your intentions?!","“If a mother who truly loves her child knows that something like this had happened to her daughter, regardless of whether it’s true or not, the first thing she would do is defend her daughter and minimize the harm done to her. She wouldn’t want it to affect her daughter’s future and life, but you directly convicted Xi Xi of what this man is accusing her of! Moreover, it’s Xi Xi’s birthday today, but you’ve always been by Xu Anran’s side. Could it be that an adopted daughter is more important than your biological daughter?","“Oh~ I know. Are you afraid that Xi Xi will return to the Xu family and become the eldest daughter of the Xu family, replacing Xu Anran and blocking her path, so you want to use this opportunity to destroy Xi Xi?”","The entire venue was in an uproar.","Xia Yunlou’s entire body stiffened. Then, she roared crazily. “Shut up! Xi Xi is my daughter. How could I harm her?! It’s just that Xi Xi grew up in the countryside. It’s possible for such things to happen to her!”","Li Xing’er felt like her head was about to explode. It was fine to have a mother like Xia Yunlou, but she even went as far as to help her adopted daughter to frame her own daughter.","Xu Zhi looked up at the Xue family, and his heart skipped a beat. If those guests thought that the Xu family framed Qiao Xi, it would be bad.","He waved his hand and ordered, “Men! Drag this man who’s spreading rumors out! Call the police and arrest him! I want to sue him for defamation!”","Xu Anran frowned."]},{"number":605,"title":"Chapter 605 - You Mother And Daughter Are Birds Of A Feather","paragraphs":["Before she could say anything, Xu Anyi yelled, “Dad! We haven’t figured out what happened yet. Don’t be in a hurry to chase him away! Maybe this man is telling the truth. Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside. With her mischievous personality, it’s normal if she got together with a man when she was young. How can such an embarrassing woman enter the Xu family?”","“Shut up!” Xu Zhi’s blood was boiling. Xia Yunlou was already being suspected by others, yet this idiot Xu Anyi still dared to add fuel to the fire. How ridiculous!","The next second, Xue Liang said coldly, “It seems like Young Master Xu and Madam Xu don’t believe in Xi Xi and even despise her for growing up in the countryside. But why don’t you think about who took Xi Xi’s identity and caused her to be stranded in the countryside?”","Everyone from the Xu family turned pale.","Xue Liang glanced at the crowd. “I heard that the Xu family’s servant swapped Xi Xi and Xu Anran, and the servant is Xu Anran’s biological mother. The servant is still being taken care of by the Xu family. How will Xi Xi be avenged, then?”","“No wonder the Xu family’s business is getting worse. How can immoral people get rich? When the company falls into Young Master Xu’s hands, the Xu family will be finished. Ha!”","Xu Anyi was furious. Suppressing his anger, he said, “Young Master Xue, I’m just stating facts.”","Xia Yunlou’s gaze was ruthless as she gritted her teeth. No matter what, she had to pour this basin of dirty water on Qiao Xi and make her completely unable to turn the situation around. In this way, Qiao Xi wouldn’t have the qualifications to seize the status of the Xu family’s eldest young miss.","After a moment of silence, Xia Yunlou pointed at the man and asked, “What happened between you and my daughter? Tell me everything!”","“Xia Yunlou! Stop fooling around!” Xu Zhi was furious.","“What did I do?! If Xi Xi really got together with this man and had a child with him but abandoned them for power, we can’t just sit back and do nothing. Otherwise, people will say that our Xu family is heartless!”","Xia Yunlou raised her voice. In her heart, only Anran was her biological daughter. As for Qiao Xi, if she could be obedient, she could naturally stay in the family. However, if she insisted on fighting with Anran, then Xia Yunlou could only destroy her.","“I’m Xi Xi’s mother. If Xi Xi really wronged you, I’ll make it up to you!” Xia Yunlou said to the man.","She knew clearly in her heart that everyone was definitely looking at her with disdain, but as long as she could ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation and help Anran maintain her status as a top socialite, she didn’t care about anything else.","Updates by vipnovel.com","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened as a chilling aura emanated from him.","The corners of Luo Qing’s lips curled up.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “I’ve been back in the Xu family for so long, but Mom, you’ve never asked me about my past. I’m really curious now! This is good as well. There are some things that should be explained clearly!”","Seeing this, the man explained with snot and tears rolling down his face, “Xi Xi, we’ve known each other since we were young. You followed me when you were 16 and accidentally got pregnant. Although I have a woman I like, I’m still willing to take responsibility for you. But you abandoned me for glory and wealth!”","Qiao Xi crossed her arms and glanced coldly at the man before suddenly smiling.","“Do you think it’s worth it to take this job for 100,000 if you’re only going to end up losing your life?”","100,000 yuan?","Xia Yunlou hurriedly interrupted, “I think what he said is quite plausible. Xi Xi, could it be that you really did such a thing?”","“What’s the hurry, Madam Xu?”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “When I was 16, I hadn’t returned to the Qiao family, let alone the Xu family. I also didn’t know Gu Zheng, so you can say whatever you want because you think I won’t have any evidence to prove my innocence.”","Most of the people present knew that Qiao Xi had married Gu Zheng, but there were still some who were doubtful. Now that Qiao Xi had spoken out about it in public, it finally confirmed this matter.","Xia Yunlou’s expression was ugly. “Stop talking about President Gu!”","“Madam Xu, no wonder you like Xu Anran and not me. We’re not the same kind of people! You mother and daughter are birds of a feather!”","After saying that, Qiao Xi looked coldly at the man and took out her phone from her bag. Her slender fingers tapped on the screen a few times. She connected to the big screen in the banquet hall."]},{"number":606,"title":"Chapter 606 - Using Others To Make A Move","paragraphs":["Xu Anran lowered her head and thought about how to completely ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation.","This time, she wanted Qiao Xi to be hated by everyone. It would be best if she was immediately abandoned by Gu Zheng and no one would fight with her for the identity of the Xu family’s eldest young miss.","Xu Anran had sinister thoughts. She wanted to trample Qiao Xi under her feet. She wanted Qiao Xi to know the consequences of offending her.","Just as she was immersed in her joy, she heard the people around her exclaim.","Xu Anran suddenly looked up, her face pale.","A video appeared on the big screen. It showed the Xu family’s villa. The person filming was hiding in the bushes, but the video was very clear. Every word was heard clearly.","Wen Xi said, “I have an idea that can ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation!”","Xu Zidie said, “Let’s find a random man and say that he’s Qiao Xi’s lover! We’ll say... that she got pregnant and had an abortion at the age of 16. She got together with that ugly man at such a young age. I want to see how she can still enter the Xu family then.”","“Is this method reliable? Will that man betray us?”","“What’s there to be afraid of? As long as we give him a sum of money, there’s nothing he won’t do for us. Once this matter is exposed, I want to see what Qiao Xi will do! Anran, don’t worry. From now on, no one will fight with you. The identity as the eldest daughter of the Xu family will always belong to you.”","Xu Anran said, “This... Isn’t this too much? I’ve never thought of hurting her, but if doing so can make her listen to our parents obediently and not make them angry, it’s worth it.”","Xu Anyi said, “Heh, let’s see if she’ll still dare to go against you after this!”","After the recording ended, the entire banquet hall fell into dead silence.","The Xu and Wen families were livid.","The others didn’t dare to open their mouths. After all, that was the young master of the Xu family, Xu Anyi, and the young miss of the Xu family, Xu Anran. Moreover, Wen Xi and Xu Zidie were both members of the Xu family as well. This was their family matter. However, no one had imagined that the four of them would actually conspire to ruin Qiao Xi.","No matter what, Qiao Xi was Xu Anyi’s younger sister. Even if he didn’t have any feelings for her, they were still related by blood. Xu Anyi should know that if their plan was successful, Qiao Xi would forever carry this stain and be affected for life.","After a while, the crowd began to whisper among themselves.","“The Lu and Wen families have such terrible upbringing!”","“Xu Anran, why were you pretending?! You were clearly trying to get someone else to do your dirty work, yet you still spoke so pompously as though you had nothing to do with this!”","“Xu Anyi is even worse. He framed his own sister for an outsider. He must be retarded!”","“Actually, Xu Anran is the most scheming one among these people. She’s clearly the one who wants to deal with Qiao Xi, yet she used others to do the job for her. Even if the matter was exposed, she could say that it had nothing to do with her! Mr. Xu, there are some things that I’ll be frank about. If you still keep this adopted daughter of yours at home, sooner or later, your Xu family will be turned upside down by her. Your biological daughter will also sever all ties with the Xu family!”","“I really don’t understand. It’s fine if the Xu family is biased toward Xu Anran, but Qiao Xi is their biological daughter, after all. They can’t help their adopted daughter bully their biological daughter! Moreover, Qiao Xi isn’t inferior to Xu Anran at all. She’s the champion of the International Real-time Translation Competition!”","“She’s so powerful! The Xu family doesn’t dote on their outstanding biological daughter but dotes on a scheming adopted daughter. They must be blind!”","“I heard that Miss Qiao suffered in the Qiao family when she was young and was chased to the countryside by her stepmother. Now that she has finally returned to her biological parents’ side, she’s still being schemed against by the adopted daughter and her biological brother. How pitiful.”","“I think this matter isn’t just related to the adopted daughter. Didn’t you hear what Xia Yunlou said earlier? She doesn’t seem to like Qiao Xi either!”","Xia Yunlou’s heart skipped a beat.","Xue Liang smiled. “Madam Xu, does this incident have anything to do with you?”","“I—”","Xue Liang’s eyes suddenly turned cold. “Mr. Xu instructed the bodyguards to drag this man away just now, but you were the one who stopped him. You were also the first one who confirmed Xi Xi’s relationship with this man without any evidence and just based on this man’s one-sided statement. Even if you say that this has nothing to do with you, who will believe you?”","Actually, even if this matter had nothing to do with Xia Yunlou, Xue Liang would still make this matter be related to her."]},{"number":607,"title":"Chapter 607 - A Family Of Fools","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou was not satisfied to have a daughter like Xi Xi, hence she actually helped Xu Anran destroy Xi Xi’s reputation. What right did such a person have to be Xi Xi’s mother?","The moment Xue Liang finished speaking, everyone looked at Xia Yunlou in shock, followed by disdain and mockery.","“Is Xia Yunlou really Miss Qiao’s biological mother? How can there be such a mother in this world? She actually used such a method to destroy her own daughter!”","“It’s all because of that scheming adopted daughter. I remember when we were at the Shen family’s banquet, Xia Yunlou said in front of everyone that her adopted daughter loves President Gu. She tried to force Miss Qiao and President Gu to divorce!”","“Huh? Such a thing happened?”","Xu Anran’s legs went weak, and she supported herself on the chair.","Gu Zheng’s expression did not change. Xue Liang sneered. “President Gu isn’t blind. How could he possibly like her?”","Xu Anran’s face turned pale, and she looked like she was about to faint.","At this point, the truth was already revealed. Xu Zhi looked up in disbelief. “Xia Yunlou!”","“No! No!”","Xia Yunlou immediately roared and defended herself. “Xi Xi is my biological daughter. How could I harm her?! You’re talking nonsense!”","Xu Zhi and Xia Yunlou had lived together for more than 20 years. He knew her character very well. Seeing that she was so nervous, he immediately confirmed Xue Liang’s words and raised his hand to slap her.","“Why are you so nervous if you didn’t do it? Do you want to ruin your daughter? I know very well that you don’t like Xi Xi, but she’s our biological daughter while Xu Anran is just an adopted daughter. You’re too ignorant!”","Smack!","Then, Xu Zhi raised his hand and gave Xu Anran a slap as well.","“Xu Anran! Back then, it was your mother who swapped you with Qiao Xi to gain benefits. You’re just a servant’s daughter. How are you qualified to fight with Qiao Xi? If it weren’t for you, my daughter wouldn’t have been left outside to suffer! Get lost! Get out of the Xu family!”","“Dad, I...”","Xu Anran sobbed silently, and Xu Anyi immediately stood up to defend her. “Dad! How can you say that about Anran? It was Qiao Xi who stole Anran’s things and even stole the man she loves! You know that Anran likes President Gu, so why won’t you help Anran? Do you know how sad Anran feels when she sees Qiao Xi and President Gu being a loving couple?”","Xu Zhi didn’t say anything, but everyone’s faces were full of contempt.","“Is Xu Anyi crazy? President Gu doesn’t even know Xu Anran. Moreover, he married Miss Qiao a long time ago. Not only does President Gu not like Xu Anran, but even if he really likes her, she’s only fit to be a mistress!”","“Young Master Xu isn’t helping his own sister but is instead helping the adopted daughter to destroy his sister’s family. He’s even questioning why Mr. Xu isn’t helping Xu Anran?”","“Haha, what kind of drug did Xu Anran feed Young Master Xu and Madam Xu? It’s as if they’ve been bewitched into helping her!”","Everyone mocked the Xu family.","Xu Zhi was extremely frustrated. He knew very well in his heart that the Xu family could not afford to offend the people behind Qiao Xi. He could only roar at the three people from the Xu family, “Get lost!”","“Dad!” Xu Anyi was indignant.","Xu Anran said tearfully, “Dad, President Gu...”","“F*ck!” Someone couldn’t help but curse. “Seducing a man in front of the legitimate wife... How shameless can she be?! Top socialite? What bullsh*t! She’s just a scheming mistress!”","Xu Anran’s body trembled.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he looked gently at Qiao Xi who was beside him. “It’s time to cut the cake.”","Then, his eyes turned cold as he looked at Xu Zhi behind him. “Mr. Xu, I won’t let things end here just like this. I hope you can give me a reasonable explanation for all this.”","Xu Zhi felt his brain buzzing, and the blood in his body seemed to have frozen.","What sin did he commit in his past life to marry such a muddle-headed wife, give birth to an idiot like Xu Anyi, and even raise such a ruthless adopted daughter?","If he had married Yunqiu back then...","The more Xu Zhi thought about it, the more annoyed he became. “Xia Yunlou, come out with me!”","Seeing the Xu family leave, Qiao Xi ordered expressionlessly, “Close the door.”","...","Xu Zhi brought Xia Yunlou outside. He gritted his teeth and said, “Are you crazy? Xi Xi knows so many big shots. Shouldn’t you be happy? Why did you find someone to ruin her reputation?”"]},{"number":608,"title":"Chapter 608 - Otherwise, We’ll Divorce","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou cried out, “No matter how muddle-headed I am, I won’t do such a thing! She’s my biological daughter, after all! I just thought that since she grew up in the countryside and had no one to discipline her, it wouldn’t be strange if she accidentally got pregnant and got an abortion, so—”","“Shut up! You’re still talking! I don’t care why you did it, but Xi Xi is our daughter. You can’t do anything to harm her. I’ll send Xu Anran away now to prevent any more trouble!”","“Xu Zhi!” Xia Yunlou shouted, “No! Anran has stayed with us for so long. Where are you going to send her? If outsiders know that Anran has been chased out of the house, she’ll definitely be mocked. How can she continue living?!”","“Who asked her to go against Xi Xi time and time again? She brought this upon herself!”","Xu Zhi was furious. “Do you know how much impact the incident today could have had on Xi Xi?! If everyone had fallen for the act, what would’ve happened then?”","Xia Yunlou panicked. “So what? Qiao Xi’s reputation isn’t good anyway. It doesn’t matter even if she gets into one more scandal. Moreover, with the Xu family and President Gu around, who can say anything—”","Smack!","Before she could finish, Xu Zhi raised his hand and slapped her.","“Xia Yunlou! Let me warn you, Qiao Xi is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Xu Anran is just an adopted daughter. If I find out that you dare to frame Xi Xi again, I’ll divorce you!”","Xia Yunlou was not to be outdone. “You want to divorce me? If it weren’t for our Xia family, would the Xu family be where they are today? Besides, I’m Xi Xi’s mother. Would I harm her? Everything I do is for her own good!”","Xu Zhi’s face was full of ridicule. “Xia Yunlou, we’ve lived together for so many years. I still don’t understand your thoughts. You know very well why you did all of this!”","Even if Xia Yunlou didn’t like Qiao Xi, she was still her own daughter, after all. Why did she have to be ruthless to Qiao Xi every single time?","Xu Zhi’s eyes were full of disdain as he said word by word, “It’s because Xi Xi was raised by her. Xi Xi looks like her, and her personality is also similar to her. Seeing Xi Xi is like seeing her when she was young! You’re jealous of her because the position of Madam Xu should have been Xia Yunqiu’s!”","“Ah—!!” Xia Yunlou screamed like a madman, “Shut up!”","Xia Yunlou felt like she was about to explode!","Why?! Why did that woman have to be above her in every aspect? She had clearly been dead for so long, yet she was still haunting her like a ghost. No one could forget her!","Xu Zhi’s words completely angered her. Xia Yunlou roared crazily. “It’s all her fault! It’s all her fault! She’s the eldest daughter of the Xia family! She’s my mother’s favorite daughter! Even you treat her as Madam Xu in your heart! Worst of all, my daughter looks so similar to her. How can I not hate her?!","“She deserved to die! She should have disappeared completely. Why is she disturbing my life again?!”","Xu Zhi’s face was gloomy. “You b*tch! How dare you say such things?! You were the one who stole your sister’s engagement back then. You were the one who stole what originally belonged to her. What right do you have to hate her?","“Xi Xi was raised by Yunqiu herself, so what’s so strange about her being similar to her? Moreover, Xi Xi isn’t like Yunqiu but like your and Yunqiu’s mother, Old Madam Yin. Yunlou, how could you be so ignorant?!”","Just because she hated her biological sister, she wanted to destroy her biological daughter who resembled her sister?","Xu Zhi thought of those big shots behind Qiao Xi and instantly felt a chill down his spine.","Now, he only hoped that Xi Xi would not take issue with the Xu family. No matter what, they were related by blood. If she insisted on taking revenge, how could the Xu family endure it?","He had thought that his daughter was just a wild girl from the countryside. He didn’t expect her to have such powerful backers. Any one of them could make Li City tremble.","Xu Zhi’s eyes were cold. It seemed that he must obtain Qiao Xi’s forgiveness.","“Yunlou, apologize to Xi Xi immediately. You and Xu Anran must make Xi Xi forgive the Xu family. Otherwise...”","He took a deep breath and said, “Otherwise, we’ll divorce!”","Xia Yunlou suddenly raised her eyes and looked at the man in front of her in disbelief.","Divorce?","Although the two of them had not been happy in all these years, they were still kind to each other. Now, he wanted to divorce her for that b*tch?"]},{"number":609,"title":"Chapter 609 - Don’t Worry, Everything Is Fine","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou was really afraid that she would be abandoned, so she suppressed her anger. “What’s so difficult about asking Qiao Xi to forgive me? I’m her mother. If she makes things difficult for me, she’s unfilial!”","Didn’t Qiao Xi always hope to have a family? As long as she wanted a family, she had to forgive her and Anran. Otherwise, how could the Xu family accept her?","...","Longwan Residential.","The first thing Qiao Xi did when she got home was to open the presents.","The gift boxes filled the entire living room, each one more valuable than the last. The butler could not help but sigh. He had thought that the president had married a lady with a bitter life, but he did not expect that this lady was a real pearl and came from such a powerful background.","Qiao Xi picked out some gifts that she liked and put them in the bedroom. Gu Zheng then instructed the butler to keep the remaining gifts before he asked gently, “Shall we go upstairs?”","“Okay.” She nodded.","At this moment, Lele ran in happily and rushed in front of Qiao Xi. She lowered her eyes. “My grandfather used to have a dog too.”","Gu Zheng pursed his lips.","“Before this, the mountain was desolate. There were no flowers or trees, not to mention animals. So Grandpa had a dog. That dog was like Lele, always happy.","“Later on, Grandpa planted flowers and trees on the mountain. It gradually regained its vitality. Actually, I really don’t understand why a godly doctor like Grandpa had to live in such a remote place.”","Qiao Xi’s voice carried a trace of helplessness.","She had once asked her grandfather, but he only said, “Since you’re a miracle doctor, you have to be more mysterious. Of course, you can’t casually appear in front of people.”","However, now that she had grown up, she felt that her grandfather’s words were a little far-fetched. Why must miracle doctors be mysterious? It was probably because her grandfather was keeping a secret.","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent. “Why aren’t you curious why the divine physician brought you up the mountain?”","Qiao Xi suddenly fell silent. She really hadn’t thought about this question.","When she was driven to the countryside by the Qiao family, she was not even ten years old. There were only a dozen or so families in the village, and they were all so poor that they could not even put food on the table.","The Qiao family gave each family a sum of money, and everyone agreed to let Qiao Xi stay in the village.","Later on, when her grandfather and elder brother passed by the village, they found her and gave the villagers a sum of money to take her away. They also instructed the villagers not to tell anyone that she had left and to pretend that she had been staying in the village all along.","Now that she thought about it carefully, there were indeed many suspicious points.","In that poor village, the villagers were isolated from the world. Why would her grandfather and elder brother go to such a place? Could it be that they were there to pick her up and were not just passing by?","“But who should I ask? Grandfather has been missing for so long.”","Qiao Xi knew that the worst-case scenario was that her grandfather had already passed away. After all, her grandfather was getting on in years. He had been missing for two years, so it was very likely that he had already been killed. Even though she was using her identity as Black Tide to engage numerous hackers to search for him, there was still no clue.","Her grandfather had gone missing for two years, yet not a single trace was left behind. Qiao Xi truly didn’t dare imagine how formidable the other party’s ability was.","Suddenly, Qiao Xi’s phone flashed.","She looked down and saw that the screen of her phone had turned black.","Qiao Xi was stunned for a few seconds before suddenly realizing that her phone had been hacked.","She was a hacker! Although she was not the best in the hacker world, she was definitely in the top ten. Who could hack her phone?","Who was that hacker?","Qiao Xi angrily picked up her phone, wanting to retaliate. Unexpectedly, just as she was about to move, the screen flashed once again. A line of words appeared: [Don’t miss me, everything is fine. —Grandfather.]","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened abruptly as her body trembled uncontrollably.","She immediately picked up her phone, wanting to decode the other party’s code. However, she didn’t expect the other party’s technique to be so superb that she couldn’t decode it at the moment.","Gu Zheng also saw the words on the screen and could not help but frown. He was about to reach out when the screen flashed again—","[Little Six, you don’t need to get Mo Yuan to crack the code. I just want to say a few things.]","Qiao Xi knew that the person on the other end of the phone was indeed her grandfather, but she didn’t understand. Since her grandfather was still alive, why was he using such a method to speak to her? Moreover, he was even clearly aware that the person by her side was Mo Yuan?","[Little Six, I’m sorry for making you worry. I wish you happiness forever.]"]},{"number":610,"title":"Chapter 610 - Enemies Meet On A Narrow Road!","paragraphs":["[It’s not that I don’t want to see you, but there are some special reasons. I’ll appear one day. I know that you’ve been looking into your mother’s matters. Your mother and I were indeed old acquaintances. After your mother passed away, I knew that you were bullied by the Qiao family and was sent to the countryside. That’s why I brought your brother there to fetch you back.","[Little Six, I heard that you’ve found your biological parents. Your biological mother is called Xia Yunlou. I know they don’t treat you well. You don’t have to be sad because Xia Yunlou might not be your real biological mother.]","Qiao Xi gasped.","Xia Yunlou was not her biological mother? Then why did she acknowledge her?","[This is just a guess. I can’t confirm it. The most direct way is to do a paternity test. You can get Gu Zheng to help you. He’s your husband. He’ll help you solve all your problems. It’s a waste not to use him!]","Gu Zheng took a glance. This divine physician really didn’t treat him as an outsider!","[Little Six, don’t worry about me. When the time is right, I’ll appear.]","The last sentence stopped for a few seconds before the screen returned to normal.","Qiao Xi picked up her phone and wanted to trace the other party, but she didn’t find any clues.","Gu Zheng smirked. “The godly doctor’s hacking skills are actually so superb.”","Qiao Xi was slightly stunned. “This is my first time learning about it.”","What secrets did Grandpa have? Why was he hiding in the dark for two years without meeting them?","“Your grandfather said that he’s safe, so you don’t have to worry. When he’s done with whatever it is he’s doing, he’ll naturally appear.”","Qiao Xi nodded wearily.","Grandpa said that Xia Yunlou may not be her biological mother, so why did the Xu family still want to acknowledge her?","Fortunately, after today’s incident, the Xu family would not come looking for trouble with her.","The next morning.","Li Xing’er called. “Xi Xi, can you be my model? It wasn’t easy for my gown to be chosen, but I’m not satisfied with the models I’ve seen. Only your figure is most suitable. Come over and support me!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. “I’ll go too.”","Li Xing’er chuckled. “Oh! You just have to show your face and it’s only for an hour, but President Gu is still worried! I didn’t expect the famous President Gu to be so clingy!”","Li Xing’er was participating in a variety show. Every episode, they would select the works of a group of designers. Models would wear the clothes and walk on stage. Then, they would select the most beautiful model and the most influential designer.","Although it was a competition, everyone knew that the program team had already decided who the final champion would be. Everyone else was just going through the motions.","The gown designed by Li Xing’er was merely a foil and only appeared on camera for a total of ten seconds. But such an opportunity could only be chanced upon by luck, so Qiao Xi agreed.","“But I don’t know how to do a catwalk!”","“It’s okay, we’re all amateurs. Just walk around and don’t fall down. Anyway, everyone is there to be a foil to certain models or female celebrities. You just have to show the gown I designed well.”","The tip of Gu Zheng’s tongue brushed past his teeth. He revealed an unruly expression.","His Mrs. Gu was just a foil meant to highlight female celebrities?","Qiao Xi didn’t care. After asking Li Xing’er about the time and venue, she prepared to leave.","When she arrived at the scene, she found out the female celebrity’s identity.","“F*ck! Enemies really meet on a narrow road! That female celebrity is actually Xu Anran’s friend! If I had known, I definitely wouldn’t have asked you to come!”","Li Xing’er flew into a rage. “Forget it, I don’t need this show. Let’s go!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “Meng Meimei is an A-list celebrity. If you leave just like this, it’ll be a slap to her face. How are you going to survive in this industry in the future?”","“What the f*ck?!” Li Xing’er could not help but swear, “F*ck! I get angry every time I see her. She must not be a good person to be friends with Xu Anran.”","Qiao Xi raised her brows.","Meng Meimei, Xu Anran’s best friend?","“When did you submit the design draft?”","“About two months ago. The variety show had already issued a notice before filming started, and many designers submitted their drafts. I submitted my draft after I saw the announcement and was selected not long after.”"]},{"number":611,"title":"Chapter 611 - Qiao Xi Is My Wife","paragraphs":["Li Xing’er continued, “Before the show started filming, they had already sent me a notice saying that my gown had passed the selection, but as to which episode it would appear in, it wasn’t confirmed yet. I’ve been waiting for the news and was only notified of the exact time last week.”","Qiao Xi raised her brows. “What about Meng Meimei?”","Li Xing’er was a little hesitant, “I heard it was a special guest, but I remember that she wasn’t the one they invited! Could it be... Could it be that she stole someone else’s spot? You mean she did it on purpose?","“She’s Xu Anran’s best friend. After she heard about what happened between the two of you, she purposely chose to appear in this episode. Even if you couldn’t make it, she would probably embarrass me on the show instead...”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Yeah, looks like someone is standing up for Xu Anran again!”","With a calm expression, she slowly said, “I guess Xu Anran didn’t tell Meng Meimei the truth. If Meng Meimei knew my identity, she definitely wouldn’t attack me.","“I’ve always been a person who doesn’t attack unless I’m attacked first. If she wants to attack me, she’ll have to pay a painful price.”","...","At this moment, the production team was nervously leading the way for Gu Zheng. “President Gu, look, this is the editing room backstage. There’s a rest area behind.”","As this variety show was sponsored by Gu Corporation, Gu Zheng was like the boss of the show. Everyone was naturally respectful, afraid that they would offend this God of Fortune.","When the director received a call from Song Shiyu saying that Gu Zheng was coming to visit, he was scared out of his wits. He thought that there was something wrong with the show, but he didn’t expect that President Gu was just here to take a look.","After walking around the venue, the director brought Gu Zheng to the lounge.","Coincidentally, Meng Meimei was talking to her manager. “Anran is an A-list celebrity. Although she doesn’t act anymore, her status is still high. But she was actually bullied by a wild girl! This is too much!”","“I think Anran is too benevolent. With her ability, she can directly mobilize her own fans to deal with Qiao Xi. Those fans can curse Qiao Xi to death!”","Hearing her manager’s words, Meng Meimei nodded her head in affirmation. “That’s right! This time, Qiao Xi is also joining the show. Just wait and see how I teach her a lesson later! So what if she’s the daughter of the Xu family? Is she as powerful as Anran? I think she’s just an idiot! She dared to fight with Anran as soon as she returned to the Xu family. Who gave her the confidence?!”","The manager sneered. “She probably really thinks she’s the daughter of the Xu family and that she can do whatever she wants just because she has a status now. With Anran’s ability and identity, dealing with Qiao Xi is like crushing an ant.”","Meng Meimei’s eyes were vicious. “Go and see if she’s here. I’m going to teach her a lesson this time and take revenge for Anran. Let’s see if she still dares to be so arrogant in the future!”","Everyone outside the door broke out in a cold sweat. The director said nervously, “P-President Gu, this celebrity was hired at the last minute and we’re not familiar with her. If you don’t like her, we can replace her.”","The director knew that President Gu didn’t like people who played dirty tricks behind his back, not to mention that Qiao Xi wasn’t a celebrity and was just a model who came to make up the numbers.","Meng Meimei would probably never be able to work under Gu Corporation ever again.","As expected, Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. “I don’t want to see her.”","“P-President Gu... she’s a special guest this week. The notice has already been sent out. If we replace her...”","Gu Zheng looked up coldly. “Do you know who Qiao Xi is?”","The director thought for a few seconds and shook his head. “I don’t know. As a senior, it’s indeed a little overboard for Meng Meimei to target a newcomer, but this is a private grudge between them. It can’t affect the show! Why not...”","“Qiao Xi is my wife.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was calm, but it made people flustered without giving them the chance to respond.","The director raised his head and met that pair of deep and cold eyes. He felt cold sweat dripping down his back. Even if he wanted to plead for Meng Meimei, he didn’t have the guts.","He knew that Qiao Xi was invited by Li Xing’er. Li Xing’er was the eldest daughter of the Li family. Someone who could be the friend of this rich miss was definitely not an ordinary person. But he didn’t expect that Qiao Xi was actually President Gu’s wife."]},{"number":612,"title":"Chapter 612 - Special Guest Has Been Changed","paragraphs":["The director was silent for a moment, his body trembling slightly.","Regardless of anything else, he had the ability to become the director of this variety show under Gu Corporation. After calming down, he immediately replied, “I understand, President Gu. Actually, we’ve already arranged for two special guests. I’ll get the other female celebrity to save the situation.”","Gu Zheng’s voice was low. “Mm.”","Seeing that the big boss was satisfied, the director heaved a sigh of relief. “President Gu, how about... I bring you to the stage to take a look?”","Gu Zheng waved his hand and rejected, his tone carrying a hint of authority. “Deal with the matter I’ve instructed you to.”","“No problem, I’ll definitely get it done.”","The director nodded and bowed as he sent Gu Zheng off. As he watched Gu Zheng’s tall figure disappear at the end of the corridor, his stiff body softened a little. He then helplessly instructed his assistant, “Quickly call Jinzhou and invite her to come on the show first.”","The assistant looked troubled. “But Meng Meimei isn’t someone to be trifled with. What if she doesn’t agree and causes a scene?”","“She has already offended President Gu. How is she going to survive in the industry? Even if we don’t do anything, President Gu will definitely teach her a lesson. If we let her appear on the show, it’ll affect our viewership ratings!” The director snorted. “What bad luck! We just had to invite such an idiot who wants to teach Mrs. Gu a lesson!”","The assistant replied, “I heard from Meng Meimei that she’s here to avenge Xu Anran.”","“Xu Anran...” The director spat on the ground. “The two of them are indeed best friends. On camera, they look weak and gentle, but in private, they’re violent, vicious, and petty. It’s troublesome to work with such people. It’s better to replace people like them earlier than later.","“Don’t think too much. Hurry up and inform the staff that the special guest has been changed,” the director instructed impatiently. The show was about to start, so he had to brace himself.","...","On the other hand, Li Xing’er brought Qiao Xi into the dressing room. Her eyes lit up when she saw Qiao Xi walking out in the gown she designed. “Wow! This gown suits you so well. Only you can wear such a high-class gown!”","Updates by vipnovel.com","The two of them waited for 20 minutes, but no makeup artist came in. When they went out to ask, they realized that Meng Meimei had called all the makeup artists away. The remaining contestants didn’t have makeup artists either, so they could only rely on themselves.","Actually, everyone knew that they were just going through the motions. Meng Meimei was the champion of this episode, and they were already very satisfied to be able to show their faces on the show.","However, Li Xing’er was the eldest daughter of the Li family. She couldn’t stand the humiliation and immediately called her brother. Instantly, a professional makeup team arrived.","After putting on makeup for Qiao Xi, the makeup artists also put on makeup for the other contestants. The dressing room was harmonious.","“Miss Li, thank you so much. If it weren’t for you, we would’ve been in trouble.”","“The gown you designed is really nice!”","“Not only are the clothes nice but Miss Qiao is also really pretty. She’s beautiful, has a good figure, and has an outstanding temperament. She’s even better than professional models.”","“That’s right! I thought Miss Qiao was a professional! Wearing this gown makes you look like a fairy from a painting. If you guys can’t get a ranking, then...”","Actually, everyone knew in their hearts that Qiao Xi was the most beautiful model. It was a pity that the program had already internally selected Meng Meimei, the special guest. That was why Meng Meimei was so arrogant.","...","Meanwhile, in Meng Meimei’s dressing room.","Her dressing room was packed with people. It was obvious that one makeup artist was enough, but she insisted on having several of them surround her. She was unwilling to let anyone leave. No one dared to offend her, so they could only stay in the dressing room.","Meng Meimei’s assistant tried to persuade her. “Sister Meimei, why don’t you have the makeup artists leave? The others probably don’t have any makeup on. The director might be unhappy.”","Meng Meimei sat in front of the mirror and said arrogantly, “No one is allowed to leave. Why should those small-time models bother putting makeup on? Do you think the director doesn’t know anything? He won’t care about those small models. As long as I, the special guest, can appear in front of the camera in a glamorous manner, no one else is important.”","The moment she finished speaking, there was a commotion outside the door. The assistant pushed the door open and saw that it was a professional makeup team. Every member was very famous."]},{"number":613,"title":"Chapter 613 - The Same Purple Gown","paragraphs":["Meng Meimei’s assistant was shocked. “These people look like ‘Clearshadow’, a famous team of makeup artists.”","Meng Meimei abruptly turned around and gritted her teeth. “Did Qiao Xi use the Xu family’s connections? Otherwise, how could she have invited such a famous makeup team?","“B*tch! Not only did you steal Anran’s identity, but you even want to steal my limelight!”","The assistant frowned. She wanted to say that Xu Anran was not a good person. If she really hated Qiao Xi, why didn’t she deal with Qiao Xi herself but instead incited Meng Meimei to do it?","An hour later, all the models were done with their makeup. The director informed all the crew members to get ready. The shoot would officially begin in 20 minutes.","The models lifted their gowns and walked out of the dressing room. Meng Meimei also walked out in a purple gown and raised her head arrogantly. However—","“Wait! Why are you wearing the same color as me?”","The gown designed by Li Xing’er was also a purple long gown. It had passed the internal selection two months before the show started, and the judges all gave it high scores.","Now that Qiao Xi was wearing this dress, her fair skin and curvaceous figure added more vibrancy to this dress. She was so beautiful that one couldn’t take their eyes off her.","At this moment, Meng Meimei walked up to Qiao Xi angrily and glared at her fiercely. “Why are you wearing purple?”","The atmosphere instantly became awkward. Everyone lowered their heads and didn’t dare to make a sound. Everyone knew Meng Meimei’s identity, so no one dared to offend her.","The assistant director had just returned from outside and didn’t know that Meng Meimei had been replaced. He hurriedly came over to persuade her. “Miss Meng, please calm down. It’s just a small matter. Although it’s the same color, the style is completely different. It won’t affect the filming at all.”","“A small matter? Who is she to wear the same color as me?”","Meng Meimei said angrily. Then, she angrily threw her handbag on the ground and looked at Qiao Xi viciously. “I order you to take off your clothes! Now! Immediately!”","The entire place was silent.","Qiao Xi patted Li Xing’er’s hand to assure her and asked indifferently, “Why?”","“Why? Because I’m a senior and you’re just a model! I’m an A-list celebrity and a special guest, while you’re just an amateur model! Do you think you deserve to wear the same color as me?”","“When did Miss Meng hand her gown to the production team?”","Meng Meimei said disdainfully, “I’m different from you guys. As long as I bring a gown over, it’s automatically approved.”","Qiao Xi said unhurriedly, “But Xing’er’s gown was already approved two months ago. The production team didn’t say that there was anything wrong with the gown.”","What she meant was that even the production team said that there was no problem, so why was Meng Meimei kicking up a fuss?","Even if the production team had requested that there should not be any clashing colors, it was Li Xing’er who submitted her gown first. Everything was first come, first served. By right, Meng Mei should be the one changing her gown.","Meng Meimei pointed at Qiao Xi and gnashed her teeth in anger. “You, what do you mean by that?! I told you to take it off. Are you deaf? The production team doesn’t have the final say. If I tell you to take it off, you have to!”","The manager also stood up and snorted. “Miss Qiao, since you’re here to participate in the competition, you should know the rules. Meimei is your senior, so how can you wear the same color as her?”","Then she scolded Li Xing’er, “You must be a new designer too! Let me remind you, if you want to survive in this industry, don’t offend our Meimei. Otherwise, you’ll have to bear the consequences!”","The manager was sure that Li Xing’er was just a small designer without any background. If she had a background, she would not have come to participate in this kind of show as just a regular designer.","Li Xing’er clenched her fists. No one had ever dared to threaten her like this.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “Miss Meng, I would like to ask who set the rule that we can’t wear the same color? If you feel that it’s inappropriate, you can ask the judges or the production team to give the final say. Moreover, although our gowns have similar colors, the style is completely different.","“Could it be that you have the right to change the rules of the program? If that’s the case, why would we need to participate in the program at all?”","As soon as these words were spoken, the air seemed to have almost frozen. The atmosphere became oppressive. Even though everyone disliked Meng Mei, no one dared to stand up for Qiao Xi."]},{"number":614,"title":"Chapter 614 - Who Are You Threatening?","paragraphs":["Li Xing’er took out her phone and complained to her brother about what was happening at the scene. Shortly after, her brother sent a message: [I told you I didn’t want you to participate in that variety show. Can’t you just stay home and inherit your assets...? Okay, don’t be angry. I’ll help you deal with that little celebrity.]","Li Xing’er: [I must work harder or you’ll drag me back to inherit the family assets.]","Qiao Xi’s words instantly angered Meng Meimei. She roared. “Purple is my lucky color! Don’t you know? You clearly know that I’m participating in the show, yet you still dare to fight with me. You must be doing this on purpose!”","Before participating in the show, everyone would do their research on who the guests of the show were so as to avoid getting into conflicts like this. If they learned that Meng Meimei liked the color purple, they wouldn’t choose purple gowns.","But Li Xing’er’s gown was approved two months ago. At that time, it was not confirmed who the special guest was, so this matter could not be avoided.","More importantly, as a special guest, Meng Meimei could take a look at the design drafts of other designers. When she first saw that someone had designed a purple gown, she could have discussed the situation with the production team then. At that time, she could have requested Li Xing’er to change the gown. However, she just had to wait until it was time to go on stage before she got angry.","Besides, who made the rule that if she liked purple, others could not wear it?","Qiao Xi sneered. “Miss Meng, could it be that you bought the copyright to the color purple and only you can wear this color in this world? To be honest, I’m also a designer. I’ve been a designer for so many years, but I’ve never heard of purple being exclusive to someone. You can treat purple as your lucky color. This is your right, but you don’t have the authority to restrict others from choosing what color they want to wear.”","The assistant immediately tried to persuade her. “Sister Meimei, why don’t you forget it? She’s just a small model, don’t—”","Meng Meimei shouted angrily, “Shut up! I won’t allow anyone to wear the same color as me! Purple is my exclusive color. No one else can wear it wherever I’m around! If anyone wears it, it’ll be plagiarism. It’ll be considered as taking advantage of my popularity!”","She glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. “Ha! You said you’re a designer? Do you think you’re worthy of being a designer? So, any Tom, Dick, or Harry can be a designer? Since you’re a designer, you should know that my lucky color is purple. If you fight with me, I have the ability to make you—”","“Who is Miss Meng threatening?”","Before she could finish, a cold male voice was heard.","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw the director walking respectfully with a tall, handsome, and powerful man.","Updates by vipnovel.com","Everyone did not know this man, but they could recognize the special assistant who was with him—Song Shijing.","The famous Song Shijing was President Gu’s personal assistant!","Song Shijing and Song Shiyu were President Gu’s most trusted men. If they could give orders on behalf of President Gu, then the person who could make Song Shijing accompany him had to be Gu Zheng himself!","The manager gasped.","Before she could warn Meng Meimei, the furious Meng Meimei exploded. “Director! You’re finally here. This model is wearing the same-colored clothes as me. She—”","“Miss Meng, let me ask you again. Who were you threatening just now?” Song Shijing’s voice was cold.","Meng Meimei looked up at Song Shijing. She felt that she had seen this man somewhere before, but she couldn’t remember where. Gu Zheng had caught her attention.","Although she had never seen Gu Zheng before, she could tell from his clothes and bearing that this man had a noble status. Thus, she immediately explained in an aggrieved manner, “Sir, I’m not trying to make things difficult for this newcomer, but she’s just a small model. She doesn’t respect her seniors and deliberately wore purple to anger me. She’s too much!”","Song Shijing smirked. “Didn’t Miss Li just say that her gown was approved two months ago? She didn’t do it on purpose.”","“But everyone in the design industry knows that purple is my exclusive color. Since they know that I’ll be participating in the show, they should’ve avoided the color purple!”","“Haha.” Song Shijing sneered.","Meng Meimei felt a little guilty. “If she changes her clothes, I...”"]},{"number":615,"title":"Chapter 615 - Offended The Lady Boss","paragraphs":["“That’s not necessary.” Song Shijing interrupted her. “It’s going to be a lot of trouble to do a replacement. Wouldn’t it be easier to just quit the competition? Then we won’t have to waste everyone’s time.”","When Meng Meimei heard this, she beamed with joy. It seemed like this gentleman was going to help her.","There was nothing strange about this. She was a special guest on this variety show, so naturally, these people would side with her.","“Thank you—”","“Then please leave now, Miss Meng. Don’t disturb the program anymore.” Song Shijing interrupted Meng Meimei with a mocking expression.","The smile on Meng Meimei’s face gradually disappeared, and her eyes were filled with disbelief. She even thought she had heard wrongly. “What?”","“Am I not clear? Miss Meng! You’ve been replaced! And you will face a ban!”","The manager and Meng Meimei turned pale.","Meng Meimei was stunned for a few seconds before she started laughing maniacally. “Are you kidding me? What right do you have to replace me? What right do you have to ban me? I’m under Gu Corporation. What right do you have to ban me?”","“Yes, I don’t have the right...” Song Shijing smiled. “But our president does.”","He bowed slightly to invite the man behind him to step forward. At this moment, Gu Zheng slowly raised his eyes, his sharp gaze sweeping across the crowd. His body was surrounded by a cold aura. He seemed to have descended among the crowd like a god.","Meng Meimei’s manager had never met Gu Zheng before, but Song Shijing had called him the president. Her heart sank.","“Who’s your president?” Meng Meimei still didn’t realize the danger she was in and questioned arrogantly.","“President Gu Zheng.”","When this name was mentioned, everyone’s breathing stopped. Meng Meimei’s eyes widened as she looked at the man in front of her in fear. Her voice trembled slightly as she said, “T-This...”","Meng Meimei’s manager was the first to react. She immediately cried and begged for mercy. “President Gu, please give Meimei another chance. She shouldn’t have made things difficult for the newcomer. She already knows her mistake. We’ll withdraw from this program now. Please spare her. She’ll remember this lesson, but the ban... The ban...","“No matter what, Meimei is still an A-list celebrity. She’s outstanding in all aspects, and the company has spent a lot of money on her. If we ban her now, it won’t be good for the company either...”","This was the first time Meng Meimei had seen her manager begging for help. She finally realized that she had offended someone she shouldn’t have.","Her eyes were filled with remorse, and tears streamed down her cheeks.","“President Gu! I really know my mistake now. Please give me a chance!”","Meng Meimei ran to Gu Zheng and begged him in a humble manner.","Gu Zheng, who had been silent for a long time, suddenly sneered and said in a low voice, “Miss Meng, you said that you know your mistake. Do you know what you did wrong, then?”","“I... I was wrong. I shouldn’t have made things difficult for the newbie. I shouldn’t have embarrassed the company and you!”","“So... you think you’ve offended me?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his eyes full of disdain.","Meng Meimei’s face turned pale. Wasn’t that the case?","Qiao Xi shook her head helplessly. It seemed like Gu Zheng was going to use his skills to humiliate his newest victim again.","As expected, Gu Zheng’s thin lips parted slightly. “No, the person you offended isn’t me. It’s Mrs. Gu.”","Mrs. Gu?","Meng Meimei was confused. She didn’t even know Mrs. Gu, so how could she have offended her? She came to the show today just to teach Qiao Xi a lesson. Who knew that Qiao Xi would coincidentally wear a purple gown as well, so...","Wait! Mrs. Gu? Qiao Xi?","Meng Meimei looked up abruptly, her face filled with disbelief.","Could it be that... Mrs. Gu was...","How was this possible?! Didn’t Xu Anran say that Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside and was an ignorant idiot? If she had known that Qiao Xi was Mrs. Gu, she wouldn’t have dared to target her own lady boss!","Qiao Xi slowly walked in front of her and said in a low voice, “Have you ever thought about why Xu Anran didn’t personally take action if I’m really just the daughter of the Xu family who has led a wandering life? Why did she come to you and complain about me instead? It’s because she can’t defeat me, so she used you to deal with me.”","Meng Meimei’s body trembled as cold sweat seeped out of her back."]},{"number":616,"title":"Chapter 616 - Came Here To Apologize","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi sized up Meng Meimei with a smile before silently turning around to leave.","Everyone followed Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng as they left. The originally congested corridor immediately became much more spacious. Meng Meimei’s entire body went limp as she slid along the wall to the ground.","She was trembling with remorse and anger.","Xu Anran!","...","The variety show officially started filming, and no one caused any trouble, so the show proceeded smoothly. After filming, Qiao Xi directly entered the dressing room, changed her clothes, and went out. She saw Gu Zheng standing at the door, waiting for her.","“Mrs. Gu, you’re really multi-talented. You could even walk so well on the runway.” Gu Zheng smiled devilishly and held her hand as they walked out the door. He said leisurely, “And you’re very beautiful too.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment, but she couldn’t help herself and ultimately still asked after getting into the car, “Am I really beautiful?”","“Very beautiful, more beautiful than anyone else. If you enter the modeling industry, I’m afraid no other models will be able to make a living.”","As soon as Gu Zheng finished speaking, Qiao Xi was instantly speechless. She never realized that Gu Zheng was so mushy when he spoke sweet words.","The car suddenly jolted, and only then did Qiao Xi realize that this wasn’t the way back home. She asked curiously, “Where are you taking me?”","“Nine Heavens Villa,” Gu Zheng said indifferently. “Your property.”","Qiao Xi thought for a moment before realizing that there was a villa among the assets her mother had left behind for her, but no one had gone there for a long time. The place must be a little old, so she didn’t understand why Gu Zheng wanted to bring her there.","Gu Zheng said gently, “To celebrate your birthday.”","“Didn’t we celebrate it yesterday?”","He pondered for a moment. “Others gave you birthday presents, but I haven’t. Besides, someone you hate has come to our house. Let’s not go back for now.”","Song Shijing said unhurriedly, “Young Madam, the president has ordered people to renovate the villa and build a hot spring area. Professionals have tested the place and there are no problems with the air and water quality.","“More importantly, the president even remodeled the villa’s backyard into a yard that belongs solely to you. He named it Night Tide Yard. You’ll definitely like it.”","Qiao Xi’s interest was instantly piqued when she heard this. She never expected that Gu Zheng would prepare such a surprise birthday present behind her back.","However, Qiao Xi was very curious about who that annoying person in Longwan Residential was. Why did Gu Zheng not want her to see that person?","...","At this moment, at Longwan Residential.","The butler looked at Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran. He said helplessly, “Madam Xu, I’m really sorry. Our president and young madam have gone on a long trip. They won’t be back today. You can come back another day!”","Xia Yunlou’s face darkened. “Call her immediately and tell Qiao Xi that I want to see her!”","When the butler heard Xia Yunlou address the young madam so rudely, he instantly frowned. “Madam Xu, I’m just a butler. I don’t have the right to pry into their private matters, much less disturb the couple’s lives. If you really have something urgent that requires you to meet them, why don’t you call Young Madam directly?”","Xia Yunlou was so stunned that she could not speak. After calming down for a long time, she shouted angrily, “I’m her mother! How dare you talk to me like that?! If you anger me, I’ll make her chase you out of Longwan Residential!”","“I have no objections if President and Young Madam want to chase me away, but you don’t seem to have the authority to do so. If there’s nothing else, please leave!”","“You... You let Qiao Xi out! Why is she avoiding me? I’m here to apologize. Could it be that she won’t forgive her own mother for the rest of her life?”","The butler pursed his lips. “So, you’re here to apologize, Madam Xu! I thought you were here to pick a fight! But no matter what you’re here for, the President and Young Madam are not here. If you still don’t give up, don’t blame us for being rude to you. Song Shiyu, come out now!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shiyu ran out of the hall in a hurry and said with a fake smile, “Everyone, my brother has gone out with the president and the young madam. They really won’t be coming back tonight. It’s not a good idea for you to block the Longwan Residential. If you continue to cause trouble here, I’ll have to call Mr. Xu and ask him to pick you up personally.”","Xia Yunlou was somewhat afraid."]},{"number":617,"title":"Chapter 617 - Second Brother Is Here","paragraphs":["Seeing this, Xu Anran said gently, “Sorry to have disturbed you. We’ll leave now.","“Mom, let it go. I don’t think Sister will forgive us. We’ll come back in a few days, okay?”","The butler looked at Xu Anran who was pretending to be weak and snorted. He closed the door and isolated the family outside.","The people from the Xu family looked disgusting.","...","The few of them got into the car unwillingly. Xia Yunlou and the two siblings wiped away their tears. “Boo-hoo... I’m Qiao Xi’s biological mother! But your father actually asked me to lower my head and apologize to her. If this gets out, where will I put my dignity?!”","Xu Anran also shed a few tears as she sobbed. “Mom, I’m sorry... It’s all my fault. If it weren’t for me, you wouldn’t have to suffer like this. Actually... I should have left long ago.”","“Anran! Don’t say that. How could I bear to let you leave!” Xia Yunlou immediately stopped her. Then, she gritted his teeth and said, “For Qiao Xi’s sake, your dad actually wants to divorce me! Why did I give birth to this jinx of a daughter?! Before she came back, the family was very harmonious. The moment she came back, the entire family fell into chaos!”","A trace of ruthlessness flashed past Xu Anran’s eyes. “But... But what else can we do? For the sake of your marriage, we can only lower our heads and apologize. Why don’t I go and beg Qiao Xi? I’ll kneel down and beg for her forgiveness!”","Xia Yunlou held her hand tightly, and her eyes were filled with heartache. “Anran, how can I bear to let you kneel down to her? I have a better idea. I’ll definitely make Qiao Xi forgive us.”","She lowered her voice and whispered to Xu Anran.","“But...” Xia Yunlou was in a difficult position. “If that’s the case, you won’t be able to keep your identity as the eldest daughter of the Xu family anymore. It’ll still be hard for you...”","Tears welled up in Xu Anran’s eyes as she said pitifully, “It’s alright. As long as she can forgive us and not ruin my parents’ marriage, I don’t mind being wronged.”","...","Nine Heavens Villa.","When they arrived, it was already the afternoon and the sky was a little dark.","“The weather feels a little cold. I’d better not soak in the hot spring today,” Qiao Xi muttered to herself, and as soon as she finished speaking, her slightly cold body fell into a wide and warm embrace.","Gu Zheng took off his coat and draped it over her. He wrapped her in his arms and chased away all the cold in an instant. “The scenery at the villa is beautiful. Let’s walk together.”","She nodded with a smile. Suddenly, she noticed a figure standing in the corner. She asked in surprise, “Second Brother?”","Luo Qing, who was dressed in black, was hiding in a corner. He lowered his head, and his black hair covered his eyes. He stood there like a statue as though the cold wind couldn’t affect him at all.","Those gray eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s. It was the symbol of the Luo family’s bloodline to show their noble status.","He pursed his lips tightly. His handsome face was well-defined and filled with coldness. When he saw the young woman in front of him, he revealed a gentle smile.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with surprise as she anxiously said, “Gu Zheng, wait for me. I’ll go talk to Second Brother.”","Gu Zheng knew that she had four brothers. They were all big shots too. He would not be jealous of them. He nodded gently and stood at the same spot to wait for her.","Song Shijing watched Qiao Xi run over and asked in a low voice, “President, will you be unhappy to see Young Madam alone with other men?”","Gu Zheng looked indifferent and said casually, “Are you close to Song Shiyu?”","Song Shijing looked confused.","Gu Zheng said, “You know that Song Shiyu’s salary has been deducted, so you’re deciding to stand in unison with him, huh? You two are indeed close!”","Song Shijing: “...” ‘President that’s not what I meant. I just saw that you didn’t look too good, so I asked.”","Gu Zheng smiled.","He believed that there was only kinship between Qiao Xi and her brothers. There were no romantic feelings between them. It was just that when he saw her being intimate with other men, he still felt a little sour in his heart. This was an emotion that a normal man would have, but he would restrain himself. Otherwise, he would scare the young woman.","Moreover, he was clearly aware in his heart that Luo Qing and the other brothers treated Qiao Xi as their own younger sister and truly loved her. This was the most precious kinship in Qiao Xi’s heart."]},{"number":618,"title":"Chapter 618 - Leaving Her Husband At The Door","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng would never destroy whatever was precious to her, including kinship.","More importantly, her junior liked gentle men. To make sure she would keep liking him, he would maintain a gentle image.","On the other hand.","“Second Brother, why didn’t you tell me that you were coming?”","“This is your birthday present.”","Luo Qing handed the black box in his hand to Qiao Xi. “I didn’t know when’s your birthday, but now that I know, I’ll give you this hidden weapon as a gift.”","Qiao Xi took it from him and looked at him with a smile. “This is the birthday that the Xu family set for me. Actually, my mother had previously set it on a different day. You didn’t have to give me a birthday present. Otherwise, you’ll have to give me one next year too!”","“Don’t worry. Just keep it. I’ll prepare something better for you next time.”","Qiao Xi knew that her gloomy second brother had always been a man of few words. He would only say a few more words when facing her. She couldn’t help but feel warm in her heart. She slowly opened the box. “Teacher has already given me this hidden weapon.”","Luo Qing frowned. “Teacher’s hidden weapons aren’t as powerful as mine. Not only can my hidden weapons protect you, but they can also avoid getting detected by metal instruments. Moreover, it’s difficult to find any traces of it in surveillance cameras. Even if you attack, others won’t be able to catch any clues.”","Qiao Xi’s mouth gaped open in shock.","What was wrong with Second Brother today? He was so abnormal! He actually said so much in one breath.","However, she had to admit that Second Brother understood her well. He knew that she liked to use hidden weapons when there were a lot of people around. That was why he created a hidden weapon that would not be detected by others. This made it easier for her to teach some petty people a lesson.","Qiao Xi took out the hidden weapon and studied it carefully. There seemed to be a medicinal fragrance lingering on it. “What smell is that? Why haven’t I smelled it before? Is it newly developed?”","“Qin An developed it.”","Knowing that it would be troublesome to ask her second brother, Qiao Xi directly gave Qin An a call.","Qin An smiled sinisterly. “You definitely won’t be able to guess what this thing is used for. I specially developed it for you. Aren’t you always around women who don’t mean what they say? In front of others, they pretend to be kind-hearted and weak, but behind others, they’re more ruthless than anyone. For example, Xu Anran.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes instantly lit up. “Don’t tell me that this medicine will cause one to reveal what’s in one’s heart?! You’re too awesome! Holy sh*t!”","“You’re thinking too much. I’m not that capable!”","Qin An’s words shattered Qiao Xi’s fantasy as he seriously explained, “In the future, if she tries to put on an act in front of you again, you can try to use this hidden weapon on her. If she gets hit by a needle laced with this medicine, it can cause her facial expression to go out of control. For example, the corners of her mouth will start twitching or her eyes will start to blink randomly. This way, no one will believe anything she says.”","Qiao Xi seemed to be lost in thought. “There are many ways to deal with Xu Anran. Why did you give me a harmless concealed weapon like this?”","Qin An gave a sly smile. “You’ll understand in a while. Little Six, I know you like to pretend to be weak, so I gave you this hidden weapon. Before long, you’ll know the benefits of this hidden weapon.”","Qiao Xi pouted coquettishly. “How annoying! I really am weak!”","The two of them walked to the Night Tide Courtyard together. Luo Qing said, “Alright, I’ll go back first. Go back to your room and rest.”","Qiao Xi nodded as she watched Luo Qing leave. She suddenly felt as if she had forgotten something and stood on the spot to think for a minute before suddenly reacting.","Wait! Where’s Gu Zheng?","She had left her husband at the door!","...","Gu Zheng lifted his eyes to look at the drizzling rain in the sky. His body was shrouded in mist, and his hair was dripping with rainwater. His entire body was emitting a cold aura.","At this moment, he was chuckling as he looked into the distance. Qiao Xi was running toward him in a panic. He sneered. “Mrs. Gu, so you still knew to come back?”","Qiao Xi, who had forgotten about her husband: “...” ‘Gu Zheng, can you stop smiling? I’m scared!’","Qiao Xi’s face was immediately filled with flattery. “I heard that you prepared a courtyard for me, so I couldn’t help but take a look. But I immediately came back to pick you up.”","Gu Zheng sized her up with his deep eyes and said in a low voice, “Is that so?”","“Mhm, mhm!” Qiao Xi nodded her head like a chick pecking at rice. She could only brace herself and admit that if she were to say that she had forgotten about Gu Zheng while walking with Second Brother, this man would definitely hold a grudge."]},{"number":619,"title":"Chapter 619 - Relaxing In The Hot Springs Together","paragraphs":["Seeing that Gu Zheng was silent, she quickly changed the topic. “I found the indoor hot springs next to Night Tide Court! It’s raining now, so we can’t go outside. Why don’t we go to the indoor hot springs together?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes burned with passion. After a few seconds of silence, he asked word by word, “Are you sure you want to go with me?”","Qiao Xi didn’t hesitate in the slightest. “Yes, let’s go together!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes to hide his desire.","...","20 minutes later, Qiao Xi arrived at the indoor hot springs in a bathrobe. The floor was also warm, and the room emitted a faint fragrance that made one feel very comfortable.","Gu Zheng’s hot breath came close and landed beside her ear, causing her to shiver.","“Mrs. Gu, why aren’t you going in?”","Qiao Xi only felt her entire body tremble. She only wanted to relax in the hot spring, but when she was changing her clothes earlier, Gu Zheng had said something into her ear. “Junior, you were the one who invited me to go to the hot springs with you, so don’t blame me for what happens later. After all, you’re too tempting. I’m truly unable to control myself.”","She really did not expect that the seemingly decent President Gu would actually be so passionate in private. Moreover, he was really too strong in that aspect, so strong that it was scary.","“Y-You go first. I’ll wait a moment.” Qiao Xi’s face was red as she stammered out a reply.","Tempting? Unable to control himself? Did Gu Zheng really say these?","Besides, she was only wearing a thin bathing suit under her bathrobe. It was basically the same as her not wearing anything!","Gu Zheng’s scorching gaze sized up her body, moving down her fair neck and landing on her chest for a moment before his breathing became heavy.","“Alright, you can take your time.”","Qiao Xi glared at him fiercely. ‘Ha, you bastard! If you hadn’t tormented me until I was weak all over the previous time, would I be so afraid?’","However, she could only complain in her heart. There was still an ingratiating smile on her face. “I suddenly don’t really want to soak in the hot springs anymore. Why don’t you enjoy the hot springs yourself? I’ll wait here.”","Gu Zheng ignored her and slowly took off his bathrobe, revealing his eight packs and muscular chest. He had broad shoulders and a narrow waist. His model-like figure came into Qiao Xi’s view.","Qiao Xi: “Gulp...” Although she had seen Gu Zheng’s body many times, she still couldn’t help but swallow her saliva. His figure was truly too alluring.","The blush on her cheeks spread to her ears as she stammered, “G-Gu Zheng, get dressed.”","The man slowly turned around and looked at her flushed cheeks with interest. With an innocent expression, he said, “How am I going to soak in the hot spring if I don’t take off my clothes? Don’t tell me you don’t take off your clothes in the hot springs?”","Qiao Xi, who was standing at the side, instantly choked up. She stood at the same spot and imagined the two of them soaking in the hot springs together. They would kiss and hug each other. It was not only Gu Zheng who could not hold himself back; even she couldn’t control herself!","Gu Zheng entered the hot springs and leaned against the edge lazily. He closed his eyes contentedly and enjoyed the warmth enveloping him.","At this moment, the maid walked in with hot tea and looked at Qiao Xi in confusion. “Young Madam, why aren’t you going into the hot springs?”","Qiao Xi felt her limbs go limp, so she blurted out, “I... I’ll wait until he’s done. Otherwise, he definitely won’t be able to hold himself back.”","The maid’s lips twitched. “Young Madam, you’re overthinking.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Damn! In your eyes, Gu Zheng is a gentleman, huh? You don’t know how much of a beast he is in private!’","After a while, the maid tactfully left Night Tide Court, leaving only the couple in the large courtyard.","Gu Zheng leaned comfortably against the edge of the hot springs as though he had fallen asleep.","Qiao Xi squatted down and asked softly, “Gu Zheng?”","Seeing that Gu Zheng didn’t have any reaction, Qiao Xi finally let out a sigh of relief. It looked like he was asleep. Hence, it should be fine if she took advantage of this time to soak in the hot springs!","The water quality here in Nine Heavens Villa was the best in the entire Li City, and Night Tide Courtyard was in the upper reaches of the villa. Not only was the water clean, but the environment was also beautiful. If she missed this opportunity, who knew how long she would have to wait for the next time?","Qiao Xi waved her hand in front of Gu Zheng’s eyes. After confirming that he was really asleep, she quietly took off her bathrobe and carefully stepped into the hot springs.","The ‘sleeping’ Gu Zheng’s lips curled up slightly, but his expression remained indifferent for the most part."]},{"number":620,"title":"Chapter 620 - Leaving The Entertainment Industry","paragraphs":["The sky outside was still gloomy, and the surroundings were silent. Only the pattering of rain could be heard. Qiao Xi leaned against the pool and sighed comfortably.","She did not know when she fell asleep, but when she opened her eyes, she was already on the small couch in the room inside Night Tide Court.","Qiao Xi propped herself up and looked around. Where was Gu Zheng?","Although she didn’t know how long she had been sleeping, it was already a little dark outside. The lights around Night Tide Courtyard were already lit up. Qiao Xi put on a coat and held an umbrella as she followed the path to find Gu Zheng.","At this moment, she heard a commotion. “Let us in! I’m Qiao Xi’s elder sister. I have something important to discuss with her!”","When Qiao Xi heard this voice, she abruptly looked up. Why was Xu Anran here?","She looked at the door and sized up Xu Anran. She realized that she was recording something on her phone.","Just as she was about to step forward, someone suddenly held her hand. Gu Zheng had unknowingly appeared beside her. He said gently, “Go back to your room. Leave this to me.”","Qiao Xi shook her head. “How can I do that? They’ll probably be disappointed if I don’t make an appearance.”","She stood at the same spot and watched for a while. Then, she realized that Xu Anran was holding her phone and doing a live broadcast. Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran had come here to apologize on a live broadcast because they wanted to use the fans’ power to force her to forgive them. If she rejected them, those fans would definitely scold her for not knowing what was good for her.","At the door, Xia Yunlou was still crying and begging humbly, “I’m Xi Xi’s biological mother. Please let me in. I just want to see her, boo-hoo...”","The maid stopped her. “Our president and young madam are resting. We don’t dare to go in and disturb them. If you’re really Young Madam’s mother, why don’t you call them directly? What’s the use of arguing here?”","A trace of resentment flashed past Xu Anran’s eyes.","Xia Yunlou was crying her eyes out. “She’s not answering my calls...”","Seeing how pitiful she was, the maid couldn’t bear to reject her. Hence, she nodded. “Alright, then. I’ll ask Young Madam. If you’re really her mother, she’ll definitely invite you in.”","Xia Yunlou smiled smugly. They were currently doing a live broadcast. Qiao Xi would be thought of as unfilial if she didn’t appear.","No matter how outstanding a person was, as long as they were accused of being unfilial, their reputation would be ruined. Coupled with the power of public opinion, Qiao Xi would be the one begging them to let the matter rest.","...","Ten minutes ago.","The car stopped at the entrance of the hot springs villa. Xia Yunlou looked at the gloomy weather and frowned. “The weather is terrible. Why don’t we come back another day?”","Xu Anran smiled and said, “Mom, it’s good that the weather is bad. Only then can we show our sincerity.”","Xia Yunlou also felt that what she said made sense. The fact that they still came to Nine Heavens Villa to look for Qiao Xi on a rainy day showed how difficult it was for them. If Qiao Xi still refused to see them, Xu Anran’s fans would definitely scold her for being unfilial.","As soon as she finished speaking, Xu Anran threw the umbrella away. Her thin dress was instantly drenched by the rain. She raised her hand and messed up her hair before starting a live broadcast.","Xu Anran had a lot of fans. As soon as she started the live broadcast, many fans rushed in, and the number of fans increased.","[Wow! Anran is doing a live broadcast!]","[Why didn’t the studio inform us? We almost missed our goddess’ live broadcast!]","[Where is she? Anran seems to be in the rain. Is she filming?]","Xu Anran’s eyes were slightly red as tears mixed with the rainwater. Her voice trembled slightly. “Everyone, I’m sorry. I want to announce something important. I’ve decided... to leave the entertainment circle.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the entire broadcast room was in an uproar.","Although Xu Anran no longer acted, she could still be considered a popular female celebrity. For her to suddenly announce her withdrawal from the entertainment circle was a big piece of news.","It quickly attracted some entertainment reporters, and the number of viewers reached the peak.","Fans asked: [Goddess Anran, why do you want to quit the entertainment industry?]","[Why are you crying? Did someone bully you?]","Xu Anran sobbed, “No... No one bullied me. Actually, this matter started 20 years ago. At that time, my mother was giving birth in the hospital but the nurse accidentally carried the wrong child over, causing the Xu family’s biological daughter to be stranded outside. So... I’m not the real daughter of the Xu family!”"]},{"number":621,"title":"Chapter 621 - Acting Pitiful On A Live Broadcast","paragraphs":["The live broadcast screen went silent. The fans even suspected that it was a prank.","Everyone knew that Xu Anran was the eldest daughter of the Xu family and had a powerful backer. That was why she was able to stand firm in the entertainment circle. If it wasn’t for the Xu family, how could she have achieved so much in such a short period of time? After all, the entertainment circle had never lacked beauties.","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. She wiped her tears and sniffled. “My parents have already found their biological daughter. For the past 20 years, my parents and brother have been very good to me. Even though they know that I’m not their biological child, they still treat me like I am. However, I know that everything I have is supposed to belong to someone else. I’m the one who’s occupying someone else’s identity.","“My younger sister isn’t as lucky as I am. She grew up in the countryside and suffered all kinds of grievances. It’s reasonable that she doesn’t want to forgive me. Moreover, she said that as long as I stay in the Xu family, she won’t go home. Hence, I’ve decided to move out of the Xu family.”","Xu Anran said tearfully, “I know it’s all my fault. If I hadn’t taken over her identity, she wouldn’t have suffered so much. That’s why I’m willing to leave the Xu family, my parents, and my brother. I won’t accept any resources in the entertainment industry anymore.","“Everyone knows that I’ve been doing well in the entertainment industry all these years because of my family’s help. Without the Xu family, no one else would care about me. Hence, I’ve decided to quit...”","When she said this, she suddenly choked and cried in grief. Then, a noble-looking woman hugged her shoulders and comforted her gently. “Don’t cry, Anran.”","Xu Anran’s voice trembled. “Mom...”","“Mom, you don’t have to leave with me. I’m the one my sister hates. Why should I implicate you? I’ll persuade her to go home.”","Xia Yunlou’s heart ached as she cried. “This isn’t your fault! At that time, you were just a baby and didn’t know anything. It was the nurse who carried over the wrong baby. You grew up in the Xu family since you were young. I’ve always considered you a child of the Xu family. How could she blame everything on you?”","“Mom, don’t say anymore. My younger sister will be unhappy. You and Dad finally found her. We’ve even braved the heavy rain to rush to Nine Heavens Villa to ask for her forgiveness. I don’t need anything else as long as you and Dad are happy.”","Xia Yunlou pounded her chest. “Anran, my poor daughter! You’re here compromising, but she made your father so angry that he can’t even get up from bed now. If it isn’t because she’s my biological daughter, forget it...”","The live broadcast was silent for a few seconds before it exploded.","[F*ck! I didn’t expect a drama like this to happen in real life. Anran and the real daughter of the Xu family were accidentally swapped. 20 years later, the real daughter of the Xu family appeared. Now, she wants to chase Anran away!]","[Although Anran is not the real daughter of the Xu family, she has lived in the Xu family for 20 years, after all. She has accompanied the Xu couple for so many years and can be considered their daughter. Why must that real daughter chase Anran away the moment she comes back?]","[Yeah, and I think Madam Xu is reluctant too. She’s even crying from sadness!]","[I heard that after the Xu family’s real daughter was mistakenly adopted by Madam Xu’s biological sister. After that, Madam Xu’s biological sister passed away and she even left all her assets to her. Since she no longer has to worry about food and clothing, why must she return to the Xu family? I think she’s just selfish!]","[It’s still raining outside! Madam Xu and Anran braved the rain to rush over, but she’s hiding in Nine Heavens Villa and refuses to come out. This person is too ruthless! No wonder Madam Xu doesn’t like her biological daughter!]","Then, the two of them went up the mountain in the rain and walked to the entrance of Night Tide Courtyard. However, they were stopped by a maid.","Xu Anran lowered her eyes as a trace of sinisterness flashed past her eyes. She had guessed that Qiao Xi wouldn’t come out to see them. It just so happened that she was doing a live broadcast. This way, everyone would think that Qiao Xi was heartless.","Xia Yunlou cried sadly. “I’m Xi Xi’s mother. Can you let me in? I have something to tell her.”","Xu Anran choked and said, “Sister, it’s all my fault. It has nothing to do with Mom. You can choose not to see me, but can you let Mom in? It’s still raining outside. Mom’s health isn’t good to begin with. She...”"]},{"number":622,"title":"Chapter 622 - Mrs. Gu Pretends To Be Soft","paragraphs":["Suddenly, a shout came from the courtyard. Following that, a slim figure rushed out with an umbrella in her hand. She was so weak that it seemed like she would be blown away by the wind.","Her eyes were filled with shock as she exclaimed, “Mom! Sister! It’s raining so heavily. Why are you guys here? Why aren’t you guys carrying umbrellas?! Your clothes are all wet. It’s all my fault for falling asleep and causing you guys to be drenched in the rain. If I knew that you guys were coming to look for me, I would definitely have sent someone to fetch you!”","Xu Anran instantly choked up and looked at the crying Qiao Xi with disbelief.","How could this be possible?! Why would Qiao Xi come out?","Qiao Xi had guessed Xu Anran’s intentions. Wasn’t she trying to use public opinion to attack her and force her to take the initiative to seek peace? However, she wouldn’t fall for this trick. When it came to pretending to be weak and frail, she was better at this. She would pretend to be an obedient and sensible daughter in the live broadcast.","Moreover, before rushing to the door, Qiao Xi had deliberately put on makeup to make her seem sickly. Even if she was drenched in the rain, her makeup wouldn’t be removed. At this moment, her entire face was deathly pale, and her appearance was extremely weak.","Qiao Xi looked at the mother and daughter in surprise. Even the best actress out there would feel ashamed of her inferior acting skills.","“Sister! I’m sorry. It’s all my fault for letting you and Mom get drenched in the rain. Why didn’t you call me before you came? I didn’t even know! Boo-hoo... It’s all my fault. Why did I have to fall sick and only wake up at this time?","“It’s also because I’m sick that Ah Zheng brought me here to recuperate for a few days. He even instructed the maids not to disturb me. Who knew that you would come at this time? The maids didn’t dare to disturb me, so you guys ended up getting drenched in the rain. Quickly come in. Don’t catch a cold.”","Xia Yunlou looked at Qiao Xi in surprise and sized her up. Her lips were pale, and she would cough from time to time. Her eyes were slightly red, and she didn’t look like she was pretending.","Before the two of them could speak, Qiao Xi suddenly sneezed. Tears trickled down her face as she cried, “Mom! Why aren’t you going in? I know you blame me for coming out too late, sob sob sob sob... You can hit me or scold me, but don’t hurt your own body. I beg you, quickly go into the house and avoid the rain, okay?”","Qiao Xi covered her mouth and pretended to be in despair as her body swayed weakly.","The maid at the side rushed forward to support her and exclaimed, “Young Madam! Your body is so cold! You’re already sick. This cold wind is going to make it worse.”","Qiao Xi’s voice trembled. “It... It’s alright.”","The maid was also a smart person. She followed Qiao Xi’s plan and said, “Young Madam has been running a fever for the entire day. She has only slept for a short while, but when she heard that her relatives had come to visit, she rushed out without even putting on her coat. She doesn’t even care about her health.”","Qiao Xi said weakly and gently, “It doesn’t matter to me. I can’t let Mom and Sister get drenched in the rain again. If I don’t come out to welcome them, they’ll be angry. It’s all my fault for being too disappointing. Why did I fall sick?! Please don’t blame me and quickly come into the house with me, alright?”","Everyone watching the live broadcast was stunned.","[Don’t you guys think that the real daughter of the Xu family looks quite gentle? She doesn’t seem to have any intention of chasing Xu Anran away. In fact, she’s quite enthusiastic toward her.]","[Why do I feel so sad? The daughter who was previously wandering outside has finally found her biological parents but has to be careful and please her family. She’s afraid that she’ll be hated by them. She’s clearly seriously ill, yet she still braved the heavy rain to welcome her mother and sister. She’s simply afraid that Madam Xu and Xu Anran will blame her. How can such a pitiful young lady chase Xu Anran out of the house?]","[Come to think of it, it’s a fact that Xu Anran had taken over her identity and enjoyed everything that should have belonged to her. After living with the Xu family for 20 years, even though she has returned to the Xu family, it’ll be difficult for her to integrate into the Xu family. If Xu Anran doesn’t move out of the Xu family, the real daughter’s life in the Xu family will be very difficult. I think it’s reasonable to chase Xu Anran away.]","[I think so too. Although this isn’t Xu Anran’s fault, she did steal the identity and family of the real heiress, after all. She should have left from the beginning. She can’t blame the real heiress!]","Xu Anran looked at the comments in the live broadcast with hatred in her eyes.","This b*tch actually tricked her!"]},{"number":623,"title":"Chapter 623 - The Hidden Weapon’s Effects","paragraphs":["Xu Anran glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and suddenly rushed in front of her. Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with fear. “Sister, what are you doing?! I’ve already promised you that I won’t return to the Xu family. I won’t fight with you over the identity of the Xu family’s eldest young miss. I don’t want anything anymore. I beg you to stop messing around. I only want to live a peaceful life.”","[What the f*ck?! What did Xu Anran do to this young lady? She was so scared with just one look. Has Xu Anran privately abused her?]","[Did you all hear that?! I don’t think the real daughter doesn’t want to go home, but it’s because Xu Anran threatened her, so she doesn’t dare to go home!]","[Then why did Xu Anran say that the real daughter wanted to chase her out of the Xu family? It seems like Xu Anran wanted to ruin the real daughter’s reputation!]","When Xu Anran saw everyone’s comments, she immediately wanted to turn off the live broadcast. However, for some reason, she felt a sharp pain in her wrist and lost all feeling in her arm.","Qiao Xi retracted her hidden weapon without a trace. She looked at Xu Anran with her big deer-like eyes, still full of fear. “Sister, you asked me to leave the Xu family and I have already agreed. If you think I’m an eyesore, I can leave Li City and never come back to disturb you. Please just let me go!”","Upon hearing these words, the corner of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched slightly. Her eyes that were originally gentle like water suddenly seemed to pop out as she glared fiercely at Qiao Xi.","[F*ck! I was scared to death! Xu Anran’s expression is so scary. It’s as if she wants to kill someone!]","[Did you hear what the real young miss said? I get it now! It was Xu Anran who went to threaten the real young miss and forced her to get out of the Xu family. She made the Xu family misunderstand the real young miss. Now, they’re even forcing her to leave Li City!]","Upon seeing these words, Xu Anran suppressed the anger in her heart. A smile appeared on her face. However, the muscles on her face seemed to have stiffened. When she smiled, it was even scarier and she looked absolutely ferocious.","Her mind buzzed as flames raged in her heart. She knew that it was a live broadcast, but she just wanted to charge over and tear apart Qiao Xi’s hypocritical face. She wished for nothing more than to strangle that b*tch Qiao Xi to death.","Qiao Xi, that b*tch, was clearly acting pitiful, but everyone believed her!","At this moment, the medicine had already entered Xu Anran’s bloodstream and was taking effect. Xu Anran could only feel the flames of anger burning in her chest. Her rationality and lucidity instantly disappeared.","“You b*tch! Shut up! Dad told us to apologize to you, but you’re saying I forced you to leave the Xu family! If you really want to leave, then get lost! Disappear immediately! It’s better if you die!”","The live broadcast room was silent.","Xu Anran was also stunned. She covered her mouth in disbelief. She had actually said what was on her mind out of anger!","[Did I hear wrongly? Xu Anran told the real daughter to scram and even said that it would be better if she died?]","[I finally understand now. Xu Anran was just putting on a show when she was complaining earlier. She’s the one who threatened the real daughter, yet she said that the real daughter is forcing her. She’s truly an actress! She acted so well!]","[I caught the main point. Xu Anran just said that Mr. Xu asked them to apologize to the real young miss. That means that Mr. Xu knows that Xu Anran had threatened the real young miss, so he asked Xu Anran and Madam Xu to apologize. It seems like she has done this more than once.]","[Xu Anran knows that she’s doing a live broadcast, yet she still shouted at the real young miss. She even said that it would be better if she died. I can’t imagine how badly she abuses the real young miss behind the scenes!]","Qiao Xi leaned forward with an aggrieved expression. “Sister...”","It was only then that Xu Anran realized that her body was gradually stiffening. The corners of her mouth were twitching uncontrollably, and her eyes kept blinking. She wanted to get out of this situation and tried to raise her arms with great effort.","At this moment, Qiao Xi walked in front of her and her arm directly hit Qiao Xi’s face.","No, no!","She did want to kill Qiao Xi and give her a tight slap, but she absolutely would not do such a thing when everyone was watching through the live broadcast!","Smack!","This slap wasn’t loud, but everyone clearly saw Xu Anran slap Qiao Xi. Then, Qiao Xi’s body fell weakly...","Suddenly, a tall figure flashed past and firmly caught Qiao Xi, wrapping her in his arms like a rare treasure. He used the warmth of his body to warm her."]},{"number":624,"title":"Chapter 624 - I Won’t Allow You To Get Injured","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng had already been waiting by the side for a long time. When he saw Qiao Xi desperately fall backward, his eyes were filled with maliciousness and insidiousness. At this moment, his rage was even greater.","Even though he knew that all of this was set up by Qiao Xi, he was still unable to control the rage in his heart when he saw Xu Anran slap Qiao Xi on the face.","Gu Zheng did not look up, but his whole body exuded a cold and murderous aura. His thin lips parted slightly. “Scram!”","Xu Anran’s heart trembled as she retreated a few steps in fear.","[Ah! Thank goodness Miss Qiao didn’t fall!]","[It’s raining outside and Miss Qiao is still seriously ill. If she had really fallen to the ground, her condition would definitely have worsened! Xu Anran is too cruel! She did something wrong yet still wanted to hurt others?]","[I’ve already stopped being a fan. Who would like a celebrity like her? It doesn’t matter if she occupies the real daughter’s identity. After all, she can’t be blamed for this matter, but it’s her fault for threatening the real daughter. She even dared to hit Miss Qiao in public. If she had fallen and gotten injured, Xu Anran would legally be held responsible!]","[Wow! The man hugging Miss Qiao is so handsome! Who is he? He’s even more handsome than male celebrities! Especially that hug just now. It was so affectionate, yet he was so domineering when facing Xu Anran.]","Xu Anran’s fingers were stiff, and she could not turn off the live broadcast. Xia Yunlou couldn’t care less and directly rushed over, throwing the phone to the ground.","However, it was too late. Everyone had already seen what they needed to see and knew what was going on.","Qiao Xi seized the opportunity and couldn’t be bothered to talk to Xu Anran anymore. She directly fell into Gu Zheng’s embrace and winked at Gu Zheng with a sly smile.","In front of the courtyard, Xu Anran’s eyes almost popped out from rage. Her fingers trembled as she pointed at Qiao Xi. “You... You framed me!”","“Stop arguing! Are you done?!”","Unknowingly, some staff from the villa had gathered at the entrance of Night Tide Courtyard. Everyone looked at Xu Anran with disdain.","“Mrs. Gu fell asleep the moment she returned to Night Tide Court. When she heard that you two were here, she rushed out to welcome you without even putting on her coat. She was already sick to begin with but is drenched in the rain now. Xu Anran, you vicious woman! You even knocked Mrs. Gu unconscious. You’re really too vicious!”","“Hurry up and leave! Nine Heavens Villa doesn’t welcome you!”","At this moment, a few strong men walked over and pushed Xu Anran and Xia Yunlou. The two of them were already drenched in the rain and did not have any ability to resist. They could only be chased out of Nine Heavens Villa.","Xia Yunlou’s heart was filled with fear. They were originally here to apologize, but somehow, things had taken the wrong turn. Anran even slapped Xixi. How could Qiao Xi forgive them now?","At this moment, her phone suddenly rang.","After the call was connected, Xu Zhi’s angry roar could be heard. “Look at what you’ve done! I told you to apologize! Who told you to do a live broadcast?! Xu Anran even slapped Xi Xi. Are you two crazy? Get back here immediately!”","Xia Yunlou’s mind buzzed. Her body went limp as she sat on the ground. Her body was covered in mud and water. She looked extremely pathetic.","...","In Night Tide Courtyard, Gu Zheng carried Qiao Xi into the bedroom and coughed lightly. “Mrs. Gu, wake up.”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes and looked around while smiling sheepishly.","She picked up a bottle of makeup remover and wiped off the makeup on her face. Her initially sickly little face instantly returned to normal.","Gu Zheng stood behind Qiao Xi and reached out to hold her waist. He rested his chin on her shoulder and pulled her into his embrace. He said softly, “Mrs. Gu, do you trust me so much that you chose to fall backward without any worries?”","Qiao Xi said indifferently, “That’s not the case. Even if you hadn’t stepped in, there were still two maids by my side. If they were unable to catch me, then I could only fall to the ground. But I had already calculated the angle. So long as I fall to the right, I’d fall onto the lawn. At most, it’d just be a light injury.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were bloodshot as he gradually tightened his grip on her waist and leaned close to her ear while breathing heavily. “Qiao Xi, I won’t allow you to be injured—not even light injuries.”","Qiao Xi felt a scorching heat envelop her ear, and her entire body trembled.","She looked at the man’s reddened eyes through the mirror and frowned slightly. Could it be that Gu Zheng’s poison was flaring up?"]},{"number":625,"title":"Chapter 625 - Rumors Of Sisterhood","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s hot palm slid down her waist and landed on her cheek, caressing her gently. “Don’t make me worry.”","Qiao Xi felt a wave of warmth in her heart, but what followed was bitterness because she was able to sense that the frequency of Gu Zheng’s poison relapsing was getting higher and higher. Fortunately, when the situation wasn’t serious, he was still able to control it.","...","At the Xu family’s villa.","Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran returned home like two drenched chickens. Xu Anyi immediately came out to welcome them and wiped the rainwater off their bodies.","However, Xu Zhi sat on the sofa and roared. “You two pieces of trash! I only asked you to apologize, but what did you do?! Not only did you hit Xi Xi, but you even broadcasted it live! The Xu family’s reputation has been thrown away by you two idiots!”","Xia Yunlou lowered her head, not daring to make a sound.","Xu Anran’s tears fell like rain. “Dad...”","“I’m not your father! You’re not related to me by blood!”","Xu Anran’s face turned pale as she sobbed. “I’m sorry. I didn’t expect my sister to be sick. We suddenly chased after her, so maybe we scared her...”","Xu Zhi happened to watch the live broadcast. He also felt that it was a little strange. Qiao Xi was usually smart and bold, but this time, her face was full of fear as if she was very afraid of them.","Xu Anran cried and said, “Xi Xi has always hated me. I’m afraid that she won’t want to see us anymore. But Xi Xi is your real daughter, after all. How can I bear to see you two separate? I have an idea, but I don’t know if it’s feasible.”","Xu Zhi’s expression softened a little. “What idea?”","“I heard that Xi Xi and Mrs. Xia Yunqiu were very close, and Mom is Mrs. Xia Yunqiu’s biological sister. If Mom says that she wants to pay respects to Xia Yunqiu, Xi Xi probably won’t refuse, right?”","Everyone immediately reacted. Even if Xi Xi held a grudge against the Xu family, there was no reason to stop Xia Yunlou from paying her respects to Xia Yunqiu. If Xi Xi insisted on disagreeing, then it would be against the rules.","If she agreed, they would find another chance to persuade Qiao Xi to forgive them.","Xu Anran sniffed and said, “Mom, we have to seize this opportunity.”","...","The next morning.","Recently, Qiao Xi had heard some rumors that the relationship between Xia Yunlou and Xia Yunqiu was deep. After Xia Yunlou found out that her sister had gone missing, she searched for her for more than ten years. Moreover, when she heard that her sister had passed away, Xia Yunlou was heartbroken and fell seriously ill.","There was also some news on the internet. It was said that the two sisters had always been close. Although they did not grow up together, they still shared the same parents and were related by blood.","Qiao Xi was slightly puzzled. Why was Xia Yunlou spreading this news online?","Suddenly, her phone rang and Old Madam Yin’s number appeared on the screen.","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment before calling out awkwardly, “Grandma.”","“Xi Xi, have you seen the news on the internet?” Old Madam Yin’s voice was a little stern. At this moment, the younger members of the Yin family were also standing by the side, trembling in fear.","Qiao Xi asked, “Are you referring to the news of Madam Xu and Mom’s sisterly love?”","Old Madam Yin’s voice was slightly cold. “Yes, it’s about this. I’ve never paid attention to the news on the internet. It was Jingting who told me. Actually, your mother’s relationship with Xia Yunlou... wasn’t as good as she says it was. Their relationship can’t be explained in just a few words. Anyway, remember that if Xia Yunlou uses her relationship with her sister to force you to lower your head, you don’t have to bother about it.”","Qiao Xi felt her heart soften, and she replied with a smile, “Alright, I’ll remember.”","Tears welled up in Old Madam Yin’s eyes. “My dear child, if you encounter any trouble, come and look for me. As long as I’m here, no one is allowed to bully you!”","Actually, Old Madam Yin didn’t understand as well. Xi Xi was Yunlou’s biological daughter, yet her character was completely different. She was extremely similar to Yunqiu instead. Could it be that it was because Yunqiu had raised her so Xi Xi resembled her?","Qiao Xi nodded. “Thank you, Grandma. Can you tell me about what happened between mother and Madam Xu? I really want to know.”","There was silence for a few seconds.","Old Madam Yin was silent before she sighed. “Back then, I met and fell in love with Xia Cheng. We got married and soon gave birth to a son and two daughters.","“Both of us were wealthy, so I abdicated my position and became a full-time housewife. I took care of the children with peace of mind. The five of us lived happily, but...”"]},{"number":626,"title":"Chapter 626 - Old Matters Between The Xia Sisters","paragraphs":["“But Xia Cheng suddenly wanted to go overseas to work. He requested to have one of our daughters accompany him. I couldn’t bear to let the child leave, but Xia Yunlou, who was only six years old at that time, insisted on following him. Yunqiu and your uncle, Yunyi, couldn’t bear to part with her. They begged her to stay, but she still left with Xia Cheng.","“At that time, when I missed my younger daughter, I often called her. That child told me that she was afraid that her father would be estranged from his family after being away from home for a long time. That was why she was willing to follow him. I was very touched at that time and felt that although my younger daughter was only six years old, she was very sensible.","“But Xia Cheng is a man, after all. How could he take care of a child alone? I was afraid that Yunlou would suffer with him. Every six months, I would bring the child back to stay with me for a month. The two sisters had a very good relationship and often talked about everything. I couldn’t bear for the two children to be separated, so I asked Yunlou to move back. She agreed.”","Old Madam Yin paused.","“At that time, Yunlou said that she still had some things to do over there. She went back abroad and said she would definitely return within a week. However, Yunlou didn’t come back after a week. Yunqiu and Yunyi were worried about her and rushed over to pick her up. Who knew that not only was Yunlou not willing to leave, but she even scolded Yunqiu and told her to get lost.","“I really found it hard to believe that such an obedient daughter would become like this. I thought that Xia Cheng had said something, so I sent people to keep an eye on Yunlou. Who knew...”","Although Old Madam Yin was suppressing her emotions, Qiao Xi could hear that she had suddenly choked up.","After a moment of silence, Old Madam Yin said sorrowfully, “Who knew that Xia Cheng had been cheating on me? Yunlou was staying with that mistress, even calling that woman her mother. They had become a family of three.","“After I found out about this, I wanted to divorce Xia Cheng. I thought the children would understand me, but Yunlou said...","“‘Mom, as a woman, you have to be tolerant. Daddy just made a mistake that every man makes. Moreover, you two have been living separately for so long. He needs a woman to accompany and care for him. You can’t blame him’.","“‘Dad isn’t the only one who likes Aunt Xiao Ai. I like Aunty Xiao Ai too. She’s young, beautiful, and gentle. She treats me well too. I feel happy living with her’.","“From then on, Yunlou never came back. After I divorced Xia Cheng, I brought Yunqiu and Yunyi back to the Yin family. However, after my two daughters grew up, Yunlou snatched Yunqiu’s fiancé, Xu Zhi, away. She became someone I didn’t know. She had a fiery and vicious personality. She completely forgot about the kinship between siblings.”","Old Madam Yin’s voice was filled with sorrow. “I hold a certain responsibility for her becoming like this! Xi Xi, I hate her in my heart, but I’m also filled with guilt. If I had insisted on keeping her by my side back then, perhaps everything wouldn’t have changed.”","Qiao Xi remained silent. Perhaps Xia Yunlou had left home for her parents, but she abandoned her family for an outsider.","According to Old Madam Yin, Xia Yunlou’s temperament had suddenly changed drastically after a week. The younger sister, who was originally close to her elder sister, suddenly cursed at her when they met again.","Even Qiao Xi felt that Xia Yunlou had become a stranger.","At this moment, Old Madam Yin said slowly, “In any case, you can discuss with me matters regarding Xia Yunlou. Don’t be deceived by her.”","Qiao Xi said, “Okay, Grandma.”","After she hung up the call, this matter still lingered in Qiao Xi’s mind. She kept having the feeling that something was off. What exactly had happened? Could it be that the Yin family didn’t find it strange that Xia Yunlou’s disposition had changed greatly in a short week?","Perhaps everyone suspected it, but they didn’t find anything, so Old Madam Yin just gave up.","Just then, Gu Zheng entered and carried her into the car. “This place is a little far from your university. I’ll send you there.”","The man looked at Qiao Xi who was frowning and said gently, “The news on the internet was deliberately released by Xia Yunlou. Don’t be troubled by this.”","Qiao Xi nodded.","Gu Zheng started the car, his heart in a mess.","Earlier, Song Shijing had called him and said anxiously, “President, Chairman Gu and the shareholders caused a ruckus this morning and invited several investors. They said that if you don’t show up today, they’ll side with Chairman Gu.”"]},{"number":627,"title":"Chapter 627 - A Well-prepared Murder Attempt","paragraphs":["Song Shijing knew that this was no small matter, so he called Gu Zheng immediately.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness. He did not understand why Gu Weiming was suddenly attacking him.","Suddenly, he tightened his grip on the steering wheel and stepped on the brakes. His expression changed as his heart trembled. However, his expression did not change. “Xi Xi!”","Qiao Xi slowly opened her eyes and frowned when she saw Gu Zheng’s solemn expression. “What’s wrong?”","“Do you still remember that there’s a patch of grass in front? When we’re reaching that spot, jump down from the car,” Gu Zheng said calmly.","Qiao Xi’s pupils constricted abruptly, and her body instantly stiffened. However, Gu Zheng’s eyes were still calm and emotionless as he said indifferently, “Xi Xi, I’m sorry. I promised to protect you from harm, but I might not be able to do it this time.”","Qiao Xi clenched her fists. She knew that someone had tampered with the car.","Gu Zheng’s voice was calm. “The brake line must have been cut. Get off first. I’ll be fine.”","After passing that patch of grass, there was a sharp turn ahead. With the current speed of the car, it was very difficult to pass through. There was a possibility that they would fall off the cliff directly. The chances of Gu Zheng surviving were very slim.","Qiao Xi knew that the patch of grass was her last chance. If she couldn’t jump out of the car then, then...","Her face was pale as unprecedented fear surged in her heart. Gu Zheng, on the other hand, had a calm expression and was still controlling the car. He was driving toward the patch of grass. “Xi Xi, be good and listen to me. I’ll drive toward the patch of grass. Get ready to jump off the car. I’ll come back to find you in a while.”","Qiao Xi was scared witless. They were about to reach the patch of grass. If the car continued to drive forward, it would only fall off the cliff.","Gu Zheng tightly gripped the steering wheel with both hands, his voice ice-cold and serious. “Qiao Xi, quickly jump!”","With the car’s current speed, she would definitely be injured even if she fell on the patch of grass. Meanwhile, Gu Zheng couldn’t even jump out of the car. What should he do?","“Don’t worry, I can handle it. You’ll make me panic if you’re by my side. Jump off the car first. I promise I’ll come back to find you.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a few seconds before nodding with reddened eyes.","She and Gu Zheng had been through so much since they were young. Every time, they managed to survive. This time, there would be no problem as well.","Qiao Xi kept telling herself to trust Gu Zheng. He would definitely do as he promised. She opened the car window and took a deep breath.","All of a sudden, a loud rumble came from ahead. Gu Zheng shouted loudly, “Xi Xi!”","A huge truck was rushing over, and its target was them. If Qiao Xi really jumped down now, then she would be crushed to death by the truck in the next moment.","The mountain road was narrow, and their car was out of control. Gu Zheng could only take a gamble. He turned the steering wheel and drove the car into the patch of grass, allowing the truck to hit only the driver’s seat. At the last second, he used his body to protect Qiao Xi.","Qiao Xi lost control of her body, and a wave of rumbles resounded in her ears. She felt a dull pain in her body. Her internal organs had been shaken up, causing her vision to become blurry before she fainted.","...","“Mrs. Gu’s condition isn’t serious. She’ll wake up soon, but President Gu needs to undergo surgery. We can’t guarantee when he’ll wake up.","“Usually, when a driver encounters danger, they would subconsciously turn the steering wheel to the left. The impact of the crash would be focused on the front passenger, while the driver would be able to avoid the brunt of the damage. This is the first time I’ve seen someone like President Gu turning the steering wheel to the right. He allowed himself to be hit by the truck. He even protected Mrs. Gu with his body.","“That’s why Mrs. Gu only suffered minor injuries, but President Gu...”","Qiao Xi felt a buzz in her ears. Who was speaking?","“Logically speaking, the people who take that road are usually heading to Nine Heavens Villa. However, the person in charge of Nine Heavens Villa said they weren’t expecting a delivery. Furthermore, based on the situation at the scene, the target of that truck was clearly President Gu’s car. It seems like it was a well-prepared murder attempt!”","“The police have stepped in to investigate, but the truck driver is dead. We’ll have to look for other leads.”","“Do you think this murder attempt was aimed at President Gu or Little Six?”","“We can’t be sure. The other party might have wanted to kill both of them!”"]},{"number":628,"title":"Chapter 628 - Escaping Danger","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi felt as if her body was drifting on the ocean, and as the waves rose and fell, it caused her to feel waves of dizziness. It felt as if every part of her body had been crushed.","Qin An glanced at the bed and happened to see her fingers move. “Little Six!”","Everyone immediately gathered around the bed. Shen Yu patted her hand gently. “Lie down properly and don’t move.”","Qiao Xi felt her throat burn as she spoke with difficulty, “Where’s Gu Zheng?”","Everyone in the ward was silent.","Qiao Xi was flustered and raised her voice. “Where’s Gu Zheng?”","Upon hearing her hoarse voice, Qin An helplessly said, “He’s out of danger. After all, his car is bulletproof. It wasn’t damaged by the strong impact, but a steel bar pierced through his shoulder blade. He still needs to undergo surgery.”","Qiao Xi listened to Qin An’s words in a daze as her mind buzzed. She recalled that a second before the accident took place, Gu Zheng had protected her using his body. Before she fainted, she had clearly seen Gu Zheng’s face being cut by glass. Blood had flowed from his shoulder, soaking his white coat.","How painful it must have been!","Qiao Xi’s nose felt sour, and she couldn’t help but sob.","“Luckily, Gu Zheng had sent his location to Song Shijing at the last moment. Song Shijing rushed to the scene of the accident with his men and saved your lives. You were lucky to have survived the impact of the truck.”","Qiao Xi bit her lip and silently cried.","Shen Yu glared at Qin An. “Little Six just woke up and is still weak. Can’t you say something nice to coax her? Why must you make her sad?”","Qin An said indifferently, “She has to accept this fact. Besides, she only suffered minor injuries. Gu Zheng survived as well. She isn’t as weak as you think.”","Xue Liang looked at Qiao Xi’s pale face and frowned with heartache. In his impression, Little Six was sly and smart, but now, she was lying weakly on the bed with a blank look.","Qiao Xi sniffed and lowered her head. “How long was I unconscious?”","“Three days.”","“I want to see Gu Zheng.”","Just as Shen Yu was about to reject her, Qin An beat him to it. “Your body is very weak now. Eat something first and do a check-up. If there’s no problem, I’ll bring you to see him.”","Among the brothers, Qin An’s medical skills were the best. He was certain that Gu Zheng wasn’t in danger, so everyone naturally believed him.","Qiao Xi nodded and obediently ate a bowl of porridge. She then did a full body check-up. After Qin An confirmed that she was fine, he put her in a wheelchair and pushed her to another ward.","At this moment, Gu Zheng’s body was wrapped in bandages. Various instruments were connected to his body, and he wore an oxygen mask. His face was pale and lifeless.","Qiao Xi had never seen Gu Zheng so fragile before. He had always been so powerful and domineering. No one seemed to be able to make him lower his head. However, this accident had almost taken his life.","Qin An said softly, “When he was sent to the hospital, he was covered in blood. I immediately treated his wounds. He can be considered lucky. Although his shoulder blade was pierced, it didn’t injure his bones or organs. However, it’ll take at least half a year for his wounds to fully recover.”","“It’s been three days. Why isn’t he awake yet?”","“Little Six, I believe you know the reason.” Qin An felt somewhat helpless.","Qiao Xi abruptly raised her eyes, her fingernails piercing her palm as her voice trembled slightly. “Could it be... that the poison has acted up?”","Qin An nodded and said, “Gu Zheng’s luxurious car that costs tens of millions of yuan had been modified before. It has very strong resistance against large impacts, so although his injuries are serious, they aren’t fatal. His internal organs aren’t ruptured either. Furthermore, his body is very strong. Logically speaking, he should have woken up long ago. The reason why he hasn’t woken up is that the poison has spread.”","Grandfather had researched for many years but still couldn’t find a way to cure the poison. If they wanted to save Gu Zheng now, they could only use the blood of the divine physician’s successor.","Originally, the descendant of the divine physician should have been Qin An. However, for some reason, he didn’t inherit the special blood. Due to a freak combination of factors, Qiao Xi was the one who inherited the divine physician’s bloodline.","Now that her grandfather was not around, she was the only one who could save Gu Zheng. The only way to cure Gu Zheng was to use her blood."]},{"number":629,"title":"Chapter 629 - She Was Willing To Save Him With Her Blood","paragraphs":["“Little Six, we don’t want to interfere with your decision, but there are some things I have to tell you. Using your blood to neutralize the poison is equivalent to burning your life. Moreover, your lives will be connected. If he dies, you won’t be able to live either!”","Qiao Xi remained silent.","“Do you know why Grandpa gave up on curing Eldest Miss Lu?”","Qiao Xi looked up. With her grandfather’s character, if he could use his blood to help Eldest Miss Lu detoxify the poison, he would certainly have offered his blood without hesitation. But why did he give up?","“Because Grandpa knew that using the blood of the divine physician to detoxify the poison would cause his and the patient’s lives to be linked. He was already in his 60s then and might pass away anytime. Eldest Miss Lu was still young, so if he really did that, Eldest Miss Lu’s life would be shortened. Therefore, he gave up and wanted to rely on his own abilities to help her detoxify the poison. However, he didn’t expect Eldest Miss Lu to suddenly die from the poison, which made Grandpa feel guilty for the rest of his life.”","Qin An furrowed his brows and persuaded her. “Xi Xi, I know that you have deep feelings for Gu Zheng, but you have to think carefully. Once your blood ties are connected, you won’t be able to regret it. He’ll absorb your life force to suppress the poison. Perhaps you—”","Qiao Xi interrupted him. “I know.”","“Have you really decided?” Qin An’s voice trembled slightly.","A teardrop rolled down from the corner of Qiao Xi’s eyes, and she said in a flat voice, “Third Brother, I know all of you are doing this for my own good, but I love Gu Zheng. If he leaves this world, then there’s no meaning in me continuing to live! Even if he has to absorb my life force, I’m willing to save him!”","“Perhaps I’ll regret it in the future, but if I don’t save him now, I’ll spend the rest of my life in sorrow and regret. I just want to have a clear conscience.”","Qin An fell silent for a moment before turning to the ward’s door. Suddenly, he paused and slowly said, “Little Six, although we’re your family, we have no right to interfere with your choice. Since you have already decided, I have nothing to say. As long as you’re willing, we’ll support you.”","Qiao Xi picked up the small knife on the table and cut her wrist, causing blood to gush out bit by bit.","...","At this moment, Xue Liang’s face was full of heartache. “Little Six ultimately decided to use her blood to save him, but...”","Qin An, who usually talked non-stop, suddenly fell silent. He had been learning medicine from his grandfather for many years. He knew how his grandfather had regretted not saving Eldest Miss Lu. His grandfather had watched helplessly as she died from the poison.","As a miracle doctor, his grandfather was revered by the world, but he couldn’t save that woman, so he spent his days in guilt.","Due to a stranger who had no family or friends, the latter half of his grandfather’s life was greatly affected. If Qiao Xi didn’t save Gu Zheng and Gu Zheng died from the poison, Little Six would forever live in pain.","Qin An prayed in his heart, hoping that Gu Zheng would wake up and live a peaceful life without illness or calamity.","Shen Yu looked at his younger brothers and said calmly, “If Gu Zheng hadn’t used his body to protect Little Six, Little Six would probably be seriously injured right now. Therefore, it’s reasonable for Little Six to decide to save him. Moreover, they’re husband and wife. If Little Six can only watch as her husband’s poison relapses and lives in pain, she might as well take a gamble.”","As soon as he finished speaking, everyone looked at each other and could not help but nod. Luo Qing, who had always been silent, suddenly looked up. His eyes were filled with sharp killing intent. “Find out who hurt Little Six. I want to tear that person into pieces!”","...","In the ward.","After Gu Zheng drank Qiao Xi’s blood, his complexion gradually became rosy again. Qiao Xi heaved a sigh of relief. It looked like it wouldn’t be long before Gu Zheng woke up.","At this moment, a small black figure rushed in from outside the ward. Gu Lele leaned against Qiao Xi’s feet and used his claws to scratch Qiao Xi’s shoes. Then, he looked at the hospital bed with a solemn expression. He seemed to know that his father was hurt and was feeling sad over it.","Song Shijing said sadly, “I was afraid that you would be lonely, so I brought Lele here to let him accompany you. I believe the president will wake up soon.”","Thump!","Song Shijing suddenly knelt down in front of Qiao Xi and said in a choked voice, “Young Madam, it’s all my fault. If I hadn’t called the president and told him that something had happened to Gu Corporation, he wouldn’t have rushed back in such a hurry. The car accident wouldn’t have happened either.”"]},{"number":630,"title":"Chapter 630 - I Will Be Sad If You Cry","paragraphs":["“When the president wakes up, I won’t have any objections to whatever punishment you wish to give me. But please don’t be calculative with me now. I still have to protect you and the president!”","Qiao Xi reached out to support him and said in a light voice, “This has nothing to do with you.”","Someone wanted to harm her and Gu Zheng. Even if they didn’t succeed this time, they would still attack another time. Song Shijing couldn’t be blamed for this. The enemy was too vicious.","Song Shijing stood up and walked out of the ward quietly.","Qiao Xi bent down and hugged Gu Lele in her arms, gently caressing his body. He called out to Gu Zheng, then left Qiao Xi’s embrace and directly jumped onto Gu Zheng’s bed.","He was very smart and did not step on Gu Zheng’s body. He just walked along the side of the bed to Gu Zheng’s cheek and used his small head to touch Gu Zheng’s face. Seeing that Gu Zheng was unconscious, he carefully licked his cheek.","Seeing that his father had no reaction, Gu Lele tilted her head and stared at the person on the bed in confusion.","When Qiao Xi saw this scene, tears instantly blurred her vision.","“Gu Zheng, wake up! You promised to protect me. You can’t go back on your word. If you don’t wake up, someone will bully me soon.","“Your son is here to see you. Gu Lele has gained weight again. If you don’t protect us, the Gu family will skin us alive!”","Qiao Xi muttered to herself until her mouth was dry, but the man on the bed still had no reaction. She couldn’t control her tears and even wanted to cry.","‘Gu Zheng, we’re now connected by blood. If you die, I’ll die with you. I’m still so young. I still have many things to do. Can you bear to let me die?","‘Didn’t Third Brother say that you would wake up soon? Why hasn’t there been any reaction after so long? I’ve already risked my life to save you. If you really die, I’ll be in a terrible state!","‘Gu Zheng! You bastard! Don’t scare me! I don’t want to die yet! Boo-hoo! Damn it, I’m so beautiful and have such a good figure. I’m a beauty that’s hard to come by in a hundred years. Am I going to die like this?’","At this moment, Gu Zheng gradually regained consciousness. His body was in intense pain as if he had been crushed. His face was wet, and there was a furry thing rubbing against his face.","After that, he regained his sense of hearing. There was a noisy person crying and shouting in his ears. It was very noisy, but he didn’t feel annoyed because he knew that this person was his beloved Mrs. Gu.","Gu Zheng’s head felt like it was about to explode. He slowly opened his eyes and first saw the enlarged version of Gu Lele before him. Then, he saw the crying Mrs. Gu.","‘Gu Zheng, if we die together, will we dominate the trending topics? The netizens will say that the extraordinarily handsome President Gu died in a car accident, while Mrs. Gu died from heartbreak!","‘Even if you’re not thinking of yourself, you have to think of me! I don’t want to die yet! I haven’t given birth yet! I haven’t eaten all the delicacies in the world!’","Gu Zheng seemed to have understood something because he heard Qiao Xi’s inner voice. He said weakly, “Mrs. Gu.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly widened as she stared at the man on the bed in disbelief. Then, she probed, “Gu... Gu Zheng?”","“I’m here.”","After these two words were spoken, Gu Zheng only heard an earth-shattering wail resounding in his ears. However, this was actually Qiao Xi’s inner voice. In reality, she was suppressing her sobs and only silently shedding tears.","With great effort, Gu Zheng raised his hand and caressed her cheeks, wiping away her tears. Suppressing the burning sensation in his throat, he said hoarsely, “Don’t cry.”","He only said a few words before he felt a sharp pain in his body. It was so painful that his forehead was covered in sweat, but he still gritted his teeth and said, “I’ll be sad if you cry.”","Qiao Xi’s nose felt sour.","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door and walked in. He was surprised to see Gu Zheng awake. “President, you’re awake.”","“You should have gone to Gu Corporation three days ago, but you never showed up. I found an excuse to brush off the board of directors, and they believe me. Now, should we release the news of your injury?”","Qiao Xi knew that this matter had been suppressed. Otherwise, if Gu Yao knew that his brother had been injured in a car accident, he would have come over long ago. How could he not have made any movements?"]},{"number":631,"title":"Chapter 631 - Fighting For The Inheritance","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng was silent for a long while before he said indifferently, “Seal off all news and pretend nothing happened.”","Confused, Song Shijing didn’t ask further and followed Gu Zheng’s instructions.","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi had just opened her eyes when she heard the noise outside.","No noise was allowed in the hospital so as to not disturb the patients’ rest. Who was it who came to disturb the patients so early in the morning?","Qiao Xi got up impatiently and was about to go to the ward next door to see Gu Zheng when she saw a group of people blocking the corridor. Song Shijing was receiving them.","Gu Zheng was staying in a VIP ward. There was a living room outside the ward, and the group of people had just taken their seats.","Qiao Xi stood at the door and carefully sized them up. They seemed to be a couple with a few children. Although they said they were here to visit Gu Zheng, there wasn’t the slightest bit of worry in their eyes.","What caused Qiao Xi to feel strange was that didn’t Gu Zheng already order the news to be sealed off? Why did these people still know about Gu Zheng being injured?","The noise grew louder. Fortunately, the soundproofing in the living room was good and did not disturb the other patients.","“Song Shijing, you’re just an assistant. What right do you have to interfere in our family affairs? Gu Zheng is unconscious and has no heir. The most important thing now is to select a new successor!”","“We know that you’re loyal, but you have to think about the Gu family. If Gu Zheng is gone just like that, the Gu family will be in big trouble if we’re without a leader!”","Qiao Xi sneered. It looked like these people thought Gu Zheng was dead, so they hastily came over to fight for the position of heir. When she heard this, the flames of rage in her heart burned fiercely.","Song Shijing was also frowning, his face full of anger. “Our president is still alive and well. Why should we select the next heir? Even if we really want to change the heir, what right do you have when you’re just a member of the Gu branch family? If you want your children to be adopted by our young madam, you have to first check if your children are even qualified to be the heir!”","Qiao Xi: “??”","No wonder they brought over a few children with them when they came to visit. It turned out that they wanted her to adopt these children.","Song Shijing didn’t care about the other party’s reputation at all, but the other party didn’t feel embarrassed. The man continued, “We’re doing this for Mrs. Gu’s sake. She’s a weak woman without a husband and a child. How can she manage Gu Corporation alone?","“In the past, the Gu Corporation had Gu Zheng, so naturally, no one dared to cause trouble. But Mrs. Gu is just a woman. How can she convince the public? My son is already 25 years old this year. If he’s adopted by Mrs. Gu, he’ll definitely be able to revive Gu Corporation. Isn’t this a good thing?","“Although the child isn’t Mrs. Gu’s biological child, she’s still the mother of the heir in name. She doesn’t have to care about anything in the future and can even make a fortune. How carefree she’ll be!”","Qiao Xi: “?” ‘Are you kidding me? I’m only 20 years old, yet you want me to adopt a 25-year-old son? Are you crazy?!’","“Song Shijing, loyalty is a good thing, but Young Madam is not a member of the Gu family, after all. If we give her Gu Corporation, she might give it to another man in the blink of an eye. This young woman is immature and will be easily seduced.","“I heard that Mrs. Gu is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. If you don’t give us Gu Corporation, sooner or later, Gu Corporation will change its name to Xu Corporation. Don’t regret it then!”","Qiao Xi stood at the door with a face full of disdain. They were clearly doing this for their own benefits, yet they spoke so many pompous words. It was simply too laughable.","Song Shijing said that he had already blocked the news. Gu Yao didn’t even know that Gu Zheng was injured, but the Gu branch family knew about it. They must have something to do with the attempted murder.","At this moment, Qiao Xi was already very clear in her heart that if she continued to investigate, all the clues would point to the Gu family. Chairman Gu must have sent people from the Gu branch family to visit Gu Zheng because he wanted to know whether Gu Zheng was dead or not.","Gu Weiming felt that if he wanted Lu Yan to acknowledge the Gu family and become the heir, he had to kill Gu Zheng. Otherwise, there would be endless trouble.","Now that there was no news of Gu Zheng, they were certain that Gu Zheng was doomed. Therefore, they could not wait to snatch Gu Corporation away and take away his position as heir."]},{"number":632,"title":"Chapter 632 - Are You All Worthy Of Being My Sons?","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi waved at the person beside her. “Song Shiyu.”","“Young Madam.”","“Immediately call all the entertainment reporters and ask them to come over.” Qiao Xi’s gaze was deep as she slowly said, “This matter can’t be concealed. It has already gotten to this point, so there’s no need to conceal it.”","Song Shiyu left the hospital quietly. Qiao Xi straightened her back and walked proudly into the living room. The people in the room looked up, their eyes full of greed and calculation.","Song Shijing walked up to Qiao Xi and said in a low voice, “Young Madam, these people are all members of the Gu branch family, so... they’re not related to President Gu by blood. They just share the same surname.”","Since they were from the branch family and shared no blood relations with Gu Zheng, why did they come to fight for the position of heir? They even wanted their 25-year-old son to be adopted by her. She had never seen such shameless people.","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she walked to the main seat and sat down. Her icy-cold gaze swept over the people before her as she slowly said, “You want me to adopt your sons?”","“Young Madam, you don’t have a child. How can you manage the huge Gu Corporation? If no one inherits the corporation, it might fall into the hands of outsiders in the future! My sons are of the Gu family’s bloodline. It would be best if they inherit the assets left behind by President Gu. Don’t worry, my sons will definitely be filial to you.”","Other than the child who was still learning how to speak, the rest of the children’s eyes were filled with greed. Their parents must have told them why they were here and told them that as long as they became the heir, they would have endless money to spend.","Qiao Xi lazily leaned on the sofa and stared at them. Although her gaze was calm, it gave others a fatal sense of oppression.","“Young Madam, it’s reasonable for you to be in charge of the Gu family when President Gu is not around. But you don’t have a child, and you can’t just watch as Gu Corporation falls into the hands of others. You might as well take this opportunity to quickly establish an heir. Anyway, President Gu has already—”","Qiao Xi’s gaze turned cold, and that person was so scared that he didn’t dare to make another sound.","After a moment of silence, another person continued, “Sons, quickly come over. Greet your new mom. It doesn’t matter that Young Madam is still young. You have to be filial to her in the future.”","The children knew clearly in their hearts that as long as they became Qiao Xi’s child, they would be able to become the successor and the head of the Gu family. It was merely a title, so they didn’t care at all.","Moreover, Qiao Xi was young and beautiful, so it wasn’t a loss for them. Moreover, they would be able to obtain many assets and definitely be able to live a good life for the rest of their lives.","Qiao Xi looked at the greedy gazes of everyone and said indifferently, “All of you have thought it through, huh? If you become my sons, then you’ll have nothing to do with your original family.”","“Yes, we’re willing to be your sons.” The children did not hesitate and answered in unison, afraid that they would be too slow.","The fiery gaze of the 25-year-old man fell onto Qiao Xi. How could such a young and beautiful woman endure the loneliness of being a widow? Once he became the head of the Gu family, he would make Qiao Xi his woman.","Qiao Xi nodded thoughtfully, then frowned. “But some of you are older than me, so calling me your mother isn’t very appropriate!”","“Age is not an issue. It’s our honor if you’re willing to be our mother.”","Qiao Xi’s attitude made them feel that she had already agreed. How could a widow make an enemy out of the entire Gu family? As long as she obediently listened and chose an heir, the Gu family wouldn’t bully her. At least, she would have no worries for the rest of her life.","“Heh! You guys feel honored, but I feel disgusted!”","Qiao Xi coldly snorted and spoke indifferently, her eyes full of ridicule. Only the Gu family could think of asking her to acknowledge a few sons who were already past 20 years old!","“You guys want to be my sons? Who gave you the confidence? If you want to be the successor of the Gu family, why don’t you look in the mirror and see if you’re worthy?! Do you have the ability to manage Gu Corporation?","“Are your brains for decorations? You fools, I’d rather declare bankruptcy than hand Gu Corporation over to you!”","Boom!!!","Everyone fell into silence, and the smiles on their faces gradually vanished."]},{"number":633,"title":"Chapter 633 - Gu Zheng And I Have Good Genes","paragraphs":["After a short while, someone said furiously, “Qiao Xi, we pitied you and that’s why we wanted to let you adopt our sons. If you don’t have a son, who’ll care for you in the future?”","Bang!","Qiao Xi raised the teacup on the table and fiercely smashed it onto the ground, causing pieces of porcelain to scatter all over. The living room was completely silent and thick with killing intent.","“I’m only 20 years old. How can you be so sure that I won’t have a child? Do you think that I don’t have the ability to conceive or is it Gu Zheng you don’t believe in? Moreover, Gu Zheng and I have good genes. The children I give birth to will definitely be good-looking and smart. They won’t be as ugly as the children you’ve given birth to. It’ll be embarrassing for me to acknowledge them as my sons!","“If you can give birth, why can’t I? How can you be so sure that I can’t give birth to a perfect heir? Do you think that Gu Zheng is dead?”","Qiao Xi’s face turned dark as a bloodthirsty smile appeared on her face. Since Gu Weiming wanted to blow things up, then she would fulfill his wish.","Gu Weiming had sent a few small fries from the Gu family to gather information. If Gu Zheng died, he would immediately collaborate with the Gu family’s elders to elect Lu Yan to take over. If Gu Zheng hadn’t died, he could also take the opportunity to anger Gu Zheng.","But he should not forget that even if Gu Zheng was not around, there was still the legitimate Mrs. Gu. If she wanted to deal with the useless people from the Gu branch family, it would be as easy as crushing a few ants.","At that moment, the reporters Song Shiyu had invited had already arrived. They were waiting outside the door with their cameras, ready to get first-hand news.","The moment Qiao Xi said that, the few of them looked extremely embarrassed. The father of the family suppressed his anger and said, “We didn’t say that, but President Gu was hit by a truck. There hasn’t been any news for so many days, so he must be in trouble. We just wanted to give you a way out. Not only did you not thank us, but you’re even treating us so rudely!”","Qiao Xi sneered and asked with a lazy voice, “He was hit by a truck?”","He continued, “You’re still so young, so how can you have the ability to protect the Gu family? As long as you agree to adopt these children, we won’t make things difficult for you. You don’t have to worry about anything in the future. Just take the money to shop and maintain your beauty.","“These children have all grown up and become sensible. There’s no need for you to put in the effort to nurture them. You’ll have gained a few obedient sons for free. You’ll definitely thank us in the future.”","“Thank you?” Qiao Xi raised her brows, her eyes filled with ridicule. “All of you are doing such a shameless thing, yet you think I’ll thank you?”","The man seemed to have lost his patience as he roared in exasperation. “Qiao Xi! Don’t be so shameless! At the end of the day, you’re just an outsider. The corporation is called Gu Corporation. It’s our Gu family’s property! We have the qualifications to manage the company. If you’re willing to cooperate, then everything will naturally be negotiable. If you’re not, then be careful as you may not get anything in the end!”","A trace of a smile curled on the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth as she looked coldly at him.","“Ha, you’re threatening me?”","“Don’t say that, I’m telling the truth. Now that President Gu’s life is in danger, what can a weak woman like you do? I advise you to cooperate with us obediently. Otherwise—”","Bang!","Before he could finish speaking, someone kicked open the door. Several cameras were aimed at the crowd, and the reporters started taking photos frenziedly.","The male reporter who kicked the door open stood in front of Qiao Xi and said indignantly, “What? Bullying a weak woman like Mrs. Gu? Don’t you have any shame! If President Gu were here, would you still dare to do it?”","The people from the Gu branch family did not know what was going on. A few reporters rushed in front of them and pointed their microphones at them. They asked sharply, “Are you from the Gu branch family? Where did you hear about President Gu’s accident?”","“Even if something really happened to President Gu, President Gu’s younger brother, Gu Yao, should be the one to inherit the family business. What right do you have to force Mrs. Gu to give the inheritance rights to your children?”","“You should look in the mirror and take a look at your greedy faces. They’re disgusting!”","It was only then that the members of the Gu branch family realized that the room was full of reporters.","“Mrs. Gu, why did you invite the reporters here? This is a matter of our Gu family. You can’t change anything even if you invite them over. Let’s have a good talk in private. If this matter blows up, it won’t be good for the Gu family’s reputation.”"]},{"number":634,"title":"Chapter 634 - Who Said He Was Dead?","paragraphs":["The few of them looked at the cameras and the overbearing reporters. They were instantly enraged. “President Gu is already dead. You’re just an outsider. Gu Corporation is the Gu family’s business, you—”","“Who said he’s dead?” Qiao Xi spoke coldly.","“I really don’t understand. The few of you suddenly barged into the hospital and claimed that Gu Zheng had gotten into a car accident. Now, you’re saying that Gu Zheng is dead. Who did you hear that from?","“As the car accident was deliberately staged, the police have already determined that it’s a case of attempted murder. They’re keeping the news a secret, and only a few reliable people around me know about it. Even Gu Yao doesn’t know about it, so where did you hear the news from?","“Even if you know that Gu Zheng had gotten into a car accident, what makes you so sure that Gu Zheng is dead? Unless you already knew that Gu Zheng would get into a car accident and his injuries would be very serious.”","Qiao Xi slowly stood up and faced the reporters as she spoke word by word, “Gu Zheng was indeed in a car accident, and we’ve already cooperated with the police to seal the news. I presume everyone only found out about this today?”","“Yes,” the reporters replied.","They only heard that Gu Corporation’s board of directors had a meeting and President Gu was not there. However, they did not know the reason behind it. Even Gu Yao did not know that his brother had gotten into a car accident, so how could outsiders know?","“So, how did you people from the Gu branch family know that Gu Zheng had gotten into a car accident?” Qiao Xi’s gaze swept over indifferently. Their faces were filled with panic as they lowered their heads guiltily.","“Even Gu Yao, his biological younger brother, doesn’t know about it. How did you people from the Gu branch family know about it? You even concluded that Gu Zheng is dead and tried to force me to adopt your children. Now, the police have already determined that it was a case of attempted murder and a premeditated car accident. Could it be...","“Could it be that this accident is related to you?” Qiao Xi looked at them with a smile.","The entire place was silent. Those few people’s bodies trembled, and the corners of their mouths twitched uncontrollably. After a while, they shouted in exasperation, “You’re talking nonsense!”","“President Gu... We heard about the car accident by chance. As a member of the Gu family, we only came to visit him. What does his car accident have to do with us?","“Mrs. Gu, you can’t suspect us just because of such a small matter! You’re using your position to take revenge for your personal grudges. You just don’t want to adopt these children, so you’re throwing dirt on us!”","“Ha! So, you’re saying Mrs. Gu can’t suspect you bunch. Then what about me?” At this moment, a cold and low voice came from outside the door. The coldness that spread out made everyone present shiver.","Everyone abruptly looked up to see Gu Zheng slowly walking in. He was wearing a hospital gown and a black coat. His eyes were sinister as he scanned the crowd.","The middle-aged man who had rebutted Qiao Xi earlier instantly stiffened and retreated with a face full of fear. However, Gu Zheng walked toward him without any scruples, his entire body emitting killing intent.","Gu Zheng hooked his finger. “Song Shijing.”","“President, we’ve already called the police. The police will be here soon.”","When the members of the Gu branch family heard this, their legs instantly went soft and they fell onto the sofa. They had heard from Chairman Gu that Gu Zheng had gotten into a car accident. Moreover, Chairman Gu had also said that if Gu Zheng died, Gu Corporation would have no heir. Qiao Xi, a woman, was unable to manage such a large corporation. She also didn’t have a child and could only choose a child from the Gu branch family to adopt. That was why they had hurried over.","They did indeed want to fight for the position of the Gu family’s heir, but they did not commit murder! Even if they had the guts, they would not dare to make a move on Gu Zheng!","“P-President Gu, your accident really has nothing to do with us!”","Song Shijing helped Gu Zheng sit down. The man held Qiao Xi’s hand gently, but his voice was still cold. “The news of my accident was sealed off. Where did you hear about it?”","They trembled in fear and blurted out without thinking, “It was Chairman Gu! He told us! We just wanted to visit you.”","Qiao Xi blinked her eyes and pretended to be puzzled. “Chairman Gu is Gu Zheng’s father. If he knows that Gu Zheng has gotten seriously injured in a car accident, why didn’t he come to visit but send you guys to fight over Gu Zheng’s assets instead?","“You said that you wanted to visit Gu Zheng, but none of you asked about his condition since you came. It was as if you were sure that he was dead. You even threatened me to adopt your children. Is this what you call a visit?”"]},{"number":635,"title":"Chapter 635 - He’s The Mastermind!","paragraphs":["The reporters agreed with Qiao Xi.","The few of them were so frightened that they were at a loss. The situation in front of them was very unfavorable for them.","Before they could think of a countermeasure, Qiao Xi continued, “No matter what, the position of heir is not for anyone here to fight over. Don’t forget that there’s still the Gu family’s second young master, Gu Yao! Gu Yao is Gu Zheng’s younger brother. If Chairman Gu wants to change the heir, he has to consider Gu Yao first. Why would he give you guys a turn?! Don’t treat us like fools!”","They were so anxious that their foreheads were covered in sweat. If they did not explain it clearly now, they would not be able to explain it in the future as well. They might be arrested, and if they were really charged with murder, it would be troublesome.","“What Mrs. Gu said makes sense. Who do they think they are to inherit President Gu’s assets? Even if the Gu family wishes to choose another heir, there’s still President Gu’s biological brother, Second Young Master Gu! These people shouldn’t even think about it!”","“That’s right! And if Chairman Gu knows that President Gu had gotten into a car accident, why didn’t he come to visit him? Instead, he made these random people come over to annoy him.”","As soon as the reporter finished speaking, the father of this Gu branch family shouted in fear, “It was him! Chairman Gu told us the news. I’m not lying! I have evidence to prove that it was him!”","When she heard the last sentence, Qiao Xi revealed a smile of success.","What she said just now was just to scare these people. Her real purpose was to let them testify against the mastermind, and the mastermind of this car accident was most likely Gu Weiming.","The children were so frightened that they hugged their heads and cried. The middle-aged man said fearfully, “President Gu, I’m telling the truth. Chairman Gu told us that you were in a car accident. The car accident really has nothing to do with us. We wouldn’t dare to do anything to you even if we had the guts!”","He took out his phone and clicked on a video. “I have evidence. When I went to the Gu family’s residence, I had guessed that something was wrong, so I secretly recorded a video. Take a look.”","Gu Weiming was heard saying, “Ah Zheng got into a car accident and is in a coma now. He probably won’t be able to make it. We can’t leave Gu Corporation with no heir. We have to find a successor as soon as possible.”","The man was shocked. “President Gu got into a car accident?”","Gu Weiming took a sip of tea and pretended to be calm. “A few days ago, the doctor said that he was seriously injured and might never wake up. I remember that your son is 25 years old this year?”","The man nodded, confused.","Gu Weiming said, “Gu Corporation can’t fall into the hands of Qiao Xi, that woman. How about this? Bring your and your younger brother’s children to visit Ah Zheng, then let Qiao Xi choose two to adopt and nurture to become the next heir. If you promise to give Qiao Xi benefits in the future, I don’t think she’ll reject it.”","When the man heard this, he instantly beamed with joy and stammered excitedly, “Chairman Gu, y-you want my child to be the heir?”","Gu Weiming said calmly, “Yes, even if Ah Zheng is gone, Gu Corporation still needs to continue operating. I think your son is not bad. Let him be the heir.”","After that, the two of them exchanged greetings. The middle-aged man turned off his phone and scrambled to Gu Zheng’s feet. He pulled on his pants and wailed. “President Gu, how would I dare to do anything to you?! You heard it yourself. It was indeed Chairman Gu who told me about this. How could our family have the money to hire someone to kill you? President Gu, believe me!”","Song Shijing picked up the man’s phone and made a few copies of the video.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as he said indifferently, “So, you’re saying that the accident was indeed not done by you.”","“Yes, yes! President Gu, it’s all because of Chairman Gu.”","Gu Zheng waved his hand impatiently. The man was so frightened that he stopped breathing. Gu Zheng said casually, “It’s been hard on all of you to come all the way here to see whether I’m dead or alive. I can’t let you come for nothing. Song Shijing, treat them to a cup of tea at the police station.”","They were so scared that their bodies went limp. Song Shijing smiled coldly. “Everyone, please go to the police station to give your statements. It won’t take much time.”","They did not dare to refute, afraid that they would anger Gu Zheng and be sent to prison in the next second.","The reporters at the scene had also seen the video. They looked a little embarrassed and didn’t know what to write in their articles.","Song Shijing understood what everyone was thinking and said gently, “Please report the truth.”"]},{"number":636,"title":"Chapter 636 - Gu Weiming Is Suspected Of Murder","paragraphs":["The reporters were all experienced people and knew how deep the water ran in wealthy families. However, they did not expect that this group of people would be sent by Chairman Gu. He knew that President Gu was seriously injured in a car accident, yet he still let these people threaten Mrs. Gu and fight for the right to inherit Gu Corporation.","The children from the Gu branch family were all mediocre. Even if Gu Corporation was handed over to them, it was just a title. The real power would still lie in Gu Weiming’s hands.","From the looks of it now, the mastermind behind this car accident had already been revealed. However, everyone found it hard to believe that Gu Weiming would actually lay his hands on his own son for money and power.","With witnesses and a video as evidence, the police quickly had a suspect and applied for an arrest warrant. They rushed straight to the Gu family’s old residence. “Chairman Gu, you’re suspected of murder. Please cooperate with our investigation.”","At this moment, Gu Weiming was discussing business. The other party looked at Gu Weiming in surprise. “Chairman Gu, you...”","Gu Weiming’s face darkened as he shouted, “Nonsense! Do you have any evidence? You broke into the Gu family’s residence for no reason. This is trespassing on private property!”","If the police officer in front of him was just an ordinary person, Gu Weiming could have immediately ordered the bodyguards to chase him out. However, the police officer who came to the door was the young master of the Huo family, one of the wealthiest families in Li City. This young master didn’t like doing business and only wanted to be a police officer. Now, he had become a famous police officer in Li City.","If Gu Weiming chased Young Master Huo out, it would be equivalent to offending the entire Huo family.","Officer Huo showed his arrest warrant and said without any expression, “Chairman Gu, you’ve broken the law. We have reason to arrest you. Please cooperate with our investigation. Otherwise, we’ll take forceful measures.”","When the potential business partner here to have a meeting heard this, he immediately found an excuse to leave.","Gu Weiming trembled in anger. “Gu Zheng!”","Officer Huo sneered. “Chairman Gu, I haven’t told you which case you’re involved in yet. How do you know it’s related to President Gu?”","Gu Weiming pretended to be calm and said, “I’ll cooperate with you for the investigation, but I’ll tell you clearly that the car accident has nothing to do with me. That unfilial son, Gu Zheng, actually suspects his father and even got the police to arrest me. He’s really a good son!”","“Chairman Gu, are you blaming President Gu?” Officer Huo narrowed his eyes. He had never been afraid of anything, so he didn’t care about offending Gu Weiming.","“You’ve misunderstood President Gu. He didn’t report you. It was your cousin who went to the police station to provide evidence. According to the clues at the scene and the video he provided, we have reason to suspect that you’re related to this car accident.”","Gu Weiming’s face darkened. It was that useless person who reported him!","What surprised him even more was that Gu Zheng actually survived after being hit by the huge truck. He was really too lucky!","Even if the truck couldn’t kill him, he should have at least been poisoned. Didn’t Lu Qingyun die from the poison? But why wasn’t Gu Zheng poisoned?","...","A week later.","Gu Zheng’s body had almost recovered, but Gu Weiming was still in the police station cooperating with the investigation and hadn’t been released.","At this moment, Gu Corporation was without a leader. Lu Yan could take this opportunity to take over the Gu family. However, who knew that Gu Yao would suddenly appear and disrupt Lu Yan’s plans?","After Qiao Xi heard about this, her eyes widened in shock. “Gu Yao?”","That silly child could actually take over the Gu family at such a critical moment and even caused Lu Yan’s plans to fail?","The Gu family’s company was the lifeline of the Gu family. Gu Weiming had already planned to leave all his shares to Lu Yan. Besides, Gu Zheng did not have the shares of Gu Corporation. He could not stop all of this from happening. Even so, Gu Yao had a large portion of the shares.","Although Lu Yan was Gu Weiming’s biological son, he was not recognized by the public. Before Gu Weiming could transfer his shares to Lu Yan, he was arrested by the police. Now, only Gu Yao was the rightful heir to the Gu family’s company.","In just a week, the Gu family had undergone a drastic change. Gu Yao could hold up half the sky now.","Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door and walked in. He bowed and invited a man in a suit and leather shoes in."]},{"number":637,"title":"Chapter 637 - The World Is Huge, Nothing Is Too Strange","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi lifted her eyes to look at the man in front of her. His originally red hair had been dyed black. There was a hint of roguishness in his eyes but also a hint of steadiness. The previously reckless Gu Yao seemed to have become a different person.","Gu Yao seemed to have grown up overnight. He went from a child to a domineering man. He used his abilities to prove that he was not just a playboy. He could also manage the Gu family.","When Gu Zheng was around, Gu Yao could be the second young master of the Gu family in peace. But now that Gu Zheng was not around, he would definitely not let outsiders take over the Gu family. His image of a rich playboy was just a disguise. He was Gu Zheng’s younger brother, so he was naturally not bad.","At this moment, his gaze was sharp. The moment he saw Qiao Xi, his eyes turned slightly red as if he had a thousand things to say.","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with gratification as she praised Gu Yao in her heart. She stood up to welcome him and was about to speak...","“Damn! I really have to take my hats off to you! I didn’t expect managing the company to be so tiring! Qiao Xi, I’ve been dealing with those old guys all day. I’m so annoyed!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Where’s the domineering Gu Yao from earlier?’","Gu Yao cried and said, “Qiao Xi, I originally thought that being the president was easy, but I didn’t expect it to be so tiring! When will Gu Zheng recover? I really don’t want to manage this lousy company anymore! Why don’t you take over?”","Gu Zheng leaned against the hospital bed with a book in his hand. Without raising his head, he said, “I have nothing to do with Gu Corporation. I don’t have any shares and have no right to manage it.”","Gu Yao hurriedly said, “I’ll give you all my shares!”","Gu Zheng slowly lifted his eyes and said lightly, “I don’t want them. Gu Corporation is under your control.”","The ward suddenly fell silent for a few seconds. Gu Yao widened his eyes in shock. “No way! You want to throw this mess to me? I’ve already been the acting president for a week. Do you want me to be the president for the rest of my life? Boo-hoo... Gu Zheng! You can’t do this to me! I’m just a playboy. ” n3wn0vel . ” I’ve already used up all my energy to manage the company for a week. Don’t make things difficult for me!”","Qiao Xi listened to Gu Yao’s crying and even wondered how Gu Yao had the ability to fight with Lu Yan.","Gu Yao was like a pitiful puppy bouncing in front of the hospital bed. There were tears in his eyes as he said pitifully, “Gu Zheng, I’m your biological younger brother! You can’t treat me like this!”","Gu Zheng’s expression was calm. “How is the company doing now?”","At the mention of the company, Gu Yao’s confidence was boosted as he said proudly, “Don’t you know who I am? How can I let Lu Yan, that dog, snatch things from me? If I lose to him, where will I put my dignity in the future? But I didn’t expect this dog to have some skills. He actually...”","Gu Yao’s voice suddenly stopped. There was something that had been bothering him. Gu Zheng and Lu Yan both shared the same mother, but why did she only help Lu Yan and never cared about Gu Zheng?","Gu Zheng smirked. “Very good.”","Although it was just two words, it was still a compliment. If it were any other time, Gu Yao would have been so happy that his tail would be up in the air. But right now, his expression was dark. “Gu Zheng, I’m really tired. I don’t understand why Dad would do this to you.”","Actually, his parents doted on Gu Yao a lot and had never treated him badly since he was young. They would give him money and help him settle any trouble he caused. However, he had never experienced kinship in this family because everyone in this family was very cold and only cared about benefits.","For example, they were actually able to make a move on their biological son, Gu Zheng, for Lu Yan’s sake. In that case, wouldn’t they have to deal with him in the future as well?","For Lu Yan, they could give up their other two sons. Did they have to cause chaos in the family and kill each other?","“Of course, you don’t understand his thoughts,” Gu Zheng said nonchalantly.","Gu Yao was confused. Was there a reason behind this?","Then, Gu Zheng said seriously, “You’re a normal person. Of course, you wouldn’t understand the thoughts of a scumbag. The world is big, and there are all kinds of strange things. You guys aren’t of the same species, so there’s no need to understand his thoughts. You just have to be good and not lower yourself to the level of a retard.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Is it really okay for you to say that your father is an idiot? You’re being unfilial!’"]},{"number":638,"title":"Chapter 638 - Composer Fu Sheng","paragraphs":["But in the next second, Gu Yao nodded in admiration. “You’re right! Why do I have to understand the thoughts of a retard?”","Qiao Xi was even more speechless. If Gu Weiming heard the brothers talking about him behind his back, he would probably be angered to death.","Although Gu Zheng was cold, he was sincere toward Gu Yao. Only Gu Zheng could make Gu Yao feel the existence of kinship, so after he found out that his parents had attacked Gu Zheng, he was completely disappointed in them.","Since he was young, Gu Zheng had taken care of him, educated him, and nurtured him so that he could distinguish right from wrong. That was why he had not been reduced to a cold-blooded person like his parents.","...","At the Xu family’s home.","Xu Anran’s eyes were slightly red. She rushed to the living room and held Xia Yunlou’s hand. “Mom! Have you heard? President Gu was in a car accident. He’s seriously injured and unconscious. I heard that this car accident was a murder attempt. Sister will definitely be implicated. Why don’t we quickly bring her back?”","At this time, the news on the internet had already caused an uproar. The official news reported that the brake line of Gu Zheng’s car was cut by someone, and a huge truck had directly crashed into Gu Zheng’s car. Fortunately, that car was bulletproof, so Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi survived. However, both of them were seriously injured.","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. “Mom, the Gu family is really too dangerous. Sister was lucky this time and managed to escape the calamity. But what should we do next time? Sister is your biological daughter. Are you going to watch her get killed?”","Xia Yunlou was silent for a moment before her eyes suddenly lit up. “You’re right. We have to bring Xi Xi back as soon as possible!”","Xu Anran was so anxious that she was tearing up. “The last time we went to visit my sister, there was a misunderstanding. Now that the netizens are scolding me, I can’t stay in the entertainment industry anymore. However, I’ve never blamed my sister. I only hope that she can let bygones be bygones and follow us home.”","Xia Yunlou had a loving look on her face. “Anran, you’re really my good daughter. The situation with your reputation is only temporary. After some time, everyone will forget about these trivial matters. As long as you donate money to charity, everyone will change their impression of you.”","Xu Anran frowned. All these years, she had spent a lot of money but did not manage to save much. Now, she could only allow herself to lose some benefits.","Suddenly, her manager sent a message to her. Xu Anran glanced at it and said happily, “Mom, I heard that there’s going to be a grand music festival held in the country.”","Xia Yunlou shook her head.","Xu Anran smiled and said, “This music festival is the most prestigious pop music competition in the country. All of the famous musicians in the country will be participating in it. If I can get first place in this competition, those people will probably stop scolding me!”","Xia Yunlou hesitated. “But you...”","“Mom, all these years, I’ve been learning how to write and compose. I’m confident that I can win an award in this competition. Even if I can’t win first place, I definitely won’t embarrass you guys.”","Xu Anran indeed did not have any talent in writing lyrics or composing songs. However, she had previously found a very talented composer on a small website. That person had posted a few songs online two years ago and there was no news of him after that. Xu Anran sent someone to investigate for a period of time and guessed that the person might have passed away.","Later on, she used her connections to get the website to remove all of that person’s works and claimed them to be hers. It seemed that the composer’s name was Fu Sheng.","Xu Anran smiled and said, “Mom, believe me. I’ll definitely win the award in the competition. But what should I do about my sister? What should I do to make her forgive me?”","At the mention of Qiao Xi, Xia Yunlou felt irritated and couldn’t help but roar. “I’m her mother! Do I need her forgiveness? She has already caused us to be scolded by netizens. What else does she want?!”","Xu Anran rolled her eyes. “Mom, if President Gu forgives me, will my younger sister also forgive me? After all, she’s President Gu’s wife. She has to listen to President Gu.”","Xia Yunlou suddenly looked up. “Yes! If President Gu forgives us and Qiao Xi still refuses to forgive us, then it just means she doesn’t know what’s good for her!”","In the hospital.","When Qin An came to check on them, he could not help but sigh. “The two of you are indeed much better than ordinary people. You’re recovering very quickly and there are no side effects.”"]},{"number":639,"title":"Chapter 639 - She Said She Couldn’t Live Without Him!","paragraphs":["A huge truck had crashed into them, but they recovered completely in less than half a month.","Qiao Xi had only suffered light injuries, and there were no further problems after she woke up. But Gu Zheng had suffered heavy injuries. His shoulder blade was pierced by a steel rod. At that time, he had guessed that it would take at least half a year for Gu Zheng to fully recover. However, it had only been half a month now, yet Gu Zheng had more or less recovered. It was just that the wound on his shoulder hadn’t completely healed, so he still had to be careful.","Qin An stared at Qiao Xi for a moment before his eyes darkened. He could not help but remind her, “The two of you can be discharged now, but you have to take care of your health when you return home.”","Seeing Qin An’s departing figure, Gu Zheng looked up and asked, “Why is Qin An staring at you? What are you hiding from me?”","Qiao Xi’s heart shook. “Nothing...”","He hadn’t finished speaking when Qiao Xi fell into a scorching embrace.","Gu Zheng’s shoulder was injured, and he pulled her into his embrace with one hand. He suppressed the sorrow in his heart and said with a hoarse voice, “Qiao Xi, this is the last time. I won’t allow you to harm yourself anymore, even if it’s for my sake!”","Qiao Xi looked up in surprise. She knew that with Gu Zheng’s intelligence, he must have known that she had used her blood to save him. He just held it in and did not say anything.","She leaned into Gu Zheng’s arms and listened to his intense heartbeat. She choked and said, “Ah Zheng, I really can’t watch you get poisoned!”","Gu Zheng, who had always been calm, was also trembling all over. He gritted his teeth and said, “I know what the consequences will be if you use your blood to save me. I don’t want you to sacrifice yourself for me.”","Qiao Xi looked up, her eyes filled with sparkling tears. “You know everything, but you don’t know that the thing Grandfather regrets the most in his life is not detoxifying Miss Lu’s poison back then. He has been regretting it his entire life. Gu Zheng, can you bear to let me live in pain for the rest of my life?”","Tears flowed down her cheeks, and Qiao Xi’s voice was firm. “Gu Zheng, I can’t live without you. Besides, I’m still standing in front of you while my body isn’t affected in the slightest. As for what happens in the future, who can tell? We just have to enjoy the present.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at her tears. For the first time, he had a taste of heartache. It was an indescribable feeling. He was both touched and heartbroken. It made his eyes sting.","She said that she could not live without him!","“President...” Song Shiyu suddenly barged in. The first thing he saw was the two of them hugging each other tightly, and he immediately swallowed his words.","Gu Zheng looked up slightly, his eyes filled with displeasure. Didn’t the assistant he hired know how to knock on the door? Why did he always barge in and ruin the mood?","Song Shiyu noticed that the president was looking at him with an unfriendly gaze and quickly reported, “President, Chairman Gu has been released. The mastermind has been found!”","There wasn’t the slightest bit of surprise in Gu Zheng’s eyes. He slowly let go of Qiao Xi and gestured for Song Shiyu to continue.","“But the mastermind is dead. That person is...” Song Shiyu paused, looked at Qiao Xi, and continued, “Qiao Rou!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened. “What?”","Song Shiyu repeated, “It’s Qiao Rou. All the clues and evidence point to Qiao Rou. And after the DNA comparison, we confirmed that the woman in the truck was Qiao Rou. She was the one who hit your car with the truck.”","Qiao Xi frowned. At that time, the situation was critical and they weren’t in their right minds to look at the murderer’s face. All they could think about was how to avoid the fatal blow. She never would have thought that the person driving the truck was actually Qiao Rou.","What was even more shocking was that Qiao Rou was dead?","Song Shiyu’s face was gloomy. “But there are still many unexplainable problems. For example, how did Qiao Rou cut the brake line? How did she know your whereabouts? And how did she confirm that you would drive to the city at that time? If she didn’t have help, she wouldn’t have been able to do this. But all the clues point to Qiao Rou now. Chairman Gu was detained for seven days, but there’s no new evidence.”","Qiao Xi said, “I suddenly remembered that Lu Yan had once worn a watch that was given to him by Qiao Rou. They must have been involved long ago.”"]},{"number":640,"title":"Chapter 640 - Gu Yao Is Really An Angel","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng felt a stinging pain in his eyes and closed them in exhaustion. The terrifying memories of his childhood surfaced in his mind. His lips turned pale, and his breathing became hurried.","Even though more than a decade had passed, his emotions would still fluctuate when he thought about those dark and painful days. At that time, he was locked up in Maple Garden by Huang Lilan and suffered abuse every day.","In the darkness, he gritted his teeth and endured the whipping and cursing. The hatred in his heart grew like vines and corroded his heart.","The accident had brought bad memories back to his mind. He had a bad feeling. Maybe...","Gu Zheng rubbed his eyes, and his eyes swelled up. He forcefully endured this discomfort and opened his eyes as he was deeply afraid of being discovered by Qiao Xi.","However, Qiao Xi could still see the exhaustion in his eyes. She asked softly, “Are you feeling unwell?”","Gu Zheng shook his head and pretended to be calm. There was a hint of warmth in his deep eyes.","Hearing that Gu Zheng was about to be discharged from the hospital, Gu Yao rushed over to pick him up. When he saw Gu Zheng’s cold gaze, he could not help but be shocked. “F*ck! Big Brother! Your gaze is killing me!”","Gu Yao and Gu Zheng had grown up together, so Gu Yao thought that he understood Gu Zheng very well. He disdained to pretend in front of others, but in front of Qiao Xi, he would always pretend to be gentle and warm. But now, Gu Zheng’s face was cold. Gu Yao felt a chill go down his spine just by looking at him.","“Let’s go, let’s go. I’ll send you home.”","Gu Yao was afraid that he would run into the same situation as before. Before he got into the car, he checked the car. After confirming that there was no problem, he drove the two of them back to Longwan Residential.","After getting out of the car, Qiao Xi asked with a worried expression, “Gu Zheng, did... you not rest well?”","Third Brother said that Gu Zheng’s physique was very good and he was fine. Logically speaking, he should be fine, but his complexion was not too good.","Gu Zheng felt that his mind was a mess, and his temples were throbbing. His footsteps were weak, and his gaze had turned sharp. “I’m fine. I’ll go upstairs first.”","Qiao Xi didn’t pursue the matter. After two hours, she quietly went to his room and saw him lying on the bed with a frown and pale lips.","She was a little confused. He had been normal in the morning, but after Song Shiyu told them about the mastermind behind the accident, something went wrong.","Actually, everyone knew in their hearts that Qiao Rou was just a scapegoat. The real masterminds were Gu Weiming and Lu Yan. However, did she not understand why this matter affected Gu Zheng so much?","“Qiao Xi.” It was unknown how long Gu Yao had entered the room. Seeing that Gu Zheng was sleeping, he pulled her out of the door. “Come downstairs with me, I have a gift for you.”","“You got injured because of the car accident. You’re also a patient, yet you stayed in the hospital to take care of my brother for so long. It’s been hard on you, so I prepared a gift for you. Not only are you sure to like it, but I’m sure Gu Zheng will like it too!”","Qiao Xi was almost moved to tears. Gu Yao was really a little angel. Not only did he carry the heavy responsibility of the company during this period, but he even took the time to prepare a gift for them!","After going downstairs, Qiao Xi immediately saw a few pink boxes on the sofa. They were exquisitely packaged with a black bow on top.","Gu Yao rushed over and opened the boxes one by one, revealing the things inside. The smile on Qiao Xi’s face gradually disappeared.","On the other hand, Gu Yao was excited. “Qiao Xi! You like them, right? I spent a long time choosing them, and these styles are all very good. Gu Zheng and I are biological brothers, so he’ll definitely like the styles I like! Why are you blushing?! We’re both adults. What’s there to be embarrassed about?! I just think that since you guys haven’t been intimate for half a month, you guys should have some fun now! That’s why I prepared these things. Hahaha!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Someone come quickly! Throw this hooligan out!’","Gu Yao continued, “Don’t look down on the nightwear. Just these few pieces of fabric cost me a lot of money! After all, they’re nightwear. You’ll be sleeping in them, so you have to consider the quality and comfort. I was afraid that Gu Zheng would tear the nightwear apart if he got too agitated, so I bought the ones with straps. As long as he pulls the straps, the nightwear will automatically come undone! Amazing, right?”","Qiao Xi: “...”","“You don’t have to thank me. It’s only right that I do this!”"]},{"number":641,"title":"Chapter 641 - Gu Zheng Doesn’t Stoop To The Level Of A Fool","paragraphs":["Hearing Gu Yao’s words, the corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. He had bought her so many sexy nightwears, yet he still wanted her to thank him? He probably wanted Gu Zheng to thank him!","“Gu Yao, I finally understand why you were always beaten by Gu Zheng since you were young but you still have your limbs intact.”","Gu Yao asked curiously, “Why?”","“Because Gu Zheng doesn’t stoop to the level of a fool,” Qiao Xi said through gritted teeth. Only a fool like Gu Yao would give his sister-in-law sexy nightwear.","After Gu Zheng woke up, he went downstairs and saw the two of them sitting on the sofa and talking. They were holding a few pieces of fabric in their hands. This intimate scene made his eyes darken.","Gu Yao was still talking non-stop. “There’s very little fabric! Gu Zheng is injured, after all. He hasn’t recovered yet. Will he be unable to take the shock?! Although his body has recovered, he still can’t do any vigorous exercise!","“Why don’t we forget about it first? You should wait for him to recover before wearing these. Otherwise, he definitely won’t be able to control himself!”","As soon as Gu Yao finished speaking, Qiao Xi saw a tall figure coming down from upstairs. She abruptly raised her eyes and saw Gu Zheng looking at the two of them with a faint smile.","Damn! Gu Yao would be the death of her!","Gu Yao’s back was facing the stairs, so he did not see the man. He continued, “What’s with your expression?! I’m doing this for your own good. I want to hug my nephew as soon as possible.”","Qiao Xi blinked at him, hinting at him that Gu Zheng was downstairs. However, Gu Yao did not understand what she was doing and asked with a puzzled expression, “Qiao Xi, what’s wrong with your eyes? Are you not feeling well? Or do you and Gu Zheng like more exciting things? Gu Zheng, that brat, looks like quite a serious man. I didn’t expect him to play so well in bed!”","“Heh! You’re having fun?” A low and cold voice sounded from behind him.","Before Gu Yao could react, he blurted out, “That’s right! Gu Zheng...”","Suddenly, he paused and felt a chill behind him. It made his hair stand on end. He turned around in horror. At this moment, Gu Zheng was looking down at him.","“Brother! You... Listen, I just figured that you and Qiao Xi haven’t done it in a long time, so I wanted you two to have some fun. Do you understand? I’m doing this for your own good.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep and cold. Qiao Xi sensed that something was wrong, but Gu Yao did not notice anything unusual with Gu Zheng.","“Gu Zheng, why are you looking at me with this expression? You’re always throwing a tantrum. You’re her husband, yet you don’t know how to be gentle. Qiao Xi is still here. Don’t tell me you want to hit me?! Ah! Cough, cough, cough... Gu Zheng, you...”","Gu Zheng’s eyes turned cold as if he thought that Gu Yao was being noisy. He suddenly reached out and grabbed Gu Yao’s neck. The force he exerted made Gu Yao unable to breathe.","Gu Yao was instantly stunned. He had even forgotten to struggle. In the past when Gu Zheng hit him, he would only suffer from some physical pain. Now, Gu Zheng was actually strangling him?","Qiao Xi’s expression changed, and she hurriedly moved forward to stop Gu Zheng. She held a silver needle and stabbed it into an acupuncture point on his arm. “Gu Zheng, let go!”","Gu Zheng slowly raised his head, his eyes looking gray. His younger brother and lover were both standing in front of him, but the look of gentleness and love in his eyes had already vanished. It was as though he had become a stranger.","At this moment, Gu Yao also realized that something was wrong. His voice was hoarse. “Gu Zheng! You... What are you doing?”","The man let go, and his eyes gradually recovered their clarity. However, what appeared in the corners of his eyes was shock and alienation. He did not explain anything and hurriedly turned to leave.","Gu Yao and Qiao Xi looked at each other. The former asked with some lingering fear, “Qiao Xi, what’s wrong with him? Why do I feel like he seemed to have changed into a different person just now? It was as though he wanted to kill me.","“He was fine before he was discharged. Could it be that he’s sick?”","Qiao Xi sighed. “Gu Yao, your brother isn’t targeting you. He’s just a little unwell.”","Gu Yao was silent for a moment before he suddenly shouted, “Could it be that Gu Zheng was sleepwalking?! He didn’t have this problem when he was young! You have to watch him when he sleeps at night. If anything happens to him, the company will fall into my hands. I don’t want to be the president forever! It’s too tiring!”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Damn! I thought you were worried about your brother, but you’re afraid of having to manage the company.’","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes. Logically speaking, Gu Zheng had already drunk her blood, and the poison in his body should have been dealt with. Why did he suddenly become like this?"]},{"number":642,"title":"Chapter 642 - The Devil In His Body Awakens","paragraphs":["An hour later, Qiao Xi went upstairs. Gu Zheng was working in the study. His eyes were calm. Seeing her enter, he asked casually, “Has Gu Yao left?”","Qiao Xi frowned and did not answer immediately.","Gu Zheng did not raise his head and said softly, “It’s getting late. Go back to your room and rest.”","Qiao Xi hesitated for a moment, and her eyes were filled with worry. “Aren’t you going to rest?”","“There’s still some work that hasn’t been settled. Gu Corporation is holding an important meeting. If you have time, come with me.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. Gu Zheng had never allowed her to come into contact with his work matters. Why did he suddenly ask her to go to the company for a meeting this time?","Even though she had doubts in her heart, Qiao Xi still nodded without the slightest hesitation.","Qiao Xi walked out of the study and suddenly stopped when she reached the door. She turned around to look at Gu Zheng and saw that his eyes were indifferent as he looked seriously at the document in his hands. He looked very normal. Perhaps he was just feeling unwell earlier.","...","After Qiao Xi left, Gu Zheng suddenly raised his head. His eyes surged with a layer of coldness that gradually turned gray. He had always been trying his best to control his emotions in front of Qiao Xi, and the impulse that came from the bottom of his heart caused him to be slightly exhausted.","Back when he was in Maple Garden, he had gotten poisoned. He was also drugged with something that could make one go crazy. It caused him to lose his emotions and rationality from time to time, turning him into a bloodthirsty demon. The funny thing was that even with his astonishing willpower, he could not control it.","He used to be a little boy who often smiled. However, after being tortured in the darkness and facing countless abuse, he gradually lost his feelings and warmth. He ended up like this.","Gu Zheng had long known that a demon was in his body, and it would escape when he let his guard down. It would occupy his body and possess his soul. It had no emotions, just a thirst to kill.","In the past, Gu Zheng thought that there was nothing wrong with this. At the very least, no one would dare to bully him anymore. He was irritable and cold, but it was not a weakness. Instead, it was his protection.","He disdained emotions because he was an indifferent person. However, everything changed after Qiao Xi appeared.","The last time his illness acted up was many years ago. It had been so long that he had forgotten about the demon in his body. He was very afraid that the demon would hurt Qiao Xi.","He originally thought that the demon would disappear with the passage of time. That way, no one would ever know the darkness hidden in the depths of his heart. He thought that he had hidden it very well and would not let the demon born in Maple Garden occupy his body anymore. Unfortunately, he failed.","Gu Zheng clenched his fists. He would rather die than allow himself to hurt Qiao Xi. She was the woman he loved the most. She was his life.","The man slowly got up and walked to the bedroom door. He gently pushed it open. Seeing that she was sleeping soundly, he revealed a gentle smile.","He walked softly to the bed and bent down to plant a kiss on her forehead. It was a light kiss, but it was filled with strong emotions. He said, “I love you.”","...","Late at night, the sleeping Gu Zheng suddenly opened his eyes. His gray eyes were sharp and cold like a wolf in the dark. He glanced at the woman beside him and narrowed his eyes.","He was sleeping on the same bed as a woman?","The memories in Gu Zheng’s mind were still there, but the emotions in his heart had already vanished. He even sneered. He actually got married and had a wife.","At this moment, Gu Zheng felt that he must have lost his mind. He was actually willing to marry and was completely obedient to this woman. He was even willing to sacrifice his life for her.","There was no emotion in his eyes. They were filled with disgust. He could not even accept sleeping on the same bed as this woman. Hence, he lifted the blanket and slowly got up.","It was just that he did not expect his actions to be too aggressive, which woke Qiao Xi up. The impatience in Gu Zheng’s eyes grew even more intense. He felt that women were really too troublesome.","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi narrowed her eyes and roared furiously. “I finally fell asleep. Why are you moving around?! I’m not sleeping with you anymore! How annoying!”","Gu Zheng: “...”","He suddenly recalled the terrified faces of Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan after he controlled this body the last time.","“Ah! Your... Your eyes have turned green! You’re not Gu Zheng! People from the Gu family don’t have green eyes. Get out of the Gu family!”","“You’re a demon! Just like your dead mother, you’ll kill us sooner or later!”"]},{"number":643,"title":"Chapter 643 - Women Are Trouble","paragraphs":["At that time, the six-year-old Gu Zheng was like a wild wolf with green eyes. He held a sharp dagger in his hand and rushed out of Maple Garden. Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan fled in a panic while shouting in horror that he was a demon!","However, even though he was in a rage, he was only a six-year-old child. He still could not compare to an adult in terms of physical strength. In the end, he was subdued by the bodyguards and locked up.","However, Qiao Xi was very different from the others. She did not feel afraid. Perhaps it was because it was too dark in the room, so she had not noticed the changes in him.","Gu Zheng bent down and leaned closer. “Open your eyes and look at me. Don’t you have anything to say to me?”","Qiao Xi opened her sleepy eyes. With the light from the lamp, she looked into Gu Zheng’s eyes. His eyes were glowing with a green light, adding an evil charm to the already handsome man.","She frowned.","Gu Zheng looked as if he had expected this. Indeed, she was no different from the others. She started to be afraid after seeing his eyes.","Previously, every time he appeared, it was because Gu Zheng’s anger had accumulated to a certain extent or it was because of strong stimulation. However, the current Gu Zheng was already powerful and calm enough. Why did he still appear? Could it be because of this woman in front of him?","While looking at Qiao Xi’s charming face, he wondered if she had done something to let Gu Zheng down.","Tsk! Women were troublesome.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with coldness. Just as he was about to mock her, a familiar voice suddenly appeared in his mind.","‘... Is he crazy?’","Gu Zheng’s expression froze, and his cold eyes were filled with confusion.","This woman actually dared to insult him? He really did not understand why Gu Zheng liked this woman! Speaking of which, he was also a part of Gu Zheng, but he did not like Qiao Xi.","“What’s the point of wearing contact lenses at night to scare me? How lame!”","Qiao Xi’s face was filled with rage.","She had always minded the quality of her sleep, so she was very angry when she was abruptly awoken. She was already angry when she was woken up, and after seeing Gu Zheng’s strange appearance, she was even more furious.","‘Damn! Could it be that Gu Yao was right? Is Gu Zheng really sleepwalking? Before he attacked Gu Yao, he was also sleeping. Now, he’s acting crazy again after falling asleep! He must be sleepwalking!’","Gu Zheng: “...”","‘It’s fine! Sleepwalking isn’t an illness. It’s just a small problem. I’ll look for Third Brother and Gu Zheng will definitely be fine!’","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before looking at Gu Zheng’s eyes meaningfully. Then, she pretended not to have noticed anything strange and lay down to continue sleeping.","‘They don’t seem to be contact lenses. How did his eyes turn green, then?’","Gu Zheng heard her thoughts and knew that she had already realized the problem. She should be afraid now.","Then, the voice sounded again—","‘He has indeed been acting a little abnormally recently. Could it be that the poison is acting up? But that shouldn’t be the case. My blood is supposed to detoxify the poison in his body, no?","‘Perhaps using blood to detoxify the poison can only temporarily suppress the poison’s effects. Perhaps this is a side effect. It’s my fault for not being skilled enough to completely detoxify the poison in his body.’","The coldness in Gu Zheng’s eyes seemed to have dissipated a little, and his mind was filled with Qiao Xi’s worried voice.","He looked at Qiao Xi with slight surprise and was silent for a moment. He never expected that this woman would actually be worried about his health.","Gu Zheng sneered and looked at Qiao Xi with an icy-cold expression. This woman was really an idiot to use her blood to detoxify his poison and not hesitate to share the same blood as him!","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi looked at the dark circles under her eyes and was instantly infuriated. She was a beauty! How could she have dark circles?!","She was about to curse when Gu Zheng entered the bedroom. His eyes were calm as he pressed himself against her back. She immediately swallowed the words in her mouth.","Seeing that she was about to say something, Gu Zheng asked, “What’s the matter?”","Qiao Xi hurriedly shook her head. “N-Nothing!”","Gu Zheng looked at the dark circles under her eyes and frowned. “You didn’t sleep well last night? Did you lose sleep? Is it because of me? Xi Xi, don’t think too much.”","‘So, you know that the dark circles on my face are because of you, you bastard! If you hadn’t woken me up last night and said those strange things to me, I wouldn’t have lost sleep!’","Gu Zheng’s body abruptly stiffened, and a wave of coldness suddenly appeared in his eyes. He woke Qiao Xi up last night and even said some strange things to her?","In that case, the demon must have woken up again last night and occupied his body, but he did not know what had happened."]},{"number":644,"title":"Chapter 644 - She’s Just A Weak Woman!","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng hurriedly turned on his phone and looked at it. That demon did not leave anything behind. It was as if he had never been here at all. This time, it was a little different from before. Previously, the demon would cause a mess every time he appeared, as though he was afraid that others would not know that he had gone crazy.","Gu Zheng suppressed the uneasiness in his heart and held her hand tightly. “Let’s go to the company.”","Qiao Xi stood in front of the mirror and looked at the dark circles under her eyes. She sighed helplessly. “Why do you want me to go? What does the company’s meeting have to do with me?”","Gu Zheng was a little hesitant. “It’s just...”","He just did not want to be separated from her. He felt uneasy even if it was for a second. He was very afraid of losing her. If Qiao Xi left him, he would definitely go crazy.","Qiao Xi put on makeup to cover her dark circles. The two of them arrived at Gu Corporation. Gu Zheng entered the meeting room first while Qiao Xi went to his office to wait.","An hour later, when Qiao Xi saw that Gu Zheng was not back yet, she was slightly bored and wanted to go out for a walk. She had just left when she bumped into a woman.","...","On the other hand, Gu Zheng had just ended the meeting and hurriedly walked to his office.","The demon had appeared again. Actually, he was a little puzzled as to why the demon kept being unleashed recently. He had not been released for many years.","Gu Zheng’s willpower was too strong, and he was usually very calm. Nothing seemed to be able to anger him, but perhaps his emotions had been unstable recently, so he was easily overpowered.","Song Shiyu sensed that there was something wrong with the president.","Gu Zheng’s eyes shone with a green light, and he looked devilish. “Song Shiyu.”","Song Shiyu said, “Huh?” ‘Damn! President, what’s with that look? I’m so scared!’","“Young Madam is in trouble. You fired Director Feng, so she went to look for Young Madam to cause trouble...” Song Shiyu said nervously.","Gu Zheng was still wondering why he was so emotional when he heard Song Shiyu’s words.","He suddenly frowned. “Qiao Xi is here?”","Song Shiyu widened his eyes in confusion. “Didn’t Young Madam come with you this morning? Young Madam has been waiting for you in the office. I didn’t expect to see Director Feng as soon as I left.”","Gu Zheng was slightly annoyed. Gu Zheng liked Qiao Xi, but he did not like her. Why should he help Qiao Xi? He thought so in his heart, but he could not reveal anything on his face. Hence, he berated angrily, “Are you all trash? You knew that she was in the office, yet you still allowed Director Feng to disturb her! She’s just a weak woman. How can she win against the company’s people?!”","No matter what, Qiao Xi was his wife in name. Although he did not like her, he could not show it in front of others. Moreover, Qiao Xi was his woman. How could he let others bully her?","Song Shiyu: “...” A weak woman?","Although Gu Zheng felt that he did not care about Qiao Xi, he could not help but speed up after he heard the news. “Let’s go take a look!”","Half an hour ago.","Qiao Xi went out for a walk out of boredom. A woman who looked like a secretary walked over and said respectfully, “Mrs. Gu, the receptionist called and said that there’s a young miss downstairs who claims to be your sister. She wants to see you. Do you wish to invite her up?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “My sister?”","Xu Anran?","Qiao Xi did not know why Xu Anran was here, but there were many people in the company. It would be difficult to avoid criticism if she kept her waiting downstairs. It was better to let her come upstairs and see what she wanted to do.","“Bring her up.”","The secretary brought Xu Anran upstairs. At this moment, she was wearing a white dress and looked weak like a little white flower that had gone through many harsh things.","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm. “Sit.”","Xu Anran seemed to be shocked as she said while trembling, “Sister, I won’t sit down.”","Qiao Xi looked at her pretentious appearance and sneered in her heart. It seemed that she had been practicing her acting skills at home these past few days. She came looking for her to pretend to be a weak and innocent woman!","Did Xu Anran think that as long as she pretended to be weak, others would think that she was being bullied and pity her?","Perhaps others might pity Xu Anran, but Qiao Xi did not indulge her. She did not care about what others thought.","Qiao Xi sneered. “Forget it, then. Just stand.”","Xu Anran didn’t seem to have expected Qiao Xi to be so heartless. The corners of her mouth twitched slightly as she lowered her head aggrievedly.","Suddenly, the people in the lounge were pushed aside. A woman cried and rushed in. “Mrs. Gu, you must be Mrs. Gu! Boo-hoo...”","Qiao Xi looked in the direction of the voice. “You...”"]},{"number":645,"title":"Chapter 645 - Threatened","paragraphs":["The middle-aged woman choked and said, “I’m Director Feng from Gu Corporation’s finance department.”","Qiao Xi nodded to indicate that she heard her. Before she could say anything, Director Feng said, “Mrs. Gu, I wish to talk to you.”","Qiao Xi stared at the middle-aged woman in front of her and sized her up before looking at Xu Anran. She suddenly realized that something was off, so she smiled indifferently. “Alright, what do you want to say to me, Director Feng?”","Director Feng glanced at Xu Anran and quickly said, “Mrs. Gu, I’ve been working in Gu Corporation for more than ten years and have always been conscientious. However, President Gu wants to fire me. Can you plead for me on the account that I’ve been working for the company for so many years?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. Gu Zheng wanted to fire her, so why was she looking for her?","Gu Zheng had always had his own reasons for doing things. Since she was fired after working for the company for more than ten years, it must be because she had done something wrong. Otherwise, Gu Zheng would not have done this.","Qiao Xi did not know what had happened, so she naturally would not agree to her request. “Director Feng, I’m sorry, but I can’t help you with this. Since Ah Zheng has already made his decision, he must have his reasons.”","Director Feng hurriedly said, “Mrs. Gu, I did do something wrong, but it’s not a big deal. Moreover, this matter is related to you, so I can only look for you.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. Related to her? She had never seen this person before. Moreover, she had never cared about the company’s matters. What did this have to do with her?","Before Qiao Xi could say anything, Xu Anran tried to persuade her. “Sister, Dad and Mom have always told us to be tolerant and magnanimous since we were young. Director Feng has worked so hard for so many years. How could you fire her because of you?”","Gu Zheng had just reached the door when he heard this. He stopped in his tracks and smirked.","It seemed that there was more than one person who wanted to make things difficult for Mrs. Gu. Apart from Director Feng, who had been fired, there was also the b*tch, Xu Anran. The two of them were in cahoots to bully Mrs. Gu?","He knew that these two women were up to no good, but others might not. If Mrs. Gu fell into their trap and was misunderstood by others, she would definitely be very sad!","Director Feng cried and said, “Mrs. Gu, I only stood up for Qiao Rou. I didn’t know that Qiao Rou was the illegitimate daughter back then. I was also deceived by her, so I said those words. It’s only right that you hate me, but you can’t make me lose my job!”","Xu Anran immediately seized the opportunity and said, “Xi Xi, no matter what, Director Feng has been working in Gu Corporation for more than ten years. How can you fire her just because of a few words? Qiao Rou did do something wrong, but this has nothing to do with Director Feng! She was deceived by her. You shouldn’t be so unforgiving, right?!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly as she chuckled. “Sister, do you think I should look for Gu Zheng and get him to take back his order to fire her?”","Director Feng had a pleading expression, but Qiao Xi’s eyes suddenly turned cold in the next second. “Ah Zheng fired you, but as his wife, you want me to go against his wishes. Are you trying to sow discord between us? Do you think I’m a fool? Do you think I’ll do whatever you say? Should I go against my husband for a stranger?”","Gu Zheng, who was outside the door, smiled. Mrs. Gu still had some tricks up her sleeve.","Director Feng’s expression darkened. “Mrs. Gu, I’ve been working in Gu Corporation for so many years. I was fired because I spoke up for Qiao Rou. If news of this gets out, the employees will definitely be disappointed!","“I’m begging you, Mrs. Gu. Please plead for me. I’m the director of the finance department. If I leave, who will do my job? This will be the company’s loss. President Gu might blame this on you.”","Qiao Xi couldn’t help but laugh. Was this a threat?","If she really listened to Director Feng and went to plead with Gu Zheng, she would be a fool!","Qiao Xi could not be bothered to continue arguing with this woman, so she stood up and left.","Seeing that she was ignoring her, Director Feng instantly flew into a rage out of humiliation and shouted, “Mrs. Gu! Are you sure you don’t care about this matter? Do you think it’s appropriate for you to fire a veteran of a company just because of a few words? Gu Corporation is so ignorant. Will the employees be willing to pledge loyalty to a company like this?","“If news of this gets out, your reputation will be affected as well. I advise you to consider it carefully!”","Qiao Xi slowly turned around, and her voice was icy-cold. “What are you doing? Are you angry from embarrassment?”"]},{"number":646,"title":"Chapter 646 - Of Course, She’d Choose To Forgive You","paragraphs":["“Mrs. Gu, don’t go too far. You’re both sisters, so why don’t you learn from Miss Anran? She’s so gentle and kind. If you can be like her...”","“Don’t go too far?”","At this moment, a cold voice came from outside the door, interrupting Director Feng.","Gu Zheng glanced coldly at Qiao Xi. This woman was really too weak. She was just obediently watching Director Feng strut around in front of her. If he did not appear, would she stand there and be criticized?","Although he did not like this woman, she was Mrs. Gu in name. If she were to lose her reputation, he would lose all his dignity.","Gu Zheng frowned. This woman was really stupid.","When Xu Anran saw Gu Zheng appear, she immediately took a few steps forward with a shy expression. “President Gu, as Xi Xi’s sister, I don’t think Director Feng should be fired. It’s not right to fire a long-term employee for personal reasons, right?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were cold as he said casually, “Hmm? Are you accusing me?”","Xu Anran was so scared that her face turned pale. Her eyes were red as she said aggrievedly, “President Gu, I’m doing this for your and the company’s sake. Director Feng has been working hard for so many years in the company but she was fired. Outsiders will think that it’s all because of my sister. This won’t be good for her either...”","“She’s been working hard?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, his face filled with mockery.","“I’ve never mistreated any employee of Gu Corporation. They work for the company while I pay them their salary. Is this called hard work? Just because she has worked in the company for more than ten years, I can’t fire her even though she made a mistake?”","Director Feng’s expression turned uglier and uglier. Gu Zheng said impatiently, “I thought that you were being used by others, so I merely fired you. I didn’t expect you to make things worse. Since that’s the case, don’t blame me for being nasty.”","Gu Zheng said coldly, “Director Feng, you were the one who exposed our whereabouts to Qiao Rou. You’re half a murderer. Since you’re unwilling to accept your outcome, let’s meet in court.”","Director Feng’s body went weak, and she immediately swallowed her retorts.","Her eyes were filled with horror as she stammered, “President Gu, I was deceived by Qiao Rou! I’m also a victim!”","“Song Shiyu, submit all the evidence about Director Feng and Qiao Rou colluding together. Whether Director Feng did it on purpose or not, it’s a fact that she exposed our whereabouts to Qiao Rou, causing Young Madam and me to be attacked. Now, she’s openly threatening Young Madam in the company. If I let this go, I’ll be laughed at!”","After Gu Zheng finished speaking, he walked in front of Qiao Xi and said with an indifferent tone, “Let’s go, Mrs. Gu.”","Director Feng was dragged out by the bodyguards. Xu Anran was trembling in fear, but she was already here. She could not just leave without doing anything.","Qiao Xi was so arrogant now because of President Gu. If Xu Anran could gain President Gu’s favor, how would Qiao Xi dare to continue treating her like this? At that time, the entire Li City would crawl under her feet.","Xu Anran quickly walked over and stood in front of Qiao Xi. Tears trickled down her face. “Xi Xi, don’t blame me. I thought that Director Feng was just gossiping with me saying that you wanted to fire her. I didn’t know that she exposed your whereabouts. If I knew that the car accident was related to her, I wouldn’t have spoken up for her.”","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “You chickened out so quickly? Weren’t you being so reasonable just now?”","The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched slightly. “Xi Xi, you... You’ve misunderstood me. You’re my sister. Everything I do is for your own good.”","Then, Xu Anran turned around and looked at Gu Zheng pitifully. “President Gu, I’m sorry. Can you forgive me? I really—”","Before she could finish, Gu Zheng interrupted, “Sure.”","A trace of surprise flashed past Xu Anran’s eyes. She thought that she would have to cry for a while before Gu Zheng would agree. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng forgave her directly.","The corners of her mouth curled up slightly. It seemed that President Gu’s feelings for Qiao Xi were nothing special. No matter what, he was only doting on her for a short while. Otherwise, how could he forgive her so easily?!","Xu Anran smiled shyly. “President Gu, have you really forgiven me? Xi Xi, since President Gu has already forgiven me, don’t be angry with me, alright?”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched as she silently pinched Gu Zheng’s arm.","Xu Anran had a proud expression. If it were not for Gu Zheng, she would definitely mock Qiao Xi.","At this moment, Gu Zheng suddenly said, “Although you forced your sister to forgive a murderer, my wife has always been gentle and kind. Of course, she’d choose to forgive you.”"]},{"number":647,"title":"Chapter 647 - Being Brainless Is Also A Kind Of Illness","paragraphs":["“However, I’m a person with a bad temper and can’t tolerate anything. Since you want to apologize, you can’t just say it. Why don’t you write two apology letters or prepare some gifts to express your sincerity? I’ll naturally forgive you once you do that.”","Qiao Xi, who was standing at the side, was slightly puzzled. She kept feeling that Gu Zheng was acting very strange today and did not seem like his usual self.","The smile on Xu Anran’s face froze as she looked at Gu Zheng in confusion.","Gu Zheng sneered. “You did something wrong, after all. Don’t you need to apologize? If you’re going to apologize, you have to show some sincerity. My wife is the mistress of the Gu family, so your apology has to be more formal. Otherwise, you’ll be looking down on the Gu family.”","Looking down on the Gu family? How could Xu Anran bear this crime? She bit her lip. She suddenly felt that President Gu seemed to have changed. He had become evil, and his expression was very sinister.","Seeing that Xu Anran was silent, Gu Zheng completely lost his patience. “What? Xu Anran, are you unwilling?”","Without waiting for Xu Anran to answer, Gu Zheng said mercilessly, “Please don’t show that shy expression when you see me next time. Are you afraid that others won’t know that you’re trying to seduce me? You’re so ugly, but you have such stupidly beautiful dreams!”","Qiao Xi: “...” Damn!","Although she knew that this man had a vicious tongue, she had never seen Gu Zheng so aggressive. How could a car accident change someone’s character so much?","Xu Anran also looked up in shock. She suppressed the grievances in her heart and said with a trembling voice, “President Gu, I... I was wrong. I should apologize to my sister, but I just wanted what was best for her. If that person spreads nonsense after being fired, it’ll affect my sister’s and your reputation, after all.”","“IMiss Xu, are you sick?” Gu Zheng suddenly asked.","Xu Anran looked puzzled, but she could sense a trace of mockery in Gu Zheng’s eyes.","The next second, Gu Zheng smiled and said, “Being brainless is also a kind of illness. Since you’re sick, quickly go to the hospital to get yourself checked. Don’t run around with this illness of yours. Although it’s not your fault that you’re brainless, it’s your fault for stepping out to disgust others.”","Gu Zheng glanced at her and said again, “If you don’t need your brain, you can donate it to someone who needs it. You’ll be doing a good deed.”","Qiao Xi watched this scene in shock.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and left. When he reached the door, he even reminded Xu Anran, “Right, remember to write those apology letters!”","Xu Anran: “...”","Hearing the sound of their footsteps gradually disappear, Xu Anran’s face instantly turned ferocious. She clenched her fists tightly, her fingernails digging into her palms.","Qiao! Xi! What was so good about her? Why were so many people helping her? Even a genius like President Gu had changed for her.","...","In the office.","Gu Zheng was busy working while sitting down on the chair. Meanwhile, Qiao Xi was lying on the sofa with her eyes closed. Suddenly, her phone rang. Xue Liang had sent a message: [The winner of Planet Music Festival is a newcomer in her 20s. I heard that the judges are very impressed with her.]","Qiao Xi was slightly surprised. Planet Music Festival was the most prestigious music competition in the country. The champion was usually a famous musician. This time, it was actually a newcomer. How extraordinary!","Qiao Xi asked: [What’s her first name?]","Xue Liang: [I’m not sure. The news is temporarily blocked. I only heard it from a friend, but this matter must be true.]","Since she was so mysterious, Qiao Xi was even more curious about who that newbie was. Even Xue Liang could not get any news about her. It seemed that she had some background.","[Little Six, didn’t you also like music before? You used to go by the name ‘Fu Sheng’.]","Qiao Xi replied with an emoji. Xue Liang continued to ask: [Then why didn’t you participate in the competition? If you had, you might’ve been able to get an award.]","Xue Liang had heard Qiao Xi’s songs before. Although they were not complete, they were really nice. He had always wanted Little Six to pursue music, but she did not seem to be too interested in it.","Qiao Xi had been very talented in art since she was young. She was talented in fashion design, jewelry design, musical instruments, and paintings. However, most of them were just her interests and hobbies. She did not want to compete with others for the precious title of champion.","Suddenly, a notification popped up—","[Xu Anran’s comeback. Her new song is amazing, and the chorus has caused an uproar.]","The comments section was filled with criticisms. They wondered how the banned artist could make a comeback so quickly. However, there were also people who praised her: [Although I don’t like her, this song is really nice.]"]},{"number":648,"title":"Chapter 648 - The Strange Gu Zheng","paragraphs":["[This song is really good! I’m looking forward to the entire song!]","[I’ve never heard a song like this before. It’s unique and pleasant to listen to. It looks like Xu Anran wrote it herself!]","[Wow! Xu Anran can even compose! She’s indeed a rich missy. She’s talented and beautiful. I’m so envious!]","Qiao Xi glanced at the comments section. She was also curious about how good Xu Anran’s song could be, so she clicked on the audio. There was only a small portion of the song. Xu Anran’s voice was very ordinary, but this song...","Why did this song sound a little familiar?","Qiao Xi suddenly reacted and immediately found the website. She logged into her account, but the user did not exist.","Her account was gone?","Qiao Xi’s eyes sank as she immediately opened her laptop, logged into Black Tide’s account, and hacked into the website to check the records.","She had previously learned how to compose for a period of time, so she registered an account on the website under the name ‘Fu Sheng’ and released more than ten self-created songs. However, none of them were complete. After that, she became busy designing clothes to participate in the competition, so she gave up on composing.","Later on, she also composed some songs in her free time, but she never uploaded them. She kept them stored on her computer. She did not expect her account to be mysteriously erased.","Qiao Xi leaned against the sofa with a thought-provoking expression. This small website had been operating for seven to eight years. They had very good reviews. It would not have erased a user’s account for no reason. Perhaps this had nothing to do with the website and was the work of a hacker?","The account that had not uploaded any works for many years had already been forgotten by everyone. If it were not for this music festival, Qiao Xi would have almost forgotten that she still had a music account. Hence, it was not difficult to make this account disappear from right under her nose.","Speaking of which, she and Xu Anran were really fated. Xu Anran finally got a chance to make a comeback and even plagiarized her song.","Qiao Xi suddenly had an idea. Could Xu Anran be the champion of Planet Music Festival?","She smirked and turned off her computer.","Gu Zheng had been silently observing her for a long time. He cleared his throat and asked, “What’s wrong?”","The man’s voice was a little distant, making Qiao Xi feel unfamiliar for a moment. She replied truthfully, “It’s not a big deal. I previously uploaded some songs on a small website, and one of them sounds just like Xu Anran’s new song.”","Gu Zheng frowned. “That woman plagiarized your song?”","Qiao Xi nodded with a calm expression.","Gu Zheng’s expression darkened. “I’ll help you deal with her.”","He was a top hacker, so he could handle such matters easily.","The next second, Qiao Xi had a surprised expression. “Do I need your help for such a small matter?” Her senior was acting so strangely! She was Black Tide! Black Tide was ranked in the top ten of the hacker rankings! She could handle such a small problem in minutes. However, the time was not right yet, so she did not want to expose Xu Anran so soon.","Gu Zheng was a little puzzled. Although he had his original memories after he woke up, it was inevitable that some memories were missing. Moreover, when a large number of memories surged into his mind, it would be very chaotic. Hence, in his memory, Mrs. Gu was weak and kind. She would not even resist when she was bullied. She often said that she was very weak and could not lift heavy things.","He really thought that Mrs. Gu was weak.","Mrs. Gu was abandoned when she was young. She was weak and did not have anyone to support her. However, when she encountered such troublesome matters, she insisted on not needing his help?","At this moment, Gu Zheng could not hear her thoughts. When he saw Qiao Xi’s surprised expression, he felt annoyed.","This was the first time in his life that he had taken the initiative to help a woman, but she did not accept it. Could it be that the other Gu Zheng had never helped her before? Was that why she was so surprised?","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and pondered. Perhaps that man did not treat Qiao Xi sincerely. Otherwise, why did he never help her even when he saw Qiao Xi being bullied?","It was unknown what went wrong with him, but he said coldly, “I’ll help you!”","Qiao Xi: “???” Gu Zheng was so strange!","She opened her mouth. “No, it’s alright...”","“There’s no need to thank me.” Gu Zheng put on a high and mighty look. “I might have neglected you previously, but no matter what, you’re still Mrs. Gu. I’ll handle this matter.”","The demon Gu Zheng had never been sentimental, but at this moment, he suddenly pitied this woman. Since Gu Zheng had married this woman, he should treat her well. Why did he not help when he saw her being bullied? She was just a weak woman. How could she win against those vicious people?"]},{"number":649,"title":"Chapter 649 - The Champion Of Planet Music Festival","paragraphs":["The man’s eyes darkened. “I didn’t treat you well in the past, but don’t hate me for that. As long as you’re obedient, I won’t let anyone bully you in the future.”","Qiao Xi: “...” Was Gu Zheng acting up?","She looked shocked. “Ah Zheng, did you not rest well?”","Gu Zheng’s heart ached for her even more. He was just treating her a little nicer, but she was already so flattered. What did Gu Zheng do to her previously to make her live so carefully?!","On the account that they shared a body, he should treat Mrs. Gu better when he was around. After all, this woman was weak and timid.","Qiao Xi: “?” What kind of expression was that? She really wanted to open his brain and see what he was thinking.","...","In the Xu family’s villa.","Xia Yunlou entered happily with a smile on her face. “Good news! The competition’s organizer has already responded. Anran will be the champion. I knew it! Anran is the most outstanding candidate. Only she’s worthy to be the Xu family’s daughter!”","When the person in charge of Planet Music Festival called the Xu family, Xu Zhi was still worried about how to get Qiao Xi to forgive them. In the end, he heard the person in charge say that Anran won the music competition.","Planet Music Festival was the most prestigious competition in the country. Those who won first place in this competition were all top figures in the music industry. Unexpectedly, Anran actually won the championship.","If the news of Anran winning the award spread, all the bad news about her would be covered up. No one would remember how terrible she was in the past. They would only remember that she was an outstanding musician.","At that time, who would care if she was the real daughter of the Xu family or not? They would praise the Xu family for having raised such a talented daughter. It was a great thing for the Xu family.","Xu Anyi beamed. “Dad! Anran really didn’t disappoint us! Qiao Xi can’t be compared to her at all! Anran is the champion of Planet Music Festival. She’s equivalent to a top musician in the country!”","Hearing these words, Xu Zhi fell into deep thought. This was the first time someone from the Xu family had received such a high award. Anran would definitely explode in popularity this time. If that was the case, the Xu family could also borrow the spotlight.","He hesitated for a moment and said, “It’s time for Anran to move back. She’s the eldest daughter of our Xu family, after all. It won’t be nice to have others learn that she’s living outside, but Xi Xi is also a child of our Xu family. She’ll be back sooner or later. There won’t be a conflict between these two matters.”","When Xia Yunlou saw Xu Zhi relenting, she immediately took a car to Gu Corporation to look for Xu Anran.","“Anran, congratulations. I didn’t expect you to know how to compose! In the end, you won the championship for Planet Music Festival. You’ve really surprised me!”","Xu Anran smiled in embarrassment. “Mom, I’ve always liked composing, but I’m usually very busy with filming. I only casually composed a few songs. I didn’t expect to win the award so easily! Let’s not talk about this anymore. Let’s quickly look for my sister.”","At the mention of Qiao Xi, Xia Yunlou felt annoyed. She gritted his teeth and said, “If it weren’t for the inheritance Xia Yunqiu left behind, I wouldn’t...”","She paused for a moment and said with a gloomy expression, “When she returns to the Gu family, I’ll make her cough up Xia Yunqiu’s inheritance! Anran, after we get the inheritance, I won’t let you be bullied anymore!”","Xu Anran smiled and nodded.","When they were upstairs, Xia Yunlou was still thinking about what to do to make Qiao Xi obediently hand over her inheritance. Moreover, she could not anger Qiao Xi. Otherwise, if Qiao Xi went to complain to Gu Zheng or the Shen family, the Xu family would naturally be unable to bear the consequences.","“Anran, you were a little rash today,” Xia Yunlou said in a low voice. “How could you ask President Gu to forgive you in front of so many people? President Gu is someone who cares about his reputation. If he doesn’t help Qiao Xi, what will others say about him?”","Xu Anran immediately reacted. Xia Yunlou said meaningfully, “I got someone to ask around. Qiao Xi has already returned home. If you go up and look for President Gu again, you can talk in private. He’ll definitely forgive you.”","Although Xia Yunlou did not say it explicitly, Xu Anran understood what she meant. When Qiao Xi was around, she could not brazenly seduce Gu Zheng. Now that Qiao Xi was not around, she could do whatever she wanted. The atmosphere when a man and a woman were alone would naturally change.","...","At the same time, in Gu Corporation.","Actually, Qiao Xi had not left. She just went to a separate cubicle in Gu Zheng’s office and was using her laptop to draw some designs."]},{"number":650,"title":"Chapter 650 - Apologize With Sincerity","paragraphs":["Just then, Song Shijing knocked on the door and entered. “President Gu, Madam Xu and Xu Anran are here.”","Gu Zheng frowned when he heard that. This mother and daughter were really persistent. What were they trying to do?","Just as he was about to refuse, Xia Yunlou’s voice came from outside. “It’s been hard on you. You even escorted me up. Although I’m the mother of the president’s wife, I’m very easy to get along with. You don’t have to be so polite.”","As she spoke, Xia Yunlou had already pushed the door open and walked in. “President Gu, is Xi Xi here?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold. Song Shijing knew very well that Gu Corporation’s guests had to register at the front desk and the receptionist had to call the president’s office to confirm that the president wanted to see the guests before they were allowed up. However, these people were considered the president’s relatives, hence they had special identities.","When the receptionist heard that Xia Yunlou was Young Madam’s mother, she immediately invited her upstairs respectfully. This matter had violated Gu Zheng’s taboo.","Song Shijing looked at Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran. He asked tentatively, “President, they...”","Gu Zheng did not look up. His expression could not be seen clearly as he said indifferently, “Just leave them be.”","He knew very well what this mother and daughter were thinking. They wanted to take advantage of Qiao Xi’s absence to get Xu Anran to seduce him?","How did Xu Anran dare to do this?! Could it be that she had done this before and seduced the other Gu Zheng? Did that brat foolishly give in?","Gu Zheng burned with anger. How could that man have the cheek to say that he loved Qiao Xi after doing such a thing? How sad would that weak woman be if she knew that her husband had betrayed her?!","No! No! He could not allow this to happen!","Xia Yunlou swept a glance around the office. When she saw that Qiao Xi was really not around, she immediately beamed. “President Gu, don’t blame Anran. This child is impulsive and sometimes does the wrong things. However, she’s kind-hearted. She came to the company to apologize to Xi Xi. These two children are my daughters. They’re both my daughters, so I can’t bear to see them fall out!”","“Are you done? Read them to me,” Gu Zheng said coldly.","Xia Yunlou was stunned. “Read... What?”","“The apology letters! Don’t you know?” Gu Zheng took a sip of tea and slowly looked up. “An apology has to be sincere. You have to write at least 10,000 words. However, one letter is definitely not enough. You have to write at least three letters. Hurry up and read them to me after you’re done.”","The air was silent. Qiao Xi, who was in the cubicle, could not help but smile when she heard their conversation. Gu Zheng was dealing with these two women!","The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth twitched slightly. She quickly took out the gift from the bag and said softly, “President Gu, I’ve prepared a gift for my sister. Since she’s not around, please help her accept it. I think she’ll definitely like it.”","Xia Yunlou also chimed in, “Anran did do something wrong and made Xi Xi unhappy, but they’re sisters, after all. If this goes on, it’ll hurt the relationship between them as sisters. Anran, quickly apologize. I have something to attend to, so I’ll be leaving first.”","Gu Zheng smirked.","After Xia Yunlou left, Xu Anran’s face was instantly filled with a shy look. “President Gu, can I wait for Xi Xi here? I want to apologize to her in person so that she can see my sincerity.”","Song Shijing thought, ‘Don’t think I can’t tell what you’re thinking!’","Gu Zheng nodded. “Yes.”","Xu Anran looked happy. “President Gu, I’ve always wanted to talk to you. When I found out that Xi Xi was back, I was indeed very flustered. I was afraid that I would be chased out of the Xu family, so... I did something wrong.","“But now, I’ve thought it through. Since I’m not related to the Xu family by blood, I shouldn’t stay in the Xu family anymore. Before I leave, I want my sister’s forgiveness. President Gu, will you forgive me too?”","Gu Zheng remained silent. He felt like vomiting even before having dinner.","Seeing that the man did not respond for a long time, Xu Anran smiled charmingly and slowly walked to his side.","She had specially chosen a tight dress with a slit on the side. As long as she moved slightly, her fair and slender thighs would be exposed.","Xu Anran admitted that Qiao Xi’s face was good-looking, but her figure was definitely inferior to hers. She was very confident in her figure. She was voluptuous, so she would definitely arouse a man’s desires more than Qiao Xi’s thin and weak appearance.","At this moment, she was already the champion of Planet Music Festival. Even if she was not as beautiful as Qiao Xi, she was more capable than Qiao Xi. President Gu would definitely realize her good traits."]},{"number":651,"title":"Chapter 651 - Brazen Seduction","paragraphs":["Xu Anran smiled shyly and deliberately revealed her thigh. She said coquettishly, “President Gu, I know my mistake. I’m willing to do anything you ask me to.”","Gu Zheng frowned and said in a hoarse voice, “Your leg is touching mine.”","Xu Anran lowered her eyes to look. Indeed, her leg was already pressed against Gu Zheng’s. He dodged her as though he had been electrocuted. She pretended to be surprised. “Ah! I... I didn’t mean to. President Gu, don’t tell my sister, alright? I’m afraid she’ll be unhappy.”","With her many years of experience, even if Gu Zheng did not really like her, he would probably not be able to endure such brazen seduction. If Qiao Xi found out about this and came over to question Gu Zheng, Gu Zheng would definitely loathe her.","Gu Zheng said in a low voice, “She won’t.”","Xu Anran’s expression froze. Was Gu Zheng so sure that Qiao Xi would not be unhappy? She pretended to be worried and said, “If Sister finds out about this, will she think that I’m seducing you? I... I’m really not...”","“She won’t blame me.” Gu Zheng was very sure.","Qiao Xi, who was in the cubicle, could not help but be puzzled when she heard these words. Why was Gu Zheng so sure?","The next second, Gu Zheng leaned lazily against the chair and said slowly, “Your legs are so thick, yet you have the cheek to press your leg against mine? Who gave you the confidence to seduce me? I’m afraid you don’t know how good my wife’s figure is. I’ve seen her stunning beauty, so how could I possibly like you? My wife trusts my taste. She knows that I absolutely won’t like you!”","The office was silent. The air seemed to have frozen.","The smile on Xu Anran’s face gradually vanished, and her eyes went from shock to anger. She never expected Gu Zheng to belittle her like this!","In the past, even if Gu Zheng’s temper was bad, he would not be so overbearing. But now, he had a vicious tongue and a devilish charm. He seemed to have changed.","Gu Zheng sneered. “Miss Xu, aren’t you leaving?”","Xu Anran suppressed the anger in her heart and said aggrievedly, “President Gu, I-I really didn’t mean to do that. I came here today to beg for your forgiveness. As long as you forgive me, I’m willing to do anything.”","Qiao Xi, who was in the cubicle, had already closed her laptop and moved the chair to the door. Hearing the voices outside, she was very curious about what other shameless things Xu Anran could do.","Xu Anran thought that her hint was already obvious enough and Gu Zheng must have understood her intentions. As long as this man was slightly interested in her, she was confident that she could snatch him away from Qiao Xi.","Gu Zheng’s expression remained the same, then he looked up slightly as his eyes darkened. “Really... You’ll do anything?”","Xu Anran nodded with a red face. “Yes, I’ll do anything.”","Gu Zheng smiled. “Alright, I forgive you.”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Gu Zheng, you bastard!’","Xu Anran did not expect that Gu Zheng would belittle her just a moment ago only to agree to her the next moment. She immediately beamed with joy, her eyes filled with surprise and delight. “President Gu, are you really willing to forgive me?”","She did not dare to believe that her plan was going so smoothly. It seemed that Gu Zheng’s good impression of Qiao Xi was only on the surface. His feelings for her were just a temporary thing. How could a successful man like Gu Zheng only have one woman by his side?","Xu Anran quietly pressed the recording pen in her bag, then asked softly, “President Gu, have you really forgiven me? But what about my sister?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes, and his expression could not be seen clearly. However, Xu Anran clearly saw him frown. Then, he said impatiently, “I forgive you.”","The corners of Xu Anran’s mouth slowly curled up. Gu Zheng had already spoken. Even if Qiao Xi was unwilling, she would not dare to make a scene. If she angered Gu Zheng, Gu Zheng might divorce her in a fit of anger.","Xu Anran raised her head confidently. She was a top socialite, while Qiao Xi was just a country bumpkin. Even if Qiao Xi had gotten her wish and become Mrs. Gu, it would be very difficult for her to keep her identity.","Xu Anran’s face was full of smiles. She was about to ask if they were going to the hotel or back to Longwan Residential when Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Let’s start.”","Xu Anran was stunned for a few seconds. She looked at the man in front of her in surprise. He actually asked to do it here. Was he so anxious?","This was the first time she had done such a thing in the office. If anyone found out, it would be very awkward.","Xu Anran smiled shyly. “President Gu, it’s not good to do it here, right? I don’t mind, but if others see us, it’ll inevitably ruin your image and reputation. However, if you’re keen, I... I’m willing.”"]},{"number":652,"title":"Chapter 652 - He Actually Said I’m Weak!","paragraphs":["“Are you going to do it or not?! Why are you wasting your breath?!” Gu Zheng roared impatiently. Clearly, he no longer had the patience.","Xu Anran was shocked. She raised her trembling hand and took off her jacket. She sat on the sofa and stroked her hair shyly. She also unbuttoned one of the buttons on her chest.","Just then, Gu Zheng suddenly made a call. “Song Shiyu, send the cleaning tools over. In order to apologize, Miss Xu insisted on cleaning the office. Didn’t I make myself clear? She wants to clean the place!”","Xu Anran’s hand, which was about to take off her clothes, froze as she looked at him in disbelief.","Wait! When did she say she wanted to clean?","Gu Zheng slowly looked up, his eyes filled with mockery. The corners of his mouth curled up in disdain. “Miss Xu, you’re indeed very sincere. You’re willing to do anything for the sake of apologizing. Coincidentally, the top floor needs to be cleaned. Please clean all the offices on this floor. You have to ensure that you do a good job. I’ll have my assistant check your work later.”","Xu Anran sat on the sofa seductively. She was stunned for a few seconds before realizing what Gu Zheng meant. He was asking her to clean the offices?","She looked down at her half-naked body. A strong sense of shame welled up in her.","Was there something wrong with Gu Zheng’s brain?! She, a beauty, had already delivered herself to his door, yet he was not interested? He even asked her to clean the offices. Did he think she was a cleaner?","At this moment, Qiao Xi, who was in the cubicle: “...” Hahaha!","She carefully pushed open the door, revealing a gap. She saw Xu Anran’s face alternating between red and white before she ran out with red eyes.","She was about to get up when Gu Zheng pushed the door open and walked in. His eyes were filled with anger. “I finally know now. She’s really too shameless. She actually seduced your man. You’ve suffered greatly!”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. “What?”","“She’s been targeting you time and again, yet you still accepted her apology? Qiao Xi, you’re the mistress of the Gu family and my woman. Why are you so weak? How can you let Xu Anran bully you?!”","Qiao Xi widened her eyes in shock.","Gu Zheng frowned and left after saying that, leaving Song Shiyu and her staring at each other in shock.","Qiao Xi was silent for a short while before she asked with slight hesitation, “Don’t you think that Gu Zheng has been acting very strange recently? He wouldn’t have been knocked silly during the accident, right?”","Song Shiyu said, “No way...”","Qiao Xi patted her chest and said in disbelief, “You heard what he said, right? He actually said that I’m weak! If he wasn’t knocked silly, then he must have lost his memory!”","Song Shiyu did not answer. Perhaps to the president, Mrs. Gu was really weak.","...","The Xu family.","When Xu Zhi heard that Xu Anran had not only not been forgiven but also offended Gu Zheng, he was instantly furious.","“Xu Anran! Let me tell you, if you don’t invite Qiao Xi back, there’s no need for you to come back even though you’ve won the championship for Planet Music Festival. Get lost immediately!”","As soon as he finished speaking, an old female voice sounded from the outside.","“Who dares to ask Anran to get lost?”","Old Madam Xu’s expression was serious as she cursed, “You’re actually chasing Anran away for that wild girl, Qiao Xi? Xu Zhi, are you crazy?”","Xu Zhi looked troubled. “Mom, no matter what, Xi Xi is my daughter.”","“So what?” Old Madam Xu’s gaze was sharp. “Her getting replaced back then is her fate. She was just unlucky and can’t blame anyone for it! Ever since she came back, she has caused chaos in this family. She’s a jinx! Now, you even want to chase away the daughter who has accompanied you for 20 years for Qiao Xi!”","Old Madam Xu’s gaze landed on Xia Yunlou, and her eyes were filled with ridicule. “You’re also a piece of trash. Is this how you’re managing this family? If you can’t even deal with Qiao Xi, what right do you have to be the madam of the Xu family? Doesn’t Qiao Xi care a lot about Xia Yunqiu? Just start with her.”","Xia Yunlou was enlightened. “Mom, you’re right. Xi Xi was raised by my sister. She treats my sister as her biological mother and has no feelings for me at all. Moreover, she’s just a child. It’s not safe for her to keep the huge inheritance my sister left behind.”","Old Madam Xu’s expression was cold. “No matter who she cares about, you’re still her biological mother! If she doesn’t acknowledge you, then spread this news online and use public opinion to force her. She’s just a child and definitely won’t be able to handle the rumors. When the time comes, she’ll obediently bring her inheritance back to the Xu family.”","Xia Yunlou smiled and nodded. Old Madam Xu was indeed capable."]},{"number":653,"title":"Chapter 653 - Listen To My Excuses","paragraphs":["Old Madam Xu glanced at Xu Zhi and ordered, “Let me tell you, Anran is the eldest daughter of the Xu family. Even if Qiao Xi returns, she can’t take Anran’s position! Anran, let’s go!”","Xu Zhi did not say anything.","On the other hand, Old Madam Xu was about to bring Xu Anran upstairs. Unexpectedly, Xu Anran’s eyes were instantly filled with tears. “Grandma, the room upstairs belongs to my younger sister. My room is... in the basement.”","Bang!","When she heard this, Old Madam Xu slammed the table and roared, “Not only did she snatch your identity, but she even stole your room! The child that Xia Yunqiu raised is really a b*tch!”","Xu Zhi frowned and said, “Mom! How can you say that? She’s my daughter, after all!”","Old Madam Xu’s face was ferocious, and her eyes were filled with resentment. “Back then, Xia Yunqiu also caused chaos in the Xu family. If she had been obedient and sensible, I would have agreed to let her marry into the Xu family for your sake, but she just didn’t know what was good for her! Now, the daughter she raised is the same. As soon as she returned, she caused chaos in the Xu family!”","Xu Zhi’s face was livid. He suddenly realized that perhaps he had been wrong all these years.","The Xu family was in a mess now because he had chosen the wrong person. If he had chosen Yunqiu back then, he would definitely have a beautiful family and a cute daughter.","Old Madam Xu turned around and said impatiently, “Yunlou, you’re Qiao Xi’s mother, after all. If she refuses to come back, then she’s unfilial! Prepare a banquet in two days and get Qiao Xi to come back.”","Xia Yunlou nodded in embarrassment. Xu Zhi’s heart was in turmoil. He did not understand why his wife and mother were all targeting Xi Xi. She was the true daughter of the Xu family and their biological daughter!","Could it be because she was the child Xia Yunqiu raised?","...","On the other hand, Qiao Xi picked up the phone and replied indifferently, “I understand.”","At this moment, she was holding a will in her hand. It was left behind by her mother. Even now, she didn’t understand why her mother wrote these things in her will.","At that time, she had probably only been married to Qiao Zhenguo for a few years. She did not know that Qiao Zhenguo was having an affair. Even if she knew, with her ability, she could completely take over Qiao Corporation and would not be afraid of a mistress. How could she have known that she would be killed by a mistress?","Although Xu Mei had already admitted that she caused her mother’s death, Qiao Xi always thought that there was definitely a secret behind this.","Xu Mei wanted to kill her mother, and she had indeed done so. However, there was more than one person who wanted to kill her mother. It was because of this that her mother prepared such a long will. She was afraid that if anything happened to her, her inheritance would fall into the hands of others.","Moreover, why did Mom leave her hometown back then and go to Li City? She even married Qiao Zhenguo. Who was she hiding from? Was it Xia Yunlou?","A trace of danger flashed through Qiao Xi’s eyes. She really did not expect that a woman like Xia Yunlou would be her biological mother. The two of them did not have any similarities.","She looked at the time and suddenly realized that it was already so late. Why was Gu Zheng not home yet? She called Gu Zheng but the call was rejected.","Qiao Xi was confused and called Song Shijing. It was noisy on the other end when the call connected. Song Shijing asked hurriedly, “Young Madam, are you looking for the president?”","“Yes, he’s not answering my calls. Did something happen?” Qiao Xi asked.","Song Shijing paused and said uneasily, “The president... is busy and can’t answer the phone right now.”","Can’t answer?","Qiao Xi did not understand what he meant, and Song Shijing tried to avoid talking about it.","Song Shijing broke out in a cold sweat. He did not understand why the president, who never liked women, would suddenly come to such a place.","Qiao Xi thought that the company’s matters were not settled yet. Just as she was about to hang up, she heard a delicate voice coming from the other end of the phone. “President Gu, let’s have a drink!”","Then, Qiao Xi clearly heard Gu Zheng’s low voice. “This wine isn’t good.”","Boom!!!","Qiao Xi’s eyes widened abruptly, and her fingers that were holding the phone turned pale.","Song Shijing wanted to cry. The president was doomed!","Qiao Xi suppressed her anger. “Song Shijing! Is this what you meant by saying that he’s busy?”","Song Shijing explained in a trembling voice, “Young Madam, listen to my excuses... No! Listen to me. The president came here to...”","Qiao Xi could not be bothered to listen to his explanation and hung up angrily.","Song Shijing was trembling in fear. How was he going to explain this to Young Madam? Actually, he did not understand what was wrong with the president. Had he really been knocked silly by the truck?"]},{"number":654,"title":"Chapter 654 - Gu Zheng Is A Jerk","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on Song Shijing, and he smiled devilishly. “Was it her?”","Dumb woman! She only called when her husband hadn’t come home late at night. Could it be that Gu Zheng was always having fun in the bar, so she did not dare to reach out and ask?","As she would be sad if she asked, she might as well pretend not to know. Was she forced to endure all of this and cry secretly under the covers at night?","At this moment, he was very sure that the other Gu Zheng was a jerk. Although he said he loved her, he was just pretending to love her. Actually, Gu Zheng did not like Qiao Xi at all.","Although this Gu Zheng had no feelings and could not fall in love with a woman, he still had morals. At this moment, his heart ached for that stupid woman.","Song Shijing nodded. “Yes, it was Young Madam.”","The people in the room smiled tacitly. Everyone who came here to play was already married. Their wives at home also knew about it, but they could only helplessly accept it.","Gu Zheng waved his hand, and Song Shijing handed him his phone. He looked at the call history. What did she say in such a short time?","That stupid woman clearly knew that he was here to drink, but she still accepted it helplessly. She was still too weak. How could she sit firmly in the position of Mrs. Gu with such a character?","Seeing Gu Zheng’s calm expression, Song Shijing was already mourning for him. Young Madam was about to kill someone just now. She would not stop until he explained himself tonight.","In Longwan Residential, Qiao Xi sat on the sofa and sulked. After calming down for a while, she suddenly realized that something was wrong. Gu Zheng had always kept a clean reputation. He even felt disgusted when an A-list celebrity like Xu Anran approached him. How could he accept another woman?","In the past, although he had a cold and vicious tongue, that was only with outsiders. He was always gentle when facing her, but now, she felt a trace of unfamiliarity in his eyes.","Qiao Xi frowned. When she was learning medicine from her grandfather, she had once come into contact with a type of drug. After taking that drug, another persona would be born within that person. That persona might be similar to the actual person or it might be the opposite. Perhaps Gu Zheng had been drugged.","It was also possible that Gu Zheng had been agitated in the dark Maple Garden back then and developed another personality. It was possible that the other personality occupied his body after the car accident.","Was the Gu Zheng now not the real Gu Zheng?","No! He was Gu Zheng! It was just that he had lost some of his memories and feelings, causing his character to be different from Gu Zheng’s. The original Gu Zheng was silent, but this person was arrogant and unbridled.","Qiao Xi went upstairs to change without saying a word. The butler hurriedly asked, “Young Madam, it’s already so late. Where are you going? Do you need a chauffeur to send you there?”","Qiao Xi said casually, “Help me prepare the car. Gu Zheng isn’t back yet even though it’s so late. I’m going out to look for him. With his identity, he probably won’t go to a small bar. He’s probably at the most luxurious Summer Palace Club in Li City.”","The butler was shocked. The president actually went to the Summer Palace Club?","Qiao Xi’s expression remained unchanged. She suddenly turned around when she reached the door and smiled lightly. “Don’t worry, I’ll bring Gu Zheng back.”","...","At Summer Palace Club.","Song Shiyu looked at the luxury car that was slowly driving over and wanted to cry. “Brother, it’s bad! It’s bad! That car is from Longwan Residential! Young Madam is already here. Why don’t... we run?”","The car stopped at the entrance. Qiao Xi stretched out her long, fair legs and walked into the clubhouse with a strong aura.","Song Shiyu shuddered. “Brother, if we apologize to Young Madam now, will she spare our lives?”","After Qiao Xi entered, she walked straight toward the Song brothers, then walked past them and pushed open the door of the private room. At this moment, Gu Zheng was sitting lazily on the sofa. A few fiery-eyed women in the private room were staring at him warmly, but no one dared to approach him.","When they saw Qiao Xi barge in, those women were instantly displeased and hurriedly stopped her. “Wait! Who let you in?!”","“Everything has to be done first come, first served! It’s not even our turn yet. Why are you trying to get close to President Gu as soon as you enter? Don’t you know the rules?!”","Song Shiyu: “...” ‘You’re seeking death! You’ll see!’","At this moment, someone recognized Qiao Xi and said sarcastically, “Oh! So, it’s Mrs. Gu! President Gu has been having a good time tonight. I advise you not to ruin the mood!”","Gu Zheng looked up and glared at the woman unhappily. Nonsense! He was not here to have fun. He was just here to prove something."]},{"number":655,"title":"Chapter 655 - Learning How To Serve Mrs. Gu","paragraphs":["“I heard that Mrs. Gu isn’t a top socialite either. Who knows what methods she used to get to where she is today?!”","“It’s been so long since she entered, but President Gu hasn’t even spared her a glance. It looks like he’s already tired of her. We have to seize the opportunity. Maybe we’ll have a chance to climb up the social ladder!”","Gu Zheng sneered. “I’ve been here for so long, but have I paid you women any attention? Don’t flatter yourself!”","When everyone heard this, no one dared to say anything and just looked at Qiao Xi with ridicule.","Gu Zheng stood up and slowly walked to Qiao Xi’s side, then asked in a low voice, “You came to look for me?”","Look! President Gu definitely did not like this young madam. The situation had already progressed to this, yet he did not even explain himself. He just impatiently asked her a question.","Qiao Xi glared fiercely at him and said angrily, “What do you think?! I want to ask why you’re here.”","Gu Zheng did not expect Qiao Xi to be so angry, and his face was filled with surprise. This was the first time he had seen Qiao Xi flare up after occupying this body. Why was she inexplicably a little cute?","Qiao Xi looked at him angrily. “Answer me! Why? Don’t we have alcohol at home? Since you think the alcohol here is bad, why are you drinking here?”","Gu Zheng thought that Mrs. Gu, who knew that he had come to the clubhouse, would be sad at home and hide to cry alone. Unexpectedly, she actually chased after him.","Things didn’t go as he expected. His mind was a mess. Suddenly, he regained his senses. “Because the people here are different from those in the family.”","Qiao Xi glared angrily at him and was speechless.","The Song brothers were speechless. Had the president gone mad? How could he speak to Young Madam like that?","Qiao Xi flared up. “The people are different? You mean to say that I’m the one in the family while there are many other women here? In that case, I’ll meet different men here, then!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and instructed, “Immediately get all the men in the clubhouse. I want all the good-looking ones! It doesn’t matter how much they cost!”","Song Shijing gasped. ‘Stop fooling around, you two. One is a man while the other is a woman. But you two are fooling around in the same private room. You’ll definitely be on the news tomorrow!’","Gu Zheng looked at Qiao Xi in surprise. This Mrs. Gu did not seem to be as weak as he had imagined, but she was very weak in his memories!","How could a weak woman come here to catch him in the act? How could she dare to question her husband?","Gu Zheng frowned and remained silent. Everyone thought that he was about to flare up. Unexpectedly, he was thinking in his heart that he could not let Qiao Xi suffer. He had to let everyone think that he truly doted on Qiao Xi. Only then would outsiders not dare to bully Qiao Xi. Otherwise, after he vanished, Qiao Xi would still be bullied.","Gu Zheng’s expression was cold as he looked at the trembling manager. The other party was so scared that he broke out in a cold sweat. The next second, Gu Zheng asked with a serious expression, “This club belongs to Gu Corporation?”","The manager trembled. “Yes, President.”","Gu Zheng cleared his throat and said coldly, “Fire all those who were rude to my wife just now!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the room fell silent for a few seconds before it exploded. Everyone hurriedly begged for mercy. They thought that President Gu did not dote on Mrs. Gu and only pretended to be loving on certain occasions. Unexpectedly, he really cared about Mrs. Gu.","Gu Zheng’s voice was cold. “You knew very well that she was my wife, yet you were still rude! It’s already kind of me to just fire you. If this happens again, I’ll make sure you can’t stay in Li City anymore!”","Everyone was so scared that their faces turned pale. If President Gu fired them, no other place would take them in. It was equivalent to not being able to stay in Li City anymore.","Song Shiyu dragged everyone out with the bodyguards. The room was much more spacious now, and a group of good-looking men rushed in the next second.","Gu Zheng looked up and glanced at the crowd, scaring them so much that their bodies trembled. They hurriedly lowered their heads. They did not understand why Mrs. Gu would dare to let other men accompany her when President Gu was still here. She was blatantly making President Gu a cuckold and humiliating him in public!","“How do you usually serve others?” Gu Zheng asked.","Everyone broke out in a cold sweat and stammered. They were afraid that Gu Zheng would take their lives in a fit of anger.","“Say it! I’m asking you a question! I’m trying to learn how to serve others.” Gu Zheng frowned impatiently.","Everyone was stunned and looked at him with shock. Even a trace of surprise flashed past Qiao Xi’s eyes. What was Gu Zheng doing?!"]},{"number":656,"title":"Chapter 656 - Gu Zheng Is So Adorable","paragraphs":["The manager was stunned for a few seconds and replied in fear, “President Gu, are you sure? They only serve customers. How can you learn from them?”","Gu Zheng frowned. Everyone thought that he had realized that something was wrong. Unexpectedly, he shouted impatiently, “What the hell are you talking about?! Just do as I tell you to!”","He just wanted to curry favor with Qiao Xi. Why was it so difficult?","Qiao Xi remained silent. As expected, there was another personality in Gu Zheng’s body. He was ignorant of the world and was domineering and charming. At this moment, everyone would probably think that the couple had some special fetishes.","She walked in front of Gu Zheng and held his hand tightly. “Stop fooling around, Gu Zheng. Let them go.”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and looked at her hand, then gestured for everyone to leave. He was slightly unhappy. He thought that he was establishing his authority for Qiao Xi and even disregarding his reputation to learn how to serve women, but she did not appreciate it at all.","‘Gu Zheng looks so cute when he’s angry!’","Gu Zheng heard Qiao Xi’s thoughts and looked at her with a surprised expression. She actually said that he was cute?","‘His red face is really too cute. He’s like a child.’","At this moment, the displeasure in Gu Zheng’s heart had already vanished. A trace of redness dyed his cheeks and spread to the back of his ears. His breathing also became hurried.","When he woke up in this body, the gazes of everyone in his memory were filled with fear, disgust, and pity. Only Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with affection. Even though this emotion was very unfamiliar to him, it inexplicably shook his heart.","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and said in a hoarse voice, “Let’s go home.”","The instant he lowered his head, he happened to see the pair of thin stiletto heels Qiao Xi was wearing. Without a word, he took off his coat and wrapped it around her body. He picked her up by the waist and threw her into the car.","Song Shiyu and Song Shijing looked at each other and retreated a few steps. They smiled as Gu Zheng sat in the driver’s seat.","Qiao Xi struggled out of the oversized coat. She was just about to open the door and run to the front passenger seat when she heard Gu Zheng say in a low voice, “Sit properly. The backseat is safer. Moreover, I’ll be distracted if you sit beside me.”","Qiao Xi’s heart trembled. She remembered that Gu Zheng had also said this before. Even though he had already changed into a different person and lost all his emotions, he still subconsciously protected her. This sort of desire to protect her seemed to have seeped into his bones.","Previously, Gu Zheng would still allow her to sit in the front passenger seat. The two of them would chat along the way as they went back to Longwan Residential. However, after that car accident, Gu Zheng refused to let her sit in the front passenger seat no matter what.","Perhaps that drug did not completely make one lose their emotions. It only sealed the deepest emotions in one’s heart. Only then would those terrifying memories not hurt the one affected.","The car stopped at Longwan Residential. Qiao Xi went upstairs and entered the bathroom of the master bedroom. Suddenly, she heard the door open. She casually wrapped a towel around herself and ran out of the bathroom. She said sweetly, “Ah Zheng~”","Gu Zheng suddenly trembled as if a fire was burning in his body.","20 minutes ago, he was still sitting in the study in a daze. He did not understand why he had started to care about Qiao Xi. He cared about her mood and every move. He even ignored his image to please her.","She was clearly the stupid woman that man had married. He only helped her because she was Mrs. Gu and he did not want her to be too embarrassed. However, this woman had already completely swayed his heart.","Gu Zheng came back to his senses. The woman in front of him was wrapped in a towel, which revealed her exquisite collarbone, fair neck, and long legs. Her cheeks were red from the heat, while her eyes were burning as they landed on him.","The man’s Adam’s apple moved, and he felt his body heat up. It was as if a voice was clamoring to break out of the cage. He immediately looked away. His voice was hoarse with desire. “Put your clothes on.”","Qiao Xi blinked. “Have you seen anyone wear clothes to shower? Gu Zheng, why aren’t my clothes in the master bedroom? I remember that I clearly left them here before this.”","Qiao Xi, who had just thrown her clothes away, was looking at the blushing man with an innocent expression. She exhaled and asked gently, “Did you throw away my clothes?”","Hearing her charming voice, Gu Zheng’s body stiffened. After he woke up, he did see some women’s clothes in the master bedroom. They were an eyesore to him, so he put them aside. However, in order to avoid trouble, he did not throw them away.","He was extremely puzzled in his heart as well. The two of them clearly did not have a good relationship, so why would Qiao Xi shower in his bedroom?"]},{"number":657,"title":"Chapter 657 - Innocent Boy","paragraphs":["At this moment, some fiery scenes appeared in Gu Zheng’s mind. Those memories could not be erased and surged uncontrollably. His eyes darkened. “You’re bathing in the master bedroom?”","Qiao Xi looked at him with a smile and stroked her hair charmingly. “Can’t I? I’ve always bathed here. Sometimes, you would even carry me inside! Ah Zheng... can you help me get a shirt?”","Sweat broke out on Gu Zheng’s forehead as his burning gaze landed on her fair collarbone. The towel could not cover her round chest completely and revealed her fair skin. “I’ll get Song Shiyu to go—”","“Are you my husband or is Song Shiyu my husband?! You let him do everything. Are you going to ask him to send it in later? Can’t you help me find one?”","Her voice was almost pleading, so soft that it tugged at his heartstrings. Gu Zheng instantly felt his bones go soft, and he almost could not stand straight anymore. “I... I’ll go, then?”","“Yes, go to my room and get anything.”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment as he recalled those fiery memories in his mind. He really could not refuse Qiao Xi’s request, so he hurriedly turned around and left. He even closed the door, afraid that Song Shiyu would barge in at an inappropriate time.","After entering Qiao Xi’s bedroom, he pushed open the door of the closet. There was indeed a lot of nightwear inside. He casually picked up a set. The fabric was thin, and the icy silk-like touch wrapped his hot palm like smooth skin. Gu Zheng raised the nightwear and looked at it.","Boom!!!","His expression changed as he quickly tossed the nightwear to the side. Then, his ears turned red as if they were about to bleed.","Was this what Qiao Xi had asked him to get? The few pieces of light fabric could only cover important areas. There were only two thin straps on the shoulders, and they looked as if they would break if he exerted too much strength.","He closed his eyes and gasped slightly. In his mind, he could already imagine Qiao Xi wearing this nightgown. Her chest was round, and her exquisite collarbone was exposed. Further down was her torso, her slim waist, and...","Thinking of this, he hurriedly shook his head and forced himself to calm down. Although he had been dormant all these years, he was also a normal man. He had strong desires, so he naturally could not control his impulse when he saw this.","Why was Qiao Xi’s closet filled with such clothes? Could it be that he had bought them for her? For the sake of satisfying his special hobby?","The man’s body was burning. His face was red, but his eyes were gloomy. Then, he picked up a set of nightwear and hurriedly left the bedroom.","Qiao Xi wrapped herself in a towel and sat on the bed in boredom. She could already imagine Gu Zheng’s expression when he saw the nightwear. He would probably need to calm down for a while before coming back, so she was not anxious.","The door handle moved a little, and Gu Zheng walked in with a red face. He lowered his eyes and did not dare to look at her. He found a spot and threw the nightwear to her.","On the surface, Gu Zheng looked emotionless, arrogant, and vicious, but he was still very gentle to her. Moreover, he looked like a pure and innocent boy with a red face. He was really too cute!","She picked up the nightwear and entered the bathroom. After changing, she was about to leave when the man reached out to stop her. Then, the world spun. Qiao Xi’s body spun half a circle before she was pressed against the wall by the man.","The man’s fair skin was dyed red. His eyes were red as he panted slightly. “Don’t... Don’t go out anymore. In the future... you’re not allowed to wear such clothes.”","For some reason, he suddenly felt a little bitter in his heart with a trace of anger. That man was clearly lying to her. That man did not like her at all and was only using her, but she loved that man deeply. She was willing to do anything to satisfy that man’s desires.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with complicated emotions. After a long silence, he said in a hoarse voice, “Don’t believe him. He’s a bad man.”","With that, he suddenly distanced himself from her as if he had been electrocuted. “You sleep here tonight. I’ll go to the guest room.”","With that, Gu Zheng fled.","Qiao Xi leaned against the slightly cold wall and smiled meaningfully. What should she do?! This Gu Zheng really made her want to bully him!","The next morning.","Qiao Xi had just finished her breakfast and turned on her phone to take a look. She realized that many people had tagged her on Weibo. She instantly felt that something was wrong.","She clicked in and saw that the people who were commenting were all Xu Anran’s fans. The reason was that Xu Anran had posted a video. In the video, Xia Yunlou was crying while facing the camera."]},{"number":658,"title":"Chapter 658 - Public Opinion","paragraphs":["Xia Yunlou cried. “Xi Xi, I’ve let you down. Back then, it was Mom’s negligence that caused you to be carried by the wrong person. Ever since I found out about this, I’ve been looking for you. I finally found you, but there was a misunderstanding between us. Now, you refuse to come home.","“Xi Xi, I’ve been looking for you all these years. Unexpectedly, my biological sister accidentally found you and adopted you. She even wrote me a letter and told me to pick you up as soon as possible. However, she passed away before she could send the letter...","“Now that she’s no longer in this world, you can’t live without a home. Xi Xi, come back! Just take it as though you’re returning to your mother’s side for your sister, okay?”","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi watched as Xia Yunlou opened a letter. The signature on the letter was her mother’s name, Xia Yunqiu. The handwriting on the letter was indeed her mother’s. Could it be that her mother had really written to Xia Yunlou?","Logically speaking, since her mother knew that someone was chasing after her, for safety reasons, she would definitely have sent the letter to the person she trusted the most, such as Old Madam Yin or Mr. Yin. Moreover, the two of them had always been on bad terms and did not have much contact with each other. Why would her mother send the letter to her?","Was Xia Yunlou trying to use her mother to force her to return to the Xu family?","Xia Yunlou showed the letter to her and continued to cry. “When my sister left Li City, she took a lot of the Xu and Xia families’ jewelry. She mentioned those assets in the letter and hoped to return them to their rightful owner. Xi Xi, those things are in your hands, right?","“Xi Xi, you must know that those things are expensive. It’s normal for you to be unwilling to return them. But no matter what, they’re my sister’s last wish. As her adopted daughter, you have to fulfill her wish.","“I promise you that the things my sister left behind will be used for collection. We won’t sell them or use them. We just want to place them in the room where my sister used to stay to commemorate her.","“It’s all my fault. If it weren’t for my child, my sister wouldn’t have lived in seclusion in Li City and died in a foreign land. I’ve let my sister down. Now that she’s no longer alive, I can only try my best to fulfill her last wish. Xi Xi, my sister raised you up so painstakingly. You have to know how to repay kindness.”","After the netizens heard this, they sighed. For the sake of finding her younger sister’s daughter, Madam Xia Yunqiu went to Li City alone. In the end, her life even ended there. If Qiao Xi was unwilling to return Xia Yunqiu’s belongings, it meant that she wanted to keep the expensive jewelry for herself.","Qiao Xi’s eyes narrowed slightly. Xia Yunlou was quite smart this time. She knew that forcing her to return to the Xu family was impossible, so she thought of this method to use public opinion to force her back.","Due to her adoptive mother’s final wish, she had to go back with her inheritance.","Of course, she could go back, but they could not regret it!","...","The Xu family.","Xia Yunlou looked at the comments online and finally felt relieved. “Let’s see how that little b*tch will fight me now!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Xu Zhi came down from upstairs. Xia Yunlou hurriedly said while trembling, “Hubby, don’t be angry. I did that because I hope Xi Xi can come back. Moreover, how can a child like her safeguard my sister’s belongings? I just want to get everything back. They don’t belong to her, so she should return them.”","Xu Zhi frowned and glanced at Xia Yunlou with a gloomy gaze. He did not agree with Xia Yunlou’s decision, but this was the old madam’s order, so he did not dare to disobey.","Xu Zhi’s face was gloomy. “Our Xu family’s company is already in a precarious situation. It’s naturally good if Xi Xi returns the inheritance, but if something else happens, the Xu family will be doomed! Xia Yunlou, I’m warning you. Don’t provoke Xi Xi again. If you offend her, we’ll all suffer!”","Xia Yunlou was dissatisfied, but she still nodded obediently on the surface. “I understand. I absolutely won’t provoke Xi Xi. As long as she hands over the inheritance, everything will be fine.”","Now that public opinion was becoming more and more heated, if Qiao Xi did not hand over the inheritance, she would be considered unfilial to her family. At that time, she could not blame anyone for being rude. Gu Corporation’s reputation would also be affected. Gu Zheng might divorce Qiao Xi in a fit of anger.","Qiao Xi did not give a clear response. The netizens were about to explode as they commented on her profile. Xu Anran’s fans also sent her private messages cursing her."]},{"number":659,"title":"Chapter 659 - The Family In The Northern Region","paragraphs":["The netizens were all indignant. Even if Xia Yunlou was in the wrong, she had admitted her mistake and even publicly apologized. However, Qiao Xi clearly knew that she was in the wrong, yet she hid and did not say anything. Did she think that she could pocket that inheritance without returning it?","What was even more infuriating was that Xia Yunqiu had given up her life for Qiao Xi’s sake. However, Qiao Xi actually disregarded the wish of her adoptive mother, and her mind was filled with money. She was simply too much!","Gu Zheng naturally saw this news as well. His eyes were filled with anger, and his voice was cold. “Where’s Young Madam?”","Song Shijing said, “I think she’s sorting out Madam Xia Yunqiu’s inheritance.”","Gu Zheng’s gaze darkened. “Why is she sorting those things? Could it be that she really wants to return them to the Xu family? This stupid woman is crazy!”","Song Shijing: “??” Stupid woman? The president called Young Madam a stupid woman? The crazy wife-loving man who used to dote on her said that she was stupid? Even he knew that Young Madam had her reasons for doing things. Even if she returned the items, it would definitely deal the Xu family a heavy blow. Didn’t the president know that?","Then, Gu Zheng slowly said, “Your president...”","He paused for a moment and changed the topic. “How did she handle all these things in the past? Did she solve all her problems alone? Did she never ask me for help?”","Song Shijing looked at him in confusion. He remembered their private conversation. Song Shiyu said—","‘Don’t you think the president has been acting strange recently?","‘Yesterday, the president actually said that Young Madam was weak. Has his brain been damaged?’","Song Shijing smiled meaningfully. “President, don’t worry!”","...","Xu Anran was an A-list celebrity, so she was very popular. Moreover, the news of two babies being mistakenly swapped at birth had spread wide. The netizens were very concerned about this matter. To them, it was understandable that the biological daughter was unwilling to go home. After all, she and the Xu family did not have any feelings for each other, but Xia Yunqiu had raised Qiao Xi. The two should have a bond with each other. For the sake of pocketing that priceless inheritance, the daughter was unwilling to fulfill her adoptive mother’s last wish. This was a problem with her character.","Xu Anran looked at the comments online with a proud expression. She originally thought that Qiao Xi was very powerful, but now, she must be so afraid and that was why she did not dare to say anything. It had already been so long, yet she hadn’t given a response.","As Qiao Xi had not responded, Xia Yunlou was getting more confident. She believed that she would definitely be able to make Qiao Xi hand over the inheritance obediently this time.","After a week had passed, Qiao Xi still did not respond. She had already counted the things her mother left behind. These things were indeed expensive. Even if all the Xu family’s assets were added together, they would not be able to compare to them.","Although the Xia family was a noble family, it did not make sense for a daughter to take away so much gold, silver, and jewelry. Moreover, with so many valuable things taken away, the Xia family would definitely have suffered a serious loss. However, there was no news of the Xia family losing their assets in recent years.","Could it be that these things belonged to the Yin family?","It shouldn’t be because Old Madam Yin always carried a priceless blood jade with her. It was the Yin family’s heirloom, but her mother’s inheritance had two pieces of blood jade of better quality. Other than the jade pieces, there were also all kinds of antiques and paintings.","Qiao Xi found someone to appraise it. The goods her mother had left behind were all real. Moreover, any one of these things was worth millions. It was even to the extent that some of them were too expensive and difficult to estimate.","Where did all these things come from?","They were not from the Xia family nor the Yin family. No matter how successful her mother’s business was, it was impossible for her to accumulate such a shocking amount of wealth in a short period of time. Moreover, these antiques, paintings, jewelry, and gold were difficult to buy even if one had money. They required absolute power and status.","Her mother was only 26 years old when she died. She did have a business mind and managed to earn a lot of money, but it was impossible for her to own such wealth alone.","Her phone suddenly rang. Qin An called. “Little Six, I got someone to look at those things. Do you know where Aunt Yunqiu’s inheritance came from?”","Qiao Xi replied, “I don’t.”","Qin An’s voice was serious. “The treasures in the inheritance are all priceless. Any one of them is enough to make people envious. One of them...”","He paused as if he wanted to digest this news as well. “30 years ago, my father met that family in the northern region. Although he had only seen it once, he still has a deep impression of that treasure.”","The family in the northern region..."]},{"number":660,"title":"Chapter 660 - I’ll Protect You In The Future","paragraphs":["Qin An did not say it directly. Qiao Xi asked in surprise, “Are you talking about the large family that lives in seclusion in the northern region?”","“Yes. Back then, my father’s business was very good, so he was invited to the northern region. He saw the big family that occupied the northern region with his own eyes. He also saw the ruby necklace at the banquet. This necklace is called ‘Heart of Rose’. I’m just not sure why this necklace is in Aunt Yunqiu’s belongings.”","Qiao Xi was extremely shocked.","Qin An continued, “I can’t find the origin of most of the other relics. Little Six, if I have any new information, I’ll call you again.”","Just as he was about to hang up, Qin An’s voice suddenly turned cold. “By the way, do you need me to help you deal with the Xu family? If I had known that Xu Anran was so troublesome, I would have gotten Second Brother to kill her back then!”","“Third Brother, don’t fight and kill for no reason. Murder is against the law,” Qiao Xi said casually. “Besides, do I need you to deal with them? I can fight them alone!”","The Xu family was so anxious about this inheritance probably because something had happened to the company. From the looks of it, they probably did not know that her mother had left behind a shocking amount of wealth. In other words, they did not know where this inheritance came from either. Perhaps even Old Madam Yin did not know.","So... what was Mom’s relationship with the family in the northern region? What was the secret behind this?","“Little Six, it’s Aunt Yunqiu’s death anniversary tomorrow. I’ll go visit her with you.”","In the past, every time she was sad, her brothers would accompany her. This time, she hesitated and could not help but look at the man behind her. Gu Zheng was sitting on the sofa with deep eyes and a gloomy expression.","Qiao Xi’s heart jerked as she hurriedly said, “There’s no need. There’s someone accompanying me.”","After hanging up, Qiao Xi turned around and walked to the man’s side. She saw that he had a cigarette between his fingers. His entire body was shrouded in smoke, and his eyes were filled with complicated emotions. His voice was hoarse. “They’re bullying you. Why didn’t you look for me?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes in surprise.","Gu Zheng blew out a smoke ring and said softly, “Perhaps I wouldn’t have cared about these things in the past, but from now on, you can look for me if you encounter any trouble.”","The man in the past was two-faced and did not treat her well, but he would treat Mrs. Gu well.","These past few days, Gu Zheng had often been deep in thought in the study. He was very sure that this man did not really like Qiao Xi. Otherwise, why would he watch as she was bullied but not help?!","She was a weak woman and had to face a family. How could she endure the rumors on the internet?","The thought of her crying miserably under the covers after being wronged made Gu Zheng feel annoyed. An inexplicable emotion surged in his heart.","He knew very well that he was not the real Gu Zheng. It was just that when Gu Zheng was bullied when he was young, an even stronger personality was born. He was born from the darkness. As Gu Zheng grew older and stronger, he no longer needed him.","He was extremely surprised that he was able to wake up this time. He did not know how long he would be able to survive this time, but as long as he was around, he had to protect Qiao Xi from harm.","Gu Zheng looked at the woman in front of him with a complicated gaze and said in a low voice, “Don’t be afraid, I’ll help you.”","Qiao Xi’s phone suddenly rang. It was a message from Ling Pavilion. After she saw it, she directly deleted the message and said, “I’m going to the Xu family’s house tomorrow.”","“Mhm, I’ll go with you.”","Qiao Xi felt that Gu Zheng was very loyal today like a pure little puppy. This feeling seemed to be quite good.","Her eyes were filled with smiles. “Ah Zheng, don’t worry about me.”","Gu Zheng was even more upset. She was the one who was bullied, yet she still had to comfort him. This woman was really hopelessly stupid!","He got up from the sofa and approached her. He happened to hear her thoughts.","‘He’s so nice!","‘Even though he... He’s still so good to me. He’s so good to me that I want to cry.’","Gu Zheng did not hear what was said in the middle and only heard a few words. He roughly understood Qiao Xi’s meaning. She was very grateful to him.","...","The next day.","Xia Yunlou had sent invitations to all the wealthy families in Li City to invite everyone to the Xu family’s banquet.","Xu Anran’s excuse was that Xia Yunlou had been a little depressed recently. Her biological daughter was unwilling to return to the Xu family, nor was she willing to return Xia Yunqiu’s belongings. They were also unable to contact Qiao Xi. For the sake of coaxing Xia Yunlou, they invited everyone to the Xu family’s house to have tea and chat to relieve the depression in their hearts."]},{"number":661,"title":"Chapter 661 - The Filial Xu Anran","paragraphs":["Xu Anran was on the trending searches again. The netizens were all praising her for being filial. Her manager took advantage of her surge in popularity and brought a professional filming team to the Xu family. She pretended to be a reporter and broadcasted Xu Anran’s filial scene. Immediately, the live broadcast was filled with praise.","[Although Xu Anran is not the biological daughter, she’s really filial to Madam Xu.]","[So what if that woman is the biological daughter? She doesn’t have any relationship with the Xu family. She’s unwilling to return to her family now. Madam Xu dotes on Xu Anran, so it’s not strange that she doesn’t like her biological daughter.]","In the live broadcast, Xu Anran said gently to everyone, “My mom has been very depressed recently because of something. As her daughter, I can’t help her vent her frustrations, and I feel very guilty because of that. I just hope that this banquet can make my mom happier.”","Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with worry as she squeezed out a smile. “Although I’ve found my biological daughter, Anran is still my daughter. Xi Xi is the daughter of the Xu family, and so is Anran. There’s no conflict between the two of them. Don’t look down on Anran just because she’s an adopted daughter. She’s also the beloved daughter of the Xu family. I won’t treat her badly.","“Anran is filial and obedient. Since everyone is here today, I want to announce something. We’ve decided to give Anran 20% of the shares. After she marries in the future, we’ll give a bountiful dowry. We just hope that she’ll be happy in the future.”","Qiao Xi had just walked to the door when she happened to hear Xia Yunlou’s words. What did this Xia Yunlou mean? Did she want to publicly display Xu Anran’s status as an adopted daughter?","Today was Xia Yunqiu’s death anniversary. Qiao Xi was wearing a plain black dress with a white lace shawl over her shoulders. She did not wear any makeup, but her lips were red and her teeth were white. Her long hair was casually tied behind her head, yet it gave others a sense of languid beauty. She did not wear any jewelry, yet she looked pure and clean.","Gu Zheng stood beside her and could not help but lick his lips to suppress the agitation in his heart.","At this moment, the sky was dark and it was drizzling.","Qiao Xi held her mother’s belongings with a gloomy expression.","Gu Zheng patted her shoulder and said softly, “Let’s go.”","“Ah Zheng, Xu Anran confessed to you in public earlier. I’m afraid this banquet is for you.” Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully.","When Gu Zheng heard this, his body stiffened at first, then he revealed a disgusted expression. “That ugly woman likes me? Who gave her the confidence?”","Song Shiyu: “...” Why did he feel that the president was becoming more and more vicious with his words? Even if he was disgusted before, he would only express it in his eyes and never say it out loud.","“Xia Yunlou said that she’s on good terms with my mom, but she doesn’t even know it’s her death anniversary. She even arranged a banquet today. Let’s see how she’ll explain this later!”","Qiao Xi sneered. “Everyone from the Xu family is here. I’m the only one who hasn’t joined in. I don’t even know what these people will say about me once they’re all gathered!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi raised the black umbrella and slowly walked to the door while holding Gu Zheng’s arm. When the servants at the door saw that it was Qiao Xi, their faces were filled with surprise. “Miss Qiao...”","“Go! Quickly report to Madam that Miss Qiao is here!”","“Stop her, quick!”","...","The banquet hall was brightly lit and lively. It did not have the coldness of a rainy day at all. Everyone surrounded Xia Yunlou and tried to curry favor with her.","Madam Xu was the daughter of the Xia family. Behind her were two noble families. Moreover, it was said that Xu Anran had even won the championship of the Planet Music Festival. Although the officials had not announced this matter, the Xu family would not joke about it.","“Madam Xu, don’t be sad. Even if your biological daughter isn’t around, there’s still An Ran, who’s obedient and sensible! With her by your side, you’ll naturally have nothing to worry about.”","“That’s right! We all know how filial Eldest Miss Xu is! I heard that someone is broadcasting this banquet live! It looks like the netizens are also paying attention!”","Xu Anran said generously, “It was all requested by my fans. I wanted to use this banquet to comfort Mom and make her feel better. Mom also agreed to it, so a team is doing a live broadcast. If everyone minds it, I can get someone to turn it off.”","“Of course not.”","At this moment, someone suddenly asked, “Isn’t Miss Qiao coming to such an important occasion?”","The banquet hall was silent.","After a moment of silence, someone said angrily, “It’s not Madam Xu’s fault that the child was replaced. Even if there was a misunderstanding, Madam Xu has already publicly apologized. No matter what, Madam Xu is Miss Qiao’s biological mother. Isn’t it a little insensible for her to be so unforgiving?!”"]},{"number":662,"title":"Chapter 662 - Wearing Black","paragraphs":["“Miss Xu, did you invite Miss Qiao to the banquet?”","Xu Anran pretended to be flustered and explained, “My sister might have something very important to attend to, so she can’t attend. Don’t blame her.”","The more flustered she was, the more people suspected that Qiao Xi had chosen not to attend. Her sister was even trying to cover for her younger sister. This made everyone’s hearts ache even more.","Everyone’s hearts were filled with disdain for the true daughter of the Xu family. Even if Qiao Xi was dissatisfied, Xia Yunlou was her mother, after all. She had to come back on an occasion like this, but she refused to show her face. She was indeed a country bumpkin with low EQ.","Xu Anran bit her lip and explained, “Actually, it’s all my fault. When my sister just came back, we were a little unhappy about it. She might still be angry with me.”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with tears as she said sorrowfully, “I finally found my biological daughter. Who knew that she wouldn’t be close to me?! I didn’t want to miss out on 20 years with her either! She blames me, but I blame myself too!”","Everyone was also infected by her sorrow. Their eyes could not help but turn red. No one wished for such a thing to happen. Their child was lost, and the mother was the one who was hurt the most. Now that she had found her biological daughter, she was unwilling to come home. The mother was the one who had suffered the most.","Qiao Xi was really too insensible!","Even if it was for Xia Yunqiu’s sake, she should visit her mother!","Everyone was gathered together to criticize Qiao Xi when they suddenly heard the security guards shout from outside. “Miss Qiao! Please wait! I’m sorry! You can’t go in!”","The banquet hall instantly fell silent. Everyone subconsciously looked at Xia Yunlou. The family had just said that they hoped Qiao Xi would come, so why did they get the security guards to stop her?","“Madam Xu, Qiao Xi is here? Why aren’t you letting her in?”","“Didn’t you say that you wanted Miss Qiao to attend the banquet? Now...”","Xia Yunlou’s entire body trembled. That little b*tch was actually here? She thought that Qiao Xi would not appear, so she spouted nonsense at the banquet. Unexpectedly, she really came!","Since she had already said it, she could not brazenly chase Qiao Xi away.","Before Xia Yunlou could say anything, Xu Anran hurriedly rushed out with red eyes. “My sister is here! Who allowed you to stop my sister?!”","The security guard realized that he had said something wrong and quickly took a few steps back. Xu Anran went forward to welcome her warmly. “Xi Xi, you’re here. The security guard is new and probably doesn’t know you. Don’t mind him. Mom and I were looking forward to your arrival! Mom is waiting for you inside. Come in with me!”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were red as she looked at Xu Anran with teary eyes. Xu Anran instantly choked.","What was this b*tch trying to do?","Qiao Xi followed Xu Anran into the door as tears flowed down her face. She walked in front of Xia Yunlou and said with a trembling voice, “Madam Xu... Mom, I’m sorry I’m late.”","Qiao Xi was wearing a long black dress. She did not wear makeup or jewelry. She looked like she was here for a funeral. She was completely unable to blend into the lively banquet hall.","Wen Xi stood beside Xu Anran. Seeing the smile on Xu Anran’s face gradually disappearing, Wen Xi sneered. “Qiao Xi, so you still know that Madam Xu is your mother?! Why are you wearing black at the banquet?! Who are you trying to disgust?!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi in confusion as well, and only then did they notice that her clothes were inappropriate. She was wearing a long black dress and held a black umbrella. Her long hair was tied up behind her head as if she was paying respects to someone.","She was dressed like this at her mother’s banquet. She did not really come to attend the banquet, did she? She was clearly here to ruin the banquet. Was she cursing Madam Xu to die?","“No wonder the security guards won’t let her in! Who wouldn’t feel uncomfortable seeing her dressed like this?!”","“She must have deliberately worn mourning clothes to come to the banquet!”","“Even if Madam Xu did something wrong, she can’t curse her mother to die! Moreover, it wasn’t Madam Xu’s fault that the two babies were mistakenly swapped back then. How could Qiao Xi be so vicious?!”","“I heard that Qiao Xi chased Xu Anran away the moment she returned to the Xu family and even targeted her. It’s fine if she doesn’t like Xu Anran, but she’s even cursing her biological mother!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point of laughing. They were saying that she had targeted Xu Anran? From the first time the two of them met, Xu Anran had already caused trouble for her. Later on, she even colluded with Xia Yunlou to set a trap for her. With the mother and daughter treating her like this, how could she have any feelings for Xia Yunlou?!","Xu Anran occupied her identity and her parents. She even wanted to gain sympathy here. Everyone’s heart ached for Xu Anran, who had gone from the eldest daughter of the Xu family to an adopted daughter. However, why didn’t they ask what Qiao Xi had experienced all these years?"]},{"number":663,"title":"Chapter 663 - Ruining The Banquet","paragraphs":["She had been left to wander outside. If she had not met her mother, she would have been sent to the orphanage. If she had not met her grandfather, how could she have returned to Li City safely?","She was lucky to have her mother, grandfather, and four brothers. She also met Gu Zheng when she reached adulthood. What if she was not so lucky? She would have died on that cold night. She would have died in Xu Mei’s hands or in that bitter cold village.","Qiao Xi did not wish to explain these things to strangers. She had never cared if the Xu family had any feelings for her, but it was absolutely impossible for Xia Yunlou to use her mother to force her to submit!","Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with sorrow, and her eyes could not help but wander. “Forget it, let’s not talk about Xi Xi anymore. Maybe she just happened to wear black. In short, it’s good that Xi Xi is here. Quickly sit down!”","Qiao Xi sneered in her heart, then she became extremely emotional. “Mom, I’m really grateful to you. I thought you forgot, but I didn’t expect you to still remember. You even invited so many noble young ladies and madams to participate. I was wrong in the past. I shouldn’t have blamed you...”","Everyone had puzzled expressions. What was Qiao Xi talking about?! They all knew that on the surface, this banquet was held by Xu Anran for the sake of coaxing Xia Yunlou. In reality, it was Xu Anran’s blind date banquet. What did this have to do with Qiao Xi?","Xia Yunlou’s face was filled with confusion as well. Could it be that Qiao Xi could not take the public opinion and she was already admitting defeat? If she was willing to lower her head, did that mean that she was willing to return Xia Yunqiu’s inheritance?","After thinking for a moment, Xia Yunlou pretended to be loving. “Xi Xi, it’s good that you don’t blame me. Before my sister died, she hoped that you could come home so that we could reunite. It can be considered as we’ve fulfilled her last wish!”","She especially emphasized the words ‘last wish’. Qiao Xi instantly understood what she meant, and her eyes were instantly filled with tears. “Madam Xu, you’re still thinking about my adoptive mother. She’ll be very happy if she learns about it in heaven. Since that’s the case, the inheritance my adoptive mother left behind should be handed to you for safekeeping.”","Xia Yunlou did not expect things to go so smoothly. She could not help but laugh. This little b*tch was really stupid. She was handing over the inheritance so easily. Xia Yunlou thought that they would have to fight for a few more rounds!","Xia Yunlou was so excited that her entire body was trembling. She suppressed her excitement and said, “Xi Xi, you’re so sensible. Then... the inheritance is now...”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent as she smiled lightly. “There’s no rush. Madam Xu, I think all the guests have arrived now. Let’s pay our respects first. You’ve already prepared the offerings, right?”","Xia Yunlou was about to answer when she suddenly widened her eyes.","Wait! What? Pay respects?","Wen Xi’s expression froze, then she roared angrily, “Qiao Xi, are you crazy?! Why are you so disgraceful?! Everyone’s happily attending the banquet. Why are you bringing up the dead for no reason?!”","“Qiao Xi, what are you talking about?! Who are you paying your respects to?”","“When Madam Xu sent the invitations, didn’t she say that she wanted to find Xu Anran a suitable husband? How did this banquet suddenly become an occasion to pay respects to the dead?”","“Yeah! If I knew that it was for this reason, I definitely wouldn’t have come. This Qiao Xi is really too much! She’s clearly here to ruin the banquet!”","Xia Yunlou glared fiercely at Qiao Xi. What did this little b*tch want?!","She held this banquet to find Anran a boyfriend with a prominent family background. Now, it was all ruined by Qiao Xi!","Xia Yunlou suppressed her anger. “Xi Xi, stop fooling around. We’ll talk after the banquet. Even if you’re unhappy, you can’t fool around on such an occasion.”","Xu Anran also tried to persuade her. “Xi Xi, you haven’t been at home. You might not know that Mom has been in a bad mood recently. We’re holding this banquet to make her happier. Don’t make her angry, okay?”","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi suddenly widened her eyes and took a few steps back in disbelief. Her eyes were red as tears trickled down her face. Her voice trembled as she said, “Is this really a banquet?”","Wen Xi shouted with a look of disdain, “If it’s not a banquet, what else could it be?! We’re here to drink and chat! We’re here to have fun! We’re not here to mourn the dead!”","Everyone scoffed at Qiao Xi’s actions. It was fine if she was fooling around in private, but now, she even dared to do such a thing in front of everyone. In the future, she would definitely go even further!","Tears trickled down Qiao Xi’s face. She was not pretending, but she was truly sad for her mother. Xia Yunlou did not care about her sister at all. All she cared about was her mother’s inheritance."]},{"number":664,"title":"Chapter 664 - Her Death Anniversary","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi suppressed the anger in her heart and asked sadly, “Madam Xu, let me ask you again. Is this banquet really a blind date banquet? Did you hold it because you wanted to find a good man for Xu Anran?”","Although the invitation letters did not say that, everyone knew very well that this was Xu Anran’s blind date banquet. They were also willing to join in the fun.","“What do you mean?! Qiao Xi, you can’t be so sarcastic just because Sister Anran is the adopted daughter. Is there a problem with Madam Xu hosting a banquet for Sister Anran?” Wen Xi said indignantly.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was slightly cold. “Madam Xu, you said that you were very close with my adoptive mother, so for the sake of fulfilling her wish, you have to safeguard her inheritance, right?”","Xia Yunlou raised her eyes and met Qiao Xi’s cold gaze. She suddenly felt uneasy and had a bad premonition. She wanted to offer sacrifices to a dead person. Could it be that that person was Xia Yunqiu?","So, today was Xia Yunqiu’s death anniversary?","Xia Yunlou suddenly reacted and was about to speak when Qiao Xi interrupted her. “Madam Xu, today is the death anniversary of my adoptive mother, Madam Xia Yunqiu! You said that you were close to her, so you wanted to fulfill her wish and have me return her inheritance, but you don’t even remember her death anniversary!","“At this moment, the old madam of the Yin family and Mr. Yin are all in Li City. They’re not attending the banquet because they’ve already gone to pay respects to my adoptive mother! As her younger sister, why are you holding a blind date banquet for Xu Anran on this day?”","Qiao Xi’s eyes were filled with ridicule, and her voice was icy-cold. “Madam Xu, do you really care about your sister? It can’t be that you only care about her inheritance and not her, right?”","The banquet hall was deathly silent. Xia Yunlou’s face was livid. She did not expect that today would coincidentally be Xia Yunqiu’s death anniversary. Qiao Xi was grabbing onto this matter and refusing to let go. She was clearly embarrassing her.","Everyone knew that Old Madam Yin doted on Xia Yunqiu, and Mr. Yin also valued his younger sister very much. They had all gone to pay their respects to Xia Yunqiu, but Xia Yunlou, the ‘good’ younger sister, did not know about it and was even holding a blind date banquet here? Could it be that she was really doing everything for the inheritance?","If it were not for Qiao Xi’s appearance, no one would have known about it. The Xu family still looked as harmonious as always, and only Qiao Xi was sad for her adoptive mother.","Xu Anran’s expression changed drastically as she said with teary eyes, “Sister, it’s all my fault. I begged Mom to help me hold this banquet. Don’t blame Mom!","“Moreover, we didn’t know that today is Aunt’s death anniversary. If we had known, we definitely wouldn’t have held this banquet.”","Xia Yunlou’s face was pale as she lowered his head and said, “Xi Xi, we haven’t been in contact with the Yin family for so many years. You didn’t tell me about my sister’s death anniversary either. I really didn’t know what day it was today! It’s my fault. I should’ve asked you a long time ago!”","Xu Anyi immediately chimed in, “Yes! You’re blaming Mom for forgetting her death anniversary, but you never told her. Now that you’re here to denounce her, I think you just can’t stand to see your family doing well!”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with resentment. She knew that she would probably not be able to obtain Xia Yunqiu’s inheritance today. Since it was like this, she did not have to show any mercy. She had to ruin Qiao Xi’s reputation!","Then, Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with sorrow as she cried out, “Xi Xi, I know you still blame me! In your heart, I’m not worthy to be your mother. I haven’t contacted my sister for many years, but that’s because my sister isn’t willing to get close to me. She always rejects me.","“I didn’t know that it was her death anniversary, yet you’re accusing me like this! You only have her in your heart. You don’t see me as your biological mother at all! I want to be good to you and like you, but you’re just like my sister and don’t want to get close to me at all!”","When everyone heard Xia Yunlou’s complaint, their hearts ached. “Miss Qiao, no matter what, Madam Xu is your biological mother. No matter how dissatisfied you are, you have to consider her feelings!”","Seeing that everyone was speaking up for her, Xia Yunlou’s expression eased up a little. These people were all nobles who were close to her, so they would naturally speak up for her. How could Qiao Xi defeat her?","Xia Yunlou cried bitterly. “Xi Xi, you’re accusing me for my sister. I don’t blame you. No one wished for what had happened back then. Throughout these years, I’ve been in a lot of pain too. Why can’t you let go of the resentment in your heart? What did I do wrong that you’re treating me like this?”","“Madam Xu, you don’t know what you’ve done wrong? Well, I can tell you.” A cold male voice sounded. Gu Zheng was wearing a black suit and had a serious expression as he slowly walked over."]},{"number":665,"title":"Chapter 665 - The President Protects His Wife","paragraphs":["Song Shijing and Song Shiyu followed him respectfully. Xu Zhi also came up to them in fear.","Gu Zheng walked to Qiao Xi’s side and looked at Xia Yunlou with a mocking gaze before continuing, “Madam Xu, you don’t know what you’ve done, so let me remind you.”","The banquet hall instantly fell silent. Everyone gasped and felt the air freeze.","Xia Yunlou’s heart thumped, and she didn’t dare say anything. She could criticize Qiao Xi, but how could she dare cry in front of Gu Zheng?","Xu Anran leaned forward with red eyes. “President Gu, my sister has indeed suffered a lot all these years, but my mother didn’t want her to suffer either! My mother doesn’t want to see this happen, so you can’t blame her! She’s the one who’s the most hurt from this!”","Gu Zheng smirked.","Xia Yunlou hurriedly seized the opportunity. “That’s right! Newborn babies all look similar. I didn’t know that the babies were replaced. After I found out about it, I went everywhere to look for Xi Xi. What’s wrong with the relationship Anran and I share? It’s fine if Xi Xi blames me, and it doesn’t matter what she says to me in private. Why must she embarrass me in front of everyone?","“President Gu, you said that I’ve done something wrong. I know that Xi Xi doesn’t like An An, but An An has lived in this house for 20 years. How can I bear to chase her away? When the two children were swapped, An An was just an infant. She didn’t know anything. She’s also a victim. If I have to chase my daughter, who has been by my side for 20 years, out of the house for Xi Xi, won’t I be too heartless?!”","Everyone felt that Xia Yunlou’s words were reasonable. Qiao Xi was indeed too wild. Did she think that she could do whatever she wanted after marrying Gu Zheng?","No matter what, Xu Anran had lived in this family for 20 years. Before Qiao Xi appeared, she was the eldest daughter of the Xu family and a top socialite in Luo City. Now that the true daughter of the Xu family was back, was Xu Anran expected to be abandoned? This was unfair to her.","Moreover, Xu Anran was gentle and kind. Why couldn’t Qiao Xi accept her? Wasn’t it good for the two sisters to have each other’s company?","Xu Anyi’s face was filled with disdain. “Qiao Xi! You’re blaming everything on Anran. You think that Anran stole your identity, so you’re unhappy and want to cause chaos in this family!”","Xu Anran’s eyes were filled with tears. “Xi Xi, don’t blame me or make things difficult for me. It’s all my fault. I should have left this family a long time ago. As long as I leave, you won’t cause trouble anymore, right?”","Xia Yunlou hugged Xu Anran and cried.","Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng sneered and asked coldly, “Madam Xu, have you investigated who swapped the two babies? Do you know who the culprit is?”","Xia Yunlou’s expression changed as she hurriedly explained, “The nurse accidentally carried the wrong baby. Newborns all look similar. I don’t know which nurse it was, so...”","Gu Zheng interrupted coldly, “Madam Xu, I remember you saying that the Xu family’s enemy swapped the baby and found a random baby girl to replace Xi Xi. Later, Madam Xia Yunqiu found out Xi Xi’s whereabouts and adopted her.","“What’s the matter? Have you forgotten what you said?”","The netizens in the live broadcast also posted comments: [Yeah! I remember what Madam Xu said previously!]","[Wow! The domineering president! Although I can’t see his face, I can tell from his voice that he’s a handsome man!]","[This person seems to be Qiao Xi’s husband, right? I heard that Qiao Xi married the head of the Gu family, Gu Zheng. Could this be the legendary President Gu?]","At this moment, Xia Yunlou’s body went weak as she fell onto the sofa. Her mind was a mess. “I-I remembered wrongly. It seems that my enemy replaced Xi Xi. My mind was muddled.”","“Did you remember wrongly? Do you Xu mean to say that Xi Xi was swapped by your enemy?” Gu Zheng asked.","Xia Yunlou’s expression darkened as she gritted her teeth. “Yes, I’m sure that Xi Xi was replaced by my enemy. I was very sad to know about this!”","Gu Zheng’s voice turned cold. “Madam Xu, let me tell you the truth! Song Shiyu.”","“President!”","Song Shiyu looked serious as he took out the recording pen in his hand. “Madam Xu, why did you forget what you said so quickly? If you’ve forgotten, we can remind you.”","Xia Yunlou suddenly shuddered and pounced over to snatch the recording pen. Song Shiyu turned around to avoid her and pressed the button."]},{"number":666,"title":"Chapter 666 - The Xu Family’s Servant","paragraphs":["Song Shiyu turned up the volume, and the sounds of their conversation came from the recording pen.","Qiao Xi was heard saying, “Madam Xu, you already know who the perpetrator is. Why didn’t you punish her? You even let her stay in the Xu family?”","Xia Yunlou said, “It’s already been so long, so why are you still being so calculative?! We should let her off. After all, she has been a servant in our Xu family for more than 20 years. How can we bear to punish her?” ‘","Qiao Xi then said, “Since the Xu family isn’t willing to punish her and continues to let her work in the house, then I can’t live under the same roof as her.”","After listening to this recording, everyone understood. Netizens started spamming comments on the live broadcast.","[Did I hear wrongly?! The person who swapped the child isn’t a nurse or an enemy. It’s a servant from the Xu family? And this servant is still living in the Xu family?]","[This is enough to shock me for a hundred years! What’s Madam Xu thinking?! She clearly knows that the servant swapped her daughter, yet she’s still letting the servant stay in their home. No wonder Qiao Xi isn’t willing to go home!]","The recording did not end. What followed was a cry.","“Xi Xi, don’t blame Mom. It’s all my fault. Nanny Lin is my nanny. To me, she’s half my mother. She worked in the Xu family for more than 20 years and spent the best years of her life here. How can I bear to chase her away?! If you insist on calling the police and arresting her, I’ll feel guilty for the rest of my life. Mom only decided to let her stay in the Xu family because of me. If you’re really uncomfortable with it, you can hit me or scold me. As long as you agree to let her stay, I’ll do anything!”","Xia Yunlou’s voice was slightly angry. “Qiao Xi, you’ve already returned to the Xu family. What else are you dissatisfied with? If you insist on calling the police, it’ll hurt Anran’s heart. I absolutely won’t allow you to do this!”","Xu Anran said gratefully, “Mom, thank you for supporting me! Xi Xi, it was Nanny Lin’s fault back then, but she was just muddle-headed for a moment. Now that she’s old and her health isn’t good, how can she go to jail? Don’t mind the past. It’s most important for our family to be harmonious.”","“Anran is right. Actually, I’m quite grateful to Nanny Lin. If it weren’t for her, I wouldn’t have such an obedient and sensible daughter.”","The recording ended, and the venue was in an uproar.","Although it was only a short recording, everyone could tell that Xia Yunlou did not like her biological daughter. Instead, she even sounded a little disgusted.","Xia Yunlou’s face was pale. Her body was trembling and she could not say anything!","She gritted her teeth. What was wrong with what she said? That little b*tch Qiao Xi kept going against her. What right did that wild girl have to be her daughter?!","Xia Yunlou abruptly stood up. Before she could say anything, someone suddenly bumped into her. The red wine in their hand spilled onto her light-colored dress.","“Ah! What have you done?!”","Xia Yunlou roared angrily and looked up to see a noblewoman dressed in exquisite clothes. She was looking at her with mocking eyes and said sarcastically, “I’m sorry! Madam Xu, I didn’t do it on purpose. You were able to make your daughter forgive the perpetrator, which means that you’re magnanimous. I believe you’ll definitely forgive me too!”","As soon as she finished speaking, Song Shiyu took out a laptop from his briefcase and played a video in front of everyone. He played the video of Xu Anran hiring someone to frame Qiao Xi on her birthday.","At this moment, everyone finally understood why Qiao Xi was unwilling to return to the Xu family. Why did Qiao Xi have such bad intentions toward Xu Anran? It was because Xu Anran did not hesitate to ruin her innocence in order to frame her.","Xu Anran looked weak and innocent, but she was actually so vicious!","The guests and people in the live broadcast were all shocked by Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran’s actions.","Suddenly, someone commented, [I understand now. Miss Qiao just hoped that the Xu family could punish that servant. Not only did the Xu family not agree, but they even allowed Anran to frame her. Of course, she isn’t willing to return to this family. If it were me, I wouldn’t be willing to come back either!]","[Liar! You kept saying that you’re doing everything for Qiao Xi’s sake, but you’re playing tricks behind her back! You even want to snatch her assets! This pair of mother and daughter are really disgusting!]","Everyone in the live broadcast started cursing. Xu Anran’s fans did not dare to say anything at this moment. They liked Xu Anran, but they could also differentiate right from wrong. Moreover, if anyone were to speak up for Xu Anran at this moment, they would definitely be scolded badly."]},{"number":667,"title":"Chapter 667 - The Support Of Patriarch Yin","paragraphs":["[Madam Xu is so strange! Although Qiao Xi has been missing for 20 years, she’s still her biological daughter. How can she bear to let Qiao Xi suffer?]","[This is like someone losing a ruby and getting a piece of glass. You think that glass looks better. Not only aren’t you blaming the perpetrator for making you lose the ruby, but you’re also thanking them for giving you this piece of glass.]","[The above comment makes a lot of sense. Madam Xu actually thanked that servant? And that Xu Anran is a b*tch. She pretends to be weak but she deliberately provokes Miss Qiao.]","[Isn’t Xu Anran very proud? Although she’s just an adopted daughter, she’s more favored than the biological daughter. She can do whatever she wants in the Xu family and even force the biological daughter to not dare to go home!]","[Fans, open your eyes wide and take a good look. This is the goddess in your hearts! Do you still have the cheek to scold Qiao Xi?]","Everyone in the banquet hall was filled with anger as well. “Xu Anran, didn’t you say that Qiao Xi was targeting you and wanted to chase you out? We sympathized with you and spoke up for you. It turns out that you’ve been bullying her!”","“What right do you have to ask Qiao Xi to forgive you? If it weren’t for you and that servant, Qiao Xi would have a happy and beautiful life. She would have parents who doted on her. You destroyed all of this but you’re still pretending to be a good person! If I were you, I wouldn’t have the face to continue staying here!”","When Xu Anran heard the curses around her, her body went limp and she almost fell to the floor.","The door of the banquet hall was pushed open. After the Yin family paid their respects to Xia Yunqiu, they came to the Xu family. Qiao Xi’s uncle, Yin Yunyi, had a gloomy expression. Without saying anything, he rushed over and punched Xu Zhi.","“Xu Zhi, look at what your wife and adopted daughter have done! Xi Xi has finally returned, yet you actually let them bully Xi Xi like this. Your Xu family doesn’t want Xi Xi, but our Yin family wants her. She’s the eldest daughter of our Yin family. If anyone dares to bully her in the future, it’ll be equivalent to going against the Yin family!”","Xu Zhi’s face was livid. He did not dare to retort. He knew that the Yin family was coming and immediately went to welcome them while trembling in fear. Unexpectedly, he was still beaten up.","All these years, the Yin family and the Xu family had cut off all contact with them because of Xu Anran. At that time, Xu Zhi thought that Xu Anran was obedient and outstanding. The Xia family also liked her very much. Hence, he thought it was worth losing the Yin family for this daughter of his. However, he regretted it now.","Xu Zhi’s face flushed red as he said respectfully, “Patriarch Yin, our Xu family has never said that we don’t want Xi Xi. This is a misunderstanding. I’ve always doted on Xi Xi.”","Yin Yunyi had a serious expression and said in a cold voice, “Xu Zhi, perhaps others might believe this, but I don’t believe a word of it. I know too well what kind of person you are.","“Your mind is filled with benefits. Familial ties hold no significance to you. Whoever can bring you more benefits is your relative. You don’t want this daughter of yours, and the Yin family just happens to lack a daughter. We definitely won’t let her suffer any grievances and will sincerely dote on her.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Yin Yunyi threw a document in his hand at Xu Zhi’s feet.","“Xu Zhi, open it and see what your adopted daughter has done. I’ll definitely not let this matter go!”","Xu Zhi’s expression was ugly, but he did not care about his image anymore. He bent down and picked up the document. He flipped it open and looked at it. His mind buzzed.","Actually, Xu Zhi had long known that Xu Anran was not his biological daughter and sent someone to look for Qiao Xi. However, the results of the investigation back then revealed that Qiao Xi was stupid, naughty, ignorant, and incompetent. She was just a country bumpkin.","However, this information showed that Qiao Xi’s results had been outstanding since she was young. No matter what she learned, she was quick to pick it up. Moreover, she had very high artistic talent and was even called a little prodigy. It was precisely because Qiao Xi was outstanding and sensible that her brothers’ parents treated her as their biological daughter.","Yin Yunyi sneered. “All of you think that Qiao Xi is stupid and unworthy to be the daughter of the Xu family, but the Yin family doesn’t think so. No matter what, Xi Xi is still a child of our Yin family! Xu Zhi, from now on, you’ve already lost the chance to be Xi Xi’s father.”","Xu Zhi’s body went soft, and his eyes were filled with regret.","He wanted to love his daughter as well, but he did not want a stupid daughter. Now that he knew the truth, he realized how laughable he was. He believed Xu Anran’s fake information and missed out on his biological daughter for so many years.","At this moment, Xu Zhi could not help but doubt himself. Were benefits really that important? He watched as his daughter led a wandering life but turned a blind eye to it. He even doted on a fake daughter for so many years."]},{"number":668,"title":"Chapter 668 - The Reason I Hate Her","paragraphs":["On the other hand, Qiao Xi raised her eyes to look at Gu Zheng. When he brought Song Shiyu in, Qiao Xi thought that he had returned to normal. However, when she met his eyes, she knew that he was still the emotionless Gu Zheng.","Since he had no feelings for her, why would he help her?","The man sensed her gaze and slowly walked toward her. He held her hand gently. He wanted everyone to know that Gu Zheng’s love for Qiao Xi was real and not just for show.","At that moment, Xu Anran was in the middle of the crowd. She was surrounded by malicious intent. She was so afraid that her entire body was trembling. She did not dare to look at the crowd’s disdainful and angry gazes.","Everyone knew that the Xu family was holding this banquet to choose a good man for Xu Anran. Xu Anran was an A-list celebrity and a top socialite. She had the Xu family and the Xia family backing her up. Many people wanted to marry her.","Now that this matter was exposed, the scions who were originally chatting with Xu Anran all avoided her. Their eyes were filled with disgust. This difference made Xu Anran almost go crazy.","Previously, those men would always surround her. If she was in a good mood, she would give them some attention. If she was not in the mood, she would ignore them. Now, they were the ones who despised her?","Xia Yunlou suppressed the anger in her heart and gritted her teeth. “Xi Xi, I was just angry! I’m your mother! Of course, all I do is for your own good. I just don’t want you to go too far and offend others.”","Gu Zheng’s gaze landed on her, and the banquet hall was silent.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. She knew that Xia Yunlou would not admit her mistake just like that and would definitely continue putting up a struggle. Since that was the case, she would play with Xia Yunlou.","Xia Yunlou’s mind was a mess. She did not have time to think and could only defend herself. If she could not explain herself clearly, then she and Anran would be doomed!","“I admit that I like Anran more, but why don’t you reflect on yourself to find out the reason? It’s because you’re unwilling to get close to me that you’ve made me sad again and again.","“It’s not just me. Anyi hates you too. That’s because ever since you came back, you’ve ruined the peace at home. You caused Anyi to be arrested. How could he like you?","“I thought that you would change over time, but I was wrong. You don’t have this family in your heart at all!”","Xia Yunlou cried bitterly in grief. Her hair was messy, and her dress was stained with red wine. She was in a sorry state. Such a scene was broadcasted live.","When they heard this, everyone was slightly puzzled. Why did Madam Xu and Young Master Xu both like the adopted Xu Anran but hated Qiao Xi? What exactly happened? Could it be that Qiao Xi had really done something wrong to them?","“Madam Xu is right. No one would hate someone for no reason. Moreover, Qiao Xi is their blood-related relative. Logically speaking, it’s easier to accept her, but the Xu family doesn’t like her at all. Is there a reason for this?”","Xia Yunlou heaved a sigh of relief. She would not tell everyone the reason she hated Qiao Xi. It was all because of that woman. She was already dead, yet this woman had a similar face to her!","The first time she saw Qiao Xi’s photo, Xia Yunlou could not help but tremble. Qiao Xi’s face was too similar to Xia Yunqiu’s. Not only did they look alike, but even her gaze and aura were identical.","Xu Anran’s eyes were red as she bit her lip. “Xi Xi, we didn’t want to say anything and didn’t want to make things worse, but you...”","Xia Yunlou continued to cry. “You’re my daughter, so how could I not dote on you?! But what have you done? You blame us for not liking you, but why don’t you realize your own problems?”","As soon as she finished speaking, the door of the banquet hall was pushed open. First, a group of well-trained bodyguards rushed in and opened up a path. Then, a few young juniors helped a middle-aged noblewoman in. The noblewoman was wearing a blood jade. She looked noble and had an outstanding aura. She crushed all the noblewomen present the moment she appeared.","When Xia Yunlou saw the noblewoman, her body instantly trembled. She had not seen Old Madam Yin for many years, but she had not changed at all. She was still so young. It was impossible to tell that she was in her 60s.","Old Madam Yin glanced around with a gloomy gaze and said word by word, “The Xu family doesn’t like Xi Xi, so they think it’s Xi Xi’s fault?”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with horror as she stammered, “No, no...”","Everyone discussed in low voices. “Who’s this woman?”"]},{"number":669,"title":"Chapter 669 - All The Wealthy Families In Luo City Have To Respect Her","paragraphs":["“This woman is unfamiliar to me, but I know who that serious man is. He’s the head of the Yin family, Yin Yunyi. His surname was originally Xia, and he’s Old Madam Yin and Mr. Xia Cheng’s eldest son. After Old Madam Yin divorced, she brought her children back to the Yin family. Xia Yunyi changed his name to Yin Yunyi and even became the head of the Yin family.”","“You mean this gentleman is Madam Xu’s biological brother? Then this madam must be Xia Yunlou’s mother, Old Madam Yin? They’re both from the Yin family?”","Everyone gasped when they heard this. The Yin family was gathered here. What were they doing?","Old Madam Yin’s expression was calm. “It’s the Xu family’s fault that the Xu family doesn’t like Xi Xi? Xi Xi is not in the wrong here! Xia Yunlou, cut the crap. It doesn’t matter if you don’t want Xi Xi. In any case, it’s enough that Xi Xi is favored by the Yin family. She’s the only daughter of the Yin family, so why should she snatch the position of the eldest daughter of the Xu family?”","“Xi Xi doesn’t need to compete with anyone. She doesn’t need to take your small Xu family seriously. As long as she wants it, the Yin family can give anything to her. How can she take a liking to your Xu family?","“From now on, Xi Xi is the eldest daughter of the Yin family. All the wealthy families in Luo City have to respect her. Why would she snatch the position of the eldest daughter of the Xu family from Xu Anran?”","Old Madam Yin’s cold expression faded as she smiled affectionately. “Xi Xi, quick, come to my side.”","Everyone widened their eyes in shock. They heard that the Xu family hated Qiao Xi because she had offended everyone before she even joined the family, so the Xu family was unwilling to accept her.","Now, Old Madam Yin had brought the descendants of the Yin family over to support Qiao Xi. She even announced to the world that Qiao Xi was the eldest daughter of the Yin family, and she looked down on the small Xu family.","Whether it was power or wealth, the Xu family was far from being the Yin family’s match. The Yin family had been at their peak for hundreds of years, but the Xu family had always been mediocre. Now that their company was facing difficulties, the two families could not be compared at all.","Moreover, not only did Qiao Xi have the Yin family behind her, but she also had Gu Zheng. These two enormous powers were both supporting Qiao Xi, so who would dare to go against her?","Almost everyone knew the inside story of Xia Yunlou cutting ties with Old Madam Yin. At that time, Xia Yunlou was even living together with Xia Cheng’s mistress. She even called that mistress her mother. After Old Madam Yin divorced, Xia Yunlou insisted on living with the mistress. This caused Old Madam Yin to be completely heartbroken, so she cut off all contact with her daughter.","At this moment, Xia Yunlou’s eyes were empty, and her heart was filled with hatred. Why were her mother and brother helping Qiao Xi?","Just as everyone was silent, a crisp slap sounded. Xu Zhi rushed forward and slapped Xu Anran hard. Xu Anran was thrown to the ground by the sudden slap, and her cheek instantly became red and swollen.","“You b*tch!”","Seeing this, Xia Yunlou immediately rushed over to protect Xu Anran and shouted, “Hubby! What are you doing?!”","Xu Zhi’s eyes were red as he gritted his teeth and asked, “Xu Anran, you were the one who gave me the information six years ago that stated Xi Xi is naughty, willful, and stupid. You said that if she returned to the Xu family, she’d only make the aristocrats laugh at the Xu family. This is what you said, right?!”","Old Madam Yin’s gaze turned cold. So, they already knew Xi Xi’s whereabouts six years ago?","At this moment, Xu Zhi could not care about the consequences. He only wanted to vent the anger in his heart. He also regretted being muddle-headed back then and not immediately bringing Xi Xi back. If it were not for Xu Anran interfering, perhaps their family would have been reunited a long time ago.","“Xia Yunlou, is this matter related to you? Do you know why Xi Xi suddenly disappeared six years ago?”","Hearing Xu Zhi’s question, Xia Yunlou was a little flustered. “It’s all because of her stubborn character. Who knows where she went? Maybe she was with a man—”","Smack!","Xu Zhi raised his hand and slapped Xia Yunlou hard.","“Let me tell you, it was Xu Anran who changed Xi Xi’s information and made us think that she’s stupid and naughty. In fact, Xi Xi is talented and smart. She participated in various international competitions and even won championships as young as 14 years old! She’s also the goddaughter of the Shen, Qin, and Xue families!","“She didn’t disappear because she did something bad. Moreover, Xu Anran deliberately concealed her information and even sent a group of hooligans to bully her in an attempt to ruin her innocence.”","Qiao Xi reacted. This had indeed happened when she was 14 years old. At that time, a few hooligans came to look for trouble with her. Her eldest brother beat them up until they were half-dead, so his career was affected. Hence, he left the entertainment industry and went overseas."]},{"number":670,"title":"Chapter 670 - I Want To Divorce You!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi did not expect that those people were sent by Xu Anran. It turned out that Xu Anran had already secretly attacked her six years ago. At that time, she was only 14 years old, yet she already had such vicious thoughts.","“If Xi Xi was not lucky enough to meet these nobles, she would have died at Xu Anran’s hands long ago! However, you helped Xu Anran, this criminal, to bully your daughter! You’re a fool!” Xu Zhi roared.","Everyone looked at Xia Yunlou with disdain. Although Xu Zhi had done something wrong, he was repenting now. He still had his biological daughter in his heart, but Xia Yunlou was really not worthy to be a mother!","“Nonsense! Why would Anran do such a thing? Even if she did, it’s Qiao Xi’s fault. She was the one who wanted to snatch Anran’s things. Anran did it to protect herself!”","Xia Yunlou cried loudly and continued speaking up for Xu Anran.","“Back then, you agreed not to let Qiao Xi come back. I did it for the Xu family! Qiao Xi is just a wild girl. How is she worthy to be the eldest daughter of the Xu family? Only an outstanding child like Anran is qualified to be the daughter of the Xu family! Now, everyone’s laughing at us!”","Xu Zhi was stunned for a moment. He looked at Xia Yunlou in disbelief. He suddenly felt that the woman in front of him was very unfamiliar. Was this woman who had been with him for half his life really his wife?","At this point, she was actually still blaming Qiao Xi?","Xia Yunlou cried non-stop. “She’s just a country bumpkin. Even if she returns to the Xu family, she can’t replace Anran’s identity. As long as she knows her place and listens to me, of course, I’ll dote on her. However, she caused so much trouble and made me, her biological mother, lose my dignity! She’s unfilial!","“Since the two children were replaced back then, then things should have just stayed that way. Why did she come back? If she died, all of this wouldn’t have happened!”","Xia Yunlou looked at Qiao Xi with vicious eyes and wished for nothing more than to kill her.","Xu Zhi did not expect Xia Yunlou to say such a thing. She was Xi Xi’s biological mother. She actually cursed her daughter to die?","He was furious to the extreme and felt weak all over. However, his voice calmed down. “You mean Xi Xi should be left to wander outside? She shouldn’t have returned from the beginning, right?”","Xu Zhi looked at Xu Anran in disgust. “You think so too? Do you think Xi Xi will snatch everything from you if she comes back?”","Hearing Xu Zhi’s calm voice, Xia Yunlou’s heart beat violently. She had a bad feeling.","She hated Qiao Xi and her face. She did not want a wild girl to ruin their originally blissful lives. What was wrong with that?","“Alright!”","Xu Zhi roared. At this moment, he had already made an important decision. This was the first time in his life that he did not care about benefits and consequences. He just wanted to seek justice for his daughter.","“I’m the head of the Xu family. I have the right to decide whether anyone should stay or leave.”","Xu Zhi straightened his back and said word by word, “Xia Yunlou, we’re getting a divorce! Get out of the Xu family with Xu Anran. From now on, the two of you have nothing to do with the Xu family anymore. It’s not up to you to decide who the eldest daughter of the Xu family is!”","Boom!!!","The surroundings were in an uproar, while Qiao Xi widened her eyes in shock. She could not help but look at the man beside her, and the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up.","These words were like a bolt of lightning that struck everyone’s hearts. The banquet hall was silent. After a long time, Xia Yunlou asked in a trembling voice, “Xu... Xu Zhi, you... Repeat what you just said...”","Seeing that the situation was not right, the filming team already turned off the live broadcast.","Xu Zhi suddenly felt much better after saying it. Perhaps he had been wrong since the beginning. He should not have married Xia Yunlou. Now, divorce was a form of release.","His tone was calm. “I want to divorce you.”","Xia Yunlou felt as if she had been struck by lightning. She shouted like a shrew, “Xu Zhi! You want to divorce me? No! I won’t allow it! I don’t agree!”","For Qiao Xi, her husband wanted her to divorce her? Was it because of Qiao Xi’s face?","Back then, when she first met Xu Zhi, she fell in love with him at first sight. However, Xu Zhi was her sister’s fiancé. She was jealous and resentful of her. She used all means to snatch this man over and become Madam Xu. She was obedient to this man and yearned to obtain his love. However, he was going to divorce her now?","Xia Yunlou felt weak all over. She slid from the sofa to the floor, her face filled with unwillingness and anger.","“Xu Zhi! Touch your heart and ask yourself. If it weren’t for me, would the Xu family be where they are today? The Xia family has helped the Xu family for so many years and survived so many difficulties. Now, you’re actually abandoning me?”"]},{"number":671,"title":"Chapter 671 - Are You Still Yunlou?","paragraphs":["Xu Zhi’s eyes were filled with disgust. He did not want to continue wasting his breath on her. He roared, “Let’s divorce immediately! Get out of the Xu family with Xu Anran! Don’t let me see you again!”","Qiao Xi looked at the scene before her with a calm expression.","Xia Yunlou’s heart felt like it had turned into ashes. She spent so much effort to finally marry this man. She gave him children and they led happy lives. How did she end up like this?","She knelt on the floor and crawled to Old Madam Yin’s feet. She cried out, “Mom! Can you help me? I can’t get a divorce! Everything I’ve done is for the Xu family! Why can’t Xi Xi accept Anran? If she had gotten along well with An An, so many things wouldn’t have happened!”","Old Madam Yin’s gaze was cold. Yin Yunyi’s wife said coldly, “Yunlou, you forced Mom to accept that mistress back then. Now, you’re asking Xi Xi to accept the vicious Xu Anran. You really won’t change!”","The woman’s face was filled with mockery, but because the guests were all present, she did not continue.","Hearing these words, Xia Yunlou instantly went mad. “Sister-in-law! I’ve always treated you well! I’m always respectful every time I see you. Now, you’re actually speaking up for Qiao Xi?","“Qiao Xi is a jinx. She has already harmed the Xu family and will do the same to the Yin family in the future. All of you will definitely regret it!”","Gu Zheng’s eyes suddenly turned cold.","At this moment, Xu Zhi’s lawyer walked in with a divorce agreement in his hand. Xu Zhi took the agreement and threw it in front of Xia Yunlou. “Sign it!”","Xia Yunlou’s face was pale as tears trickled down her face. Now that her mother and brother were protecting Qiao Xi, her daughter and son had no right to speak. Her husband did not want her anymore either. How did she end up like this?","“No! I won’t sign it! I’m the daughter of the Xia family, and I’m also half a member of the Yin family. What right do you have to divorce me? Mom, Brother, help me! I’m also your family member!”","Xia Yunlou roared like a lunatic. The veins on her neck were bulging.","All the guests present widened their eyes. They were originally here to attend the banquet, but they did not expect to encounter such a scene.","The Yin family naturally would not pity Xia Yunlou. She was the one who brought this upon herself. It was only right that she paid the price for her actions!","Old Madam Yin revealed a loving expression. “Xi Xi, let’s go.”","Seeing that the Yin family was leaving, the guests also bade farewell. Only the Xu family was left in the large banquet hall. Xu Zhi now knew how many bad things Xia Yunlou and Xu Anran had done behind her back, so he had to divorce Xia Yunlou no matter what.","“I won’t sign it! I’ll never divorce you!” Xia Yunlou sat on the floor and screamed like a shrew.","Xu Zhi’s face was full of fatigue as he said helplessly, “You refuse to get a divorce, right? Then I’ll see you in court. I’ll fight in court with you until we’re divorced! Move out for the time being!”","Xia Yunlou fell to the floor weakly. Her mind was buzzing, and her heart was filled with unwillingness. Everything she did was for the Xu family. What right did Xu Zhi have to abandon her?","Yin Yunyi stood at the door and was in no rush to leave. He said casually, “Xia Yunlou.”","Xia Yunlou’s eyes were filled with tears. She used her last bit of strength to crawl in front of Yin Yunyi and grab his pants. He begged, “Brother! Although we haven’t seen each other for so many years, you’re my biological brother! You can’t just watch me die!”","Yin Yunyi frowned and looked at her with a complicated expression. “Are you still Yunlou?”","Boom!!!","The banquet hall was silent. Xia Yunlou’s pupils suddenly constricted as she looked at Yin Yunyi with horror in her eyes. Her voice trembled violently. “I... Of course, I’m Yunlou! You suspected me before this. Didn’t... Didn’t you already do a DNA test?”","Yin Yunyi smiled sarcastically. “Xia Yunlou, take care of yourself.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he turned around and left. Xia Yunlou was trembling and breaking out in a cold sweat. She muttered, “It’s her! She’s back!","“She has come to look for me. As long as she comes back, I’m doomed!”","...","Qiao Xi came to the Xu family today for the sake of severing ties with Xia Yunlou and exposing her hypocritical nature. She really hated Xia Yunlou for using her mother’s name to commit crimes just to snatch her mother’s inheritance.","Old Madam Yin held Qiao Xi’s hand and smiled gently. “Xi Xi, this is your uncle, Yin Yunyi. This is your aunt, Shi Qinglian. She was also your mother’s friend.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes. Shi Qinglian looked very elegant. Her name suited her well. She had the demeanor of a noble and proud lotus flower. She looked at Xia Xi affectionately. “Xi Xi, you’ve suffered terribly all these years.”"]},{"number":672,"title":"Chapter 672 - Lotus Lanterns Can Express One’s Longing","paragraphs":["Suddenly, Shi Qinglian’s eyes turned red. She said sadly, “Actually, it’s my fault. If I were a little smarter back then, Xia Yunlou wouldn’t have been able to snatch Yunqiu’s fiance, causing her to leave her hometown.”","At the mention of Xia Yunqiu, the eyes of the Yin family were filled with sorrow. Old Madam Yin took a deep breath. “Xi Xi, Yunqiu isn’t around anymore. Fortunately, you’re here.”","The Yin family also came forward to comfort Qiao Xi. Qiao Xi, who had grown up in the Qiao family since she was young, had never received such care and love. Her heart was warm.","Whether it was the Qiao family or the Xu family, they were both her nominal homes. However, they did not give her any real warmth. The Yin family gave her true kinship.","After bidding farewell to the Yin family, Yin Jingting personally drove them back to Longwan Residential. Gu Zheng saw that she did not speak along the way and did not disturb her.","This Gu Zheng had no emotions, nor did he have any relatives that he missed. He naturally could not understand Qiao Xi’s sorrow, but he understood that Qiao Xi must be very sad at this moment.","...","At 10 p.m.","Qiao Xi had already gotten into bed and was about to sleep when there was a knock on the door. Song Shiyu asked softly, “Young Madam, the president wants to take you out. He told you to wear more layers as it’s cold at night.”","Qiao Xi nodded and got up from the bed. It was already so late. Why did Gu Zheng want to bring her out?","The two of them got into the car. Neither of them spoke on the way. Seeing the car driving farther and farther away, Qiao Xi could not help but ask, “Where are we going?”","Gu Zheng opened his icy-cold eyes that were like deep spring water without the slightest ripple of emotion. However, when he faced Qiao Xi, a trace of gentleness surged into his eyes. “We’re almost there.”","The car slowly stopped, and Qiao Xi raised her eyes. It turned out to be a quiet courtyard. It was truly rare for there to be such a clean courtyard in the wilderness.","Gu Zheng looked up and concealed his fluctuating emotions. “A long time ago, this was the residence of a family. As the courtyard was exquisite and the environment was pleasant, it later became an open space. There were people who lived here and cleaned the place every day. There’s a lotus pond in the backyard. Every year, people will come here to set afloat a lotus lantern. I heard that if you write a message on the lantern for your family and set the lantern afloat on the pond, the lantern will go where the water takes it while carrying your thoughts for your loved ones.”","Qiao Xi’s eyes abruptly widened. Didn’t this Gu Zheng have no emotions? How could he believe such a thing?","He was abused in Maple Garden since he was young. He had no relatives or companions by his side, so he could only grit his teeth and endure all hardships. To him, this kind of thing should be nonsense because he only believed in strength.","However, he actually brought her to the lotus pond and even said these words. It caused Qiao Xi to even suspect that Gu Zheng had recovered.","Gu Zheng held Qiao Xi’s hand and led her to the backyard. The lotus lanterns were already prepared. Qiao Xi chose a lantern and wrote a few words on a piece of paper. She gently placed the lantern on the surface of the water and watched it float away.","“Ah Zheng, besides carrying your longing for your family, you can also make wishes. Aren’t you going to set a lantern afloat as well?” Qiao Xi asked.","When Gu Zheng heard this, he raised his eyes slightly. He did not seem to have any wishes. The young Gu Zheng hoped that someone could save him from that cage in Maple Garden, but later on, he gradually became stronger and became without desires.","Originally, Gu Zheng needed him because Gu Zheng was too weak at that time. He needed a powerful persona to break through those dark shackles. After Gu Zheng gradually became stronger, he no longer needed him.","His eyes lowered. “That’s unnecessary.”","He only appeared when Gu Zheng was weak. His time was very short. He did not know when he would disappear, but before he disappeared, he would definitely protect Qiao Xi.","Now that the Yin family was supporting Qiao Xi, even if he really vanished and Gu Zheng returned, Qiao Xi would not be bullied anymore.","In short, as long as he was around, he would protect her.","...","The two of them returned to Longwan Residential, and Qiao Xi went upstairs to rest.","Seeing that Qiao Xi had returned to her bedroom, Song Shiyu immediately asked in horror, “President, did you and Young Madam quarrel? Why are you sleeping in separate rooms?”","Gu Zheng frowned. When he just woke up, Qiao Xi was indeed sleeping in the master bedroom with him. However, she moved back to her room the next day. He thought that it was normal for them to sleep in separate rooms.","The next second, Song Shiyu said with disdain, “President, you and Young Madam have only been married for a short while, but Young Madam is already sick of you. Are you not good in that aspect? You have to go to the hospital if you’re facing problems!”"]},{"number":673,"title":"Chapter 673 - The President Hasn’t Deducted My Salary For A Long Time","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng was very clearly aware of his body. He was very healthy, but what puzzled him was whether he and Qiao Xi had slept on the same bed before this?","“In the past... we would sleep together?”","Song Shiyu looked shocked. “President, have you lost your memory? You’re husband and wife, so of course, the two of you slept together!”","Sleep together? But didn’t Gu Zheng not like Qiao Xi? If that was the case, why did they sleep together? Did they have to act at home and pretend to be loving even in front of Song Shiyu?","If they had been sleeping on the same bed, why did Qiao Xi suddenly want to move back? Had she noticed something, or had Gu Zheng done a good job of hiding the truth?","Gu Zheng thought that he should ask Song Shijing. He was his personal assistant and should know the inside story.","Unexpectedly, just as he was about to leave, Song Shiyu rushed over and stopped him. “President, you’ve been acting so strange recently!”","Gu Zheng looked up. “What’s wrong?”","Song Shiyu looked pensive, then widened his eyes in shock. “I said that you’re facing problems in that aspect, but you’re not angry? You haven’t deducted my salary for a long time!”","The living room was silent. Seeing Song Shiyu’s shocked expression, Gu Zheng frowned again. Had Gu Zheng always deducted his subordinate’s salary?","Gu Zheng secretly made up his mind and said, “Don’t worry, I won’t deduct your salary in the future.”","As soon as he finished speaking, he walked to the bedroom, but his footsteps stopped before Qiao Xi’s bedroom door.","The corridor was dark. Gu Zheng knew that the other Gu Zheng was afraid of the dark, so even though it was late at night, the corridor of Longwan Residential would still be lit. This seemed to have become a habit for the servants, but now that the lights in the corridor were switched off, the entire villa was dark.","In the past, Gu Zheng was used to bright lights. Now that the villa was so dark, did no one find it strange?","Gu Zheng took out his phone and called Song Shijing.","Song Shijing was shocked. “President, haven’t you recovered? Has the poison acted up again?”","Previously, the president could not see in the dark, but Young Madam seemed to have already cured the poison in the president’s body. Although the president had not fully recovered, he could at least see in the dark.","Gu Zheng’s mind was slightly chaotic. He seemed to have lost some of his memories. Could it be that Gu Zheng’s poison had already been cured? It was Qiao Xi who cured him?","Gu Zheng did not ask further. It was as if he already had the answer in his heart. Qiao Xi being willing to save Gu Zheng meant that their relationship was not bad. Was that man really not good to her? Perhaps he had misunderstood.","At this moment, he felt that he had lost the reason to exist. Previously, his existence was to protect Qiao Xi. He would not let Qiao Xi be bullied, but now that he knew the truth, should he still continue to occupy this body?","...","The next morning.","Gu Zheng slowly opened his eyes, which gradually recovered their clarity. He did not know why, but he felt inexplicably sad as if he had lost something.","He reached out to touch the other side of the bed. Xi Xi was not by his side. There was no warmth in the bed at all. She seemed to have left very early.","Gu Zheng got dressed and came out of the bedroom when he bumped into Song Shiyu.","Song Shiyu thought of what the president had said about not deducting his salary in the future and said slyly, “President, you were alone on the empty bed and could sleep until now. Did you do something bad last night?”","Gu Zheng said expressionlessly, “Song Shiyu.”","“Huh?”","“How long has it been since I last deducted your salary?”","Song Shiyu: “???” Didn’t he say that he wouldn’t deduct his salary anymore? The president wasn’t keeping his word!","Gu Zheng pursed his lips and asked, “Why did Young Madam return to the second bedroom?”","Hearing his question, Song Shiyu said with disdain, “I wanted to ask you that! Young Madam moved back a week ago. You must have made her angry. What did you do wrong? Tell me and I’ll help you think of a way to make her forgive you.”","A week ago? But they slept together just last night!","Gu Zheng suddenly felt that something was wrong. A trace of nervousness flashed past his eyes.","Did Qiao Xi move out of the master bedroom because she found out that there was another personality in his body?","In the past, every time that personality appeared, it was because he was being bullied or he was in danger. Why did it suddenly occupy his body this time?","At this moment, Qiao Xi walked out of the room and sized up Gu Zheng. She could not help but be stunned.","“Gu Zheng?” Qiao Xi met his eyes and could feel the gentleness and emotions overflowing from them. Her eyes burned as she ran over excitedly and pounced into his embrace. “Ah Zheng!”"]},{"number":674,"title":"Chapter 674 - Xi Xi, I’m Back","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng was knocked back a few steps by his beautiful wife. His face was filled with a gentle smile. “Xi Xi, I’m back.”","Qiao Xi had indeed not expected that Gu Zheng would suddenly return. She originally thought that he would fall ill or something, but he was only gone for a while before coming back.","Gu Zheng waved his hand and got Song Shiyu to leave. He asked in a low voice, “You knew... that he wasn’t me?”","Qiao Xi choked slightly. “Of course, I know. You’re different from him.”","Generally speaking, other personalities in one’s body would be different from the original owner, but Gu Zheng’s second personality was a little similar to him. His tone and charm were similar. As the person closest to him, though, Qiao Xi could still tell the difference.","Gu Zheng said slowly, “When I was young, I lived in Maple Garden. It was dark and cold there. I knew that I was poisoned. It was because of the darkness that I lost my eyesight, so I was very afraid of the dark. After that, I lost my memory one time. I forgot that I was poisoned and was no longer afraid of the dark.”","Qiao Xi seemed to understand that the Gu Zheng with another personality was just the same person but with a muddled memory. Because their memories were different, their personalities were different.","One was the strong Gu Zheng who was afraid of the dark, while the other was the emotionless and fearless him. However, they were both him.","Actually, Gu Zheng did not understand why the other personality would suddenly appear and stay for a week. It seemed that he was already used to his body but he still left silently.","The man turned around and went to the study. He took out an old box from a drawer. There was a piece of yellow paper inside. The handwriting on it varied from crooked and clumsy to neat. In the past, the two would talk to each other by doing this.","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment before picking up a pen and writing on the paper.","...","In the Yin family.","Yin Yunyi threw the report on the floor, her eyes filled with unwillingness.","Shi Qinglian was puzzled. “Could she really be Yunlou?”","Yin Yunyi’s expression was gloomy. “That’s impossible. Back then, Yunlou was kind and timid. She was very close to Yunqiu. The two sisters had to sleep together every night and never quarreled. So when Yunlou wanted to leave with her father, Yunqiu cried for a long time.","“After Yunlou left, the two of them contacted each other frequently and called each other almost every day. I don’t believe that a person’s character would suddenly change so drastically. She even turned against her good sister!","“Moreover, Yunlou promised us that she would come back home. Unexpectedly, when we went to pick her up, she suddenly changed her mind and even chased us out.","“Ever since then, she seemed to have changed into a different person. Yunqiu called her many times, but she never picked up the calls. After that, Yunqiu gave up as well and we stopped seeing each other.”","Shi Qinglian said, “Actually... I think it’s strange too. I saw Yunlou when I was young. Although she was young, she was obedient and sensible. She’s like a different person from the current her. Other than her face and her DNA, Yunlou doesn’t look like Yunlou at all.”","Yin Yunyi exuded killing intent. “If she’s not Yunlou, it’s possible for her to fake that face, but how did she fake her DNA as well?”","Shi Qinglian did not understand what was going on either. The Shi family and the Yin family were old friends. After she came of age, she married Yin Yunyi and had a good relationship with the Yin family. She also treated Yunlou as her family. At this moment, she was a little worried. If this Xia Yunlou was fake, where did the real Yunlou go?","Actually, it was not easy to change one’s face. Yunlou was still a child back then. It was unrealistic to have plastic surgery. Moreover, there were no traces of it on Xia Yunlou’s face.","Shi Qinglian was silent for a moment. Then, she became shocked. “Yunyi, do you think it’s possible that someone changed the DNA results? Although the possibility of that is very low—","“There’s another possibility. That person’s face is exactly the same as Yunlou’s, so she occupied Yunlou’s identity.”","Yin Yunyi’s body trembled as if he had been struck by lightning. He frowned. “Don’t spout nonsense about this for now. I’ll get someone to continue watching the Xu family. There might be clues.”","Shi Qinglian nodded and asked, “Then, are you going to interfere in Xu Zhi’s divorce from Xia Yunlou?”","Yin Yunyi replied without hesitation, “That’s the Xu family’s matter. I don’t have to interfere. Since they’re getting a divorce, then let them get a divorce. Otherwise, Xu Anran and Xia Yunlou will always make things difficult for Xi Xi.”","He had a feeling that the truth of what had been troubling the Yin family for so many years was about to be revealed."]},{"number":675,"title":"Chapter 675 - She Wouldn’t Let It Go!","paragraphs":["Longwan Residential.","Qiao Xi received a phone call. “Little Six, I’ve already sent someone to investigate. The person who drove the truck to hit you and President Gu was Qiao Rou. I’ve compared her DNA to the female corpse in the truck. I’m sure it’s her.”","It was really her?","Qiao Xi said, “It’s the same as the results of the official investigation!”","Qin An said, “I was afraid that others would do something, so I personally investigated this matter. It’s already been confirmed. The police have already closed the case.”","Actually, Qiao Xi knew clearly in her heart that Qiao Rou was just a chess piece. The masterminds were Huang Lilan and Lu Yan. They were the ones who instructed Qiao Rou to do all of that. However, there was something very strange about it. Why would a person like Qiao Rou, who was so afraid of death, give up her life for revenge?","Lu Yan and Huang Lilan... Neither of them could escape!","“Little Six, Teacher said that he made a few new dishes for you to try at Qingyuan Pavilion. He hasn’t seen you in a long time. He misses you a little,” said Qin An.","Qiao Xi nodded with a smile. She and Gu Zheng had gone to Qingyuan Pavilion before. The environment there was indeed very good, and the food there was not bad either. Hence, it was difficult to get a table. Even if they wanted to eat here, they had to book a table a few days in advance.","It had been a long time since she last saw her teacher. She could ask her teacher what was going on with the other personality in Gu Zheng’s body.","After hanging up, Gu Yao sent a message. Gu Yao said that the Xia family had sent someone to pick up Xia Yunlou and Xu Anyi, but they left Xu Anran in Li City. After all, Xu Anran had nothing to do with the Xia family. The Xia family also thought that it was better to avoid trouble. They did not care about her life or death.","Gu Yao: [Qiao Xi, I have something to tell you. My mother knows that my brother was in a car accident and wants my brother to go home to rest for a few days. What do you think she means by this? She definitely doesn’t care about Gu Zheng! But now, she wants him to go back and even called Shen Ying back.]","Qiao Xi asked: [What else did the Gu family say?]","Gu Yao replied: [Nothing much. They just said that Gu Zheng was in a car accident because of you and that those people were after you. They’re trying to slander you!]","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. The Gu family would naturally not admit that this matter was related to them, but she would not let this matter go.","She curled her lips. “Butler, help me pack my things. I want to go to the Gu family too.”","The butler looked terrified. “Madam, are you sure? The president thought that you didn’t want to go back, so he left first.”","Qiao Xi frowned. That bastard had returned to the Gu family himself and didn’t even tell her?","...","At the Gu family’s old residence.","“Ah Zheng, you’re really lucky. You survived such a serious car accident. It’s all Qiao Xi’s fault. If it’s not because she always offends others, she wouldn’t have implicated you and got you injured!”","Huang Lilan held a tissue in her hand and wiped her tears. “Ah Zheng, I know you blame me for being close to Lu Yan, but no matter what, I’m your mother. How could I harm you?!”","Gu Zheng was resting with his eyes closed when he suddenly opened them. He had actually woken up again?","He had already fallen into a deep sleep, but he woke up when he heard this woman’s nagging. It was so annoying!","This Huang Lilan was vicious and merciless. She locked him in Maple Garden since he was young and scolded him at every turn. Now that she was pretending in front of everyone, was she trying to salvage her image?","Gu Zheng really did not understand why that man came to the Gu family’s old residence. Was he here to see her act?","He touched his suit pocket and found a folded piece of paper. He remembered this. This was the way he talked to Gu Zheng. They would write messages on a piece of paper so that the other person could read them when they reappeared.","Actually, he knew that he was a part of Gu Zheng. He was not an independent person but a personality that existed in Gu Zheng’s body. Gu Zheng no longer needed him, and Qiao Xi no longer needed him either. Why did he still appear?","If others found out about this secret, they would definitely treat Gu Zheng as a monster. He did not want to see this happen!","Gu Zheng’s mind was a mess. He pursed his lips and suppressed the frustration in his heart.","Seeing that Gu Zheng was silent, Huang Lilan hurriedly pulled Shen Ying forward. “Ah Zheng, I know you like Qiao Xi, but it’s too dangerous to be with her. You should stay in the old residence for this period of time! You’re in your prime and can’t be without someone to serve you, so I got Shen Ying to accompany you. She still likes you, so she’ll definitely take good care of you.”"]},{"number":676,"title":"Chapter 676 - This Bastard Is Rebelling!","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng looked at the young woman in front of him as a memory surfaced in his mind. He knew this woman.","Huang Lilan continued, “Shen Ying has a gentle character. She won’t become enemies with others, so she won’t drag you down. Moreover, you know that she has liked you since you were young. She has always been obedient to you. With your current status, it’s normal for you to have a few women outside. Qiao Xi should accept this fact.”","Gu Zheng looked up in surprise. Did Huang Lilan think it was normal to be a mistress just because she was a mistress?","If it were Gu Zheng, he might have left expressionlessly, but he would not let them off easily. He wanted to turn the Gu family upside down!","Gu Zheng smiled indifferently. “Miss Shen, you like me? You even said that you wanted to be my secretary back then, right?”","Shen Ying looked shy and said delicately, “President Gu, I do like you. I want to take care of you. It’s fine if you think I’m not worthy to be your secretary. I can still serve you well.","“I won’t affect your normal life, nor will I threaten Miss Qiao’s position. I just want to accompany you. President Gu, please give me a chance. I’ll make you satisfied.”","Hearing Shen Ying’s words, Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. His deep eyes were filled with smiles as he sized up the woman in front of him. It made Shen Ying’s heart pound.","Gu Zheng said casually, “Since you want to take care of me so much, then pack your things and follow me back to Longwan Residential!”","Shen Ying was surprised and happy. “President Gu, don’t worry. I’ll definitely take good care of you!”","Qiao Xi had just arrived at the door when she heard their words. Was this bastard Gu Zheng rebelling?","Shen Ying glanced at Qiao Xi from the corners of her eyes and felt proud. She thought that President Gu loved Qiao Xi very much, but it turned out that he was just momentarily attracted to her.","Qiao Xi grew up in the countryside. She was uneducated and not gentle. President Gu only married her because he liked her face. Now that a long time had passed, of course, he started to hate her.","When she thought of how Qiao Xi had humiliated her back then, Shen Ying gritted her teeth in hatred. This time, she must take revenge and let Qiao Xi have a taste of being disfigured.","Shen Ying turned around slightly and pretended to be shocked. “Miss Qiao! Why are you here?! Don’t misunderstand. I just heard that President Gu needed to be taken care of for a while because you’re injured. I really didn’t mean anything else!”","Qiao Xi: “...” How fake could this woman be?","Gu Zheng frowned. “Cut the crap! Are we going to Longwan Residential or not?”","Shen Ying was extremely excited as she looked at Gu Zheng with a flattering expression, then she looked at Qiao Xi in horror. “But... But will Miss Qiao agree? If she...”","Huang Lilan looked fiercely at Qiao Xi. She had to agree to this matter. Gu Zheng looked cold on the surface, but he was someone who doted on his partner a lot. If he fell for Shen Ying, he would definitely listen to her. At that time, she could use Shen Ying to control Gu Zheng.","Shen Ying had been learning how to serve others during this period of time. As long as Gu Zheng gave her a chance, she was confident that she could make Gu Zheng fall in love with her and even abandon Qiao Xi to marry her.","Gu Zheng stood up impatiently and walked out the door first.","Shen Ying hurriedly followed and glanced at Qiao Xi who was beside her. She said gently, “Miss Qiao, don’t worry. I won’t snatch President Gu from you. I’m just going to take care of him.”","Qiao Xi looked at Gu Zheng and saw that his deep eyes were filled with disdain. He turned around to look at Huang Lilan and revealed a charming smile.","Why did this bastard’s smile make one’s hair stand on end?","Shen Ying looked at Qiao Xi’s puzzled expression with a proud look. Previously, in order to avenge Qiao Xi, President Gu let her be punished by her family and even mocked her.","Now, she was the woman President Gu cared about the most. Qiao Xi was just a mistress. The position of Mrs. Gu would be hers sooner or later. However, President Gu could not bear to chase Qiao Xi out due to their past relationship.","Seeing Shen Ying get into another car, Qiao Xi turned to look at Gu Zheng. She saw that his expression was indifferent as he personally opened the car door for her. “Mrs. Gu, let’s go.”","Qiao Xi looked at him in confusion and suddenly realized something.","Gu Zheng’s body stiffened slightly. She actually noticed it so quickly. It seemed that she could tell the difference between the two of them.","He took out the slip of paper from his pocket and took the opportunity to read it while Qiao Xi was getting into the car. There was only one sentence on it: [Tell her the truth.]","He held the paper tightly and almost tore it. He placed his burning palm on the steering wheel for a long time before taking a deep breath. He turned around and asked, “You know everything?”"]},{"number":677,"title":"Chapter 677 - A Servant Has So Much Nonsense To Say","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi gasped and did not know how to answer.","The man’s eyes were filled with complicated emotions. “I’m sorry, but I need to temporarily occupy his body. He’ll be back soon.”","The two of them were silent the entire way. When they got out of the car, they saw Shen Ying standing at the door with a smile.","Gu Zheng opened the car door for Qiao Xi and said softly, “I don’t know how I appeared either. I can only say that I didn’t do it on purpose, but he’ll probably come back to accompany you tonight.”","Qiao Xi looked at him in disbelief. “Is the other personality so obedient?”","Gu Zheng smiled and did not say anything, but there were some inexplicable emotions in his eyes.","In Qiao Xi’s understanding, dual personalities were formed by two different ways of thinking. Moreover, the two ways of thinking operated independently and were not affected by their counterpart. It could even be said that they were competitors. However, Gu Zheng’s two personalities were very similar in certain aspects. Moreover, there was no competition between the two of them. They seemed to be very close, but their memories were different.","“President Gu, you must be tired after driving, right? Let me give you a massage.”","Before Qiao Xi could figure out the reason, she heard a sweet voice. She suddenly recalled that Shen Ying was still standing at the door.","Speaking of which, why did Gu Zheng bring this woman back to Longwan Residential? Was he trying to create trouble for her?","Shen Ying specially wore a tight, slit dress that outlined her voluptuous figure. She followed Gu Zheng in arrogantly.","The servants in Longwan Residential had complicated expressions, but this was the president’s private matter. They could not interfere and were waiting for Gu Zheng’s instructions. Unexpectedly, he went upstairs and left Shen Ying downstairs.","Shen Ying was embarrassed. She looked at Qiao Xi, who was beside her, and her eyes were filled with provocation. “Miss Qiao, I’m also President Gu’s woman. You were the first to enter this family, so I’ll call you ‘Sister’ from now on. Can we talk?”","Qiao Xi’s expression was calm. “What’s there to talk about?”","Seeing that she was not angry, Shen Ying was a little surprised. Qiao Xi was calm, so she said with a proud expression, “I was sent by Madam Gu to serve President Gu. I’m sincere about my feelings for President Gu, so, of course, I’m more attentive than you. Miss Qiao, you occupied President Gu alone in the past. I hope you know who he dotes on now.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “So?”","The corners of Shen Ying’s mouth twitched slightly as she said coldly, “How can an outstanding man like President Gu only have one woman by his side? He did like you in the past, but now that the novelty has worn off, there’s nothing else to you. He brought me back to Longwan Residential, which means that the woman he likes now is me! If you’re sensible, you can still safely keep your position as Mrs. Gu. If you’re not sensible—”","Qiao Xi asked, “What can you do to me if I’m not sensible?”","Shen Ying said with a mocking expression, “Then you two can only get a divorce! Maybe President Gu won’t divorce you immediately because of your past relationship together, but he’ll definitely not be kind to you. You’ll still be the one getting hurt!","“Miss Qiao, I don’t want to go too far. As long as you’re respectful to me, I won’t make things difficult for you. I’ll even put in a few good words for you in front of President Gu to help you keep your position as Mrs. Gu.”","“What’s considered respectful?” asked Qiao Xi.","Shen Ying sat on the sofa with her legs crossed. She pointed at the teapot on the table. “Go! Get me a cup of iced coffee with no sugar. I want some pastries too. Don’t make them too sweet. Also—”","“Shen Ying.” At this moment, a man’s cold voice came from upstairs.","Shen Ying shuddered and looked up shyly. It seemed that President Gu wanted her to serve him. It was still broad daylight. It seemed that he had a lot of desires!","Gu Zheng stood upstairs and looked down at her. He said expressionlessly, “Make a cup of coffee and bring it up.”","Shen Ying was stunned for a few seconds before smiling. She ran to the kitchen and made a cup of coffee. She hurriedly carried it upstairs and said in a charming voice, “President Gu...”","Gu Zheng was looking at documents and ordered without raising his head, “Send it to Young Madam.”","Shen Ying’s expression froze as she asked in disbelief, “What? It’s for Young Madam? President Gu, but... but this is coffee I made for you. Try it, okay?”","“Just do what I tell you to do. You’re just a servant. Why do you have so much nonsense to say?!” Gu Zheng looked impatient.","The corners of Shen Ying’s mouth twitched. “I... I...”","“I asked you to brew a cup of coffee for Young Madam, but you’re unwilling. Is this how you’re supposed to be acting as a servant? The person Huang Lilan sent over is not good at all!” Gu Zheng said sarcastically."]},{"number":678,"title":"Chapter 678 - Not Lethal But Very Insulting","paragraphs":["Shen Ying’s face was pale. How did she become a servant? She was clearly here to serve President Gu. She could make coffee for Gu Zheng, but how could she be ordered around by Qiao Xi?","Tears welled up in her eyes as she said pitifully, “President Gu, I... I’m here to serve you. I thought you understood what Madam Gu meant. I’m your—”","“Miss Shen, what do you think you’re here for?” Gu Zheng interrupted her and sneered. “The servant who was taking care of Young Madam’s daily needs has taken leave, so I agreed to bring you back. Otherwise, would you have been able to enter Longwan Residential?”","Shen Ying’s mind buzzed. She was the eldest daughter of the Shen family. Why should she serve Qiao Xi?","“Miss Shen, are you unqualified for this job?” Gu Zheng asked casually.","Shen Ying’s eyes turned red as she cried. “President Gu, Madam Gu asked me to be your woman. Even if you don’t like me, you shouldn’t insult me like this! Moreover, Miss Qiao didn’t object to you bringing me back. She doesn’t even care anymore, so why do you have to...”","Before she could finish, Shen Ying suddenly felt her neck tighten. A hand was grabbing her throat, tightening it as though the person wanted to break her neck.","Shen Ying looked at the man in front of her in horror. She could feel the cold killing intent in Gu Zheng’s eyes. As long as he exerted enough strength in his palm, her life would end right here.","Gu Zheng’s eyes were malicious and insidious, while his voice was cold. “Miss Shen, I don’t have time to talk nonsense with you! Before Huang Lilan sent you here, didn’t she tell you who I am?”","Shen Ying trembled and felt the air in her lungs being sucked out bit by bit. Her face turned red from being strangled. She subconsciously struggled a little. She felt like she was about to die.","How... could he kill someone?","“Serve Young Madam, do you understand?” Although it was a question, Gu Zheng’s voice was authoritative. As long as Shen Ying dared to say no, she would die here in the next second.","Gu Zheng released his hand, and Shen Ying’s body went soft as she fell to the floor. Air suddenly entered her lungs, and she could not help but cough violently. However, she did not dare to hesitate at all and hurriedly stammered, “I... Cough, cough... I’ll go make coffee for Young Madam.”","As she watched Shen Ying flee the study in horror, Qiao Xi asked curiously, “You asked Shen Ying to come to Longwan Residential just to make her a servant?”","Gu Zheng said, “That’s right! It just so happens that you lack someone to serve you, and she volunteered. With Madam Gu paying her salary, I’ll be getting a servant for free. Why don’t I use her, then?”","Qiao Xi remained silent. Gu Zheng had made a wise move.","Then, she heard Gu Zheng say slowly, “He doesn’t care about fighting with these women, but if he doesn’t teach them a lesson, they’ll naturally not let the matter rest. Hence, it’s better for me to handle this kind of matter. He has never cared about these petty things, which is why he made them think that he indulges them. However, I can’t tolerate such things.”","The person he was talking about was the original Gu Zheng. He indeed was never one to fight with women. When faced with Shen Ying’s brazen seduction, he would only turn a blind eye to it.","Even though what Gu Zheng did this time was not lethal, it was extremely insulting. Shen Ying would probably be so angry that she would not be able to sleep at night.","“He should be very happy that I helped him deal with these b*tches! Besides, they took the initiative to provoke me. It’s not too much for me to do this, right?”","Qiao Xi nodded obediently. “No, it’s not too much.”","The original Gu Zheng was more mature. He was steady and deep. He did not show his emotions on his face. Even if he could not stand Huang Lilan, he would not rashly make a move. However, this Gu Zheng would not indulge anyone. Whoever dared to provoke him would die without even knowing how!","After she finished speaking, Qiao Xi turned around and went downstairs, heading straight for the fridge.","Gu Zheng asked, “What are you going to take?”","Qiao Xi’s body stiffened. She thought that Gu Zheng’s memory was a mess and he would probably not care about her anymore. Hence, she pretended to be calm and replied, “I’m gonna eat ice cream. What’s wrong?”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng frowned. “Who allowed you to eat ice cream? What time is it now? And you still want to eat ice cream? Aren’t you worried about getting a stomach ache?","“You’re already so old, yet you’re still as gluttonous as a child. You’re eating so much ice cream. When your period comes, you’ll feel uncomfortable again. No wonder he kept reminding me to take care of you!”","Qiao Xi: “???”","What? Could it be that the two of them could talk?","...","On the other hand, Shen Ying made another cup of coffee and was about to send it over when the two of them went back to their room to rest. She could not suppress the anger in her heart and threw the exquisite coffee cup onto the floor."]},{"number":679,"title":"Chapter 679 - Be My Chess Piece","paragraphs":["Song Shijing walked up to her and said indifferently, “Miss Shen, you’re too careless. Clean this place up as soon as possible. This coffee cup is a limited edition. Miss Shen, you have to compensate us according to the price.”","Shen Ying was so angry that her face was red. However, when she recalled Gu Zheng’s cold gaze just now, she did not dare to flare up. She could only grit her teeth and endure it.","When night fell, Shen Ying stood in the living room and roared, “What? Why can’t I stay here? I’m supposed to serve Young Madam. If I don’t stay here, where else can I stay?”","“Miss Shen, you were indeed taught by Huang Lilan. Just because Huang Lilan is a mistress herself, she thinks that all men are as unprincipled as Gu Weiming?”","A cold male voice came from behind. Shen Ying was so scared that her body trembled.","The servants of Longwan Residential had already returned to their rooms to rest. Gu Zheng walked downstairs leisurely while Song Shijing took a few steps back respectfully.","Gu Zheng was wearing a set of silk pajamas with only three buttons buttoned, revealing his fair and strong chest. He said lazily, “Miss Shen, do you know why I brought you back to Longwan Residential?”","Shen Ying looked up at the lazy and devilish Gu Zheng, her heart trembling in fear. “It’s... It’s because you like me. I’m here to serve you.”","“Heh!” Gu Zheng sneered. “Who gave you the confidence, Miss Shen?”","“Miss Shen, have you seen Qiao Rou?”","Gu Zheng took a few steps closer. Shen Ying then realized that Gu Zheng was holding a gun in his hand. The metallic luster made her eyes hurt. Her body trembled as a cold sweat broke out on her forehead. She replied in horror, “I don’t know her! I don’t know who she is!”","Gu Zheng looked down at her with eyes filled with disdain. “It doesn’t matter whether you know her or not. You’re just a dog beside Huang Lilan. Even if you don’t tell the truth, it won’t affect me at all.”","Shen Ying heaved a sigh of relief. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng said coldly in the next second, “There’s no need for me to keep those who are useless to me. It’ll be more peaceful if they die.”","What? Gu Zheng really wanted to kill her?","“No matter what your motive is, your actions have crossed my bottom line. However...” Gu Zheng paused and continued, “However, I think it’s still useful to keep you.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng raised his hand and pressed the cold muzzle of the gun against Shen Ying’s forehead. Shen Ying was so scared that her face turned pale. Her body trembled, and she could not say anything.","Gu Zheng said casually, “I have something that I need you to do, Miss Shen. Go back to the old residence now and tell Huang Lilan that not all men are as easy to deceive as Gu Weiming. Then, stay by Huang Lilan’s side obediently and wait for my instructions. If you’re unwilling to cooperate with me, then you’ll be useless to me. I’ll let you die miserably. Do you think Huang Lilan can protect you then?”","Shen Ying’s body stiffened. Her back was drenched in sweat.","Gu Zheng put down the black muzzle and said, “Alright! Get lost!”","Shen Ying’s legs went weak, and she almost fell to the floor. She staggered a few steps and ran away in a panic, ignoring her image.","At this moment, she realized that Gu Zheng knew everything. Those things could not be hidden from his eyes. He knew that she had met Qiao Rou, so he wanted to kill her.","However, that was not her intention. Madam Gu had ordered her to do that. If she did not do as she was told, Madam Gu would not help her get close to Gu Zheng.","At this moment, in the villa.","Song Shijing looked confused. “President, aren’t you worried that she’ll tell Madam Gu about this?”","Gu Zheng smiled meaningfully. “Shen Ying isn’t stupid. She knows that Huang Lilan is using her, and she also knows that I’m using her. There’s only one difference between me and Huang Lilan, and that’s that Huang Lilan doesn’t have the guts to kill her. I can take her life at any time.","“In order to protect her life, she’ll naturally agree to any of my requests. I can’t find any clues about the car accident, but she’s by Huang Lilan’s side every day. She’ll definitely discover something.”","Shen Ying knew that Gu Zheng wanted to investigate the car accident, and she also knew that Madam Gu and Lu Yan had been using her. They could sacrifice her like they had sacrificed Qiao Rou. Shen Ying naturally had to make plans for herself. She would weigh the pros and cons before deciding whose side to stand on.","“Huang Lilan thinks that I’ll like Shen Ying and plans to use her to restrain me, but she would never think that Shen Ying would betray her and be my chess piece.","Song Shijing gulped. Gu Weiming and Huang Lilan could go against anyone but the president. They would definitely die miserably by doing this!","Song Shijing said unhurriedly, “President, you’re not in a good state, so don’t worry about these things. You should rest first and let ‘him’ handle it. He’s also you...”"]},{"number":680,"title":"Chapter 680 - He Has The Right To See This World Too","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng said casually, “I think so too. Letting him appear is the best way.”","Song Shijing frowned and asked, “President, but if you let him appear, aren’t you afraid that he’ll replace you completely?”","“This body is not only mine but also his. Moreover, he has helped me solve many problems. I can’t let him sleep in the dark forever. He has the right to see this world.”","Qiao Xi happened to hear their conversation when she went downstairs. She knew that Gu Zheng was back, but she did not expect Gu Zheng to say such things. Sure enough, these two personalities were in a mutually beneficial relationship. There was no competition between them.","She turned around and returned to her room. She made a call. “Teacher, I have something to ask you.”","Liang Pingchuan could not help but be stunned when he heard what Qiao Xi said. “You mean that Gu Zheng has dual personalities, but these two personalities are very similar. It’s just that their memories are different?”","“Yes.”","Liang Pingchuan sighed. “Little Six, what did you do after detoxifying the poison? Did anything special happen?”","Qiao Xi said, “No, I just temporarily suppressed the poison in his body. There’s nothing special about it. Teacher, do you mean that his other personality appeared because he was poisoned?”","“Little Six, don’t you think that the biggest difference between the two personalities is that the original Gu Zheng would lose his ability to see in the dark while the other isn’t affected at all? Could it be that another personality was born to protect Gu Zheng when he was fighting against the poison back then?”","Qiao Xi thought about it. Such words were very reasonable.","“That personality didn’t appear for many years because Gu Zheng is already powerful enough and doesn’t need anyone’s protection. The appearance of the other personality this time is because of the poison in his body. There’s also another possibility.”","Liang Pingchuan said seriously, “If you continue to help Gu Zheng detoxify the poison, the poison in his body will be completely removed one day. At that time, his other personality will completely disappear.”","As soon as these words were spoken, Qiao Xi’s entire body trembled.","“He’s different from Gu Zheng. There’s a reason for his existence. In the past, it was to protect Gu Zheng. Now, it’s to resist this poison. Once the poison in Gu Zheng’s body is completely removed, there’s no need for him to exist anymore. Perhaps he sensed that he was about to disappear, so he suddenly appeared.”","Was that so? He knew that he was about to disappear, so he wanted to enjoy the world in his last moments?","Qiao Xi’s heart seemed to have been heavily struck by a rock, and she was unable to calm down for a long time. It turned out that the proud and devilish Gu Zheng would soon disappear.","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi woke up to find that Shen Ying had left. Song Shijing came over and explained, “Miss Shen left last night. She won’t make you angry anymore.”","Qiao Xi was puzzled. “Why did she suddenly leave? What happened?”","Shen Ying was determined to seduce Gu Zheng. However, she had only stayed in Longwan Residential for a day. How could she give up so easily?","Song Shijing was in a dilemma. He could not say that the president had scared her away by pointing a gun at her head, so he could only say vaguely, “The president naturally had a way to make her leave. She’ll be useful when she goes back.”","Qiao Xi pondered over these words for a moment and instantly understood Gu Zheng’s intentions. Shen Ying would naturally return to Huang Lilan’s side, so Gu Zheng wanted to use Shen Ying to deal with Huang Lilan?","“Qiao Xi.” Gu Zheng walked out of the bedroom and brought Qiao Xi into the study. Song Shijing ordered everyone to leave, leaving the two of them alone in the study.","Gu Zheng’s gaze was deep, and there seemed to be a trace of sorrow in his eyes. “You’re Black Tide?”","Qiao Xi did not understand what he meant, but she still nodded obediently.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth twitched with difficulty. No wonder he always subconsciously wanted to protect this woman. He had always thought that Gu Zheng was not good to Qiao Xi and mistakenly thought that he was her savior. It turned out that he had misunderstood everything. It was his one-sided wish to protect Qiao Xi, but in Qiao Xi’s opinion, perhaps he was just a demon who was occupying someone else’s body.","The man’s eyes were malicious. “Perhaps you think that I’m causing the two of you to separate and that I’m occupying his body. I should have disappeared a long time ago, right?”","In the past, his existence was to protect Gu Zheng. After Gu Zheng became stronger, he fell into a deep sleep. After so many years, he thought that he finally had a reason to stay. Now, it seemed that it was just a misunderstanding.","Actually, she did not need him. She even thought that he was unnecessary."]},{"number":681,"title":"Chapter 681 - Caught In Bed","paragraphs":["At this moment, Gu Zheng’s eyes were filled with loneliness. It turned out that she did not need him and even thought that he was an eyesore.","Qiao Xi’s heart ached. “No...”","Gu Zheng turned around and said in a low voice, “But you hug him and sleep with him. You’ve never been willing to get close to me because you know that we’re different. You moved out of the master bedroom the day I woke up.”","Qiao Xi’s heart softened to the extreme when she saw Gu Zheng’s aggrieved appearance.","Gu Zheng continued, “We share the same body. In essence, we’re no different. It’s just that our memories are different, which is why our actions are different. I’m an incomplete person. I don’t have any feelings. Is that why you’re unwilling to hug me?”","The sorrow in Gu Zheng’s eyes caused Qiao Xi’s heart to ache. He was right. Although he was another personality, he was still Gu Zheng in essence.","The man took a few steps closer and looked at her seriously. Seeing that she did not move, he smiled bitterly. “Nothing can be forced. If you’re unwilling, then forget it.”","With that, he left. “Go back to the master bedroom to sleep tonight. He’ll come back to accompany you.”","Qiao Xi watched his figure gradually disappear and stood on the same spot for a few seconds.","At night, Qiao Xi went to the master bedroom and happened to see Gu Zheng walking out of the bathroom in a bathrobe. He had a self-deprecating smile on his face. “You know that he’ll be coming back tonight, so you immediately moved back to the master bedroom. But you couldn’t even give me a hug. In the end, I’ve been abandoned.”","Qiao Xi heard his complaints and took a deep breath. She walked to his side and hugged his waist from behind. She said softly, “Don’t say such things anymore. You’re also a part of him. The two of you are inseparable, but you don’t have any feelings for me. How can I sleep on the same bed as you?”","Gu Zheng frowned. “Can’t you even hug me?”","Qiao Xi: “...” The arrogant Gu Zheng was so coquettish!","She could not bear to make Gu Zheng sad. She walked in front of him and placed her hands on his waist. She patted his back gently and gave him a short but gentle hug. “Is this enough?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes, and his emotions could not be seen clearly. However, the corners of his mouth curled up slyly without her knowing. “It’s too short. I want a proper hug!”","Qiao Xi bit her lip. “No, it’s enough.”","Gu Zheng looked aggrieved. “In your heart, he and I are still different. You don’t actually want to hug me.”","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth twitched slightly. With Gu Zheng’s stern face, it was truly difficult for her to accept that he was acting like a little puppy!","She knew that if she did not hug him today, this man would definitely not give up. Hence, she walked forward and hugged his waist. The two of them hugged tightly, feeling the warmth of each other’s bodies.","Suddenly, the man’s mind went into a daze. His eyes gradually returned to normal. He stood rooted to the ground for a moment before slowly waking up from his confusion. “Xi Xi?”","Qiao Xi: “!!!”","Gu Zheng felt the little woman in his arms tremble slightly and licked his lips. “You’re hugging me? No, that’s not right. You were hugging that guy?”","Qiao Xi felt her heart skip a beat. Could it be that this bastard was jealous?!","The man held her waist tightly and pulled her into his arms. Their hot breaths intertwined. His eyes were burning, and his voice was filled with danger. “Why were you hugging him?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Isn’t he you? What’s the difference?’","Gu Zheng narrowed his eyes. “Why did you move back to the master bedroom? Were you going to sleep with him?”","Qiao Xi had a puzzled expression. Didn’t the other Gu Zheng say that her senior would be back tonight, so he asked her to move back to the master bedroom? Could it be that her senior didn’t know that he would be back tonight?","Qiao Xi suddenly realized that she seemed to have been tricked, but it was too late.","The corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up as he exuded a dangerous aura. “Did you have a good time with him while I was away? Did you hug him? Did you sleep with him?”","Qiao Xi trembled as if she had been caught in the act. She did not dare raise her eyes to look into Gu Zheng’s eyes.","Was it fun for the two of them to be jealous of each other? She would be the one suffering in the end!","...","The next morning.","Qiao Xi opened her sleepy eyes and wanted to leave before the arrogant Gu Zheng woke up. Unexpectedly, as soon as she stood up, the man beside her woke up and grabbed her wrist.","Gu Zheng’s hair was a little messy, and one of the buttons on his pajamas was unbuttoned, revealing a large area of honey-colored skin. He looked extremely lazy but exuded strong hormones."]},{"number":682,"title":"Chapter 682 - Pink Porcelain Vase","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng’s voice was lazy. “Grandma’s birthday is coming up soon. The Gu family is holding a birthday party. Come with me.”","Qiao Xi nodded in agreement, then left the bedroom in a panic.","Looking at her fleeing figure, the corners of Gu Zheng’s mouth curled up. Then, he took out a piece of paper from the drawer of the bedside table. On it was a sentence: [Don’t have any other thoughts.]","Gu Zheng recalled the warm embrace last night before he fell asleep. Qiao Xi’s weak and delicate little hands were wrapped around his waist. That touch was really lethal. Then, he smiled and wrote down: [I suddenly feel that it’s not that bad having a delicate wife!]","...","After Qiao Xi went downstairs to eat breakfast, Gu Yao called. “Do you know that Grandma is holding a birthday party?","“I really don’t understand. Her health isn’t good either, so why is she holding a birthday party?! I heard from her that she has something important to announce. Qiao Xi, have you thought of what birthday gift to give Grandma? Why don’t you accompany me to pick a gift?”","Hearing Gu Yao’s tone, Qiao Xi suddenly realized why the arrogant Gu Zheng always gave her a familiar feeling. The arrogant Gu Zheng was exactly the same as Gu Yao.","However, Gu Yao was not as scheming as Gu Zheng, nor would he wheedle and ask for hugs like Gu Zheng. Gu Zheng’s appearance when fighting for her favor made him look like those two-faced women.","He pretended to be pitiful and begged her to hug him. However, he had deliberately calculated the time so that she would be misunderstood by her senior. Only the arrogant Gu Zheng could do such a thing!","Qiao Xi was silent for a moment before she suddenly asked, “Gu Yao, do you want to hug me?”","Gu Yao: “???” What was wrong with Qiao Xi? ‘Don’t try to harm me!’","Beep beep...","Gu Yao hurriedly hung up. He was not sure if Gu Zheng was by Qiao Xi’s side, but his intuition told him that hanging up was the best way to avoid being implicated by Qiao Xi.","...","In the afternoon, Qiao Xi accompanied Gu Yao to Li City’s shopping street.","Gu Yao said, “Grandma likes porcelain. I know a shop here that collects porcelain vases. I came a few times to buy a particular vase, but the owner of the vase always refuses to sell it to me. He said that he wants to sell it to someone who’s meant to have it. Grandma’s birthday is coming up soon. I wonder if I can buy the vase this time.”","The two of them had just reached the door when a kind middle-aged man led them into the inner courtyard.","Qiao Xi did not know anything about porcelain, but she was truly surprised when she saw that particular piece of porcelain. The old madam would surely like it. The craftsmanship of this hollow vase was complicated, and probably not many people could do it.","The middle-aged man said, “The art of making vases is complicated and peerless. Many people have come to buy this particular piece, but my grandfather has never agreed because he doesn’t care about money. He only has one special request.”","Qiao Xi asked curiously, “What request?”","“The pink porcelain vase was made by several high-level craftsmen for three days and three nights without sleep. They failed countless times to create a perfect piece. The firing, carving, and gem-embedding have to be done all over again if anything goes wrong. That’s why it’s so expensive. Now that Grandpa is old, he wants to gather all the craftsmen in the world to create a pink porcelain vase for his great-granddaughter.","“Grandpa’s eldest grandson, my cousin, left home many years ago. His whereabouts are unknown. Grandpa heard that my cousin left behind a daughter. He investigated for a long time but failed to find her.","“He’s old. He’s afraid that he’ll suddenly die and won’t be able to see his great-granddaughter for the last time, so he wants to find a famous craftsman to make a unique porcelain vase for his great-granddaughter. If you can do it, I’ll give this vase to you for free.”","The middle-aged man continued, “This is his only request. He wants to find the top porcelain craftsman in the world to make a unique porcelain piece.”","Gu Yao opened his mouth in surprise. “If I could find the top porcelain craftsman in the world, I wouldn’t have come here so many times to beg for this vase. Why don’t we forget about it? Let’s not delay things here.”","A glint flashed across Qiao Xi’s eyes as she asked casually, “May I know your surname?”","The middle-aged man chuckled. “It’s not convenient for me to mention my name.”","Qiao Xi looked at the vase, then said thoughtfully, “Porcelain Master, then...”","“We’re finally here! Let’s go in!” At this moment, a sharp female voice came from outside, accompanied by hurried footsteps."]},{"number":683,"title":"Chapter 683 - Stupid Rich Second-Generation","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi raised her eyes and saw two young women walk in. One of them walked in front of the middle-aged man and asked arrogantly, “How much is this vase?”","The middle-aged man smiled as he stated the request to get this vase. The woman instantly looked impatient. She glanced at Qiao Xi and Gu Yao, then pointed at them and asked, “Are you here to buy vases too?”","Before Qiao Xi could answer, the young woman said, “This has nothing to do with you. Get out immediately and don’t affect our shopping!”","As soon as she finished speaking, the bodyguards behind her rushed over to chase them away. Gu Yao was the second young master of the Gu family. When had he ever been treated like this? He said angrily, “Does your family own this place? What right do you have to chase us away?”","The woman’s face was full of disdain as she said impatiently, “This vase is mine. Why are you still here? Besides, when I buy things, I don’t like outsiders being around.”","Gu Yao looked at the middle-aged man indignantly. “Who is she? How can she be so rude? Are you just going to watch her fool around?”","The man said gently, “Whoever meets the requirements will naturally get the vase.”","What he meant was that if they were so easily chased away by this woman, they would definitely not have the ability to invite the top craftsman in the world to make the porcelain piece. Hence, he was indeed going to sit back and do nothing.","Qiao Xi curled her lips. This shop was quite unique.","The young woman glanced at Qiao Xi and said arrogantly, “If you still don’t leave, I’ll get the bodyguards to chase you away. Are you worthy of buying things in the same shop as us?”","The staff in the shop all thought that this woman was too arrogant. It had to be known that the people who came here to buy things were either rich or noble. If they were not careful, they would easily offend others.","Gu Yao’s face darkened. It was fine if he suffered a little, but he could not let Qiao Xi suffer with him. If Gu Zheng found out, he would be beaten up.","The woman beside the arrogant woman looked a little older. She smiled gently, but her eyes were filled with indifference. “I’m sorry. My sister is a little impatient. Please don’t take offense. This pink porcelain vase is very important to me. It’s something that the elders in our family love. I have to buy it no matter what. Please leave.”","Gu Yao retorted, “This gentleman just said that whoever meets the requirements can take the vase. We can compete fairly. Why should we leave just because this vase is important to you?”","The arrogant woman snorted with a proud expression. “Do you know who my sister is?! It’s naturally not difficult for her to find the top craftsman in the world! Are you worthy of competing with my sister? Get out immediately!”","Gu Yao: “...” Damn! This woman was even more arrogant than him!","Suddenly, someone asked in surprise, “Uhh... Is that Miss Tang?”","“Is it really Miss Tang? Miss Tang is the eldest daughter of a family of porcelain masters. She has been talented in porcelain since she was young and is known as the porcelain goddess.”","Qiao Xi recalled that her second brother had once said that among the four major porcelain families, the Luo family was at the top while the Tang family was ranked last. The Tang family was no longer as powerful as before, but the reputation they had accumulated over the years was still there.","Miss Tang’s expression was indifferent as she nodded slightly at that person and admitted her identity.","The arrogant woman at the side pointed at Qiao Xi and Gu Yao as she roared, “Let me tell you. Don’t think that you can buy everything with just money. Even if you have money, you won’t be able to hire the top porcelain craftsman in the world!”","Gu Yao had never been looked down on like this since he was born. He said angrily, “Whether we can get it or not is our business. Moreover, we were clearly here first. Why do you have to clear the area the moment you arrive? This isn’t the Tang family’s territory!”","Gu Yao glanced coldly at Miss Tang. This woman looked like a noble daughter, but she was watching her sister fool around without stopping her. She was not a good person either!","Miss Tang looked at Qiao Xi and said in a gentle tone, “Miss, I understand that you also want this vase, but this gentleman said that whoever can meet his requirements can get this vase. Are you sure you can invite the top craftsman in the world? If you can’t, then don’t waste your effort.”","As soon as she finished speaking, the arrogant woman said, “You’re just a stupid rich second-generation heir. Yet you want to compete with my sister for this vase? Don’t you have any shame?!”"]},{"number":684,"title":"Chapter 684 - Nothing But Good Looks","paragraphs":["“My sister is from the Tang family, a porcelain family. Even if she can’t find the top craftsman in the world, she can still create the perfect porcelain piece.","“Yet you have the cheek to compare yourself to my sister? Do you know anything about porcelain? Just one look at you and I know you’re an ignorant and incompetent hedonistic son!”","Tang Ruge’s expression did not change as she quietly listened to her sister scolding the two outsiders. Seeing that she was done, she said gently, “Yun Yun, don’t be so rude.”","Then, Tang Ruge looked at Qiao Xi. “Looking at your clothes, you must be from a rich family. In terms of wealth, I might not be able to compare to you, but this vase is something that the elders of my family have been thinking about for a long time. I hope you can fulfill my wish.","“Moreover, the request is to find the top porcelain master in the world. This has nothing to do with who came first. The most important thing is who has the ability to invite that person. Some things can’t be bought with just money. Even if you have money, you can’t force it.”","Gu Yao was so angry that his face turned red. This woman looked gentle and generous, but in reality, every word she said was mocking him and Qiao Xi for being nouveau riche. Moreover, why did she think she could forcefully get something?","Tang Lingyun snorted angrily. “Our Tang family is a porcelain family, and my sister is a socialite in the capital. Although she might not be richer than you, her status is definitely higher than yours. You guys stink so much that it makes me want to vomit!”","Qiao Xi recalled that there was indeed a young miss in the Tang family. She heard that she was proficient in the four arts and was a talented woman who was very popular in high society.","The Tang family thought of themselves as noble and cultured. Naturally, they looked down on businessmen who reeked of money. That was why these two ladies were filled with hostility when they saw her and Gu Yao.","Although Gu Yao did not know any porcelain masters, Gu Zheng was so powerful that he would definitely be able to find that person. Hence, he bragged, “Isn’t it just a matter of finding the top porcelain master in the world? I want to compete with you. Let’s see who can find this person first and get them to agree to make the porcelain vase.”","Hearing this, Tang Lingyun’s face was filled with disdain. “You? Do you dare to bet with us? Let’s see who can find that porcelain master first, then!”","Tang Ruge stopped her. “Lingyun.”","The surrounding people sighed. “Young man, it’s not that we’re looking down on you, but how can you possibly find the top porcelain master in the world before the Tang family? You’d better cancel the bet, lest you get yourself into trouble.”","“That’s right! This porcelain vase might be just an object to you, but it’s very meaningful to the Tang family. If you leave now, it won’t be too embarrassing.”","“The two are probably just embarrassed. That lady in branded clothes doesn’t look like someone to be trifled with. It’s probably because she’s embarrassed, so she’s jealous after seeing a cultured and knowledgeable woman like Miss Tang.”","Tang Lingyun sneered. “You’re so beautiful and wearing such expensive clothes. Who knows if you’re even spending your own money?!”","If it were anything else, Gu Yao could still tolerate it. But he could not take it lying down when she mocked Qiao Xi for being a mistress. The anger in his heart burned fiercely.","It did not matter what they said. In any case, he was indeed shameless and a good-for-nothing. However, they could not say anything about Qiao Xi. She was the champion of the International Real-time Translation Competition and was a teacher at Li City University. She was also an internationally renowned designer. Even if she had not married Gu Zheng, she still had the ability to support herself!","They shouldn’t think that Qiao Xi was just a beautiful woman who relied on men. She had clearly established herself as a capable woman.","Qiao Xi, Li Xing’er, Xue Yi, and Qin Shuwan were all beautiful and talented women. Any one of these women could make Tang Lingyun shut up.","Gu Yao was so angry that his face turned red. He did not say anything for a long time.","“Thank you for praising my beauty,” Qiao Xi said casually with a calm smile on her face.","She looked up and sized up Tang Ruge, then touched her cheek confidently. “Sigh! There’s nothing else good about me except that I’m beautiful. I’m also very troubled. I’m already so beautiful. If I’m more educated and cultured than Miss Tang, how will anyone be able to accept that?! In order to save Miss Tang’s dignity, I admit that I’m indeed uneducated.”","Gu Yao: “...” Qiao Xi was indeed Gu Zheng’s wife. Why were their words so vicious?!","Tang Ruge frowned. Her appearance was indeed not outstanding. Even after the help of heavy makeup and multiple pieces of jewelry, she could only be considered above average. Fortunately, she had an outstanding temperament and was elegant and knowledgeable. That was why she was chased after by everyone."]},{"number":685,"title":"Chapter 685 - Betting On Heart Of Rose","paragraphs":["Tang Lingyun reacted and immediately roared, “How is my sister ugly?”","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. It seemed that Tang Lingyun knew very well in her heart that Miss Tang Ruge looked very ordinary. She just looked a little more scholarly, so she appeared indifferent and elegant.","Tang Ruge’s expression darkened. Tang Lingyun shouted, “Cut the crap! Are you going to bet or not?! If you lose, I want this woman’s necklace!”","The necklace Qiao Xi was wearing was Xia Yunqiu’s relic, the Heart of Rose. Previously, when Old Madam Yin came, she had instructed her to wear this necklace.","Legend had it that a wisp of the soul of a deceased relative remained in the Heart of Rose. When the wearer was in danger, this final wisp of the soul could ensure their safety. Old Madam Yin believed that Xia Yunqiu’s soul in heaven would definitely protect Xi Xi, so she asked Qiao Xi to wear this necklace.","The ruby on the Heart of Rose was too eye-catching. Qiao Xi did not want to attract trouble, so she would put the necklace under her clothes, revealing only the platinum chain that was embedded with diamonds.","The Tang sisters were socialites from the capital. They could naturally tell that this necklace was expensive. The necklace of Heart of Rose was made with exquisite craftsmanship. Not only was it inlaid with diamonds, but it also seemed firm. A special material had been added to it. Under the sunlight, it even emitted a faint pink glow like a rose in full bloom.","Such a chain was already expensive, not to mention that stunning ruby. Tang Lingyun’s eyes were red with greed.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. Didn’t they say that the Tang family was cultured and had always looked down on businessmen who reeked of money? But it turned out that the Tang family’s young miss also liked expensive necklaces.","Tang Lingyun provoked Qiao Xi, saying, “It’s fine if you’re unwilling! I don’t think you dare take the bet!”","Gu Yao looked at Qiao Xi in embarrassment. He had naturally heard that Qiao Xi had a priceless necklace. He couldn’t care less about his dignity now. “Then—”","“No problem.” Qiao Xi interrupted him and said casually, “I’ll bet with you.”","Tang Ruge revealed a calm smile, while Tang Lingyun had a victorious smile on her face.","Qiao Xi stroked her hair and said indifferently, “Since it’s a bet, then both parties naturally have to offer something. Miss Tang wants my precious necklace, but what do you plan on offering if I win?”","Gu Yao was furious. “Yes! You said that you want to use this necklace for the bet, so you should take out something of equal value, Miss Tang. Otherwise, it’s unfair!”","Everyone present was an expert, so they were naturally able to discern that Qiao Xi’s necklace was expensive. With this kind of craftsmanship, the necklace was probably worth hundreds of millions.","Tang Ruge smiled gently. “I’m really sorry. No one in the Tang family is in the business field, so our wealth is naturally inferior to yours. We don’t have anything valuable to offer either.”","Gu Yao snorted. “What do you mean by that? You want us to take out a sky-high price for this bet, but you’re unwilling to do the same. Do you wish to earn easy money?! And you say you’re cultured? How shameless!”","Everyone was originally on the Tang family’s side, but in this matter, it was indeed Miss Tang’s fault. Even if she could not take out something of equal value, she had to take out something precious. Otherwise, it would be equivalent to bullying!","Tang Ruge was not nervous and smiled helplessly. “My Tang family doesn’t have any jewelry. In terms of value, the ancient painting ‘Eternal Winter Snow’ that my father bought is the most precious. Although this painting isn’t as valuable as the necklace, it’s still worth 30 million. Miss Qiao, what do you think?”","Gu Yao was still dissatisfied. How could a 30 million painting compare to Qiao Xi’s necklace that was worth hundreds of millions?","Unexpectedly, Qiao Xi agreed without the slightest hesitation. “Alright.”","Gu Yao hurriedly pulled Qiao Xi’s hand and took a few steps back. He said in a low voice, “Qiao Xi! Are you crazy?! It’s a bet with no chance of winning. You’re offering up Heart of Rose while she’s offering a lousy painting. It’s too big of a loss!”","Qiao Xi smiled meaningfully. “Who said I don’t have a chance of winning?”","Seeing that she was so confident, Gu Yao immediately beamed. “Gu Zheng knows the top porcelain master in the world, right? So you’re going to ask him for help?”","Qiao Xi said, “Nope.”","The smile on Gu Yao’s face vanished instantly. “What kind of husband is Gu Zheng?! He can’t help at all! What should I do?! I’ve already bragged about it, so is it too late to go back on my word now? You can leave first later. I’ll go confront them. I’m shameless anyway, so it’s fine if they scold me. You can’t lose Heart of Rose to them!”"]},{"number":686,"title":"Chapter 686 - Porcelain Vase With Hollowed Out Jade Rings","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi felt that Gu Yao was really too cute. How could that vicious mistress Huang Lilan have such a righteous son?","She smiled at Gu Yao. “Don’t worry. Gu Zheng doesn’t know that person, but I do!”","At this moment, outside the door.","Song Shijing stood beside Gu Zheng and looked at the gloomy man. He felt uneasy. He suddenly missed Song Shiyu. If he were here, the atmosphere would not be so awkward.","Gu Zheng frowned. He had never interacted with porcelain masters all these years. What if he could not help Qiao Xi?","At the door of the porcelain shop, Song Shiyu looked surprised. “Huh? President, what are you doing here?”","Gu Zheng was already unhappy. Hearing Song Shiyu’s words, he immediately mocked, “With your IQ, don’t say that you’re my assistant. Of course, I’m here for the porcelain vase!”","After entering, Qiao Xi had a surprised expression. “Gu Zheng, what are you doing here?”","The moment he saw Qiao Xi’s smiling face, the frustration in Gu Zheng’s heart instantly vanished. His face was filled with a gentle smile. “I came to see you. Why aren’t you home after shopping for so long?”","Song Shiyu: “???” ‘I’m really speechless! The president is two-faced!’","Now that the bet had been set, even if someone came, it would not change anything. Tang Ruge sized up the man in front of her, and her heart suddenly thumped violently.","Tang Lingyun did not notice her sister’s emotions and still looked disdainful. “Miss, if you know a porcelain master, ask them to quickly come over. I want to see which one of us can find the most skilled porcelain master!”","Porcelain master?","Gu Zheng walked to her side and asked softly, “Are you going to lose?”","Qiao Xi frowned. Could it be that she was so useless in his heart? No matter what, she was an international designer. Moreover, even if she did not know the top porcelain master in the world, she still had a few brothers. What was there to be afraid of?","However, Qiao Xi wanted to know Gu Zheng’s answer. She raised her eyebrows and asked, “What if I lose?”","Then, she saw the man smile evilly before replying in a lazy, “What else can we do? We’ll go back on our word! The Tang family is just a family in decline, right? What can they do if we don’t give the necklace to them? We didn’t sign an agreement anyway.”","The Tang family said that Qiao Xi was a cultured person, but they wanted Qiao Xi to use Heart of Rose as a bet. They were clearly people who wanted to fish for fame. There was no use in reasoning with such people.","Qiao Xi: “...” Go back on their word? Was Gu Zheng so shameless? However, she found it very interesting!","At this moment, the shop owner chuckled and said, “Everyone, let me tell you about Grandpa’s rules. Grandpa misses his great-granddaughter. Since he wants to give her something, he has to give her the best porcelain piece. Hence, he hopes to invite the top craftsman in the world to make a porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings.”","The moment that was said, the shop fell silent.","“A porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings? Hasn’t the art of this been lost?”","“That’s right. This method of creating this is very complicated. As the name suggests, jade and porcelain need to be fused together. Porcelain needs to be heated, while jade can’t withstand high temperatures, so the two can only be carved separately. However, in the end, they have to be fused together with a unique technique.”","Just the sound of this method was daunting. Unless it was the top porcelain master in the world, who could create such a complicated piece?","Rumor had it that a few had indeed made this kind of porcelain before, but only three had succeeded in the past few hundred years. In recent years, only the Luo family had succeeded. However, the Luo family had already retreated to Xuan Island and they never talked about the past. Who could invite the Luo family?","Now that the shop owner had made this request, everyone was put in a difficult position.","Gu Yao was uneasy. What if Qiao Xi could not invite a master who knew how to make hollow jade rings? She would lose. But there was also a possibility that the Tang family could not invite such a powerful figure.","Just as everyone was silent, Tang Ruge smiled and walked forward. “Senior, you know about the porcelain with hollowed-out jade rings. Could it be that you know the Luo family?”","The shop owner smiled and said, “Does that mean you can find a suitable porcelain master, Miss Tang?”","Tang Ruge smiled in embarrassment. “The Tang and Luo families are both porcelain families. My father is on good terms with the Tang family. When I was young, I’d go to the Luo family to see that porcelain and jade vase.”","Gu Yao stomped his feet anxiously. “Qiao Xi! It’s over! I think she knows that porcelain master!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was indifferent. “What’s the rush? The master hasn’t been invited yet, right?”","“You’re really calm! If you lose, will you really give her Heart of Rose? It’s all my fault. If I hadn’t argued with them, you wouldn’t have made a bet with them.”"]},{"number":687,"title":"Chapter 687 - Mr. Pei Is Here","paragraphs":["“She isn’t the only one who has seen a porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings. I’ve seen it too,” Qiao Xi said casually.","“You’ve seen it before?” Gu Yao was surprised. Then, he lowered his voice and asked, “Where did you see it? Do you know that porcelain master?”","Gu Zheng’s eyes were deep as he looked at her. How could he have thought that she was a weak little woman who could be bullied?","At this moment, Tang Ruge said gently, “Sir, if you think it’s okay, I can invite the descendant of the Luo family to give it a try. However, I can’t guarantee that he can create a perfect piece. If it really doesn’t work, I can try to invite that expert from the Luo family.”","The usually calm shop owner’s eyes suddenly lit up. He said in surprise, “You can really invite someone from the Luo family?”","Tang Ruge smiled and said, “The Tang family and the Luo family are two of the four great families of porcelain. We’ve always been in contact with each other. Although the Luo family has already gone into seclusion, my father and Mr. Pei can still contact them.”","Mr. Pei was the famous porcelain master, Pei Lingquan. He was also Tang Ruge’s teacher.","The shop owner was surprised by Tang Ruge’s connections, but he still asked calmly, “May I ask if you can invite Mr. Pei over now? Maybe he has the ability.”","Tang Ruge said, “Sure.”","She had never lost a bet. As long as she could invite Mr. Pei, she would have won half the bet.","To be honest, she did like that necklace very much. Although only the chain was revealed, she could still tell that this necklace was expensive. This necklace was probably worth all the jewelry in the Tang family.","Tang Ruge nodded at everyone, then went out to make a call. When she returned, she smiled elegantly. “Sir, Teacher said that he’ll be here soon. Please wait a moment.”","Gu Yao pulled Qiao Xi aside and muttered, “Qiao Xi, are you just going to quietly watch them? It’ll be too late if you wait for that Pei person to arrive!”","Qiao Xi blinked and said indifferently, “So be it. I can’t stop her.”","Tang Lingyun looked proud, while Tang Ruge tapped her forehead and said, “You’re just a child. How could you ask others to use such a precious thing as a bet?! Don’t do this again!”","“I didn’t force them. Who asked them to have the intention of snatching the vase from us? If I don’t make them learn their lesson, they’ll really think that our Tang family is easy to bully!”","Tang Lingyun glared fiercely at Qiao Xi and said disdainfully, “We know that you can’t invite a porcelain master, so we won’t make things difficult for you. As long as you leave the necklace behind and get out of this shop immediately, this matter will be settled!","“If news of this gets out, how will you still be able to survive in high society in the future?”","As soon as she finished speaking, a voice came from outside the door. “Mr. Pei is here!”","Pei Lingquan was a master in the world of porcelain. He usually attended all kinds of banquets and competitions, so everyone knew what he looked like. Every time he appeared, he would be extremely high-profile, bringing along a group of disciples and followers.","“Miss Tang, you’re indeed capable. You called Mr. Pei over with just one call!”","Pei Lingquan walked in. Tang Ruge hurriedly went forward and said respectfully, “Teacher, you’re here.”","“Where’s the porcelain vase?” Pei Lingquan nodded and went straight to the point.","Tang Ruge immediately brought Pei Lingquan to the porcelain vase. The shop owner smiled and said, “Mr. Pei, sorry for not going out to welcome you!”","Pei Lingquan had been in the porcelain industry for so long and naturally knew the background of this shop. He did not dare to be arrogant in front of the shop owner and only said indifferently, “Sir, I can indeed make a porcelain vase, but the hollowed-out jade rings will be a little difficult. I might not be able to do it perfectly, so I can only invite that expert from the Luo family to come. Do you think it’s okay?”","In the world, only that expert from the Luo family could make a perfect porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings. If Mr. Pei could invite that person, Grandpa’s wish would naturally be fulfilled.","The shop owner immediately beamed with joy and became more respectful. “That’s good. I’ll thank you on behalf of my grandpa.”","At this point, the winner of the bet seemed to have been finalized. Miss Tang had invited Mr. Pei, and Mr. Pei could invite the expert from the Luo family. Qiao Xi seemed to have given up.","Tang Lingyun pointed at Qiao Xi and ordered, “Quickly admit defeat! Don’t waste any more time. Hand over the necklace now!”","Pei Lingquan’s gaze landed on Qiao Xi. “You’re the one who made a bet with my student?”"]},{"number":688,"title":"Chapter 688 - The Legendary Luo Family Has Really Appeared!","paragraphs":["Qiao Xi nodded, and Pei Lingquan grunted coldly. “Are you worthy to compare yourself to my student? Ruge was able to create porcelain pieces by herself when she was as young as five years old. With her ability, she’ll definitely have some accomplishments in the future. Even if she can’t create a porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings, she still has me, her teacher. Who do you think you are?! Hand over the necklace immediately!”","Tang Lingyun pointed at Qiao Xi and said loudly, “Mr. Pei, look. It’s the necklace she’s wearing!”","Pei Lingquan naturally knew something about jewelry as well. He could tell at a glance that Qiao Xi’s necklace was expensive, and his eyes were filled with greed. Hence, he shouted loudly, “So many eyes are watching! Don’t even think about reneging on your debt!”","Gu Yao had a look of disdain. These two were both famous porcelain masters in the industry. They said that they disdained money and valued culture over everything else. After seeing Qiao Xi’s necklace, though, they forgot about their scholarly character.","Tang Ruge was pretentious, while Pei Lingquan was just fishing for fame. Such hypocrites were really detestable.","Pei Lingquan rubbed the jade ring in his hand as he stared fixedly at Qiao Xi’s necklace. “You’re the daughter of a rich family. Why aren’t you keeping your word? Since you never planned on giving up the necklace, why did you agree to the bet then?”","Qiao Xi looked at everyone and asked casually, “Miss Tang, you haven’t brought out the porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings either. How are you so sure that I’ve lost?”","Before everyone could react, Pei Lingquan laughed out loud. “Hahaha! I’m already here. It’s only a matter of time before I create that piece. With me around, how can Ruge lose?”","Tang Lingyun said proudly, “I know you don’t want to admit defeat so easily. If you have the ability, go and invite that person from the Luo family. It’s fine even if you manage to invite the porcelain family from the capital. If you lose, you lose. Why are you still being stubborn?!","“Let me tell you, that big family in the capital has never interacted with the outside world. Meanwhile, the Luo family has been living in seclusion since a few years ago. Outsiders are not allowed to enter Xuan Island either. Only people of my sister’s and Mr. Pei’s status can contact the Luo family, while you... don’t have the ability at all!”","Everyone understood when they heard this. Qiao Xi had no chance of winning from the beginning, yet she even bet on an expensive necklace.","Gu Yao rushed in front of Gu Zheng anxiously. “Brother, why are you standing here like a block of wood? Your wife is being bullied! Are you still her husband?! Qiao Xi is about to lose. Heart of Rose is the relic left behind by Qiao Xi’s mother. How can we give it to them?!”","Gu Zheng glanced at Gu Yao, his eyes still calm. He did not have many memories of this younger brother of his. In the past, every time he woke up, he would only recall that Gu Yao was Huang Lilan’s son. Hence, he did not think Gu Yao had a good character. Now that he looked at him, Gu Yao seemed quite similar to him.","Gu Yao was still talking non-stop. Gu Zheng said indifferently, “Shut up.”","Gu Yao: “...” ‘Shut up? I’m worried about your wife! No wonder Qiao Xi keeps saying that you’re a bastard. You’re really a bastard!’","“Stop stalling for time. Quickly bring it over!” Tang Lingyun had already lost her patience and directly rushed in front of Qiao Xi, wanting to pull the necklace on her neck.","At this moment, there was a commotion outside.","“Look! Who’s that?”","Everyone looked in the direction of the voice and saw a few luxury cars worth millions of dollars parked at the door. A group of bodyguards in light clothes stood in two rows and opened up a path.","“Luo?” Someone with sharp eyes immediately noticed that the word ‘Luo’ was embroidered on the bodyguards’ clothes. Just this word was enough for everyone to understand the newcomer’s identity. The Luo family of Xuan Island?","The legendary Luo family was really here?","The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled up. The bodyguards of various large families all wore suits as well. They looked very cool, but it was just to create an impact. They were naturally not very powerful. On the other hand, the Luo family’s bodyguards were truly skilled. They wore light clothes so that they would not be restrained when they attacked. It would be easier to take down the opponent that way.","Everyone knew that the Luo family of Xuan Island was a reclusive family, and they also knew that they were a porcelain family. However, perhaps no one knew that the Luo family was best at hidden weapons and had trained many assassins.","“The Luo family! It’s actually the Luo family!” Tang Lingyun was so excited that she almost jumped up.","Pei Lingquan was stunned for a long time. He did not expect the Luo family to really appear, and it was such a big scene. He hurriedly craned his neck to see who it was."]},{"number":689,"title":"Chapter 689 - Never Heard Of Tang Ruge","paragraphs":["When the shop owner saw that the Luo family had arrived, his eyes were filled with shock. Previously, he thought that Pei Lingquan was just casually saying it. He did not believe that Pei Lingquan could actually invite the Luo family.","The Luo family of Xuan Island had been living in seclusion for many years. Pei Lingquan must not only know the Luo family but have a good relationship with them. Otherwise, why would they rush over from Xuan Island?","“The Luo family was invited by Mr. Pei?”","“Of course. Among the people present, only Mr. Pei and Miss Tang have the ability. Didn’t Miss Tang say before that the Tang and Luo families are on good terms? Of course, it’s because of the two of them.”","Tang Ruge’s bookish face was filled with joy. Her voice trembled slightly. “Is the Luo family really here?”","“Sister, the Luo family must be here for you! They’ve been living in seclusion on Xuan Island for so many years, but this is the first time they’ve appeared in such a high-profile manner. Only you can make them take you so seriously!”","Tang Lingyun was extremely excited, then she glared at Qiao Xi arrogantly. “You’re still not admitting defeat at a time like this? The Luo family, the top family out of the four great porcelain families, is here, yet you’re still hoping to win?","“I only asked you to leave just now because I wanted to save you some dignity. Now that Mr. Pei and the Luo family are here, you’ll lose very badly and your dignity will be crushed!”","Tang Ruge did not stop Tang Lingyun from mocking Qiao Xi. Instead, she leaned forward and asked, “Does anyone know who it is from the Luo family?”","“That expert from the Luo family won’t appear so easily. He probably just casually sent a disciple to represent him!”","“That’s right! The Luo family’s direct descendants naturally wouldn’t appear so easily.”","As soon as they finished talking, the car door slowly opened. A tall and cold-looking young man got out of the car. The bodyguards around him lowered their heads and bowed respectfully.","“Young Master!”","The entire venue was silent. Everyone could not help but gasp. They never expected that the person who came to be the young master of the Luo family!","Pei Lingquan was so excited that his palms were trembling. He staggered a few steps forward. “Young Master... Young Master... Luo Qing?”","Ordinary people might not know who Luo Qing was, but the shop owner and Tang Ruge naturally knew him. Luo Qing was the legendary person who could create hollowed-out jade rings. They never expected the young master of the Luo family to come in person.","Tang Ruge, who had always been calm and composed, could not help but blush as her body trembled slightly. Luo Qing’s appearance could be said to be showing the Tang family respect. This time, she won beautifully.","However, who invited Luo Qing? Was it Mr. Pei? How did Luo Qing rush over so quickly?","“Miss Tang, you’re really awesome! You actually managed to invite Young Master Luo!”","Hearing everyone’s praise, Tang Ruge controlled the excitement in her heart and forced herself to calm down. She absolutely could not be rude in front of Luo Qing. Then, she revealed a standard smile and walked forward. She said respectfully, “Young Master Luo, thank you—”","Before she could finish, Luo Qing glanced at her coldly. A chill ran down her spine as he asked coldly, “Who are you?”","Boom!!!","These three words were like a thunderclap that struck everyone’s hearts. It was as if the words had slapped Tang Ruge hard, causing the smile on her face to stiffen.","The shop was eerily quiet and filled with an awkward atmosphere. Everyone was confused. Weren’t the Tang and Luo families on good terms? Why doesn’t Young Master Luo know Miss Tang? Could it be that Young Master Luo wasn’t here for Miss Tang?","Tang Ruge was, after all, a daughter of a noble family. She immediately calmed down and still had a faint smile on her face. She said generously, “Young Master Luo, you might not have seen me before. I’m the daughter of the Tang family, Tang Ruge. I even went to the Luo family to visit with my father before, but unfortunately, I didn’t get to meet you then.”","Tang Ruge was indeed from a noble family. Her words were very eloquent. She explained that the two families were on good terms, but it was just a coincidence that she had never met Luo Qing. Not only did she save herself from trouble, but she also did not embarrass Luo Qing.","Tang Ruge felt inexplicably uneasy. Perhaps it was just because she was a little nervous seeing the young master of the Luo family for the first time. As long as he could win this bet for her, everything would be fine. So what if he did not know her?","“Tang Ruge?” Luo Qing repeated her name, then said calmly, “I’ve never heard of you.”","Never heard of her? She was the daughter of the Tang family! No matter what, the Tang family was one of the four major families in the porcelain field. How could he not know her?","At this moment, the smile on Tang Ruge’s face could no longer be maintained. She bit her lip and looked aggrieved."]},{"number":690,"title":"Chapter 690 - Lost Her Reputation","paragraphs":["At this moment, Pei Lingquan said obsequiously, “Young Master Luo, do you still remember me?”","Luo Qing glanced at him with his deep eyes. After thinking for a moment, he replied indifferently, “Yes.”","Yes! It was enough that Young Master Luo knew that the two of them had met each other before. Pei Lingquan was so excited that his face turned red. “Young Master Luo, I’m Pei Lingquan! When you came out a few years ago, you gave me a few pointers. I can be considered a student of yours!”","Luo Qing nodded expressionlessly.","Pei Lingquan suppressed the ecstasy in his heart and pointed at Tang Ruge. “Ruge is my student. Please don’t take offense.”","Only then did everyone know that Luo Qing was here for Pei Lingquan. After all, he was his disciple. Luo Qing had to show him some respect.","Tang Lingyun pointed at Qiao Xi and shouted, “Did you hear that?! Young Master Luo is here for Mr. Pei!”","Everyone looked at Qiao Xi and Gu Yao, only to see Qiao Xi raise her eyebrows. “Are you so sure that Mr. Luo is here for him?”","Seeing that she was unwilling to admit defeat, Tang Lingyun immediately retorted, “Could it be that he’s here for you, then?! Don’t be shameless! Since you agreed to the bet, you have to admit defeat. Now that Young Master Luo is here, why aren’t you admitting defeat? Are you trying to go back on your word?”","Luo Qing, who had been silent for a long time, suddenly curled his lips and looked at Qiao Xi. “Admit defeat? You mean she lost?”","Tang Ruge, who was already determined to win, could not help but tremble when she heard Luo Qing’s words. She suddenly had a bad feeling. Why did Luo Qing ask this?","Could it be that Luo Qing was doing this for...","Impossible! She had never seen this woman in the capital. She was definitely not from the capital. Apart from her, who else could invite the Luo family? How could this nouveau riche who reeked of money invite Luo Qing?!","Tang Ruge took a deep breath and suppressed the uneasiness in her heart. Unexpectedly, Luo Qing said indifferently, “She won.”","She won? Who was he talking about?","Tang Lingyun also sensed that the atmosphere was not good, but she could not accept it. She asked in disbelief, “Young Master Luo, who did you say won? My sister? You came for my sister, so naturally, my sister won. There’s no doubt about that.”","“Whoever I help will be the winner, right?” Luo Qing asked expressionlessly. He frowned slightly and was already a little impatient.","Tang Lingyun hurriedly said, “Of course. You’re the top porcelain master in the world. Only you can create hollowed-out jade rings. If you help my sister, she’ll win this bet!”","A trace of a smile flashed past Luo Qing’s calm eyes, making his cold face look a little warmer. “Looks like I’m the key to deciding the outcome.”","Tang Ruge clenched her fists, her palms sweating. She was so nervous that her entire body was trembling.","The next second—","“I don’t think I’ve ever said that I’m here to help Miss Tang. You think too much.” Luo Qing’s eyes were filled with smiles, but his smile was one of mockery.","Tang Ruge widened her eyes abruptly. Her face instantly turned pale, and her mind buzzed.","She was thinking too much? Did that mean that Luo Qing was not here to help her?","Tang Ruge seemed to have understood something and subconsciously looked at Qiao Xi. His eyes were filled with resentment and viciousness. Her mask of a noble daughter instantly shattered, revealing her true appearance.","Then, Luo Qing slowly walked to Qiao Xi’s side. In the silence, he called out gently, “Sixth Sister.”","Qiao Xi raised her eyes and looked at Luo Qing gently. Her brothers usually called her Little Six, but now, he was deliberately calling her Sixth Sister for the sake of letting everyone know that she was Luo Qing’s younger sister.","Luo Qing raised his hand and helped her smooth the hair on her forehead. Their intimate actions shocked everyone present. Then, he smiled and said, “You didn’t even tell me, your second brother, that you were bullied.”","At this moment, everyone finally understood that Luo Qing was here for her, not Pei Lingquan or Tang Ruge.","Tang Ruge’s body went soft as she looked at this scene in disbelief. She had actually lost to a nouveau riche? She had rushed to Li City from the capital for the sake of this porcelain vase. Now, she had lost all her dignity and even failed to get the vase.","“She’s actually Young Master Luo’s younger sister?”","“In that case, she’s also from the Luo family? I didn’t expect her to have this identity. No wonder she agreed to this bet. It turns out that she already knew she would definitely win!”","“This young miss is a member of the Luo family, but she keeps a low profile. Even when she was mocked, she didn’t reveal her identity. Pei Lingquan and Tang Ruge said that they were on good terms with the Luo family, but it turns out they don’t even know the daughter of the family!”"]},{"number":691,"title":"Chapter 691 - My Name Is Gu Yao!","paragraphs":["Tang Ruge’s face darkened as she clenched her fists tightly. Her fingernails were almost digging into her palms, but she still gritted her teeth and refused to say anything. She maintained her last shred of dignity.","Qiao Xi smiled lightly. “May I ask if I’ve won?”","The shop owner stood rooted to the ground for a few seconds. He did not expect the young master of the Luo family, Luo Qing, to really come.","When he heard Qiao Xi’s words, he hurriedly nodded. “Yes! Of course, you’ve won.”","Tang Ruge lowered her head with a ferocious expression. After a moment of silence, she slowly looked up and revealed a relieved smile. “I didn’t expect this miss to be from the Luo family. I was ignorant and didn’t know better. I’ve lost.”","Gu Yao snorted. “Since you lost the bet, take out that ancient painting!”","This was the bet that they had agreed on earlier. Previously, Tang Lingyun forced Qiao Xi to hand over Heart of Rose and even rushed over to snatch it. Now that Tang Ruge had lost, she should hand over the 30 million yuan ancient painting.","Tang Ruge gritted her teeth and suppressed the emotions that were about to break out of her heart. The 30 million yuan ancient painting was her father’s treasure. She lost it just like that. The price was too high.","She took a deep breath, but there was still a faint smile on her lips. There was no anger at all. “Since I lost, I’ll naturally have to give up the ancient painting. May I know where you live? I’ll send someone to deliver the painting.”","Qiao Xi said, “Second Brother, since you helped me win this bet, then I’ll give the painting to you.”","Luo Qing did not refuse and instructed his subordinates to pass that woman his address.","Tang Ruge frowned. The Luo family was a big family. They had all kinds of gold, silver, and jewelry. How could they take a liking to her ancient painting? She originally thought that Luo Qing would not accept this painting, but who knew that he really did!","Tang Lingyun stomped her feet in anger. “You... How could you accept...”","“Why not?” Gu Yao immediately interrupted her and mocked, “I remember that when you thought we lost just now, you tried to snatch the necklace. Moreover, Miss Tang has admitted defeat. Remember to send the ancient paintings to the Luo family immediately. Otherwise, everyone will think that the Tang family is shameless!”","Now that the bet was over, everyone was no longer in the mood to watch the show. They gradually dispersed. Tang Ruge was too embarrassed to continue staying here. Just as she was about to leave, she suddenly stopped in her tracks and turned around. “May I ask for this lady’s surname?”","Before Qiao Xi could say anything, Gu Yao stood up and said domineeringly, “Why? Do you want to seek revenge?”","Tang Ruge suppressed the anger in her heart and squeezed out a faint smile. “Of course not. I’ve just never heard of there being a young miss in the Luo family, so...”","Everyone instantly understood what Tang Ruge meant. She suspected Qiao Xi’s identity and felt that she was not from the Luo family.","Gu Yao had a look of disdain. “What does it have to do with you whether she’s from the Luo family or not? Anyway, she’s the one Luo Qing is helping. You lost the bet. Moreover, I’m the one who wants to buy the porcelain vase. She’s just here to accompany me. If you want revenge, come find me! My name is Gu Yao!”","As soon as this name was mentioned, even the usually calm Tang Ruge could not help but take a deep breath and ask in surprise, “Gu Yao? You... You’re from the Gu family?”","Seeing that Gu Yao was dressed in noble clothes, Tang Ruge looked at Gu Zheng. The two of them looked a little similar, so she smiled gently. “Are you the head of the Gu family, Gu Zheng?”","Gu Yao: “???” Why was this woman still smiling? She still wanted to seduce Gu Zheng in front of the legitimate wife?","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent, and he did not answer. Tang Ruge did not seem to notice the other party’s coldness and continued talking, “Mr. Gu, we met when we were young, but it’s been more than ten years. You probably don’t remember me anymore. I came to the porcelain shop today because I know that Old Madam Gu likes this pink porcelain vase, so I wanted to buy it for her. Unexpectedly, I bumped into Second Young Master Gu and there was a misunderstanding.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Gu Zheng still ignored her, but Tang Ruge continued to smile. “I was originally blaming myself for not being able to buy the porcelain vase that Grandma Gu likes. Now that I know that Second Young Master Gu is buying it for Grandma Gu, I’m relieved.”","There was silence again. Gu Zheng did not say anything, so naturally, no one would say anything. Tang Ruge stood awkwardly for a moment, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. “Teacher, Lingyun, let’s go.”","The three of them left with their attendants. The crowded shop instantly became much quieter, and even the air seemed to have become fresher."]},{"number":692,"title":"Chapter 692 - My Surname Is Situ","paragraphs":["Gu Yao was indignant. “Tsk! She sure knows how to find a way out! Hah, she seems so kind now. Where did her arrogant look from earlier go?”","Luo Qing rubbed Qiao Xi’s hair affectionately. “Little Six, the matter has been resolved.”","Qiao Xi held Luo Qing’s hand and smiled sweetly. “Yes!”","Gu Zheng frowned and took a few steps closer to Gu Yao. He asked in a low voice, “Who is this man? He’s even touching Qiao Xi’s hair? I’m still here. What is he doing?!”","Qiao Xi vaguely heard Gu Zheng’s words, and the corners of her mouth twitched slightly. It seemed that Gu Zheng had never seen Second Brother before. Would he be jealous?","In the past, Gu Zheng would never stop her from interacting with her brothers. Every time he saw them coming, he would stand a distance away and look at her gently. It seemed like the original Gu Zheng would not be jealous of her brothers!","According to their interactions over the past few days, Qiao Xi gradually realized that the second personality’s thoughts were similar to Gu Zheng’s. It was just that Gu Zheng had experienced many things and had become taciturn, steady, and calm. He was good at pretending and would not easily expose his emotions. However, this second personality had very little experience and did not know how to hide his emotions at all.","So... Gu Zheng would get jealous in the past as well? It was just that he never said anything?","Qiao Xi let go of Luo Qing’s hand as if she had been electrocuted. Coincidentally, the shop owner walked in front of Luo Qing and bowed respectfully. “Young Master Luo!”","Then, the shop owner handed the porcelain vase to Gu Yao. “According to the rules we set previously, as long as the person invites the top porcelain master in the world, this porcelain vase will belong to them. Although you haven’t made the porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings yet, I believe you won’t go back on your word.”","When Luo Qing entered, he had already seen the pink porcelain vase. It was indeed a high-grade porcelain vase, but this porcelain vase was naturally inferior to a porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings.","“Young Master Luo, you’re aware of my grandfather’s request. As long as you can create the perfect porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings, we’ll naturally give you a generous reward.”","The process of making this porcelain vase was complicated, and Luo Qing had only done one. This was a little difficult for him, but as long as he was given enough time, he was confident that he could create a perfect piece.","Luo Qing asked, “May I know your name, sir?”","Gu Yao was about to say that the shop owner was unwilling to reveal his name when the shop owner smiled and replied, “My name doesn’t matter, but since you asked, I naturally have to answer. My surname is Situ.”","“Situ...” Luo Qing hesitated for a moment. “If that’s the case, I really can’t say anything. After the porcelain vase is made, I’ll come again.”","Gu Zheng’s eyes darkened. No wonder the shop owner was looking for someone to make the porcelain vase with hollowed-out jade rings. It was because other than Luo Qing, there was another person who could make it. It was the former head of the Situ family, the old man’s missing eldest grandson.","...","After bidding farewell to Luo Qing, Qiao Xi got into the car with Gu Yao.","After returning to Longwan Residential, Gu Yao was overjoyed. “Qiao Xi! You’re really my idol! I went there a few times but couldn’t buy this porcelain vase. You helped me get it as soon as you went, and you didn’t spend any money. Grandma will definitely be very happy.”","“I officially announce that from today onward, you’re my eldest brother. If you’re so capable, why do you even need to get married?! You should just be a beautiful single woman!”","Gu Zheng frowned and was about to flare up when Song Shiyu said slyly, “Actually, I think it’s good for Young Madam to be single. She’s such an outstanding person, so she must have many suitors. If she gets married, she won’t be able to date other men.”","Gu Zheng revealed a bloodthirsty smile. “What should I do if I suddenly feel like hitting someone?”","Song Shiyu took a few steps back and looked at him in horror. “President, I was wrong. Second Young Master said it first.”","Gu Zheng was silent for a moment. “Alright, I’ll hit him first. I’ll deal with you later.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Song Shiyu fled. Gu Yao also sensed that the atmosphere was not right and quickly found an excuse to leave.","Only the two of them were left in the living room. Qiao Xi suddenly thought of something and turned around to ask, “Gu Zheng, do you know that Luo Qing is my second brother?”","Gu Zheng’s face darkened. When he thought of her smiling at Luo Qing, he felt annoyed and nodded unhappily.","Qiao Xi looked at him in confusion. “You know that he’s my second brother, so why do you look so unhappy? Could it be that you were jealous when I was with my second brother?”","A trace of surprise flashed past Gu Zheng’s eyes, then he looked at her with an accusatory gaze. He was like a puppy that had been abandoned. He said unhappily, “He’s not your biological brother.”"]},{"number":693,"title":"Chapter 693 - Gu Zheng Is Jealous","paragraphs":["At this moment, Qiao Xi was finally sure that Gu Zheng was a jealous person. He was clearly a jealous person, but the original Gu Zheng was good at pretending not to care. This arrogant Gu Zheng was not good at hiding his true thoughts.","...","Night fell, and Qiao Xi entered the master bedroom. After a moment, Gu Zheng entered. His eyes gradually returned to normal, and his tone was gentle. “Xi Xi.”","Qiao Xi knew that he was back and hurriedly pulled him to sit down. She asked probingly, “Gu Zheng, let me ask you a very serious question. Will you be unhappy seeing me with my brothers?”","Gu Zheng’s expression was indifferent as he smiled and said, “Of course not. They’re all your brothers, and they’re all very good to you. Why would I be unhappy?”","Qiao Xi: “...” ‘Keep pretending, then!’","She smiled slyly. “What if I hug my brothers? You won’t mind?”","Gu Zheng looked puzzled but still said indifferently, “It’s okay. There’s nothing wrong with you hugging them.”","Qiao Xi said, “But we’re not biological siblings! We’re not related by blood!”","Gu Zheng was even more confused. “Xi Xi, why are you asking such a question? I’m not unhappy. Don’t think too much.”","Qiao Xi: “...” She knew that he would not admit it, but he had already been exposed.","Actually, it was quite fun to watch Gu Zheng pretend to be calm. If Gu Zheng found out that he had long been exposed after putting on an act in front of her, what would his expression be like?","Qiao Xi lowered her eyes and smiled. Then, she told Gu Zheng about what had happened today. As Gu Zheng could not completely recall the memories of his secondary personality, the memories in his mind were intermittent. Someone had to help him sort them out.","“The woman Gu Yao and I met in the shop is surnamed Tang. She said that you two met when you were young. Do you remember?”","Gu Zheng thought for a moment but did not seem to remember anything.","“She’s the daughter of the Tang family, Tang Ruge. She came to Li City to attend Grandma’s birthday banquet.”","“There’s one more thing...” Qiao Xi was slightly hesitant. “The owner of that porcelain shop is surnamed Situ. Gu Yao asked him for his name earlier, but he refused to tell him. He only said his name after my second brother asked.”","“Situ?” Gu Zheng raised an eyebrow, a trace of interest flashing across his eyes. The corners of his mouth twitched. “He didn’t tell you?”","Qiao Xi shook her head.","Gu Zheng said indifferently, “The surname ‘Situ’ is very rare. Among the top noble families, there’s only one surnamed ‘Situ’. However, they keep a low profile. Only people from high society are qualified to know their names.","“Ever since the head of the Situ family went missing, the Situ family has been living in seclusion. However, their strength can’t be underestimated. They’ve become even stronger. Two years ago, the Li family of the capital wanted to develop a resort, but they were opposed by the Situ family.","“The Situ family didn’t even show their faces. They only sent someone to pass on the news. The Li family took the initiative to give up the opportunity to build the resort. At that time, they had already invested a considerable amount of manpower and resources. But because of the Situ family’s words, the Li family could only give up. You should understand the Situ family’s strength now.”","Qiao Xi was slightly shocked. No wonder Second Brother said those words when he found out that the other party’s surname was Situ. Such a family really could not easily expose their identity.","“Then think about why the Situ family opened a porcelain shop in Li City. I’m guessing the Situ family’s power has already spread to various cities through this method. Perhaps they’re looking for the missing family head,” Gu Zheng said.","...","In the porcelain shop.","“Grandpa.” The shop owner’s name was Situ Jian. He walked in front of an old man with a respectful expression. The old man was already 98 years old, but he looked strong and had a burning gaze.","The old man looked up slightly, exuding a dignified aura. “Have you found out anything about that lady?”","Situ Jian replied, “She’s called Qiao Xi. Heart of Rose is a relic that once belonged to her mother, Xia Yunqiu. Xia Yunqiu is the eldest daughter of the Xia family and the daughter of Old Madam Yin.”","“I heard that Old Madam Yin dotes on her daughter very much. There seem to be many valuable items in Xia Yunqiu’s belongings. With the Yin family’s wealth, it’s indeed possible for them to have accumulated so many precious items, but they would’ve had to pay a huge price.”","Old Master Situ’s eyes were cold as he said slowly, “Do you also think that her Heart of Rose came from an unknown source?”","“The Heart of Rose that Cousin gave away shouldn’t have appeared in the hands of a woman. Moreover, it’s someone from the Yin family who has nothing to do with the Situ family. There must be something wrong here.”"]},{"number":694,"title":"Chapter 694 - He’s A Devil","paragraphs":["“It’s been so many years, and I don’t know how many people have laid their hands on Heart of Rose. It’s not surprising that it somehow ended up in the hands of the Yin family,” Old Master Situ said. After a moment of silence, he asked, “Do you think she looks like Yu’er?”","“That lady is very beautiful. Her eyebrows and eyes do look a little similar to Cousin’s, but there are too many people in the world who look alike. We can’t make a decision based on looks alone. Why don’t I get Miss Qiao’s DNA for a DNA test?”","Old Master Situ took a sip of tea leisurely and said indifferently, “Not for now.”","“Miss Qiao is also Young Master Luo’s younger sister. She has a lot of experience. When she was young, she was abused by her stepmother and almost lost her life. After that, she met the divine physician and became a direct disciple. She also has a few brothers from outstanding families. After that, she got to know the hacker, Mo Yuan, who is also Gu Zheng. Now, she’s married to Gu Zheng and has become Mrs. Gu. What’s even more shocking is that she’s the owner of Ling Pavilion and manages an assassin organization. Her experience really makes me feel inferior!”","After Situ Jian finished speaking, the old master could not help but curl his lips. “This young woman’s ability is a little like Yu’er’s! The Tang family is doomed this time.”","Old Master Situ did not appear today and was only watching the surveillance footage in the shop. He had witnessed everything. This young lady had such a powerful force behind her at such a young age. It was definitely not just because of luck.","...","The next morning, Qiao Xi woke up early. It was Old Madam Gu’s birthday tomorrow. She and Gu Zheng were going to the old residence a day earlier to help welcome the guests.","All these years, Old Madam Gu would be deep asleep most of the time and rarely attended banquets. Even Gu Weiming could only meet Old Madam Gu once a month. However, with Old Madam Gu’s identity, as long as they held a birthday banquet for her, she would naturally attend it.","The two of them arrived at the Gu family’s old residence. As soon as they entered, Qiao Xi saw someone beside Lu Yan.","Qiao Xi frowned. “The Lu family?”","Seeing Gu Zheng’s confused expression, Qiao Xi recalled that the second personality had lost a lot of his memories. She looked at him with a complicated expression and asked tentatively, “Do you know about the Lu family?”","Just as Qiao Xi was about to explain, Gu Zheng snorted coldly. “The Lu family abandoned their biological daughter, cooperated with the mistress who killed their daughter for benefits, raised the son of the mistress, and let him take on the surname Lu. How could I not remember the Lu family who has done so many ugly misdeeds?”","Qiao Xi: “...” Why was she a little afraid? The original Gu Zheng might not bicker with the Lu family at his grandmother’s birthday banquet, but if the Lu family dared to provoke this master today, Gu Zheng would definitely make the Lu family lose all their dignity!","“Why are they here for Grandma’s birthday banquet?” Gu Zheng looked unhappy, and his eyes were filled with coldness. Grandma would naturally not invite them, so it could only be Huang Lilan and Gu Weiming.","After the two of them entered, they walked straight toward Maple Garden. As soon as they reached the door, they saw a familiar figure. It was Madam Gu—Huang Lilan.","After Shen Ying was chased away, she immediately went to the Gu family to complain to Huang Lilan. Only then did she know that Gu Zheng actually went so overboard and chased away the woman she sent over.","When she saw Gu Zheng and Qiao Xi holding hands as they walked over, Huang Lilan glared angrily. However, when Gu Zheng approached and she saw his green eyes, all color suddenly drained from her face.","It... It was the demon!","Gu Zheng glanced impatiently at Huang Lilan, directly ignoring her as he held Qiao Xi’s hand and walked away.","“You’re awake, right?”","Huang Lilan’s terrified voice sounded from behind. She rushed over and pulled Gu Zheng back. Her eyes were filled with fear and anger. Her face alternated between red and white before she laughed crazily. “Hahaha! You’re a freak!”","Gu Zheng stopped in his tracks and looked at her coldly.","Huang Lilan was so scared that her entire body trembled. She let go of his hand. It was unknown if she was afraid or happy as she started shouting crazily, “You appeared again, so he must have disappeared! Hahaha! That’s great!”","Qiao Xi’s expression was serious. Huang Lilan also knew that Gu Zheng had two personalities? But why was she so happy? What was she trying to do?","Huang Lilan laughed excitedly. “A demon! You’re a demon! It’s been so long. I thought you wouldn’t wake up anymore. I didn’t expect you to wake up at this time! The original Gu Zheng has disappeared, so the Gu family is destined to belong to Ah Yan!”","Qiao Xi was angered to the point her entire body trembled. She wished for nothing more than to rush over and slap Huang Lilan. Unexpectedly, Gu Zheng sneered. “Are you so sure?”"]},{"number":695,"title":"Chapter 695 - Like A Prisoner In Hell","paragraphs":["“Of course!” Huang Lilan said excitedly, “You’re a demon who has been sleeping for more than ten years. What can you do? The Gu family can only belong to Ah Yan!”","“Lu Yan? With his IQ, is he worthy of being the head of the family?” Gu Zheng asked coldly.","Huang Lilan instantly choked, and her eyes were filled with resentment. She suddenly glanced at Qiao Xi who was at the side and instantly laughed crazily. “Qiao Xi doesn’t know that you’re a demon, right?!”","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes darkened.","Huang Lilan said anxiously, “Qiao Xi! He’s a demon! He’s a dirty demon born from the darkness! He’s a demon imprisoned in this cage in Maple Garden!”","Then, she pointed at Gu Zheng and shouted, “You’re a demon who’s afraid of the sun. You’re only worthy of living in the dark. You must be feeling very uncomfortable standing under the sun like this today! Do you feel hot all over as if you’re about to melt?","“If others find out that the legendary Gu Zheng is actually afraid of the sun and can only struggle at death’s door in the dark, what will they say? How is such a person worthy of being the head of the Gu family?”","Gu Zheng exuded killing intent.","Huang Lilan continued to mock, “Why did you come out during the day? You want to attend the birthday banquet in Gu Zheng’s place? Are you worthy? Don’t tell me you think you’re the savior? Did you appear to protect Gu Zheng?","“Back then, I was the one who locked Gu Zheng in Maple Garden. The doors and windows were all nailed shut. I didn’t leave him with a single ray of sunlight. I didn’t give him any food or water for three days, so I forced out a demon! Do you still remember how terrifying you were back then? When you woke up, you wanted to occupy Gu Zheng’s body. I don’t believe that you’re so selfless!”","Gu Zheng felt dizzy, and his forehead hurt.","Perhaps it was because those memories were too painful. Even though he had been asleep for a long time, he did not want to recall the dark and humid environment of Maple Garden. He was afraid and hungry. Everything around him was so disgusting. Even the air was filled with a stench.","He endured the pain of darkness and hunger. From time to time, he would be beaten up like a prisoner in hell.","The woman in front of him was looking at him coldly, her eyes filled with mockery. She seemed to find it very amusing to see him struggling in pain!","Huang Lilan had always been sure that Gu Zheng hated her, but even though he had become the head of the family, he never looked for her to settle the score. This meant that he did not dare to because she was his mother!","She became crazier. “Qiao Xi, you already know that he’s not Gu Zheng. Do you still want to be with him? If you’re willing to get a divorce, I’ll help you!”","“He’s a demon! If you don’t leave him, he might kill you one day or imprison you in a dark basement to torture and abuse you! I advise you—”","Smack!","A crisp sound interrupted Huang Lilan’s words.","Qiao Xi used all her strength to slap Huang Lilan hard. Huang Lilan’s face was turned to the side. She lost her balance and fell to the ground. A few drops of blood seeped out of the corners of her mouth.","Qiao Xi was angered to the point her heart ached. It was even the first time she had the thought of killing someone. Did Huang Lilan think that torturing an unarmed child was something to be proud of?","Huang Lilan held her painful cheek and looked at Qiao Xi in disbelief. Was she crazy? She actually beat up her mother-in-law in the Gu family’s old residence?","“You dare to hit me? You b*tch! Ah!”","The curses were stuck in her throat. Huang Lilan widened her eyes in horror. She felt the air in her lungs gradually thin out, and the suffocating feeling made her subconsciously struggle.","Qiao Xi’s gaze was vicious as she grabbed Huang Lilan’s neck with increasing force. It looked like Huang Lilan’s neck would be broken in the next second.","Huang Lilan struggled weakly, her tongue sticking out as her eyes kept blinking. Her face turned from pale to purple, and her body trembled violently.","Qiao Xi tossed her to the side in disgust and warned coldly. “Huang Lilan, if you dare say another word, I’ll send you to see a true demon!”","Huang Lilan lay on the ground and panted crazily. A moment later, she finally recovered and said in a hoarse voice, “Qiao Xi, looks like you still don’t know who he is! Why are you protecting him? He’s not Gu Zheng anymore!”","“The Gu Zheng you love has already disappeared. The man in front of you is a demon! You’re really pitiful! You don’t even know that your husband has become someone else!”","“Madam Gu.” Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. “Don’t use your intelligence to try and figure me out. How could I not know what you already know?”","She looked down at Huang Lilan. “It’s been a few months. Madam Gu, do you still remember the feeling of you and Shen Ying being poisoned?”"]},{"number":696,"title":"Chapter 696 - He Was Destined To Disappear","paragraphs":["When she heard Qiao Xi mention being poisoned, Huang Lilan’s eyes were filled with ferocity as she roared. “It was you! You poisoned us!”","The last time Huang Lilan locked Qiao Xi in the basement, she and Shen Ying were suddenly poisoned. She clearly knew that it was Qiao Xi who did it, but she did not have any evidence. Even the people from the Medical Association could not find any clues.","This b*tch!","“Madam Gu, do you really not understand how I poisoned you without leaving a trace? You’ll soon know how stupid it is to be my enemy.","“The poison that time couldn’t kill you as it was just a small warning, but this time...” The corners of Qiao Xi’s mouth curled into a meaningful smile.","Huang Lilan’s heart thumped. The next second, Qiao Xi said casually, “The poison I poisoned you with this time is much more powerful than the last time. I hope you can survive. Otherwise, who’ll play with me in the future?”","Huang Lilan gritted her teeth, and her eyes were filled with anger and confusion. Why was Qiao Xi still willing to stay by his side even though she already knew that the man in front of her was not Gu Zheng?","“Qiao Xi! I’m telling the truth! He’s not Gu Zheng! He’s a demon! I’m really not lying to you this time!”","A sharp cry sounded. Gu Zheng’s heart suddenly tightened, and his eyes were filled with cold killing intent. Huang Lilan was so scared that she lowered her eyes and trembled.","The next second, Qiao Xi said indifferently, “I know.”","Huang Lilan looked at her in disbelief. Qiao Xi said casually, “Madam Gu, do you not understand human language?! I’ve already said that I know he’s not the original Gu Zheng. However, he’s also a part of Gu Zheng. He has never changed.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Qiao Xi held Gu Zheng’s hand and entered Maple Garden. The killing intent that erupted from Gu Zheng’s entire body suddenly vanished. He held that warm and soft hand while feeling an indescribable feeling in his heart.","He was born from the darkness and was called a demon by others. After everyone found out about his identity, their eyes would be filled with horror and ridicule. Only Qiao Xi was so indifferent and still intimate with him. She was like a ray of light shining into his dark life.","He was clearly just an extra personality. He was occupying this body that did not belong to him, but Qiao Xi did not blame him and had always been by his side.","After entering, Gu Zheng asked softly, “Are you really not afraid of me?”","“What should I be afraid of?”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes. For the first time, he felt nervous. “What Huang Lilan said is half-true. I... I’m indeed from the dark...”","He had never thought of himself as a demon. He thought that he was here to save the pitiful Gu Zheng. It was Huang Lilan who said that he was a bloodthirsty demon. Would Qiao Xi think the same? After all, she liked gentle men and not vicious men.","Qiao Xi glanced at him in confusion. “Huang Lilan can say whatever she wants. It won’t affect me at all. Why do you think I’m afraid of you?”","“Have you been to the basement of Longwan Residential? It’s dark and humid there. It’s an underground prison built by Gu Zheng over the years. Why do you think he built such a large prison in his own residence?”","From the day she met Gu Zheng, she had known he was not a good person. It was just that he was good at pretending and looked like a polite noble young master.","Qiao Xi blinked and smiled. “What’s there to worry about? I’m not a good person either. Aren’t we very compatible?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Gu Yao rushed in and said, “Qiao Xi! What gift did you prepare for Grandma? Quick, let me take a look!”","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and concealed the emotions in his heart. He suddenly felt that being able to live with Qiao Xi was a blessing. Unfortunately, he was destined to disappear.","At this moment, Qiao Xi turned around and took out a scroll from the gift box. She gently opened it. “I heard that Grandma likes to collect Old Master Wang’s calligraphy pieces. This is the ‘Thousand Words Life’ he wrote when he was alive. He personally wrote a thousand words. It’s the most suitable birthday gift for Grandma.”","Gu Yao’s eyes instantly lit up. “Thousand Words Life? Qiao Xi, you’re too awesome. Not only did you help me get the porcelain vase, but you also brought something so precious. This calligraphy piece is worth at least ten million.”","Old Madam Gu was the matriarch of the Gu family. In the past, when she was in good health, she was in charge of the entire Gu family. She had seen all kinds of gold, silver, and treasures. It did not matter if the gift was expensive or not. What was most important was the person’s sincerity."]},{"number":697,"title":"Chapter 697 - The Same Birthday Present","paragraphs":["“But...” Suddenly, Gu Yao frowned. “It seems that Tang Ruge is going to give Grandma a calligraphy piece too. Could it be that she heard the news and deliberately got the same kind of gift as you?”","Qiao Xi wanted to give Old Madam Gu a calligraphy piece, and so did Tang Ruge. Wasn’t this too much of a coincidence?! Gu Yao could not help but be slightly worried. That woman was not easy to deal with. She might take this opportunity to take revenge on Qiao Xi.","...","The Tang family.","Tang Ruge looked at the painting with heartache. This was the ancient painting that the Tang family had treasured for many years. Now that she had to give it to someone else, she was naturally unwilling.","Tang Lingyun shouted angrily, “That woman is really shameless. How dare she take our things?”","At this moment, there was a young man standing beside Tang Ruge. This man was the young master of the Ye family in the capital. He accompanied Tang Ruge to Li City to celebrate Old Madam Gu’s birthday.","Ye Chi was the second son in the family, and his eldest brother, Ye Qingyuan, was above him. Over the years, his eldest brother had gradually taken control of the family’s power. He had completely lost his status. Seeing that the position of heir was about to fall into the hands of another, he began to panic.","Originally, Ye Qingyuan was not valued, but he was Gu Zheng’s friend. Ever since the rest found out about this, the elders in the family changed sides and began to support Ye Qingyuan.","Ye Chi had come to Li City this time to take the opportunity to get close to Gu Zheng and obtain the right to compete for the position of heir. However, before he could see Gu Zheng, he heard that Mrs. Gu and Tang Ruge had gotten into a conflict.","Tang Ruge had a gentle personality. Before this, he had never heard of her having a conflict with anyone. Now that such a thing happened as soon as she arrived in Li City, it must be Mrs. Gu who started it!","Moreover, Mrs. Gu even asked Tang Ruge to hand over Eternal Winter Snow. Everyone knew that this painting was very valuable. Wasn’t Mrs. Gu simply forcing Tang Ruge?","Ye Chi snorted. “Ruge, Lingyun has told me everything. That woman clearly set up a trap to deceive you. Why should you give it to her?”","Tang Ruge smiled bitterly. “Our Tang family has always kept our word. A loss is a loss. I have to pay the price. It’s just a painting. How can it compare to the Tang family’s hundred years of reputation?”","As soon as she finished speaking, Ye Chi’s phone suddenly rang. After hanging up, Ye Chi looked excited. “Ruge, you don’t need to hand over Eternal Winter Snow anymore.","“The gift Qiao Xi wants to give Old Madam Gu this time is Old Master Wang’s last work, Thousand Words Life.”","The moment that was said, Tang Lingyun’s face was filled with surprise. “How is this possible? Sister clearly has the Thousand Words Life! How can that woman have it too?”","Ye Chi smiled coldly. “Old Master Wang only produced one of them. Since there are two, it means that one of them is fake! Mrs. Gu is an idiot. Since she doesn’t know calligraphy, she shouldn’t come out and embarrass herself. She actually wants to give a fake to someone!”","“Ruge, if she gives away that fake at the banquet, Old Madam Gu will definitely hate her. If that’s the case, you’ll be disrespecting Old Madam Gu if you give her Eternal Winter Snow.”","Tang Ruge was silent for a moment, feeling a little troubled. “Is it really okay to do that?”","On the other hand, Huang Lilan had already returned to the main residence. At this moment, she had a splitting headache and her entire body was burning. It was as if she had been placed in a pot of boiling water. Her lips were cracked, and a burning pain swept through her entire body.","She knew that this was a symptom of being poisoned. She was wearing a cool dress and was convulsing on the floor. She could only shout helplessly, “Call the doctor! Doctor!”","When the family doctor arrived, Huang Lilan had already been helped to the bed by the servants. Her sweat had drenched the blanket.","Huang Lilan was afraid that Qiao Xi would make another move on her, so she did not directly say that she had been poisoned. Instead, she gritted her teeth and said, “My entire body hurts! It hurts like fire!”","The doctors hurriedly did a full-body check-up on her, but the results were shocking.","“Madam Gu, there’s... There’s nothing wrong with your body.”","Huang Lilan also looked up in surprise, her heart burning with anger. “How is that possible? If there’s nothing wrong, would I be in so much pain? Maybe I was poisoned.”","At this moment, another doctor walked in. “Madam Gu, we’ve already tested your blood. The results show that everything is normal. There’s no poison in your blood.”","Then, an old doctor walked in. This person was Old Madam Gu’s private doctor. Tomorrow was Old Madam Gu’s birthday. He had to be on standby in the Gu family’s old residence in case of emergencies.","Unexpectedly, before he reached the old madam’s courtyard, he was invited to Huang Lilan’s main residence by the butler."]},{"number":698,"title":"Chapter 698 - Seek Treatment For Your Mental State","paragraphs":["Many doctors surrounded Huang Lilan to check her pulse and blood. They checked her entire body and finally came to a conclusion—Madam Gu was not sick. Her body was very healthy. She was not poisoned, and there were no other problems.","The doctors had also seen a lot of scheming in wealthy families. At this moment, they could not help but suspect that Huang Lilan was deliberately pretending to be sick to achieve a certain goal.","Old Madam Gu’s personal doctor was the oldest and had the highest reputation. Seeing Huang Lilan crying and shouting, he frowned and said, “Madam Gu, there’s nothing wrong with your body. It’s better not to waste time. I originally wanted to do a check-up on Old Madam Gu. If I miss the best timing and it causes Old Madam Gu’s body to be damaged, can you bear the responsibility?”","“I’m really sick! I was poisoned! My whole body hurts! You’re all quacks. You can’t even find out that I’ve been poisoned! A bunch of trash!” Huang Lilan lay on the bed and roared.","“Madam Gu!” Hearing Huang Lilan’s curses, the doctors were instantly angry. “We’re all famous doctors in the medical world. If we don’t have the ability, the Gu family wouldn’t have invited us over. If you don’t believe our diagnosis, you can get someone else to take a look at you. We don’t have to waste time here.”","“We can’t treat your illness, so it’s useless for us to stay here. Madam Gu, you should find another doctor to prevent your illness from worsening. You can’t blame us for this!”","“Madam Gu, you should probably seek treatment for your mental state. Only you know what you’re thinking!”","With that, everyone stood up and left the main residence. Huang Lilan’s eyes were filled with resentment as she gritted her teeth.","Impossible! Qiao Xi had clearly poisoned her. She was in pain and her body was burning. Why couldn’t these doctors find anything?","Qiao Xi, that b*tch!","She had poisoned her once before, but she accused Huang Lilan of framing her daughter-in-law. This time, she poisoned her again. There were so many doctors, but they could not find any illness.","Qiao Xi was a freak. No wonder Gu Zheng liked her. The two of them were the same.","...","The next day.","On the day of the birthday banquet, all the guests came to congratulate the Gu family. The Gu family was extremely lively.","Qiao Xi was entertaining guests in the front hall when she bumped into Huang Lilan. She was dressed very gorgeously today and had exquisite makeup on. She was forcefully enduring the pain in her body and chatting with everyone.","Qiao Xi raised her eyebrows. Huang Lilan was quite capable. She was actually able to appear in front of everyone while enduring the pain. Her forbearance was indeed shocking.","The poison she poisoned Huang Lilan with was not a traditional poison. It was just a drug that stimulated the nerves. It would cause one to hallucinate from intense pain, but it would not affect the body at all. Hence, the doctors failed to realize that she had been poisoned.","Yesterday, Qiao Xi told Huang Lilan that she had been poisoned, so she was already psychologically influenced. Coupled with the effects of the drug, it made her think that her body was in intense pain. This kind of pain was very similar to the real thing. Moreover, this kind of pain would change according to one’s imagination. It could be the pain of being whipped, a burning sensation, or the feeling of being cut.","Huang Lilan’s words yesterday had really angered Qiao Xi. For the sake of taking revenge for Gu Zheng, Qiao Xi had scattered a little more medicinal powder this time. She would be in pain for at least two to three days. Unexpectedly, in order to protect her position as Madam Gu, Huang Lilan actually endured the intense pain and came out to welcome the guests.","Qiao Xi sized up Huang Lilan, then her gaze landed on Shen Ying, who was beside her. Gu Zheng also saw Shen Ying and looked at her.","A moment later, Shen Ying excused herself to go to the bathroom and walked out of the banquet hall. She came to the backyard and said while trembling, “President Gu...”","“Miss Shen, let me remind you that there were conditions for letting you go that day. If you can’t do as per my instructions, I might take your life at any time.”","Shen Ying took a few steps back in fear and trembled. “President Gu, w-what do you want me to do?”","“What did Huang Lilan tell you?” Gu Zheng asked.","Shen Ying did not hesitate at all and said something in a low voice. When Gu Zheng heard this, a trace of danger flashed past his eyes.","Huang Lilan was really a disgusting woman. Such a dirty and vicious woman should not be living in this world. Today, he would take the place of the real Gu Zheng to get rid of this dirty woman!","Gu Zheng lowered his eyes and instructed coldly, scaring Shen Ying so much that she knelt on the floor. “President Gu, I beg you. Don’t do this to me. Chairman Gu is old enough to be my father. How can I...”"]},{"number":699,"title":"Chapter 699 - Unable To Live Or Die","paragraphs":["Gu Zheng looked down at her and said casually, “Huang Lilan wanted to use you to restrain me, and you agreed. Since you chose to be my enemy back then, you should at least pay the price for your actions! Miss Shen, don’t tell me you’re naive enough to think that you’re simply trying to atone for your sins now?","“Only allies have the chance to atone for their sins. You’re just a chess piece in my hands. You don’t have the right to refuse whatever I ask you to do. If you offend Huang Lilan, she might kill you, but if you offend me...”","Gu Zheng’s deep eyes were filled with coldness. Then, the corners of his mouth curled up into a devilish smile. “If you offend me, I’ll make you wish you were dead!”","Shen Ying’s body went weak as she collapsed to the ground. Her eyes were filled with tears as she shouted in horror, “No! I don’t want to die! Please spare my life!”","“Since you don’t want to die, you know what to do.” A small silver knife appeared in Gu Zheng’s hand. He held the knife to Shen Ying’s chin and forced her to look up.","“If you fail the mission Huang Lilan tasked you with, I’ll let you go. But can you guarantee that Huang Lilan will let you off? If you serve Gu Weiming and obtain his love, who in the Gu family will dare to touch you?","“Although Gu Weiming is muddle-headed, he has the final say in the entire Gu family’s old residence. Only he can compete with Huang Lilan and protect you. Miss Shen, you should understand that all of this is for your own good.”","Shen Ying’s body trembled. After a moment of silence, she wiped her tears and nodded reluctantly.","Seeing that he had achieved his goal, Gu Zheng smiled and stood up to leave. He knew that Shen Ying was also involved in the car accident, but he still decided to give her a chance. It was not because he pitied her, but because things would only become interesting if she was kept alive.","...","In the banquet hall, Tang Ruge walked in with a smile. Lu Yan came forward to greet her. “Hello, Miss Tang.”","Everyone’s gazes landed on the two of them. “Is this the daughter of the Tang family in the capital? As expected of a daughter of a noble family. Her every move is very elegant and noble. Miss Tang’s temperament is unparalleled.”","Tang Ruge nodded slightly at everyone and said gently and politely, “Thank you for your praise, everyone. I don’t deserve it.”","“Miss Tang, what’s your gift?” Everyone looked at the gift box in Tang Ruge’s hands in confusion. Since it was her gift to Old Madam Gu, it must be something good.","Tang Ruge smiled and said, “I heard that Old Madam Gu likes Old Master Wang’s calligraphy works. I happened to obtain Old Master Wang’s last work titled Thousand Words Life. He wrote a thousand words.","“Actually, I originally wanted to give Old Madam Gu a porcelain vase. But the vase was bought by Second Young Master Gu. Hence, I could only choose this Thousand Words Life. I hope Old Madam Gu will like it.”","Everyone exclaimed. As expected of the Tang family. Old Master Wang’s works were very valuable. She was actually able to give a piece to Old Madam Tang as a gift. She was really considerate.","At this moment, Qiao Xi and Gu Zheng walked into the banquet hall hand in hand. Gu Yao lowered his voice and reminded her, “Qiao Xi, that woman is here. Be careful.”","As soon as she finished speaking, Tang Ruge held a glass of red wine and walked toward the three of them with a smile. She smiled at Qiao Xi. “Mrs. Gu, I was in the wrong for what happened before. I apologize to you. Let me give you a toast.”","Before Qiao Xi could speak, Gu Zheng said with a cold face, “Miss Tang, you can apologize, but my wife is not good at drinking. There’s no need to ask her to drink. It’s been so many days since the incident. Miss Tang, please fulfill your promise and hand over that ancient painting as soon as possible.”","Tang Ruge’s expression froze. Everyone was confused and did not know what was going on.","On the other hand, Ye Chi could not take it lying down. He muttered to the person beside him, “It was this Mrs. Gu who set up a trap for Ruge and got her to give her to hand over the 30 million yuan ancient painting named Eternal Winter Snow. She’s really too much!”","Gu Yao glanced at Ye Chi. Where did this fool come from? Could just anyone enter the Gu family’s old residence?","He did not care who the other party was and mocked, “Miss Tang took the initiative to make a bet with my sister-in-law and even asked her to bet on a necklace worth more than 100 million. At my request, Miss Tang unwillingly bet on an ancient painting worth 30 million. Since Miss Tang lost, shouldn’t she hand over the painting?","“This bet was proposed by Miss Tang. Now that you’ve lost, you’re unwilling to fulfill your promise and are even slandering my sister-in-law? Is this the scholarly character of a member of the Tang family?”"]},{"number":700,"title":"Chapter 700 - Who Gave The Fake?","paragraphs":["Gu Yao glanced coldly at Ye Chi. “Miss Tang, you have to make things clear. Don’t let others misunderstand my sister-in-law. She’s the madam of the Gu family. Why would she covet your Tang family’s ancient painting that’s only worth 30 million yuan? What a joke!”","Ye Chi instantly choked.","Everyone looked enlightened. It turned out that Miss Tang had taken the initiative to make a bet and made Mrs. Gu bet on a necklace worth a few hundred million dollars. Meanwhile, she only bet on a painting that cost 30 million dollars.","Now that Miss Tang had lost, she was unwilling to hand over the ancient painting. It was indeed inappropriate.","Tang Ruge’s face was livid. She suppressed the anger in her heart and said gently, “A few days ago, I met Mrs. Gu and made a bet with her. I lost Eternal Winter Snow. After the banquet ends, I’ll naturally give that painting to Mrs. Gu.”","Ye Chi said unwillingly, “It was just a casual bet. Could it be that she—”","“A casual bet? Miss Tang and my sister-in-law were competing to see who could find the top porcelain master in the world. As someone from a porcelain family, Miss Tang actually initiated a bet with my sister-in-law. Tsk tsk...”","Gu Yao pursed his lips. The meaning behind his words was self-evident. Tang Ruge wanted to bet on what she was good at and even asked the other party to bet on an expensive item. No matter how one looked at it, Tang Ruge was bullying others!","Tang Ruge lowered her eyes and gritted her teeth, not knowing how to retort. She could only suppress the anger in her heart and squeeze out a smile. She changed the topic and said, “Mrs. Gu, we’re about the same age. Can I call you by your name?”","“Second Young Master Gu’s gift is the pink porcelain vase. Xi Xi, what are you going to give Old Madam Gu? I wonder if I have the honor to take a look?”","The guests’ gifts were all sent to the backyard when they entered. The butler would check and register them. However, there were also some expensive or special items that would be opened in public for everyone to look at.","Tang Ruge’s words did not surprise anyone, but Gu Yao had a furious expression. This woman clearly knew that she had given the same thing as Qiao Xi, yet she still asked in front of everyone. She clearly wanted to embarrass Qiao Xi.","At this moment, someone with sharp eyes saw Qiao Xi’s gift. “Huh? Mrs. Gu, you’re giving a calligraphy piece too? It looks very similar to Miss Tang’s Thousand Words Life.”","Everyone immediately craned their necks, extremely curious about the gift Qiao Xi had prepared.","Tang Ruge frowned. “Yes, the design on Xi Xi’s box is exactly the same as the one on the box for Thousand Words Life. Even the ribbon on the box is the same color. What a coincidence.","“Xi Xi, can you open the box and take out the gift for us to see? We’re really curious about your gift to the old madam. It’ll broaden everyone’s horizons.”","Without waiting for Qiao Xi’s agreement, Ye Chi casually tugged on the ribbon on the box, revealing the contents. The red scroll looked very festive. A few words were written on the paper—’Thousand Words Life.’","Everyone gasped.","“Isn’t Miss Tang’s gift Thousand Words Life? Why is Mrs. Gu’s gift the same work too?”","“Could it be that she took the wrong one? Maybe she accidentally took the wrong one when she did the registration process in the backyard. When Miss Tang entered, we all saw her gift. It’s Mr. Wang’s posthumous work. How did it become Mrs. Gu’s gift?”","“Mrs. Gu, your gift isn’t Thousand Words Life, right? Even if you forgot to prepare a gift, you can’t give someone else’s gift!”","Tang Ruge was stunned for a few seconds, then pretended to be surprised. “Mrs. Gu, this is my gift! Why is it with you? And your name is written on it.”","Gu Yao was about to speak when Ye Chi suddenly said, “No, this isn’t Ruge’s calligraphy piece. There’s an extra ink spot on this painting. It’s completely different from Ruge’s calligraphy piece.”","“How could there be two Thousand Words Life? Mr. Wang only made one back then! Could it be that one of them is fake?”","Someone was actually giving a fake at the Gu family’s birthday banquet. If news of this got out, the person who gave the fake would definitely lose all their dignity and would never be able to raise their head in high society again.","One of them was the daughter of a porcelain family, while the other was Gu Zheng’s wife. Their identities could not be underestimated, yet one of them was actually giving out fake goods?","Lu Yan walked forward and said gently, “Why don’t we get a professional to appraise them? We can’t accept any fake gifts. President Gu, what do you think?”","Gu Zheng sized up the man in front of him. His memory was a little blurry, but he knew Lu Yan’s identity very well. He was the person who replaced him as the legitimate child."]}]);
